e to continue\",\"WaitingPendingToolHint\":\"Complete the tool request above to continue\",\"WaitingRiggingApprovalHint\":\"Confirm the rigging request above to continue\"},\"MessageView\":{\"Thinking\":\"Thinking\",\"WelcomeEmpty\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Describe what you want and I'll take it from there.\",\"Title\":\"How can I help you create?\"}},\"Tool\":{\"AskUserAnswered\":\"Answered\",\"AskUserErrorHint\":\"The assistant sent a question in an unexpected format. You can skip this and continue the conversation.\",\"AskUserErrorRefLabel\":\"ref:\",\"AskUserErrorTitle\":\"Question card couldn't be displayed\",\"AskUserMessageIdMissing\":\"Message unavailable. Try refreshing the page.\",\"AskUserNext\":\"Next\",\"AskUserOther\":\"Other\",\"AskUserOtherPlaceholder\":\"Type your answer...\",\"AskUserPreparing\":\"Preparing questions\",\"AskUserPrevious\":\"Previous\",\"AskUserSkip\":\"Skip\",\"AskUserSkipFailed\":\"Failed to skip\",\"AskUserSkipped\":\"Skipped\",\"AskUserSubmit\":\"Submit\",\"AskUserSubmitFailed\":\"Failed to submit\",\"Draft\":{\"ApprovalTitle\":\"Generate Model\"},\"EditImage\":{\"GeneratingStatus\":\"Generating image…\"},\"ExportToSlicer\":{\"ApprovalTitle\":\"Open in {name}?\",\"OpenInBambu\":\"Open in Bambu Studio\",\"OpeningAppName\":\"Opening {name}…\",\"Preparing\":\"Preparing slicer file…\",\"SuccessText\":\"Opened in your slicer.\",\"Title\":\"Export to slicer\"},\"Image\":{\"ApprovalTitle\":\"Generate an image?\",\"Cancelled\":\"Image generation was cancelled.\",\"GeneratingStatus\":\"Generating image…\",\"ImagesMeta\":\"{n} images\"},\"Loading\":{\"AnalyzePrintability\":\"Analyzing printability\",\"Animate\":\"Applying animations\",\"ConvertModelFormats\":\"Converting model format\",\"ExportToSlicer\":\"Preparing model for printing\",\"ImageTo3d\":\"Creating 3D model\",\"ImageToImage\":\"Refining image\",\"MultiColorPrint\":\"Preparing model for multi-color printing\",\"MultiImageTo3d\":\"Creating 3D model from images\",\"Remesh\":\"Remeshing model\",\"RepairPrintability\":\"Repairing model for printing\",\"Retexture\":\"Applying new texture\",\"RetrievePrintingGuide\":\"Finding printing instructions\",\"SearchAnimateAction\":\"Searching animations\",\"SearchImage\":\"Searching images\",\"TextToImage\":\"Creating image\",\"ViewModelThumbnail\":\"Viewing model\",\"WebSearch\":\"Searching the web\"},\"LoadingDone\":{\"AnalyzePrintability\":\"Analyzed printability\",\"Animate\":\"Applied animations\",\"ConvertModelFormats\":\"Converted model format\",\"ExportToSlicer\":\"Prepared model for printing\",\"ImageTo3d\":\"Created 3D model\",\"ImageToImage\":\"Refined image\",\"MultiColorPrint\":\"Prepared model for multi-color printing\",\"MultiImageTo3d\":\"Created 3D model from images\",\"PreparingTools\":\"Prepared the required tools\",\"Remesh\":\"Remeshed model\",\"RepairPrintability\":\"Repaired model for printing\",\"Retexture\":\"Applied new texture\",\"RetrievePrintingGuide\":\"Found printing instructions\",\"SearchAnimateAction\":\"Searched animations\",\"SearchImage\":\"Searched images\",\"TextToImage\":\"Created image\",\"ViewModelThumbnail\":\"Viewed model\",\"WebSearch\":\"Searched the web\"},\"PollTaskStatus\":{\"CancelAriaLabel\":\"Cancel task\",\"FailedTitle\":\"Task failed\",\"PendingTitle\":\"Preparing…\",\"RunningTitle\":\"Generating {progress}%\",\"UserCancelledError\":\"user cancelled\"},\"PreparingTools\":\"Preparing the required tools\",\"RiggingCancelled\":\"Rigging canceled\",\"RiggingDone\":\"Rigged model\",\"RiggingErrorTitle\":\"Can't open rigging\",\"RiggingFailed\":\"Rigging failed\",\"RiggingOpen\":\"Rig Model\",\"RiggingSubmitting\":\"Preparing for rigging\",\"Texture\":{\"ApprovalTitle\":\"Generate Texture\"}},\"UserMessage\":{\"CopiedToast\":\"Copied to clipboard\",\"CopyButtonLabel\":\"Copy message\"},\"WebSearchTag\":\"Web Images\"},\"CreditsBanner\":{\"Cta\":{\"AddCredits\":\"Add Credits\",\"Claim50Off\":\"Claim 50% Off\",\"UpgradeToPro\":\"Upgrade to Pro\",\"UpgradeToStudio\