se steps, then click \\\"Verify Now\\\" to complete.\",\"AddCodeTitle\":\"Add Code to Your Bio\",\"Back\":\"Back\",\"BannedBody\":\"Your earn account is currently suspended, so you can't submit new posts or connect new social accounts. Any earnings from posts you already submitted will still be settled and paid out as normal.\",\"BannedBodyWithReason\":\"Your earn account is currently suspended, so you can't submit new posts or connect new social accounts. Any earnings from posts you already submitted will still be settled and paid out as normal. Reason: {reason}\",\"BannedReason\":\"Reason: {reason}\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"Close\":\"Close\",\"ConnectButton\":\"+ Connect\",\"ConnectHeading\":\"Connect {platform}\",\"ConnectHint\":\"Connect to submit posts and earn from this platform.\",\"ConnectMyAccounts\":\"Connect my accounts\",\"Connected\":\"Connected\",\"ConnectedTitle\":\"Connected!\",\"Connecting\":\"Connecting…\",\"ContactSupport\":\"Contact support\",\"Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Copied\":\"Copied\",\"Copy\":\"Copy\",\"Disconnect\":\"Disconnect\",\"DisconnectBlockedApproved\":\"{count, plural, one {This account has # approved post still earning. You can disconnect once the campaign settles.} other {This account has # approved posts still earning. You can disconnect once the campaign settles.}}\",\"DisconnectBlockedBoth\":\"{count, plural, one {This account has # post in review and {approved} approved. You can disconnect once they're all settled.} other {This account has # posts in review and {approved} approved. You can disconnect once they're all settled.}}\",\"DisconnectBlockedReview\":\"{count, plural, one {This account has # post in review. You can disconnect once it's settled.} other {This account has # posts in review. You can disconnect once they're settled.}}\",\"DisconnectDesc\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{handle}\u003c/strong\u003e will be unlinked from your Meshy account. You won't be able to submit new posts from this platform until you reconnect — past payouts aren't affected.\",\"DisconnectFailedTitle\":\"Please Disconnect Later\",\"DisconnectTitle\":\"Disconnect {platform}?\",\"Disconnecting\":\"Disconnecting…\",\"Done\":\"Done\",\"EnterUsernameDesc\":\"Enter your {platform} @username to get started. We'll generate a unique code for you to place in your bio to verify ownership.\",\"GenericError\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"HandleTakenDesc\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{handle}\u003c/strong\u003e is already connected to another Meshy account. Each {platform} handle can only be linked to one Meshy profile. Use a different handle, or contact support if you believe this is your account.\",\"HandleTakenTitle\":\"This handle is already linked\",\"Kicker\":\"Connect the platforms you'll post on\",\"NoAccountToDisconnect\":\"We couldn't find a connected account to disconnect. Refresh and try again.\",\"NoAccountsBody\":\"You haven't connected any social accounts yet. Link at least one platform so we can verify your posts and credit your earnings.\",\"NotConnected\":\"Not connected\",\"PublicBanner\":\"Your {platform} account must be set to public for verification to work.\",\"Step\":\"Step {num}/3\",\"StepCopyCode\":\"Copy the code\",\"StepEditBio\":\"Open {platform} and edit your bio\",\"StepPaste\":\"Paste the code anywhere and save\",\"StepRemove\":\"You can remove the code after verification\",\"Subtitle\":\"Manage the social accounts we'll track.\",\"SuccessDesc\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{handle}\u003c/strong\u003e is now linked to your Meshy account. You can submit posts from this platform.\",\"SuspendedTooltip\":\"Your earn account is suspended, so you can't connect new accounts.\",\"Title\":\"Social accounts\",\"TryAgain\":\"Try again\",\"TryDifferentHandle\":\"Try a different handle\",\"UsernameLabel\":\"Username\",\"UsernamePlaceholder\":\"yourhandle\",\"VerifyFailedDesc\":\"We didn't find the verification code in \u003cstrong\u003e{handle}\u003c/strong\u003e's bio. Make sure you saved the change and that the account is public, then try again.\",\"VerifyFailedTitle\":\"Couldn't verify ownership\",\"VerifyNow\":\"Verify Now\",\"Verifying\":\"Verifying…\"},\"Balance\":{\"AddPaypalEmail\":\"Add Paypal email\",\"AllTime\":\"All-time, all campaigns\",\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"CashPayouts\":\"Cash payouts\",\"Change\":\"Change\",\"ChangePaypalEmail\":\"Change Paypal email\",\"Close\":\"Close\",\"CodeDesc\":\"We sent a 6-digit code to \u003cstrong\u003e{email}\u003c/strong\u003e. Enter it below to confirm.\",\"CodeLabel\":\"Verification code\",\"CodeTitle\":\"Enter verification code\",\"ColAmount\":\"Amount\",\"ColCampaign\":\"Campaign\",\"ColDate\":\"Date\",\"ColId\":\"ID\",\"ColMethod\":\"Method\",\"ColPost\":\"Post\",\"CreditAwards\":\"Credit awards\",\"CreditsAmount\":\"+{credits} credits\",\"CreditsInAccount\":\"Credits in Meshy account\",\"Done\":\"Done\",\"EmailDesc\":\"We'll send a 6-digit code to confirm you own this address. This is the account that will receive your payouts.\",\"EmailPlaceholder\":\"you@example.com\",\"EmailTakenDesc\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{email}\u003c/strong\u003e is already linked to another Meshy account. Each Paypal email can only be used by one account at a time. Try a different email — or contact support if you believe this is a mistake.\",\"EmailTakenTitle\":\"This Paypal email is already in use\",\"EmailVerified\":\"Email verified\",\"EmptyCash\":\"No cash payouts yet. Your first payout starts processing 7 days after your first campaign ends.\",\"EmptyCredits\":\"No credit awards yet. Get a post approved to earn Meshy credits.\",\"FooterNote\":\"After a campaign ends, we take \u003cstrong\u003e7 days\u003c/strong\u003e to finalize your views, then up to \u003cstrong\u003e20 business days\u003c/strong\u003e to send the payout to your PayPal Email. You can check the payout status of each payment in the Payouts list under Submitted Posts.\",\"ForfeitNote\":\"This is the account that will receive your payouts. Add a verified Paypal email within \u003cstrong\u003e12 months\u003c/strong\u003e of earning a payout — unclaimed earnings are forfeited after that.\",\"GotIt\":\"Got it\",\"HoldBanner\":\"You have \u003cstrong\u003e{amount}\u003c/strong\u003e on hold. Add your Paypal email below to receive your payout.\",\"InvalidCodeError\":\"Invalid or expired code. Please try again.\",\"LoadError\":\"Couldn't load your payout history. Please try again in a moment.\",\"LockedDesc\":\"You have \u003cstrong\u003e{amount}\u003c/strong\u003e waiting to be paid to \u003cstrong\u003e{email}\u003c/strong\u003e. To make sure that payout isn't misrouted, you can change your Paypal email once it's settled.\",\"LockedTitle\":\"Can't change Paypal email right now\",\"MiniEarning\":\"Earning\",\"MiniEarningEmpty\":\"Nothing actively tracking\",\"MiniEarningSub\":\"Active campaigns still earning\",\"MiniExpired\":\"Expired\",\"MiniExpiredEmpty\":\"Nothing expired\",\"MiniExpiredSub\":\"Unclaimed for over a year\",\"MiniOnHold\":\"On hold\",\"MiniOnHoldEmpty\":\"Nothing on hold\",\"MiniOnHoldSub\":\"Add your PayPal to release it\",\"MiniPaid\":\"Paid\",\"MiniPaidEmpty\":\"No payouts yet\",\"MiniPaidSub\":\"Sent to your PayPal\",\"MiniSending\":\"Sending\",\"MiniSendingEmpty\":\"Nothing to send right now\",\"MiniSendingSub\":\"Settled, on its way to your PayPal\",\"NoCode\":\"Didn't get a code?\",\"PayoutHistoryTitle\":\"Payout history\",\"PayoutSettings\":\"Payout settings\",\"PaypalEmail\":\"Paypal email\",\"PaypalEmailPlaceholder\":\"Enter your Paypal email\",\"PostIdLabel\":\"ID: {id}\",\"RateLimitDesc\":\"You've requested too many verification codes in a short time. Please wait a while before requesting another.\",\"RateLimitTitle\":\"Too many code requests\",\"Resend\":\"Resend\",\"SendCode\":\"Send code\",\"SendCodeError\":\"Failed to send verification code. Please check the email.\",\"Sending\":\"Sending…\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Subtitle\":\"Track what you've earned and where it gets paid.\",\"SuccessDesc\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{email}\u003c/strong\u003e is now your payout account.\",\"Title\":\"Balance \u0026 Payout\",\"TotalCredits\":\"Total credits\",\"TotalEarnings\":\"Total earnings\",\"TryDifferentEmail\":\"Try a different email\",\"Verified\":\"Verified\",\"Verify\":\"Verify\",\"VerifyStatusError\":\"Couldn't verify your PayPal status. Please try again in a moment.\",\"Verifying\":\"Verifying…\",\"YourPaypal\":\"your PayPal\"},\"BeforeYouPost\":{\"DoIncludeHashtags\":\"Include {hashtags}\",\"DoIncludeHashtagsFallback\":\"Include the campaign hashtags\",\"DoMeshyModel\":\"Use a model **you made with Meshy**\",\"DoPublicWindow\":\"Post stays public for at least **7 days**\",\"DoTag\":\"Tag {mention}\",\"DontDelete\":\"Delete or set private **within 7 days**\",\"DontMusic\":\"Use **copyrighted music** without rights\",\"DontRepost\":\"Repost **old content** or someone else's videos\",\"DontWatermark\":\"Edit out the **Meshy watermark**\",\"Lead\":\"Posts missing these requirements will be rejected during review.\",\"Title\":\"Post Requirements\"},\"CampaignBanner\":{\"Platforms\":\"Platforms:\"},\"CampaignCard\":{\"Credits\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count, number}\u003c/b\u003e credits\",\"UpTo\":\"Up to\"},\"CampaignDetail\":{\"Back\":\"Back to Campaigns\",\"EndEarlyNote\":\"Campaign dates and rules are subject to change, and Meshy may end this campaign early.\",\"SubmitAllUsed\":\"You've used all your submissions\",\"SubmitBanned\":\"Account suspended\",\"SubmitDefault\":\"Submit Your Post\",\"SubmitEnded\":\"Campaign has ended\"},\"CampaignRewards\":{\"EarnCaps\":\"Earn caps\",\"FooterNote\":\"Payouts scale with views on each approved post. Views are counted from approval until \u003cstrong\u003e7 days after the campaign ends\u003c/strong\u003e, and your reward is calculated from that final number.\",\"MaxPerCampaign\":\"Max earn per campaign\",\"MaxPerVideo\":\"Max earn per video\",\"MaxSubmissions\":\"Max submissions\",\"PayoutTiers\":\"Payout tiers\",\"PerVideo\":\"Per video\",\"SubmissionLimit\":\"Submission limit\",\"TierCredits\":\"{value} credits\",\"Title\":\"How you'll get paid\"},\"Campaigns\":{\"All\":\"All\",\"AllPlatforms\":\"All platforms\",\"AnyPlatform\":\"any platform\",\"EmptyEndedSub\":\"No ended campaigns for {platform} right now.\",\"EmptyLiveSub\":\"No live campaigns for {platform} right now.\",\"EmptyTitle\":\"Nothing here yet\",\"Ended\":\"Ended\",\"Live\":\"Live\",\"Subtitle\":\"Pick a live campaign, post, and get paid by views.\"},\"Contact\":{\"FootNote\":\"We'll reply to you via \u003cstrong\u003eearn@meshy.ai\u003c/strong\u003e, usually within \u003cstrong\u003e7 business days\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"FormTitle\":\"Send us a message\",\"FrequentlyAsked\":\"Frequently asked\",\"MessageLabel\":\"Message\",\"MessagePlaceholder\":\"Tell us what's going on. Link to specific campaigns or submissions if relevant. (Minimum 10 characters)\",\"MessageSent\":\"Message sent\",\"SendAnother\":\"Send another\",\"SendError\":\"Failed to send. Try again?\",\"SendMessage\":\"Send message\",\"Sending\":\"Sending…\",\"SentBody\":\"We'll get back to you within 7 business days at \u003cstrong\u003e{email}\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"SubjectLabel\":\"Subject\",\"SubjectPlaceholder\":\"What's this about?\",\"Subtitle\":\"Questions, issues, ideas — we read every one.\",\"TopicAccount\":\"Account issue\",\"TopicLabel\":\"Topic\",\"TopicOther\":\"Other\",\"TopicPayout\":\"Payout issue\",\"TopicSubmission\":\"Submission issue\"},\"Faq\":{\"A1\":\"The Meshy Earn Program is Meshy's initiative that rewards talented creators for making great content. Create and publish a video that meets a campaign's requirements on your own social account, and you earn rewards based on the views it gets — the more views, the bigger the reward.\",\"A10\":\"In general, your video should fit the campaign theme and clearly show you using Meshy (the interface, your workflow, or the final result); include the required hashtags and @Meshy in the caption; be public, meet the minimum length (usually at least 15 seconds), and be posted within the campaign window — from your own account. The exact hashtags, length, and dates are on each campaign page.\",\"A11\":\"Don't promote or praise competitor products, or include competitor promo codes or links; don't overstate or misrepresent what Meshy can do; avoid videos with very poor image quality, heavy pixelation, or harsh audio; no sexual, violent, hateful, politically or religiously sensitive, drug- or weapon-related content; and don't repost someone else's work or resubmit a link you've already used. See the campaign page for the full rules.\",\"A12\":\"We tell you exactly which requirement wasn't met (for example “Add the hashtag #MeshyAI” or “Make your video public”). Fix it and resubmit. If there are multiple issues, they're listed together so you can fix them in one go.\",\"A13\":\"Rewards are Meshy credits and PayPal cash gift cards, issued in tiers based on whether your submission is approved and how many views it gets — the more views, the higher the reward.\",\"A14\":\"By the view tiers set for each campaign — you receive the highest tier you reach. Some campaigns also cap the reward per video or per person.\",\"A15\":\"Once your video passes review, credits are added to your Meshy account automatically — usually right away.\",\"A16\":\"Add your PayPal email to your account as soon as you have a claimable cash reward. If your PayPal email is on file, payment is usually completed within 30 days after the campaign settles; if you add it later, within 30 days after you provide it.\",\"A17\":\"After your post is approved and the campaign ends, there's a 7-day view-counting window; final settlement happens 7 days after the campaign ends, and we send your reward within 20 business days after the settlement date. Just make sure your PayPal email is on file — nothing else is needed.\",\"A18\":\"Within 12 months of our first request for it; otherwise the reward expires. We'll usually remind you by email before that happens.\",\"A19\":\"You can, as long as it still meets the campaign requirements. But if you delete the video, make it private, or remove required hashtags during the campaign, or if view manipulation is detected, the reward may be revoked. Keep the video public and the hashtags unchanged for the duration of the campaign.\",\"A2\":\"You're eligible if you're at least 18 years old and have at least one active account on TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, or X.\",\"A20\":\"Yes. By participating you agree that Meshy may use your video for marketing, including running paid ads to boost your post's reach. That's also why we ask you to confirm this with each submission.\",\"A21\":\"Send us a message using the form below and we'll get back to you within 7 business days.\",\"A3\":\"Register on the program page, then connect your social accounts and add your PayPal email (used to receive rewards). One registration per person.\",\"A4\":\"To confirm the video was really published by you, so the reward is attributed to the right person. Please connect and verify the platform account before you submit.\",\"A5\":\"Yes. But if that account still has posts under review or approved in an ongoing campaign, disconnecting is temporarily unavailable — you can do it once the campaign ends, so your rewards aren't affected.\",\"A6\":\"Publish a video that meets the requirements on your connected social account, then click “Submit Your Post” on the campaign page and submit the link. We'll review your video; once it passes review, you're in.\",\"A7\":\"Automated checks run the moment you submit. Manual review usually completes within 5 business days.\",\"A8\":\"No. Each link can only be submitted once — please don't reuse the same post across campaigns.\",\"A9\":\"Common reasons: the campaign hasn't started or has already ended, you've used up your submissions on that platform, or there's an issue with your account status. Check the hint on the page for the specific reason.\",\"Q1\":\"What is the Meshy Earn Program?\",\"Q10\":\"What does my video need to pass review?\",\"Q11\":\"What content is not allowed?\",\"Q12\":\"What happens if my submission fails a check?\",\"Q13\":\"What are the rewards?\",\"Q14\":\"How is the reward amount calculated?\",\"Q15\":\"When do credits arrive?\",\"Q16\":\"How do I claim cash rewards?\",\"Q17\":\"How soon after submitting do I get the cash reward?\",\"Q18\":\"When do I need to provide my payment info?\",\"Q19\":\"Can I edit my video after it passes review?\",\"Q2\":\"Am I eligible to participate?\",\"Q20\":\"Will Meshy use my video for promotion?\",\"Q21\":\"I have another question — how do I reach you?\",\"Q3\":\"How do I sign up?\",\"Q4\":\"Why do I need to connect my social account before submitting?\",\"Q5\":\"Can I disconnect a social account after connecting it?\",\"Q6\":\"How do I join a campaign?\",\"Q7\":\"How long does review take?\",\"Q8\":\"Can the same video enter multiple campaigns?\",\"Q9\":\"Why can't I click the submit button?\"},\"Greeting\":{\"Afternoon\":\"Hey there, {name}\",\"Evening\":\"Good evening, {name}\",\"FindCampaign\":\"Find a campaign\",\"FriendFallback\":\"friend\",\"Morning\":\"Good morning, {name}\",\"Subtitle\":\"Keep those posts coming — your next payout is just around the corner.\",\"UpLate\":\"Up late, {name}\"},\"HeroTips\":{\"DotLabel\":\"Go to slide {index}\",\"EditBody\":\"Edits that make your post no longer meet the campaign requirements before settlement will revoke the reward.\",\"EditTitle\":\"Don't edit approved posts\",\"Kicker\":\"Good to know\",\"OvertimeBody\":\"We refresh them daily for 7 more days after the end date — then your reward tier locks in.\",\"OvertimeTitle\":\"Views run overtime\",\"PaidBody\":\"Cash rewards are sent to the PayPal email on your account after the campaign settles — track the status anytime in Balance \u0026 Payout.\",\"PaidTitle\":\"How you get paid\",\"PaypalBody\":\"Payouts can't be sent without a PayPal email — rewards stay on hold until you add one.\",\"PaypalTitle\":\"Add your PayPal early\",\"PublicBody\":\"Private, unlisted or deleted posts lose their reward. Keep it visible until the campaign settles.\",\"PublicTitle\":\"Keep your post public\",\"RealViewsBody\":\"Only genuine views count toward your reward — if we detect fake or bot traffic, the submission will be revoked.\",\"RealViewsTitle\":\"Real views only\"},\"HowToParticipate\":{\"Title\":\"How to participate\"},\"Loading\":\"Loading…\",\"MobileNav\":{\"Accounts\":\"Accounts\",\"Aria\":\"Dashboard sections\",\"Balance\":\"Balance\",\"Posts\":\"Posts\"},\"Nav\":{\"Admin\":\"Admin\",\"BalancePayout\":\"Balance \u0026 Payout\",\"Campaigns\":\"Campaigns\",\"Contact\":\"Contact\",\"Overview\":\"Overview\",\"SocialAccounts\":\"Social Accounts\",\"SubmittedPosts\":\"Submitted posts\"},\"NotAvailable\":{\"BackToHome\":\"Back to Home\",\"BackToHomeAria\":\"Back to home\",\"Desc\":\"We're rolling the program out gradually. Thanks for your interest.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Earn Program isn't available for your account right now.\"},\"Overview\":{\"LiveForYou\":\"Live for you\",\"NoCampaignsSub\":\"Check back soon — new campaigns to post about will show up here.\",\"NoCampaignsTitle\":\"No live campaigns right now\",\"NoPostsSub\":\"Submit a post to a live campaign and it'll show up here.\",\"NoPostsTitle\":\"No posts yet\",\"RecentPostsTitle\":\"Your recent posts\"},\"Pagination\":{\"Next\":\"Next\",\"PageInfo\":\"Page {page} of {total}\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\"},\"PayoutStatus\":{\"Earning\":\"Earning\",\"Expired\":\"Expired\",\"OnHold\":\"On hold\",\"Paid\":\"Paid\",\"PaidInCredits\":\"Paid in Credits\",\"Sending\":\"Sending\"},\"Reason\":{\"AccountMismatch\":\"Not your account\",\"AccountNotConnected\":\"No connected account\",\"ContentChanged\":\"Content changed after approval\",\"Duplicate\":\"Duplicate post\",\"InappropriateContent\":\"Inappropriate content\",\"InauthenticMetrics\":\"Inauthentic metrics detected\",\"LowQuality\":\"Low quality\",\"MaxSubmission\":\"Submission limit reached\",\"MeshyNotShown\":\"Meshy not shown\",\"MisleadingClaim\":\"Misleading claim\",\"MissingHashtag\":\"Missing hashtag\",\"MissingMention\":\"Missing mention\",\"MissingRequiredElement\":\"Missing required element\",\"NoSupportedPlatform\":\"Unsupported platform\",\"NotOriginal\":\"Not original content\",\"NotPublic\":\"Post not public\",\"NotVideo\":\"Not a video\",\"OutOfWindow\":\"Outside campaign dates\",\"PromotesCompetitor\":\"Promotes a competitor\",\"TermsViolation\":\"Violates program terms\",\"TooShort\":\"Video too short\",\"TopicIrrelevant\":\"Topic not relevant\"},\"ReferenceVideos\":{\"Next\":\"Next reference videos\",\"Prev\":\"Previous reference videos\",\"Title\":\"Inspiration\",\"Views\":\"{views} views\"},\"SeeAll\":\"See all\",\"Sidebar\":{\"Credits\":\"{count, number} credits\",\"EarningsTooltip\":\"Total earnings: {amount} · {credits} credits\"},\"Status\":{\"All\":\"All\",\"Approved\":\"Approved\",\"AutoChecking\":\"Auto-checking\",\"AutoRejected\":\"Auto-rejected\",\"Rejected\":\"Rejected\",\"Reviewing\":\"Reviewing\",\"Revoked\":\"Revoked\"},\"Submissions\":{\"CapBanner\":\"You've hit this campaign's {cap} payout cap. New views won't add more earnings.\",\"CapLabel\":\"{earned} of {cap} cap\",\"CapReachedLabel\":\"Max reached · {earned}\",\"EmptyApproved\":\"No approved posts yet\",\"EmptyRejected\":\"No rejected posts yet\",\"EmptyReviewing\":\"No posts in review yet\",\"EmptyRevoked\":\"No revoked posts yet\",\"EmptyTab\":\"No {status} posts yet\",\"PostCount\":\"{count, plural, one {# post} other {# posts}}\",\"Subtitle\":\"Track your approvals, views, and earnings.\"},\"SubmitFlow\":{\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"Carousel\":{\"Account\":\"Confirming it's from your connected account…\",\"Hashtag\":\"Looking for the campaign hashtag…\",\"Length\":\"Verifying your video length…\",\"Mention\":\"Checking that you mentioned us…\",\"Public\":\"Checking that your post is public…\",\"Window\":\"Making sure it was posted during the campaign…\"},\"Close\":\"Close\",\"Confirm\":{\"Age\":\"I'm 18 or older.\",\"Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Desc\":\"First time joining? Please confirm the basics — we only need to ask once.\",\"Payout\":\"I agree to provide payment details within 12 months, or the reward expires. \u003clink\u003eLearn more\u003c/link\u003e\",\"Saving\":\"Saving…\",\"Title\":\"Before you submit\",\"Tos\":\"I agree to the \u003clink\u003eEarn Program Terms\u003c/link\u003e.\"},\"Detecting\":{\"Desc\":\"Hang tight — please don't close this window. We're running a few quick checks against the campaign rules.\",\"Title\":\"Checking your submission\"},\"Fail\":{\"AccountMismatch\":\"Please submit a post from a connected account.\",\"AccountNotConnected\":\"Please connect and verify your {platform} account first.\",\"BadLink\":\"Please paste a valid link to your post.\",\"Banned\":\"Your earn account is suspended and can't submit new posts.\",\"Duplicate\":\"Please submit a different post — this one has already been submitted.\",\"Generic\":\"This submission didn't pass our checks. Please try again.\",\"Generic2\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again later.\",\"MaxSubmission\":\"You've reached the submission limit for this campaign.\",\"MissingHashtag\":\"Please add the required hashtag(s): {hashtags}.\",\"MissingMention\":\"Please mention {mentions} in your caption.\",\"NoSupportedPlatform\":\"Please submit a post from a supported platform.\",\"NotAccepting\":\"This campaign is no longer accepting submissions.\",\"NotPublic\":\"Please set your post to public.\",\"NotVideo\":\"Please submit a video post.\",\"OutOfWindow\":\"Please submit a post within the campaign window.\",\"SocialFallback\":\"social\",\"TooShort\":\"Please submit a video at least {duration} long.\"},\"Failed\":{\"Title\":\"Couldn't approve this submission\"},\"Paste\":{\"Desc\":\"Paste the public link to your post for \u003cstrong\u003e{name}\u003c/strong\u003e. We'll automatically check it against the campaign rules — usually takes a few seconds.\",\"License\":\"I allow Meshy to use and boost this post in ads \u0026 marketing. \u003clink\u003eLearn more\u003c/link\u003e\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Title\":\"Paste your post link\",\"UrlLabel\":\"Post URL\",\"UrlPlaceholder\":\"https://tiktok.com/@you/video/...\"},\"Success\":{\"Desc\":\"Your post passed all the automatic checks. We'll finish review and let you know once it's approved.\",\"Title\":\"Submitted!\",\"ViewPosts\":\"View Submitted posts\"}},\"Table\":{\"Campaign\":\"Campaign\",\"Cover\":\"Cover\",\"Credits\":\"Credits\",\"Earned\":\"Earned\",\"Id\":\"ID\",\"Payout\":\"Payout\",\"PayoutAria\":\"{status} — view in Balance \u0026 Payout\",\"Platform\":\"Platform\",\"Posted\":\"Posted\",\"Reason\":\"Reason\",\"Status\":\"Status\",\"Submitted\":\"Submitted\",\"Title\":\"Title\",\"Views\":\"Views\"},\"TotalEarnedHero\":{\"Earning\":\"Earning\",\"Expired\":\"Expired\",\"OnHold\":\"On hold\",\"Paid\":\"Paid\",\"Sending\":\"Sending\"},\"TotalEarnings\":\"Total earnings\",\"ViewAll\":\"View all\"}},\"FifaCupRun\":{\"Claim\":{\"BodyAwaiting\":\"Credits unlock the moment your team wins.\",\"BodyClaimed\":\"Watch the next match. Credits drop within minutes of full-time.\",\"BodyEliminated\":\"Final tally locked. Coupons stay claimable until July 27.\",\"BodyPending\":\"Awaiting the knockout draw to confirm your spot.\",\"BodyReady\":\"One tap. Credits hit your wallet instantly.\",\"BodyReadyCoupon\":\"One tap — your credits and {coupons, plural, one {# Pro coupon} other {# Pro coupons}} land instantly.\",\"BtnClaimNow\":\"Claim now\",\"BtnClaiming\":\"Claiming…\",\"BtnViewSummary\":\"View summary\",\"ClaimedToast\":\"+{credits} credits claimed{coupons, plural, =0 {} other { · # Pro coupon}}\",\"ClaimedToastCoupon\":\"{coupons, plural, =1 {Pro coupon claimed} other {# Pro coupons claimed}}\",\"Credits\":\"credits\",\"EyebrowAwaiting\":\"Match in progress · awaiting result\",\"EyebrowClaimed\":\"Last win claimed · next match incoming\",\"EyebrowDraw\":\"Tied {home} {homeScore}–{awayScore} {away}\",\"EyebrowEliminated\":\"{team} eliminated\",\"EyebrowPending\":\"Group stage complete · awaiting the draw\",\"EyebrowWon\":\"Won {home} {homeScore}–{awayScore} {away}\",\"EyebrowWonMulti\":\"{count} wins ready to claim\",\"HeadlineAwaiting\":\"Standing by.\",\"HeadlineClaimed\":\"You're locked in.\",\"HeadlineEliminated\":\"Your run is over.\",\"HeadlinePending\":\"Through the group stage\",\"HeadlineReadyCredits\":\"credits\",\"HeadlineReadyVerb\":\"Claim\",\"PillAwaiting\":\"Awaiting\",\"PillClaimed\":\"Claimed\",\"PillEventEnded\":\"Event ended\",\"PillPending\":\"Awaiting draw\"},\"CommunityChallenge\":{\"BannerAlt\":\"Football Community Challenge\",\"Cta\":\"Join the challenge\",\"Subtitle\":\"Generate your own 3D football moments and share them with the world — a fan-made gallery running alongside the Cup Run, with weekly featured picks.\",\"TitleHighlight\":\"Community Challenge\",\"TitlePrefix\":\"Football\"},\"Content\":{\"HowItWorks\":\"How it works\",\"LoadError\":\"Couldn't load your Cup Run. Pull to refresh or try later.\",\"YourRun\":\"Your run\"},\"EventChip\":{\"CupRun\":\"Cup Run\",\"Ended\":\"Ended\",\"Live\":\"Live\"},\"Header\":{\"LogoAriaLabel\":\"Meshy\",\"StatusEnded\":\"Ended\",\"StatusLive\":\"Live · group stage\"},\"Hero\":{\"CountdownDays\":\"days\",\"CountdownHours\":\"hours\",\"CountdownMinutes\":\"minutes\",\"CtaEventEnded\":\"Event ended\",\"CtaGoToRun\":\"Go to my run\",\"CtaPickTeam\":\"Pick your team\",\"NextKickoff\":\"next kickoff\",\"Subtitle\":\"Pick one of 48 nations. Every time they win, credits land in your wallet.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eUp to 4,800 credits across the tournament.\",\"Title\":\"Pick a team.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eWin \u003ccredits\u003ecredits\u003c/credits\u003e when they \u003cwin\u003ewin.\u003c/win\u003e\"},\"Keychain\":{\"CtaGenerateYours\":\"Generate yours\",\"CtaOrderKeychain\":\"Order keychain\",\"Eyebrow\":\"New · Creative Lab\",\"GlobalBody\":\"Upload any photo — your face, your pet, your match-day moment. We'll generate a 3D football keychain in seconds. Share it, animate it, or send it to a 3D printer.\",\"GlobalFeature1\":\"Subject auto-detected and centered\",\"GlobalFeature2\":\"Football frame and medal design\",\"GlobalFeature3\":\".glb · .stl · .obj exports built-in\",\"GlobalHeadingLine1\":\"Your photo.\",\"GlobalHeadingLine2\":\"Your keychain.\",\"PreviewStep1\":\"01 · photo\",\"PreviewStep2\":\"02 · keychain\",\"Ship9ActionCodePrefix\":\"Code\",\"Ship9ActionEyebrow\":\"Flat-rate shipping\",\"Ship9ActionHeadingPrefix\":\"PRINT \u0026 SHIP TO YOUR DOOR.\",\"Ship9Step1Primary\":\"Upload your photo\",\"Ship9Step2Primary\":\"Generated in 1 min\",\"Ship9Step3Primary\":\"Shipped to your door\",\"Ship9TitlePrefix\":\"FREE GENERATION · $29 TO PRINT \u0026 SHIP\",\"TitleLine1\":\"Turn your photo\",\"TitleLine2Highlight\":\"football keychain.\",\"TitleLine2Prefix\":\"into a\"},\"NationPicker\":{\"CloseAriaLabel\":\"Close\",\"ModalAriaLabel\":\"Pick your team\",\"OnePickWarning\":\"You can only pick \u003cstrong\u003eonce\u003c/strong\u003e during the event. Choose carefully.\",\"PickTeamTitle\":\"Pick {name}\",\"SearchAriaLabel\":\"Search nations\",\"SearchPlaceholder\":\"search team...\",\"StatusEliminated\":\"eliminated\",\"StepLabel\":\"Step 01 · choose your nation\",\"TabAll\":\"all · {count}\",\"TabEliminated\":\"out · {count}\",\"TabLive\":\"live · {count}\",\"TeamEliminatedTitle\":\"{name} — eliminated\",\"Title\":\"Pick your \u003chighlight\u003eteam\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"WinsCount\":\"{count} W\"},\"PickCta\":{\"Heading\":\"PICK. SIT BACK. EARN\",\"SectionAriaLabel\":\"How Cup Run works\",\"Step1Body\":\"48 nations. Pick one. Once you pick, it's locked in.\",\"Step1CtaEnded\":\"Event ended\",\"Step1CtaOngoing\":\"Pick your team\",\"Step1Title\":\"Pick a team\",\"Step2Body\":\"Your team wins, you earn credits. Come back to claim them. Up to 8 wins counted.\",\"Step2Cta\":\"See rewards\",\"Step2Title\":\"They win, you earn\",\"Step3Body\":\"Every credit brings your ideas to life.\",\"Step3Cta\":\"Go to Workspace\",\"Step3Title\":\"Create more\"},\"Pricing\":{\"BillingMonthly\":\"Monthly\",\"BillingYearly\":\"Yearly\",\"CurrentPlanBadge\":\"Current plan\",\"FreeBonusMatch\":\"25 credits per match win\",\"FreeCtaLabel\":\"Get started\",\"FreeFeature1\":\"100 monthly credits\",\"FreeFeature2\":\"1 concurrent task\",\"FreeFeature3\":\"Basic AI features\",\"FreeFeature4\":\"Non-commercial license\",\"FreeSubtitle\":\"No credit card needed\",\"MostPopular\":\"MOST POPULAR\",\"PeriodFirstMonth\":\"/first month\",\"PeriodMonth\":\"/month\",\"PeriodSeatFirstMonth\":\"/seat/first month\",\"PeriodSeatYear\":\"/seat/year\",\"PeriodYear\":\"/year\",\"ProBonusMonthly\":\"2× credits per match win\",\"ProBonusYearly\":\"8× credits per match win\",\"ProCtaLabel\":\"Upgrade to Pro\",\"ProFeature1\":\"1,000 monthly credits\",\"ProFeature2\":\"10 concurrent tasks\",\"ProFeature3\":\"60% faster generation speed\",\"ProFeature4\":\"Private license for all assets\",\"ProFeature5\":\"Unlimited 3D model downloads\",\"ProFeature6\":\"Full DCC bridge\",\"ProSubtitle\":\"Best for individual creators\",\"StudioBonusMonthly\":\"6× credits per match win\",\"StudioBonusYearly\":\"24× credits per match win\",\"StudioCtaLabel\":\"Upgrade to Studio\",\"StudioFeature1\":\"Everything in Pro, plus:\",\"StudioFeature2\":\"4,000 monthly credits\",\"StudioFeature3\":\"20 concurrent tasks\",\"StudioFeature4\":\"Team management\",\"StudioFeature5\":\"Shared team credits\",\"StudioSubtitle\":\"Best for studios and teams\",\"SubtitleGlobal\":\"Same team, same wins. Higher plan, more credits per match. Up to 24× with Studio Yearly plan.\",\"TitleFreeHighlight\":\"Multiply\",\"TitleFreePrefix\":\"Upgrade your plan.\",\"TitleFreeSuffix\":\"your credits.\",\"YourCurrentPlanCta\":\"Your current plan\"},\"Rewards\":{\"