owser\",\"Item5\":\"Create stylized characters including anime, cartoon, low-poly, chibi and realistic\",\"Item6\":\"AI text-to-3D and image-to-3D generation in Meshy Workspace with photoreal PBR textures\",\"Item7\":\"Automatic rigging with a humanoid or quadruped skeleton, with no manual bone setup\",\"Item8\":\"Built-in animation library with walk, run, idle, attack and more\",\"Item9\":\"Export FBX, GLB, OBJ and STL for Unity, Unreal, Blender, Godot, Roblox and 3D printing\"},\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Character Generator\"},\"Slider\":{\"DefaultTooltip\":\"Default: {value}\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"LovedByCreators\":\"Loved by 10M+ Creators Worldwide\",\"PartnersLead\":\"Trusted by\"},\"Tabs\":{\"Environment\":\"Environment\",\"Logo\":\"Logo\",\"Material\":\"Material\"},\"Text\":{\"BevelEnableLabel\":\"Enable bevel\",\"BevelLabel\":\"Bevel\",\"BevelSizeLabel\":\"Bevel size\",\"BevelThicknessLabel\":\"Bevel thickness\",\"DepthLabel\":\"Depth\",\"SizeLabel\":\"Size\"},\"TextTo3DLink\":{\"Lead\":\"Prefer a text logo or character? Type your character name and extrude it into a 3D model, with fonts, depth and bevel included.\",\"LinkLabel\":\"Open the 3D Text Generator\",\"Tail\":\"tool, the same pipeline that ships to game studios, Roblox creators and product designers.\"},\"Title\":\"Free 3D Character Generator Online: Export GLB, OBJ, STL \u0026 PNG\",\"Upload\":{\"DismissHint\":\"Dismiss\",\"Dropzone\":\"Drop your reference image here\",\"ErrorBadFormat\":\"Unsupported format. Use PNG, JPG or SVG.\",\"ErrorBadSvg\":\"That doesn't look like valid SVG markup.\",\"ErrorGeneric\":\"Something went wrong while processing your character. Try a different file.\",\"ErrorNoPaths\":\"We couldn't find any shapes to extrude. Try a higher-contrast image or upload an SVG.\",\"ErrorTooLarge\":\"File too large. Max 5MB.\",\"Hint\":\"PNG, JPG or SVG · max 5MB · or hit Create to start from text\",\"Label\":\"Reference image (optional)\",\"PasteLabel\":\"Paste SVG code\",\"PastePlaceholder\":\"Paste SVG markup here…\",\"PasteSubmit\":\"Use this SVG\",\"PastedLabel\":\"Pasted SVG\",\"Posterize\":\"Posterize to black \u0026 white\",\"Retrace\":\"Re-trace with current settings\",\"Sample\":{\"Diamond\":\"Diamond\",\"Hexagon\":\"Hexagon\",\"Monogram\":\"Monogram\",\"Shield\":\"Shield\",\"Star\":\"Star\",\"Wave\":\"Wave\"},\"Samples\":\"Or start from a sample\",\"Smoothing\":\"Smoothing\",\"TabPaste\":\"Paste SVG\",\"TabUpload\":\"Upload\",\"Tracing\":\"Tracing your image…\",\"WorkspaceHint\":\"Looking for a fully textured 3D character? Try Meshy Workspace.\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Article1\":{\"Tag\":\"GUIDE\",\"Title\":\"The best free AI animation generators, compared\"},\"Article2\":{\"Tag\":\"TUTORIAL\",\"Title\":\"The 3D animation pipeline, stage by stage\"},\"Article3\":{\"Tag\":\"INSIGHTS\",\"Title\":\"How AI is reshaping animation workflows\"},\"Card1Description\":\"Prototype NPCs, enemies and player characters in hours instead of weeks. Rigged FBX drops straight into Unity and Unreal.\",\"Card1Title\":\"Game development\",\"Card2Description\":\"Block out shots fast with stylized or photoreal characters, then animate using built-in motion presets.\",\"Card2Title\":\"Animation \u0026 film\",\"Card3Description\":\"Spin up real 3D characters for AR/VR storyboards and immersive prototypes. WebXR-ready GLB exports.\",\"Card3Title\":\"XR / VR prototyping\",\"Card4Description\":\"Print collectibles, figurines and minis from your own AI-generated characters in STL or OBJ.\",\"Card4Title\":\"3D printing\",\"Description\":\"See how creators put Meshy 3D characters to work, from rigging to animation.\",\"Title\":\"3D character use cases\"},\"Workflows\":{\"AnimeCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Generate anime characters\",\"Description\":\"Tuned for anime and stylized characters, with sharp silhouettes, big eyes, expressive proportions and no model wrangling.\",\"Title\":\"Anime 3D character\"},\"CartoonCard\":{\"Description\":\"Bold, clean cartoon characters with friendly, exaggerated proportions, straight from a prompt or image.\",\"Title\":\"3D cartoon character\"},\"ChibiCard\":{\"Description\":\"Cute super-deformed chibi characters with oversized heads and tiny bodies, rigged and ready to animate.\",\"Title\":\"Chibi 3D character\"},\"Description\":\"Start from a text prompt, a reference image, or dive into the most-requested anime style.\",\"ImageCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Try image to 3D\",\"Description\":\"Upload a concept sketch, photo or reference render and convert it into a clean, rigged 3D character.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D character\"},\"LowPolyCard\":{\"Description\":\"Game-ready low-poly characters with crisp flat-shaded facets, perfect for mobile and stylized games.\",\"Title\":\"Low-poly 3D character\"},\"RealisticCard\":{\"Description\":\"Photoreal humans and creatures with detailed PBR textures, rigged for film, VFX and AAA games.\",\"Title\":\"Realistic 3D character\"},\"StyleCta\":\"Create this style\",\"TextCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Try text to 3D\",\"Description\":\"Describe your character in plain language and Meshy renders a real 3D mesh, with pose, costume, props and all.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D character\"},\"Title\":\"Three ways to create your 3D character\"},\"WorkflowsNeo\":{\"AnimateLink\":\"Animate 3D character\",\"ImageDescription\":\"Upload concept art, a photo, or a sketch, and Meshy rebuilds it as a fully textured 3D character.\",\"ImageTitle\":\"Turn any image into a 3D character\",\"SectionDescription\":\"Type a prompt or upload a reference image, and Meshy turns it into a fully textured, riggable 3D character in about a minute, so you can create 3D characters without manual modeling.\",\"SectionTitle\":\"How to create 3D characters from an image or text\",\"StartCta\":\"Create My 3D Character\",\"TabImage\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TabText\":\"Text to 3D\",\"TextDescription\":\"Type a prompt covering style, outfit and pose, and Meshy generates a rigged, animation-ready character.\",\"TextTitle\":\"Describe it, generate a 3D character\",\"UploadImage\":\"Upload Image\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Features\":{\"2DConverterFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Preserve complex geometric structures during conversion with our AI technology. Experience breathtaking realism with intricate mesh details, ensuring your 3D models maintain the precision of their original 2D images.\",\"Title\":\"Intricate geometry details\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Experience superior de-lit texture processing that separates lighting from albeto map. Enjoy pure, high-fidelity textures with preserved color accuracy that brings your 3D assets to life in any environment.\",\"Title\":\"Unmatched texture quality\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Convert everything from photorealistic characters to stylized props without quality loss. Our versatile tool handles diverse artistic styles, preserving the unique aesthetic of each 3D model regardless of design approach.\",\"Title\":\"Wide range of styles\"}},\"3DConverterFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Transform complex models in seconds rather than minutes with our optimized algorithms. Experience conversion speeds up to 10× faster than traditional desktop applications, accelerating your production workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Insanely fast\"}},\"3DFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Work seamlessly with industry-standard formats including OBJ, USDZ, STL, GLTF, and more. Eliminate compatibility barriers between different 3D applications with comprehensive format conversion options.\",\"Title\":\"Popular file formats support\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Convert files instantly in your browser without software installation or account creation. Upload your 3D asset, select your output format, and transform your model with zero unnecessary steps.\",\"Title\":\"No login \u0026 download required\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Access professional-grade conversion technology at zero cost. We’ve removed financial barriers to empower students, indie developers, hobbyists, and professional studios with enterprise-level 3D conversion tools.\",\"Title\":\"Free to all 3D creators\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Your intellectual property remains secure. Files are processed at client side and will never leave your browser or uploaded to our server, ensuring complete confidentiality.\",\"Title\":\"Privacy protection\"}}},\"FileCompressor\":{\"Achievements\":{\"Trusted\":\"Trusted by\"},\"AllCompressors\":\"All 3D File Compressors\",\"Breadcrumb\":{\"FileCompressor\":\"3D File Compressor\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Comparison\":{\"ColAfter\":\"After\",\"ColBefore\":\"Before\",\"ColMetric\":\"Metric\",\"MetricFileSize\":\"File Size\",\"MetricPrintability\":\"Printability\",\"MetricTriangles\":\"Triangles\",\"MetricUploadTime\":\"Upload Time\",\"Subtitle\":\"Representative results for typical {format} models. Actual savings depend on your file's geometry and redundancy.\",\"Title\":\"{format} File: Before vs. After Compression\",\"ValueFast\":\"Fast\",\"ValuePreserved\":\"Preserved\",\"ValueSlow\":\"Slow\",\"ValueYes\":\"Yes\"},\"Compress\":{\"AlreadyOptimized\":\"File is already well-optimized — no size reduction was possible.\",\"CompressAnother\":\"Compress Another\",\"CompressButton\":\"Compress\",\"Compressing\":\"Compressing…\",\"Download\":\"Download\",\"ErrorMessage\":\"Compression failed. Please try again.\",\"RatioHint\":\"Expected size reduction: {ratio}\",\"SizeIncreased\":\"Converted: {original} → {compressed} (size increased after format conversion)\",\"SizeResult\":\"Original: {original} → Compressed: {compressed} ({pct}% smaller)\"},\"Compressor\":\"{format} Compressor\",\"Description\":\"3D File Compressor Online – Compress GLB, OBJ, STL, PLY \u0026 FBX\",\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"We currently support GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX. Each format is processed with a tailored optimization strategy — for example, GLB/GLTF files undergo geometry deduplication, material merging, and unused data pruning, while OBJ, STL, and PLY are re-exported in optimized binary form. FBX files are converted to compact GLB for maximum portability.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes — for visible geometry, compression is fully lossless. The optimizer removes duplicate vertices, merges redundant materials, and prunes unused nodes, but never discards, simplifies, or approximates any mesh data. What you see before compression is exactly what you get after.\",\"Answer3\":\"No. The entire compression pipeline runs locally in your browser via WebAssembly and JavaScript. Your file never leaves your device, and no data is transmitted to any server at any point.\",\"Answer4\":\"Results vary depending on the file’s structure and redundancy. GLB and GLTF files typically shrink by 10–40% through vertex deduplication and data pruning. OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX files generally see 10–30% reductions. Files with more duplicate vertices or unused scene data will benefit the most.\",\"Answer5\":\"Nothing at all. The tool runs entirely in your web browser — no plugins, no extensions, no downloads. Just open the page, upload your file, and compress.\",\"Answer6\":\"The current limit is 200 MB per file. Processing time depends on both file size and complexity; most files complete in seconds, but highly detailed models on lower-end devices may take a bit longer.\",\"Answer7\":\"Absolutely. The output is a fully standards-compliant binary glTF file, compatible with Three.js, Babylon.js, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and virtually all modern 3D engines and web viewers. No special import settings are needed.\",\"Answer8\":\"FBX files are converted to GLB as part of the compression process. Static mesh geometry and basic transforms carry over reliably, but complex FBX-native features — such as blend shapes, advanced animation curves, or proprietary material setups — may not transfer perfectly. We recommend testing the output if your FBX relies on these features.\",\"Question1\":\"What 3D file formats are supported?\",\"Question2\":\"Is the compression lossless?\",\"Question3\":\"Is my file uploaded to a server?\",\"Question4\":\"How much can I reduce the file size?\",\"Question5\":\"Do I need to install anything?\",\"Question6\":\"What is the maximum file size?\",\"Question7\":\"Will the compressed GLB work with my 3D engine?\",\"Question8\":\"What happens to FBX animations during compression?\",\"SubpageAnswer1\":\"Upload your {format} file by dragging it into the upload area or clicking to select it, then click Compress. Your compressed file will be ready to download instantly.\",\"SubpageAnswer2\":\"No. Meshy's compression is lossless for visible geometry, so it never changes your model's dimensions, wall thickness, or surface detail. Your slicer reads exactly the same mesh, just in a smaller file. It only removes duplicate vertices, redundant materials, and unused scene data, none of which affect the printed result. For printing, compress to STL or OBJ, the formats most slicers expect. See our \u003cprintTypes\u003eguide to 3D print file types\u003c/printTypes\u003e and \u003cprinterFiles\u003e3D printing use cases\u003c/printerFiles\u003e.\",\"SubpageAnswer3\":\"3D files usually balloon from high polygon counts, duplicate vertices, embedded high-resolution textures, and unused scene data left behind by modeling software. Formats like OBJ, STL, and PLY also store geometry as verbose ASCII by default, which can be several times larger than the equivalent binary file. Our compressor strips that redundancy and re-exports in optimized binary form, typically cutting 10–40% with no loss of visible detail. If you also need a different format, try our \u003cconverter\u003e3D file converter\u003c/converter\u003e alongside the compressor.\",\"SubpageAnswer4\":\"Not with this tool. The {format} compressor is fully lossless. It shrinks your file by removing duplicate and unused data while deliberately keeping every polygon, so the model looks identical before and after. Reducing the actual polygon count requires mesh decimation or remeshing, which is a separate step from compression. You can generate optimized, lower-poly models in \u003cworkspace\u003eMeshy Workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e (handy for \u003cgameAssets\u003egame assets\u003c/gameAssets\u003e) and then run them through this compressor for an even smaller file.\",\"SubpageAnswer5\":\"Completely. The entire compression process runs locally in your browser using WebAssembly. Your {format} file is never uploaded to a server, and no data leaves your device at any point. Because nothing is transmitted or stored, there's no account, sign-in, or cloud processing involved. The same privacy-first, in-browser approach powers all of our \u003ctools\u003e3D tools\u003c/tools\u003e.\",\"SubpageQuestion1\":\"How do I compress a {format} file?\",\"SubpageQuestion2\":\"Does compression affect 3D printing?\",\"SubpageQuestion3\":\"Why is my 3D file so large?\",\"SubpageQuestion4\":\"Can I reduce polygon count in {format} files?\",\"SubpageQuestion5\":\"Is my file secure?\"},\"Features\":{\"Draco\":{\"Description\":\"Automatically removes duplicate vertices, merges redundant materials, and prunes unused data from your 3D models — delivering smaller files with zero quality loss.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Geometry Optimization\"},\"Fast\":{\"Description\":\"All compression runs locally in your browser. No server uploads, no waiting — results are ready in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Fast, In-Browser Processing\"},\"Formats\":{\"Description\":\"Works with GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX. Each format is handled by a purpose-built optimization pipeline for maximum compression efficiency.\",\"Title\":\"Popular Format Support\"},\"NoAccount\":{\"Description\":\"No sign-ups, no logins, no paywalls. Open the page, drop your file, and download the optimized result.\",\"Title\":\"No Account Needed\"},\"Privacy\":{\"Description\":\"Your files never leave your device. Every step of the compression pipeline runs entirely client-side, ensuring complete data confidentiality.\",\"Title\":\"Privacy by Design\"},\"SubpageTitle\":\"Why Choose Meshy's \u003chighlight\u003e{format} File Compressor\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy's \u003chighlight\u003e3D File Compressor\u003c/highlight\u003e\"},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Reduce 3D model file sizes for free — no uploads, no account needed. Meshy removes duplicate vertices and unused geometry data from GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX files directly in your browser, with zero quality loss.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Reduce the file size of {format} online for free, with minimal quality loss for intended use. This web-based tool runs in your browser with no software download required and produces a clean, compressed {format} file.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Free {format} File Compressor Online\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D File Compressor Online\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drag and drop your model or click to browse. Works with GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX files up to 200 MB. No account or software install required.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Drag and drop your {format} file or click to browse. Files up to 200 MB are supported. No account or software install required.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Upload a {format} File\",\"Title\":\"Upload Your File\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Click Compress and your model is optimized right in the browser. Meshy merges duplicate vertices and prunes unused data in seconds. Nothing is ever uploaded, so your files stay private.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Click Compress and your {format} model is optimized right in the browser. Meshy merges duplicate vertices and prunes unused data in seconds. Nothing is ever uploaded, so your files stay private.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Click Compress\",\"Title\":\"Compress\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Download the optimized file instantly. You'll see the exact before-and-after size and how much you saved. If a file can't be shrunk further, you get the original back untouched, never a larger one.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Download the optimized {format} file instantly. You'll see the exact before-and-after size and how much you saved. If it can't be shrunk further, you get the original back untouched, never a larger one.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Download\",\"Title\":\"Download\"},\"SubpageTitle\":\"How to Compress {format} Files Online\",\"Subtitle\":\"Reduce file size in three steps — everything runs in your browser\",\"Title\":\"How to Compress 3D Files Online\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"RelatedTitle\":\"Related File Compressors\",\"SectionTitle\":\"Compress Other 3D Formats\"},\"Popular\":{\"Group3DPrinting\":\"3D Printing\",\"GroupARVR\":\"AR / VR\",\"GroupGameDev\":\"Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"Popular Compressors\"},\"Schema\":{\"Feature1\":\"Compress {format} files in the browser\",\"Feature2\":\"No file upload to server — full privacy\",\"Feature3\":\"Vertex deduplication and pruning for lossless size reduction\",\"Feature4\":\"Supports GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, PLY, FBX\",\"Feature5\":\"No software installation required\",\"Feature6\":\"Free to use with no account\",\"ItemListName\":\"3D File Compressors by Format\"},\"Select\":{\"Placeholder\":\"File format\"},\"SubpageDescription\":\"Reduce {format} file size online for free with minimal quality loss. Runs in your browser — no download, no sign-up — and outputs a clean, compressed {format} file.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"{format} File Compressor – Reduce File Size Without Quality Loss\",\"Tips\":\"Select a format to go to the dedicated compressor page\",\"Title\":\"3D File Compressor Online – Compress GLB, OBJ, STL, PLY \u0026 FBX\"},\"FileConverter\":{\"Achievements\":{\"Creators\":{\"Title\":\"Community Creators\"},\"Heading\":\"Have you tried \u003cb\u003eMeshy\u003c/b\u003e? Generate 3D models in seconds using text or images.\",\"Start\":\"Start for Free\",\"Trusted\":\"Trusted by\"},\"AllConverters\":\"All 3D File Converters\",\"AllConvertersFormat\":\"{format} Converters\",\"Batch\":{\"BannerDescription\":\"Convert up to {max} files at once and download them as a single .zip.\",\"BannerTitle\":\"Batch conversion is a Pro feature\",\"ClearAll\":\"Clear all\",\"ConvertAll\":\"Convert all · {count}\",\"DownloadAria\":\"Download file\",\"DownloadZip\":\"Download .zip\",\"DropPrompt\":\"Drop {from} files or \u003cb\u003ebrowse\u003c/b\u003e\",\"FileCounter\":\"{count} / {max} files\",\"FileSummary\":\"{count} files · {size}\",\"MaxFilesToast\":\"You can batch-convert up to {max} files at once.\",\"ModeBatch\":\"Batch\",\"ModeSingle\":\"Single file\",\"PerFileSize\":\"{max}MB each\",\"RemoveAria\":\"Remove file\",\"Retry\":\"Retry\",\"SizeErrorToast\":\"Some files were skipped — each file must be under {max}MB.\",\"StatusConverting\":\"Converting\",\"StatusDone\":\"Done\",\"StatusFailed\":\"Failed\",\"StatusQueued\":\"Queued\",\"TypeErrorToast\":\"Some files were skipped — unsupported format.\",\"UpgradeToPro\":\"Upgrade to Pro\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"FileConverter\":\"3D File Converter\",\"PairLabel\":\"{from} to {to}\"},\"CTA\":{\"Button\":\"Convert a File\",\"Description\":\"Fast, free, and secure — convert between OBJ, FBX, STL, GLB, and more right in your browser.\",\"Title\":\"Start Converting Your 3D Files Now\"},\"Convert\":\"Convert {from} to {to}\",\"ConvertAnother\":\"Convert Another\",\"ConvertAnother3DModel\":\"Convert Another 3D Model\",\"ConvertErrorToast\":\"Unable to convert the model. Ensure the file is valid and supported.\",\"ConvertImage\":\"Convert Image to 3D model\",\"ConvertSuccessToast\":\"Conversion successfully completed.\",\"Description\":\"Convert 3D model files online for free with high-quality results. Meshy's web based converter works directly in your browser, no software download required.\",\"Download\":\"Download File\",\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Meshy's 3D file converter is built for 3D workflows. It runs entirely in your browser — no installs, no signups required — and preserves geometry, materials, and mesh structure during conversion. Whether you're preparing \u003cgameAssets\u003egame assets\u003c/gameAssets\u003e, \u003cprinting\u003e3D printing\u003c/printing\u003e, or \u003canimation\u003e3D Animation\u003c/animation\u003e, Meshy handles the format handoff cleanly, so you can stay focused on creating. Not sure which format fits your use case? Check out our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file format guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e.\",\"Answer10\":\"Vertex color preservation across formats:\\n\\n- GLB / glTF — full support (COLOR_0 attribute). Native.\\n- PLY — full support, used heavily in scanning workflows.\\n- FBX — supported but inconsistent across versions / exporters. Some FBX consumers ignore vertex colors.\\n- OBJ — limited support. Standard OBJ doesn't have vertex colors; some extensions add them but most importers ignore.\\n- STL — no support. Geometry only.\\n- 3MF — supports per-face/vertex colors and is the right print-format choice when colors must survive.\\n\\nWhen converting from GLB:\\n\\n- Printer with color support (Bambu AMS, Prusa MMU): export 3MF directly from Meshy.\\n- Renderer / engine: keep GLB. Don't convert to OBJ.\\n- Research/scanning workflow: PLY.\\n- FBX-only destination: convert via Blender, verify vertex color export setting in the FBX export dialog.\\n\\nMeshy exports GLB, FBX, OBJ, USDZ, STL, 3MF directly from the same task — pick the format that keeps the data your destination needs.\",\"Answer11\":\"Unit consistency depends on explicit unit handling at conversion time. Reliable approaches:\\n\\n1. Meshy's export — download multiple formats from the same task. All come from the same internal mesh, so scale and orientation match across GLB/OBJ/STL.\\n2. Blender — File → Import, then Scene Properties → Units → Length: Millimeters or Meters. Re-export with consistent units across formats. Reliable for batch work via scripting.\\n3. gltf-transform CLI — preserves units of source GLB; doesn't re-scale. Good for GLB → optimized GLB.\\n4. Assimp library — programmatic conversion with unit awareness; good for custom pipelines.\\n\\nAvoid converters that don't expose unit settings — they often default to \\\"as-is\\\" which leads to silent unit drift.\\n\\nStandard practice: Pick mm or meters as your project default. Ensure every export step uses that unit. Re-import to validate; bounding-box dimensions should match expectations. STL is unitless — apply your unit convention consistently when slicing or scaling.\",\"Answer12\":\"$41\",\"Answer13\":\"GLB → OBJ with consistent scale and orientation:\\n\\n1. Cleanest path — re-export from Meshy. The same task that produced the GLB also exports OBJ; both come from the same internal mesh, so scale and orientation match.\\n2. If you only have the GLB, use Blender:\\n   - File → Import → glTF 2.0 (.glb / .gltf). Confirm the model loads at the expected scale.\\n   - File → Export → Wavefront (.obj). In the export dialog, set Forward = -Z and Up = Y to match GLB conventions. Set Scale = 1.\\n   - This preserves scale and the GLB's Y-up coordinate system in the OBJ.\\n3. Watch for unit conversions — Blender works in meters; OBJ has no unit metadata. Verify scale post-import in your target program.\\n4. Materials — OBJ + MTL doesn't carry PBR. Textures will export, but the metalness/roughness won't survive. For PBR fidelity, stay in GLB.\\n\\nFor batch conversions, command-line tools like gltf-pipeline + custom scripts work, but the Blender path is most reliable for one-offs.\",\"Answer2\":\"Free users can convert one file at a time. Pro users can process multiple files in a single session with faster turnaround. If you need batch conversion for a larger pipeline, check out \u003capi\u003eMeshy's API\u003c/api\u003e for programmatic access.\",\"Answer3\":\"Yes. Your files are processed locally in your browser and are not sent to or stored on external servers. If you're working with sensitive or proprietary models, see our \u003cprivacy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacy\u003e for full details.\",\"Answer4\":\"Most conversions complete in under 30 seconds. Conversion time depends on file size and mesh complexity. Very large files or models with high polygon counts may take slightly longer. If processing takes more than a few minutes, try reducing the polygon count before uploading.\",\"Answer5\":\"Before converting, keep these in mind: Data loss between formats — the target format may not support certain material channels, animation rigs, or metadata present in the source format. Review our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file format guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e to understand what each format supports before converting. Watertight geometry for \u003cprintTypes\u003e3D printing\u003c/printTypes\u003e — If you plan to use the output for \u003cprintTypes\u003e3D printing\u003c/printTypes\u003e, check that your model is manifold (watertight) before uploading. External textures — Textures referenced externally may need to be packed or re-linked after conversion. Meshy automatically transfers embedded textures, but external texture files require manual processing. Scale units — Different formats sometimes use different default unit systems. Review your model's scale after conversion, especially if importing into a game engine like Unity or Unreal Engine.\",\"Answer6\":\"Meshy's converter accurately transfers geometry, face normals, UV coordinates, and basic material properties. Format-specific features that have no equivalent in the target format will be approximated or omitted. For production-critical assets, we recommend spot-checking the converted file in your target application before integrating it into a larger pipeline.\",\"Answer7\":\"After downloading your converted file, verify: 1. Geometry is intact with no missing faces or flipped normals 2. Textures and materials are applied correctly 3. Scale and orientation match your target application or engine 4. The file opens without errors in your target software\",\"Answer8\":\"Yes. Once converted, you can use your file directly with other Meshy tools — including the \u003ctextureGen\u003eAI Texture Generator\u003c/textureGen\u003e to apply new surface materials, the \u003cviewer\u003e3D Viewer\u003c/viewer\u003e to check your model, and the retopology and remesh features available in the \u003cworkspace\u003eMeshy workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e. The converted file is compatible with the full Meshy 3D pipeline.\",\"Answer9\":\"If your conversion fails, try the following steps: 1. Make sure your file is not corrupted — open it in another application to verify 2. Check that the file is within the 50 MB size limit 3. Remove any non-standard or proprietary data before re-uploading\",\"Question1\":\"Why use Meshy's 3D file converter?\",\"Question10\":\"Which target formats preserve vertex colors when converting from GLB, and which should I choose?\",\"Question11\":\"Which converters are known for keeping units consistent across GLB/OBJ/STL conversions without messing up scale?\",\"Question12\":\"How much more does a paid 3D file converter cost than free options, and what do you get for upgrading?\",\"Question13\":\"What's the most reliable way to convert a GLB into an OBJ while keeping the model's scale and orientation consistent?\",\"Question2\":\"How many files can I convert at once?\",\"Question3\":\"Is it safe to upload my 3D files to this converter?\",\"Question4\":\"How long does it take to convert a 3D file?\",\"Question5\":\"Key considerations before converting 3D files\",\"Question6\":\"How accurate is the 3D file converter?\",\"Question7\":\"What should I check after converting my file?\",\"Question8\":\"Can I use the converted file with other Meshy tools?\",\"Question9\":\"I am unable to convert my file — what should I do?\",\"SubpageAnswer1\":\"Meshy's {from} to {to} converter is built for 3D workflows. It runs entirely in your browser — no installs, no signups required — and preserves geometry, materials, and mesh structure during conversion. Whether you're preparing \u003cgameAssets\u003egame assets\u003c/gameAssets\u003e, \u003cprinting\u003e3D printing\u003c/printing\u003e, or \u003canimation\u003e3D Animation\u003c/animation\u003e, Meshy handles the format handoff cleanly, so you can stay focused on creating. Not sure which format fits your use case? Check out our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file format guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e.\",\"SubpageAnswer4\":\"Most {from} to {to} conversions complete in under 30 seconds. Conversion time depends on file size and mesh complexity. Very large files or models with high polygon counts may take slightly longer. If processing takes more than a few minutes, try reducing the polygon count before uploading.\",\"SubpageAnswer5\":\"Before converting, keep these in mind: Data loss between formats — {to} may not support certain material channels, animation rigs, or metadata present in {from}. Review our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file format guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e to understand what each format supports before converting. Watertight geometry for \u003cprintTypes\u003e3D printing\u003c/printTypes\u003e — If you plan to use the output for \u003cprintTypes\u003e3D printing\u003c/printTypes\u003e, check that your model is manifold (watertight) before uploading. External textures — Textures referenced externally in {from} files may need to be packed or re-linked after conversion. Meshy automatically transfers embedded textures, but external texture files require manual processing. Scale units — {from} and {to} sometimes use different default unit systems. Review your model's scale after conversion, especially if importing into a game engine like Unity or Unreal Engine.\",\"SubpageAnswer6\":\"Meshy's converter accurately transfers geometry, face normals, UV coordinates, and basic material properties from {from} to {to}. Format-specific features that have no equivalent in {to} will be approximated or omitted. For production-critical assets, we recommend spot-checking the converted file in your target application before integrating it into a larger pipeline.\",\"SubpageAnswer8\":\"Yes. Once converted, you can use your {to} file directly with other Meshy tools — including the \u003ctextureGen\u003eAI Texture Generator\u003c/textureGen\u003e to apply new surface materials, the \u003cviewer\u003e3D Viewer\u003c/viewer\u003e to check your model, and the retopology and remesh features available in the \u003cworkspace\u003eMeshy workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e. The {to} format is compatible with the full Meshy 3D pipeline.\",\"SubpageAnswer9\":\"If your conversion fails, try the following steps: 1. Make sure your {from} file is not corrupted — open it in another application to verify 2. Check that the file is within the 50 MB size limit 3. Remove any non-standard or proprietary data before re-uploading\",\"SubpageQuestion1\":\"Why use Meshy's {from} to {to} converter?\",\"SubpageQuestion2\":\"How many {to} files can I convert at once?\",\"SubpageQuestion3\":\"Is it safe to upload my {from} files to this converter?\",\"SubpageQuestion4\":\"How long does it take to convert a {from} file to {to}?\",\"SubpageQuestion5\":\"Key considerations before converting .{from} to .{to}\",\"SubpageQuestion6\":\"How accurate is the {from} to {to} converter?\",\"SubpageQuestion7\":\"What should I check after converting to {to}?\",\"SubpageQuestion8\":\"Can I use the converted {to} file with other Meshy tools?\",\"SubpageQuestion9\":\"I am unable to convert {from} to {to} — what should I do?\"},\"FeaturesTitle\":\"Everything You Need to \u003chighlight\u003eConvert 3D Files\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Free, instant, browser-based. No login needed. Files never leave your device. Just drag and drop your image or 3D model file to convert it to any popular format. (OBJ/STL/GLB/DXF/USDZ/GLTF/PLY/3MF)\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Convert {from} to {to} online for free with high-quality results. This web based file converter works in your browser with no software download required on your device and produces clean, compatible {to} files suitable for 3D printing and editing workflows.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Free {from} to {to} Converter\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Model File Converter\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Simply drag and drop your 3D model file into the designated area or click to convert your files. Our converter supports popular formats including OBJ, FBX, STL, GLTF, and USDZ files. The maximum supported file size is 50MB.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Simply drag and drop your {from} file into the designated area or click to convert your files to {to}. Our converter supports popular formats including OBJ, FBX, STL, GLTF, and USDZ files. The maximum supported file size is 50MB.\",\"SubpageDescription2D\":\"Simply open our Image to 3D workspace, drag and drop your {from} file into the designated area. Our Image to 3D converter supports popular formats including PNG, JPEG and WEBP files. The maximum supported file size is 20MB.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Upload a(an) {from} File\",\"Title\":\"Upload a 3D Model File\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Select your desired output format from the dropdown menu. Our tool automatically preserves geometry details, materials, and textures during conversion without requiring any technical knowledge or additional software.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Select {to} from the dropdown menu. Our tool automatically preserves geometry details, materials, and textures during conversion without requiring any technical knowledge or additional software.\",\"SubpageDescription2D\":\"Click “Generate” to convert your model to 3D. Our tool can generate aligned geometry and detailed textures during conversion without requiring any technical knowledge or additional software.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Convert to {to}\",\"Title\":\"Convert to Another Format\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Once conversion completes in seconds, click the download button to save your converted 3D model. All files are processed locally in your browser, ensuring complete privacy and immediate availability of your content.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Once conversion completes in seconds, click the download button to save your {to} 3D model. All files are processed locally in your browser, ensuring complete privacy and immediate availability of your content.\",\"SubpageDescription2D\":\"Once generation completes in seconds, click the download button to save your {to} 3D model. With this method, you can get a \u003clink\u003e3D model from a 2D image\u003c/link\u003e in seconds, not hours or even days.\",\"Title\":\"Download Your Model\"},\"SubpageTitle\":\"How to Convert {from} to {to}\",\"Title\":\"How to Convert 3D File Formats\"},\"ImageToSTL\":{\"Description\":\"Generate STL models from photos online with high fidelity, ready to use for prototyping, gaming, and 3D printing. No expertise required, No Software to download.\",\"Title\":\"Free Image to STL Converter\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"FeaturedTitle\":\"Recommended\",\"FromTitle\":\"Convert from {from} to:\",\"ImageToStlAnchor\":\"Image to STL converter\",\"JpgToStlAnchor\":\"JPG to STL converter\",\"RelatedToolsTitle\":\"Related Tools\",\"SectionTitle\":\"Related Converters\",\"ToTitle\":\"Convert to {to} from:\"},\"MaxToast\":\"You have reached the maximum number of conversions\",\"PairExtras\":{\"glb-obj-textures\":{\"Answer\":\"GLB embeds textures in the binary; OBJ + MTL stores them as separate files. Common pitfalls when converting:\\n\\n1. Make sure the conversion tool exports both the .obj and .mtl files plus the texture images (PNG/JPG). Meshy's export bundles them in a zip.\\n2. The .mtl file references textures by relative path. Keep the .obj, .mtl, and texture images in the same folder.\\n3. If textures still don't load, open the .mtl file in a text editor — verify the map_Kd / map_Ks / map_Bump lines reference filenames that actually exist on disk. Edit if paths are wrong.\\n4. PBR materials don't survive OBJ + MTL — OBJ supports only basic Phong-style materials (diffuse, specular, ambient). The metalness and roughness data from the GLB is lost.\\n5. For PBR fidelity, stay in GLB. Use OBJ only when the target program requires it.\\n\\nFor one-off conversions, Blender is the most reliable: import GLB, export OBJ with default material settings, ship the resulting bundle.\",\"Question\":\"My textures are missing after converting GLB to OBJ — how do I export the MTL and texture files correctly?\"},\"glb-stl-detail\":{\"Answer\":\"$42\",\"Question\":\"Why does my GLB lose detail when converted to STL, and what workflow prevents that?\"},\"image-to-stl\":{\"Answer\":\"$43\",\"Question\":\"How do I convert a texture/image into an STL mesh for 3D printing?\"}},\"PairOverrides\":{\"jpg-stl\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Answer7\":\"After download, check: 1. Does the STL file open in your slicer or 3D viewer? 2. Are scale and orientation correct? 3. Is the geometry watertight and 3D-print ready? 4. Are there missing faces, very thin areas, or unexpected artifacts?\",\"SubpageAnswer1\":\"Meshy's JPG-to-STL converter is built for fast 3D workflows: upload an image, Meshy generates a 3D model from it, and you export an STL file for your 3D printing workflow. Everything runs directly in your browser — no installation required. Not sure which format fits your project? Read our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file formats guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e.\",\"SubpageAnswer4\":\"Most JPG-to-STL generations complete in a short time. The duration depends on the source image, the desired level of detail, and the complexity of the generated mesh. If it takes longer, try a clearer subject, a smaller file, or a simpler perspective.\",\"SubpageAnswer5\":\"Before converting a JPG file to STL, keep three things in mind: First, the image should have clear contours and as little distracting background as possible. Second, you should check the STL file before printing in your slicer — wall thickness, scale, and closed geometry. Third, STL does not preserve colors, materials, or textures — for colored 3D assets, formats like GLB are better suited.\",\"SubpageAnswer6\":\"The accuracy of JPG-to-STL conversion depends heavily on the source image. Clear contours, good lighting, and a clear perspective deliver better results. Meshy interprets your 2D image as 3D geometry and exports it as an STL file. Check the file before printing in your slicer, especially for production-critical parts.\",\"SubpageAnswer8\":\"Yes. You can review your STL file in the \u003cviewer\u003e3D viewer\u003c/viewer\u003e and use it in your wider Meshy workflow. For surfaces, materials, or textures, choose a format like GLB depending on your target — or continue editing your model in Meshy.\",\"SubpageAnswer9\":\"If conversion fails, first check whether your JPG file opens in another program. Shrink the file if it's too large, and upload a clear image with a recognizable main subject. If it still doesn't work, try PNG or JPEG as an alternative.\"},\"HeaderDescription\":\"Convert JPG and JPEG files to STL online for free with high-quality results. This web-based converter runs in your browser with no software download required and produces clean, 3D-print-ready STL files.\",\"HeaderTitle\":\"Free JPG to STL Converter\",\"MetaDescription\":\"Convert JPG and JPEG files to STL online for free. Web-based, no downloads — clean STL files ready for 3D printing.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"JPG to STL Converter — Convert .jpg / .jpeg to .stl Online [Free | High Quality]\"}},\"Popular\":{\"Group3DPrinting\":\"3D Printing\",\"GroupARVR\":\"AR / VR\",\"GroupGameDev\":\"Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D File Converters\"},\"Preview\":{\"Alt\":\"3D model preview\",\"ErrorDescription\":\"The model could not be parsed. It may be damaged or use unsupported data for this format.\",\"ErrorTitle\":\"This file cannot be previewed\",\"OutputLabel\":\"Converted model\",\"SourceLabel\":\"Source model\",\"Stats\":{\"Dimensions\":\"Dimensions\",\"Triangles\":\"Triangles\",\"Vertices\":\"Vertices\"}},\"Select\":{\"FromPlaceholder\":\"From (e.g. OBJ)\",\"Placeholder\":\"File format\",\"ToPlaceholder\":\"To (e.g. STL)\"},\"SubpageDescription\":\"Convert {from} to {to} online for free with high-quality results. Meshy's web based converter works directly in your browser—no software download required.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"{from} to {to} Converter: Convert .{from} to .{to} Online [Free | High Quality]\",\"Tips\":\"Select the original format of your file and the desired format you wish to convert to before uploading.\",\"Title\":\"3D Model Converter: Convert 3D Files Online [Free | High Quality]\"},\"FontGenerator\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"FontGenerator\":\"3D Font Generator\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"A 3D font is a typeface rendered with real depth, lighting and material so the letters look three-dimensional instead of flat. This 3D font generator extrudes each letter into a 3D shape you can preview, spin and download.\",\"Answer10\":\"No. The 3D font generator runs entirely in your browser. There is nothing to install — just open the page, type your text, and download your 3D letters.\",\"Answer11\":\"Yes. Each style starts from a preset color and extrusion depth that you can override with the color picker and depth slider, so you can match your brand or make the letters thicker for a chunkier look.\",\"Answer12\":\"The built-in styles are tuned for Latin letters, numbers and common punctuation. Non-Latin characters such as Chinese, Japanese or emoji may not render in every style.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes. The 3D font generator is completely free to use. You can preview and download your 3D fonts without creating an account, and there is no watermark on the result.\",\"Answer3\":\"You can download your 3D font for free as a transparent PNG or as a GLB, OBJ or STL 3D model. Use PNG for graphics, thumbnails and social posts; GLB or OBJ to drop the letters into Blender, Unity or Unreal; and STL to 3D print them. No login or watermark.\",\"Answer4\":\"Yes. PNG exports have a transparent background by default, so you can drop your 3D font straight onto posters, thumbnails, logos and other designs.\",\"Answer5\":\"Yes. You can use the 3D fonts you create for personal and commercial projects. The included typefaces are open-source under the SIL Open Font License or Apache 2.0.\",\"Answer6\":\"Yes. Export your text as an STL (or OBJ) file and drop it straight into any slicer like Cura or PrusaSlicer, or send it to a printing service. The letters are generated as solid, watertight 3D geometry, and you can use the depth slider to thicken them for a stronger print.\",\"Answer7\":\"If you want to turn a word or prompt into a detailed, AI-generated 3D model rather than a styled 3D font, use the Meshy 3D Text Generator instead. This font tool focuses on stylized 3D lettering you can download instantly.\",\"Answer8\":\"Type your word, pick a style such as pixel, gold or neon, then fine-tune the color and extrusion depth. The preview updates live — when you like it, download a PNG or 3D model. No design skills required.\",\"Answer9\":\"Nine ready-made styles — classic, gold, chrome, pixel, bubble, graffiti, blocky, neon and marble — each with its own typeface, material and lighting. You can recolor and adjust the depth of any of them.\",\"Question1\":\"What is a 3D font?\",\"Question10\":\"Do I need to install any fonts or software?\",\"Question11\":\"Can I change the color and depth of my 3D font?\",\"Question12\":\"Does it support non-Latin characters?\",\"Question2\":\"Is the 3D font generator free?\",\"Question3\":\"What file formats can I download?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I export a transparent PNG?\",\"Question5\":\"Can I use the 3D fonts commercially?\",\"Question6\":\"Can I 3D print a 3D font?\",\"Question7\":\"I want to turn text into a full 3D model, not a font effect. What should I use?\",\"Question8\":\"How do I make a 3D font?\",\"Question9\":\"What 3D font styles are available?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Pick from pixel, bubble, gold, chrome, graffiti, neon, marble and more 3D font styles. Each style bundles a typeface, material and bevel tuned to look great instantly — no 3D skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Many 3D font styles in one click\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Type your text, pick a 3D font, and download right in your browser. Every export is free, with no sign-up and no watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Free, no login, no watermark\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Download your 3D font as a transparent PNG for designs, or as a GLB, OBJ or STL model for 3D apps, games and 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"Export PNG and real 3D models\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Your 3D font spins in a live preview as you type and switch styles, so you can see exactly how the letters look before you download.\",\"Title\":\"Live 3D preview, right in the browser\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"The 3D font is built entirely on your device. Your text is never uploaded to a server, so your ideas stay private.\",\"Title\":\"Your text stays in your browser\"}},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's free 3D Font Generator turns any text into a 3D font effect right in your browser — pick a Minecraft, pixel, bubble, gold or graffiti style, preview it live, and download free as a PNG, GLB or STL. No design skills, no software.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Font Generator Online\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Enter the word or letters you want to turn into a 3D font.\",\"Title\":\"Type your text\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Choose a style like pixel, bubble, gold, chrome or graffiti, then fine-tune the color and depth.\",\"Title\":\"Pick a 3D font style\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D font as a transparent PNG, or as a GLB, OBJ or STL 3D model — free and without signing in.\",\"Title\":\"Download as PNG or 3D model\"},\"Title\":\"How to make a 3D font in 3 steps\"},\"LastUpdatedLabel\":\"Last updated\",\"MetaDescription\":\"Free 3D font generator. Turn text into a Minecraft, pixel, bubble, gold or graffiti 3D font, preview it live, and download free as PNG, GLB or STL. No login.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Free 3D Font Generator: Make 3D Text Fonts Online | Meshy\",\"OtherTools\":{\"Description\":\"Explore more free browser-based 3D tools from Meshy.\",\"Explore\":\"Open tool\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D tools\"},\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb3DTools\":\"3D Tools\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BrowserRequirements\":\"Requires a WebGL-enabled browser\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Item1\":\"Pixel, bubble, gold, chrome, graffiti and neon 3D font styles\",\"Item10\":\"Polished metal, glass and matte material finishes\",\"Item11\":\"One-click switch to Meshy AI text-to-3D\",\"Item12\":\"Adjustable bevel and letter thickness\",\"Item13\":\"High-resolution PNG for thumbnails and logos\",\"Item14\":\"Runs in the browser on any device\",\"Item15\":\"Commercial-use open-source typefaces\",\"Item2\":\"Live auto-rotating 3D preview in the browser\",\"Item3\":\"Transparent PNG export\",\"Item4\":\"GLB, OBJ and STL 3D model export\",\"Item5\":\"3D-printable letter geometry\",\"Item6\":\"Adjustable color and extrusion depth\",\"Item7\":\"No login or sign-up required\",\"Item8\":\"Free with no watermark\",\"Item9\":\"Classic, blocky and marble 3D font styles\"},\"Keywords\":{\"Item1\":\"3d font generator\",\"Item10\":\"fonts for 3d printing\",\"Item2\":\"3d fonts\",\"Item3\":\"3d font\",\"Item4\":\"3d text font\",\"Item5\":\"3d letters\",\"Item6\":\"3d minecraft font\",\"Item7\":\"3d bubble font\",\"Item8\":\"3d pixel font\",\"Item9\":\"3d font download\"},\"OfferDescription\":\"Free to use with unlimited downloads and no watermark\",\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Font Generator\"},\"Style\":{\"Bubble\":\"Bubble\",\"Chrome\":\"Chrome\",\"Classic\":\"Classic\",\"Gold\":\"Gold\",\"Graffiti\":\"Graffiti\",\"Marble\":\"Marble\",\"Minecraft\":\"Blocky\",\"Neon\":\"Neon\",\"Pixel\":\"Pixel\"},\"Tool\":{\"ColorLabel\":\"Color\",\"CtaLabel\":\"Generate My 3D Font Model\",\"CtaLabelMultilingual\":\"Generate with AI\",\"DepthLabel\":\"Depth\",\"GradientEndLabel\":\"End color\",\"GradientLabel\":\"Gradient\",\"GradientStartLabel\":\"Start color\",\"MultilingualHint\":\"Some 3D font styles only include Latin letters and numbers, so non-Latin characters may not render.\",\"StyleLabel\":\"3D font style\",\"TextLabel\":\"Your text\",\"TextPlaceholder\":\"Meshy\"}},\"Generators\":{\"RelatedTools\":{\"Compressor\":\"Shrink 3D model file sizes without quality loss\",\"Converter\":\"Convert between GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL and more\",\"Description\":\"Pair these generators with the rest of Meshy's free 3D tools, all in your browser.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"HubCta\":\"Explore all 3D tools\",\"TextGenerator\":\"Turn any word into a 3D text model\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D Tools\",\"Viewer\":\"Open and preview 3D models in your browser\"}},\"Hub\":{\"Browse\":{\"Animation\":{\"Description\":\"Generate rigged 3D characters for games and films, or design custom brick-compatible parts for physical builds.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Rigged characters \u0026 motion\",\"Title\":\"Animate and build with AI\"},\"Badges\":{\"Compressor\":\"Compressor\",\"Converter\":\"Converter\",\"Tool\":\"Tool\",\"Upcoming\":\"Upcoming\",\"Viewer\":\"Viewer\"},\"ComingSoon\":\"Coming soon\",\"CompressorCard\":{\"Description\":\"Compress {format} models in your browser without losing quality or uploading files.\"},\"Compressors\":{\"Description\":\"Open the compressor tuned for a given format. Reduce file size in your browser without uploads or quality loss.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Size reduction\"},\"ConverterCard\":{\"Description\":\"Run a guided conversion from {from} to {to} in your browser without installing desktop software.\"},\"Converters\":{\"Description\":\"Jump straight into a ready-made conversion path. Each shortcut opens the Meshy converter with the right source and target format.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Format conversion\"},\"Generators\":{\"Description\":\"The first card opens the shipped 3D text tool: type words, pick styles, and export real meshes or transparent PNGs in your browser. The gray tiles preview logo, font, and shape generators on our roadmap. Each unlocks when its own tool page goes live, so you always see what is available today versus coming soon.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"3D generators\",\"Title\":\"Live 3D lettering plus the generators on our roadmap\"},\"LearnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"Text3D\":{\"Description\":\"Type words, style lettering, or build simple 3D forms — all in your browser with instant mesh export.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"3D lettering \u0026 forms\",\"Title\":\"Create 3D text, logos, fonts, and shapes\"},\"ViewerCard\":{\"Description\":\"Inspect {format} models interactively with orbit, zoom, and shading controls tuned for fast previews.\"},\"Viewers\":{\"Description\":\"Open the viewer tuned for a given format. Upload a file on the next screen to explore materials, lighting, and camera controls.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Browser preview\"}},\"CTA\":{\"Button\":\"Generate your own 3D models\",\"Description\":\"Turn prompts and images into characters, props, and textures in Meshy Workspace.\",\"Title\":\"Beyond quick utilities\"},\"Chips\":{\"AllTools\":\"All tools\",\"AndMore\":\"And More\",\"Converter\":\"Converter\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"FileConverter\":\"3D File Converter\",\"MoreTools\":\"More Tools\",\"SelectorLabel\":\"Choose a destination\",\"Viewer\":\"Viewer\"},\"CompressorSectionTitle\":\"Compress any 3D file format\",\"CompressorTileLabel\":\"Compress {format}\",\"ConverterSectionTitle\":\"Browse format conversion shortcuts\",\"ConverterTileLabel\":\"{from}→{to}\",\"Converters\":{\"TileLabel\":\"{from}→{to}\",\"Title\":\"Convert any 3D file format\"},\"Description\":\"A free online 3D toolbox in your browser: convert and compress 3D files, preview models, and generate 3D text, logos, and fonts. No download or signup to start.\",\"FAQs\":{\"Commercial\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes, you can use assets you create or process with Meshy tools in commercial projects, subject to Meshy's terms and any rights attached to your uploaded source files.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use outputs in commercial projects?\"},\"Disambiguation\":{\"Answer\":{\"Compressor\":\"Use the 3D File Compressor when you need to shrink GLB, OBJ, STL, PLY, or FBX files for faster sharing, loading, or storage without quality loss.\",\"FileConverter\":\"Use the 3D File Converter when your model is in the wrong format for a printer, game engine, CAD tool, or editing workflow.\",\"OnlineViewer\":\"Use the Online 3D Viewer when you need to inspect a model in your browser before importing, downloading, buying, or sharing it.\",\"TextGenerator\":\"Use the 3D Text Generator when you want to turn words or lettering into a stylized 3D asset for thumbnails, logos, mockups, or 3D printing.\"},\"Question\":\"Which Meshy 3D tool should I use?\"},\"Formats\":{\"Answer\":\"Support varies by tool. The converter and viewer cover common model formats such as OBJ, FBX, GLB, GLTF, STL, USDZ, PLY, 3MF, VOX, and DXF, while the text tool exports common 3D and image outputs.\",\"Question\":\"Which formats are supported across the tools?\"},\"Free\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. The hub links to free browser-based tools, and you can start using them without installing software.\",\"Question\":\"Are Meshy 3D tools free?\"},\"Install\":{\"Answer\":\"No. The tools run in a modern web browser, so you can work on common desktop, tablet, and mobile devices without a separate app.\",\"Question\":\"Do I need to install anything?\"}},\"Featured\":{\"BrickPartsGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Describe a brick-compatible part — hinges, Technic beams, gears — and generate a print-ready 3D model with parametric precision. Free to start.\",\"Name\":\"AI Brick Parts Generator\"},\"FallbackBadge\":\"3D\",\"FileCompressor\":{\"Description\":\"Compress GLB, OBJ, STL, PLY, and FBX files for free. Local processing, no uploads.\",\"Name\":\"3D File Compressor\"},\"FileConverter\":{\"Description\":\"Convert between FBX, OBJ, GLB, STL, USDZ, PLY, 3MF, and more. High-quality, browser-based, free.\",\"Name\":\"3D File Converter\"},\"FontGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Design stylized dimensional lettering and export GLB, OBJ, STL, or PNG — all in your browser.\",\"Name\":\"3D Font Generator\"},\"GeneratorsRowLabel\":\"New 3D generators\",\"LogoGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Turn flat logos into dimensional 3D concepts with live preview and mesh export in your browser.\",\"Name\":\"3D Logo Generator\"},\"OnlineViewer\":{\"Description\":\"Open and preview 3D files online. Inspect geometry, materials, and animations without installing anything.\",\"Name\":\"Online 3D Viewer\"},\"ShapeGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Build parametric 3D primitives and extruded shapes in your browser, then export PNG, GLB, or STL.\",\"Name\":\"3D Shape Generator\"},\"TextGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Type, style, and export 3D text in PNG, GLB, OBJ, and STL. WebGL-powered, runs in your browser.\",\"Name\":\"3D Text Generator\"},\"UtilitiesRowLabel\":\"Core 3D utilities\"},\"Footer\":{\"Features\":\"Features\",\"Intro\":\"Want AI-generated 3D models too?\",\"NavLabel\":\"Related Meshy pages\",\"Pricing\":\"Pricing\"},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Free browser-based 3D tools for creators. Generate 3D text, convert and compress 3D files, and preview 3D models online. All free, no downloads, no signup.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Tools\"},\"IntroHero\":{\"AccentLabel\":\"Free 3D Tools\",\"Subtitle\":\"Convert and compress 3D files, preview models online, and generate 3D text, logos, fonts, shapes, and AI brick parts — eight free browser tools.\",\"Title\":\"All 3D Tools You Need\"},\"MetaDescription\":\"Free online 3D tools: convert and compress 3D files, view 3D models in your browser, generate AI 3D text and brick-compatible parts. No install needed.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Free Online 3D Converter, Viewer \u0026 Compressor | Meshy\",\"Orbit\":{\"Category\":{\"Compressor\":\"Compressor\",\"Converter\":\"Converter\",\"Generator\":\"Generator\",\"Viewer\":\"Viewer\"},\"ViewDetails\":\"Open tool\"},\"Title\":\"Free Online 3D Tools\",\"Tools\":{\"BrickPartsGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Generate custom brick-compatible parts — hinges, Technic beams, gears — and export print-ready STL.\",\"Title\":\"AI Brick Parts Generator\"},\"CharacterGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Turn text or images into rigged 3D characters with auto-rigging and animation-ready exports.\",\"Title\":\"3D Character Generator\"},\"FileCompressor\":{\"Description\":\"Reduce 3D model file sizes in your browser with no quality loss or signup.\",\"Title\":\"3D File Compressor\"},\"FileConverter\":{\"Description\":\"Convert common model and image files into production-ready 3D formats online.\",\"Title\":\"3D File Converter\"},\"FontGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Design stylized dimensional lettering for creative projects and visual assets.\",\"Title\":\"3D Font Generator\"},\"LogoGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Create dimensional logo concepts for branding, mockups, and presentations.\",\"Title\":\"3D Logo Generator\"},\"OnlineViewer\":{\"Description\":\"Open, inspect, and preview 3D assets in your browser before importing or sharing.\",\"Title\":\"Online 3D Viewer\"},\"ShapeGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Build simple geometric 3D forms for prototyping and visual exploration.\",\"Title\":\"3D Shape Generator\"},\"SketchTo3DConverter\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a hand-drawn sketch or 2D drawing into a real, textured 3D model and export to OBJ, GLB, FBX, or STL.\",\"Title\":\"Sketch to 3D Converter\"},\"TextGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Type, style, and export custom 3D lettering in your browser with no software setup.\",\"Title\":\"3D Text Generator\"}},\"ViewerSectionTitle\":\"Browse model preview shortcuts\",\"ViewerTileLabel\":\"{format} Viewer\",\"Viewers\":{\"ItemLabel\":\"{format} Viewer\",\"Title\":\"View any 3D file in your browser\"}},\"ImageToStl\":{\"AdvancedFeatures\":{\"Item1\":{\"Description\":\"Full PBR maps — base color, roughness, metallic, normal — generated automatically. No manual UV unwrapping.\",\"Title\":\"PBR Texture Generation\"},\"Item2\":{\"Description\":\"Control triangle/quad count from 1K to 300K. Balance detail and file size for your target printer or engine.\",\"Title\":\"Adjustable Topology\"},\"Item3\":{\"Description\":\"Auto-simplify textures into clean color blocks for FDM hardware. Export as 3MF for direct slicer import.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-Color 3D Printing\"},\"Item4\":{\"Description\":\"Send models directly to Bambu Studio — no download, no import, no format conversion. Only available on Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"One-Click Bambu Studio\"},\"Item5\":{\"Description\":\"STL, OBJ, GLB, FBX, USDZ, BLEND, 3MF. Compatible with every major slicer, game engine, and DCC tool.\",\"Title\":\"Multiple Export Formats\"},\"Item6\":{\"Description\":\"Dedicated mode for optimized wireframes — ideal for real-time game assets or lightweight print previews.\",\"Title\":\"Low Poly Mode\"},\"Title\":\"Advanced Features\"},\"Breadcrumb\":\"Image to STL Converter\",\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"No credit card required. No software to download. Convert your first image to STL in under a minute.\",\"ExploreTools\":\"Explore Meshy's 3D Tools\",\"StartConverting\":\"Start Converting\",\"Title\":\"Start converting images to STL files\"},\"FAQs\":{\"A1\":\"Our converter accepts all common raster formats, including PNG, JPG/JPEG, and WebP, so you can start from a photo, product shot, or any reference image with no special preparation. The AI reconstructs 3D geometry directly from whatever you upload. If you'd rather start from a specific source format, we offer dedicated pages for \u003cconverters\u003eJPG, PNG, WebP, and SVG conversions\u003c/converters\u003e. Just pick the format that matches your file and upload.\",\"A2\":\"For the best results, choose a clear image with a well-defined subject and minimal background clutter, since the AI builds the mesh from what it can see. Good lighting and a recognizable shape help it infer depth and produce a clean, printable model. Keep in mind that a 2D photo only shows one side of an object, so hidden faces are estimated by the AI. If you need finer control, you can refine the result in our \u003cimageTo3d\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e workspace before exporting.\",\"A3\":\"You can upload standard high-resolution photos without worrying about hitting a limit in normal use. We recommend images up to around 10 MB, which comfortably covers typical phone and camera shots. Very large files don't improve quality, as a sharp, well-framed image at moderate resolution works best. If your file is oversized, simply resize or re-export it before uploading.\",\"A4\":\"You own the STL files you generate and are free to use them for prototyping, gaming, and 3D printing, including commercial projects on eligible plans. You're also responsible for ensuring you have the rights to any source image you upload. The full details are covered in our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/terms\u003e. If you're unsure what your plan permits, check the terms before commercial use.\",\"A5\":\"No. The converter runs entirely online in your browser, with nothing to install. Just upload your image, let the AI generate the model, and download the STL file directly. There are no plugins, extensions, or desktop apps required. It works on any modern browser, on desktop or mobile.\",\"A6\":\"Yes, we export standard STL files that open in virtually any 3D pipeline. You can import them straight into slicers like Cura and PrusaSlicer for printing, or into editors like Blender for further modeling. If your workflow needs a different format, our \u003cconverter\u003efile converter\u003c/converter\u003e also outputs OBJ, GLB, GLTF, PLY, and more. This keeps the output ready to use whether you're printing, rendering, or game-building.\",\"A7\":\"Yes. Uploads are transmitted securely and used only to generate your 3D model. We don't share your source images, and your generated assets stay tied to your account so you remain in control. You can review exactly how your data is handled in our \u003cprivacy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacy\u003e. Convert with confidence knowing your files are kept private.\",\"A8\":\"After conversion, preview the model to confirm the shape, proportions, and orientation match your intent. For 3D printing, check that the mesh is watertight and consider whether it needs supports or rescaling in your slicer. If any area needs cleanup or more detail, you can regenerate or refine it in the \u003cimageTo3d\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e workspace. Once it looks right, export and send it to your slicer or editor.\",\"A9\":\"Absolutely. Your STL models work seamlessly across the Meshy ecosystem. You can refine them, switch formats, or compress them for lighter file sizes as your workflow requires. This lets you generate, edit, convert, and optimize all in one place. Explore everything available on our \u003ctoolsHub\u003e3D tools hub\u003c/toolsHub\u003e.\",\"Q1\":\"What image formats can I upload? (e.g., PNG, JPG, WebP)\",\"Q2\":\"Key considerations before converting Image to STL\",\"Q3\":\"What is the maximum file size limit for uploads?\",\"Q4\":\"Who owns the rights to the converted STL files?\",\"Q5\":\"Do I need to download any software or plugins to use the STL converter?\",\"Q6\":\"Are the converted STL files compatible with standard CAD and slicing software (like Blender, Cura, or PrusaSlicer)?\",\"Q7\":\"Is it safe to upload my Image files to this converter?\",\"Q8\":\"What should I check after converting to STL?\",\"Q9\":\"Can I use the converted STL file with other Meshy tools?\"},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Convert any image into a print-ready STL file in under a minute. AI-powered, browser-based, free — no 3D modeling experience needed.\",\"Title\":\"Free Image to STL Converter — Convert PNG, JPG 2D Images to 3D STL Files\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Item1\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a detailed 3D model — no modeling skills or software required.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Conversion\"},\"Item2\":{\"Description\":\"Models export with clean geometry, proper normals, and watertight mesh. Works with Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, Elegoo Slicer, LycheeSlicer, and Ultimaker Cura.\",\"Title\":\"97% Slicer Pass Rate\"},\"Item3\":{\"Description\":\"Runs entirely in your browser. Your files stay on your device.\",\"Title\":\"No Install, No Signup\"}},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drag and drop a JPG, PNG, or WebP file. High-contrast images with clean backgrounds produce the best results.\",\"Title\":\"Upload your image\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI analyzes your image and creates a fully textured 3D model in about one minute.\",\"Title\":\"AI generates your 3D model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Export as STL and send directly to your slicer — or use one-click \u003cbambu\u003eBambu Studio integration\u003c/bambu\u003e to skip the download entirely.\",\"Title\":\"Download STL and print\"},\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Convert JPG, PNG, or WebP images to print-ready STL files in under a minute. Free, browser-based, AI-powered. 97% slicer pass rate. No install needed.\",\"Title\":\"Free Image to STL Converter: Photo to STL in Minutes\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Model1\":{\"Description\":\"From reference photo to print-ready STL in under a minute.\",\"Title\":\"Castle Architecture\"},\"Model2\":{\"Description\":\"Detailed figurines with clean topology for FDM and resin printing.\",\"Title\":\"Character Figurine\"},\"Model3\":{\"Description\":\"Engineering-grade mesh with watertight geometry, ready for production.\",\"Title\":\"Mechanical Part\"},\"Model4\":{\"Description\":\"Stylized characters and props exported with multi-color 3MF support.\",\"Title\":\"Creature \u0026 Fantasy\"},\"Title\":\"From Image to Real Object\"},\"WhyChoose\":{\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy for Converting \u003chighlight\u003ePhoto to STL\u003c/highlight\u003e?\"}},\"LogoGenerator\":{\"AIShowcase\":{\"Description\":\"Need a photoreal 3D logo, animated 3D wordmark, or a custom AI brand style beyond the browser tool? Switch to Meshy Workspace — the AI 3D pipeline trusted by 10M creators.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI in Workspace\",\"PrimaryCta\":\"Create My 3D Logo\",\"Title\":\"Production-grade 3D logos with Meshy AI\"},\"AdobeComparison\":{\"Description\":\"Adobe's 3D tools are powerful but require a paid Creative Cloud subscription and a desktop install, and their 3D output is a rendered image or video, not a mesh file. Meshy runs free in your browser and exports a real 3D mesh.\",\"Features\":{\"animation\":\"Animation built in\",\"fastResult\":\"Result in seconds\",\"free\":\"Free to use\",\"meshExport\":\"Real 3D mesh export\",\"noInstall\":\"Browser-only, no install\"},\"Footnote\":\"Adobe, Photoshop, Illustrator and After Effects are trademarks of Adobe Inc. Comparison reflects each app's documented 3D output capability: Illustrator's 3D and Materials effect renders to the 2D artboard, and After Effects 3D layers render to video frames. Neither path exports a GLB, OBJ or STL mesh file.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy 3D logo at a glance vs Adobe Creative Cloud tools\"},\"AiEnhance\":{\"Label\":\"Open in Workspace\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"LogoGenerator\":\"3D Logo Generator\"},\"CameraPresets\":{\"Front\":\"Front\",\"Label\":\"Camera\",\"ThreeQuarter\":\"3/4\",\"Top\":\"Top\"},\"Environment\":{\"IntensityLabel\":\"Intensity\",\"LightingLabel\":\"Lighting\",\"Preset\":{\"Cozy\":\"Cozy\",\"Daylight\":\"Daylight\",\"Outdoor\":\"Outdoor\",\"Studio\":\"Studio\",\"Sunset\":\"Sunset\"},\"ShowBackground\":\"Show background\"},\"Export\":{\"ChooseFormat\":\"Choose format\",\"Download\":\"Download\",\"GlbCaption\":\"Unity, Unreal, Roblox Studio\",\"ImageGroup\":\"Image\",\"MeshExportNote\":\"What you see uses bloom and HDRI lighting that won't be saved in the file.\",\"ModelGroup\":\"3D Model\",\"ObjCaption\":\"Blender, Cinema 4D, all 3D apps\",\"PngCaption\":\"Thumbnails \u0026 social\",\"PngPillTemplate\":\"PNG · {size}\",\"PrintGroup\":\"3D Print\",\"Size\":{\"HdShort\":\"HD\",\"SquareHdShort\":\"2K\",\"X1Short\":\"1×\",\"X2Short\":\"2×\"},\"SizeLabel\":\"Export size\",\"SizeOption\":{\"Hd\":\"HD (1920×1080)\",\"SquareHd\":\"Square HD (2048×2048)\",\"X1\":\"1× (480×480)\",\"X2\":\"2× (960×960)\"},\"StlCaption\":\"3D printers (no color)\",\"Working\":\"Rendering…\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Start with a 2D logo, then let AI add depth. Upload an SVG, PNG or JPG — a transparent-background SVG or PNG gives the cleanest edges — and Meshy shows a free 3D preview in your browser. To finish, open it in Meshy Workspace, where the AI image-to-3D pipeline turns your logo into a production-ready, fully textured 3D model.\",\"Answer10\":\"You upload a 2D logo and Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline reads its shapes, depth and materials to build a true 3D mesh — no manual extruding or modeling. Your browser shows an instant demo preview, then Meshy Workspace generates the production-ready, fully textured version of your own logo.\",\"Answer11\":\"Yes. Export your 3D logo as GLB or OBJ from Meshy Workspace and it drops straight into Unity, Unreal and Roblox Studio — ideal for game titles, stream overlays and esports branding. The mesh is game-engine ready, with no conversion step.\",\"Answer12\":\"Hiring a designer gives bespoke artwork but costs more and takes days. An AI 3D logo generator like Meshy turns your existing logo into a production-ready 3D model in minutes, free to start — great for quick iterations, social content and prototypes. Many teams explore directions with Meshy first, then bring in a designer only if they need fully custom art.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes. Uploading your logo and previewing it in 3D is free in your browser with no login. To generate and export the full 3D model — transparent PNG, GLB, OBJ or STL with no watermark — continue in Meshy Workspace, which comes with free trial credits and no card required.\",\"Answer3\":\"The in-browser 3D preview appears in seconds the moment you upload a logo. Generating the full textured 3D model of your own logo in Meshy Workspace usually takes a minute or two — no render queue, no manual modeling — and you can export it as soon as it is ready.\",\"Answer4\":\"Yes. From Meshy Workspace you can export a high-resolution transparent PNG of your 3D logo — drop it straight into a YouTube thumbnail, an Instagram post, a slide or a flyer.\",\"Answer5\":\"Yes. The PNG you export from Meshy Workspace has a transparent background, so your 3D logo sits cleanly on any color, photo or video — with no white box around it.\",\"Answer6\":\"SVG and other vectors are input formats, not outputs — you upload an SVG, PNG or JPG and Meshy builds a 3D version of it. The exports are 3D meshes (GLB, OBJ and STL) plus a transparent PNG from Meshy Workspace. If you need a flat vector, keep your original SVG; Meshy adds the third dimension on top of it.\",\"Answer7\":\"STL is the standard for 3D printing and works with most consumer printers — export it from Meshy Workspace (STL carries geometry only, no color). If you want full-color rendering or AR instead of printing, choose GLB or OBJ.\",\"Answer8\":\"A strong 3D logo starts with a clean, high-contrast 2D mark: simple, bold shapes read clearly in 3D, while thin lines and fine detail can get lost. Upload a transparent-background SVG or PNG for the sharpest edges, keep the design uncluttered so it works at small sizes, and choose a material and lighting that match your brand.\",\"Answer9\":\"Yes. 3D logos you create with Meshy are free to use for both commercial and personal projects, and exports carry no watermark — so you can ship them in products, videos, merch and client work.\",\"Question1\":\"How can I design a 3D logo?\",\"Question10\":\"How does an AI 3D logo generator work?\",\"Question11\":\"Can I create a 3D gaming logo online?\",\"Question12\":\"AI 3D logo generator vs hiring a designer: Which should I choose?\",\"Question2\":\"Can I create a 3D logo for free?\",\"Question3\":\"How long does it take to create a 3D logo online?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I download my 3D logo in PNG format?\",\"Question5\":\"Can I download a transparent background logo?\",\"Question6\":\"Can I get my logo in SVG or vector format?\",\"Question7\":\"What is the best file format for printing a 3D logo?\",\"Question8\":\"What makes a good 3D logo design?\",\"Question9\":\"Can I use a free 3D logo commercially?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D logo from Meshy Workspace — a transparent PNG for video and social, GLB or OBJ for real-time rendering and AR, or STL for 3D printing. Free trial credits, no card required.\",\"Title\":\"Export your 3D logo to PNG, GLB, OBJ or STL\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"No Adobe subscription, no manual extruding, no learning curve. Upload an SVG, PNG or JPG logo, preview it in 3D, then let Meshy's AI generate the production-ready version in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Turn any logo image into 3D — a free Photoshop 3D alternative\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"A professional logo-to-3D-model maker for students, indie creators and studios alike. Start free with no login, then generate the full textured 3D model in Meshy Workspace with free trial credits and no watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Free image-to-3D logo maker for every creator\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"See an instant 3D demo spin in the browser with a live WebGL preview, then generate the full production-ready version of your own logo with AI in Meshy Workspace.\",\"Title\":\"Instant 3D preview in your browser\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Your browser preview hands off to Meshy Workspace, where the image-to-3D AI trusted by millions of creators turns your logo into a production-ready, fully textured 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline\"}},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Generate 3D logos from images online with high quality, quickly, and for free. No design expertise required, no software to download.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Logo Generator Online\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drop in an SVG, PNG or JPG logo to get started — or try the built-in sample.\",\"Title\":\"Upload your logo image\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"See an auto-rotating 3D demo spin in the browser — a liquid-glass preview of the look your logo gets, instantly and with no render queue.\",\"Title\":\"Preview your logo in 3D\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Open your logo in Meshy Workspace and let the AI image-to-3D pipeline turn it into a production-ready, fully textured 3D model — then export GLB, OBJ, STL or a transparent PNG. Free trial credits, no card required.\",\"Title\":\"Generate and export with AI in Workspace\"},\"Title\":\"How to Make a 3D Logo from Images in 3 Steps\"},\"Material\":{\"Category\":{\"Fabric\":\"Fabric\",\"Natural\":\"Natural\",\"Reflective\":\"Reflective\"},\"ColorLabel\":\"Color\",\"Customize\":{\"Label\":\"Customize PBR\"},\"GlowIntensityLabel\":\"Intensity\",\"GlowLabel\":\"Glow\",\"Preset\":{\"Balloon\":\"Balloon\",\"Cactus\":\"Cactus\",\"DiscoGlitter\":\"Disco Glitter\",\"Floral\":\"Floral\",\"Gem\":\"Gem\",\"LiquidGlass\":\"Liquid Glass\",\"Marble\":\"Marble\",\"Moss\":\"Moss\",\"PinkVelvet\":\"Pink Velvet\",\"Rainbow\":\"Rainbow\",\"WetGlass\":\"Wet Glass\",\"Wood\":\"Wood\"},\"Type\":{\"Clay\":\"Clay\",\"Custom\":\"Custom\",\"Glass\":\"Glass\",\"Metallic\":\"Metallic\",\"Plastic\":\"Plastic\",\"RoughGlass\":\"Rough Glass\"}},\"MetaDescription\":\"Free 3D logo generator. Upload a logo image or SVG, preview it in 3D, then generate and export PNG, GLB, OBJ or STL with AI in Meshy Workspace. No watermark.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Free 3D Logo Maker: Generate 3D Logos from Images In Seconds\",\"PopularTools\":{\"Description\":\"Beyond 3D logo, explore the full Meshy AI suite for 3D creators.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"PricingCta\":\"See Pricing\",\"Title\":\"Other Popular Meshy AI Tools\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"Compressor\":\"Shrink 3D model file sizes without quality loss\",\"Converter\":\"Convert between GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL and more\",\"TextGenerator\":\"Turn any word into a 3D text model\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D Tools\",\"Viewer\":\"Open and preview 3D models in your browser\"},\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb3DTools\":\"3D Tools\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BrowserRequirements\":\"Requires WebGL 2\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Item1\":\"Free online image-to-3D logo maker — turn an SVG, PNG or JPG logo into a 3D model\",\"Item10\":\"Drag-and-drop or file-picker upload, up to 5MB per file\",\"Item11\":\"Hands your uploaded logo straight into Meshy Workspace for AI image-to-3D generation\",\"Item12\":\"Free for commercial and personal use with no watermark\",\"Item13\":\"Free in-browser 3D demo preview with no login or software install\",\"Item14\":\"Works in any modern browser, including mobile Safari and Chrome\",\"Item15\":\"One-click Open in Workspace upgrade to Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline\",\"Item2\":\"3D logo effect creator, a free alternative to 3D logo in Photoshop, Illustrator or After Effects\",\"Item3\":\"Instant in-browser 3D demo preview — no render queue and no waiting\",\"Item4\":\"Auto-rotating 3D demo preview in the browser\",\"Item5\":\"Accepts SVG, PNG or JPG logo uploads (up to 5MB)\",\"Item6\":\"AI image-to-3D generation in Meshy Workspace with photoreal PBR textures\",\"Item7\":\"Liquid-glass material and HDRI studio lighting in the 3D demo preview\",\"Item8\":\"Transparent PNG export from Meshy Workspace for thumbnails, social posts and video overlays\",\"Item9\":\"GLB, OBJ and STL export from Meshy Workspace for Blender, Unity, Unreal, Roblox Studio and 3D printers\"},\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Logo Generator\"},\"Slider\":{\"DefaultTooltip\":\"Default: {value}\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"LovedByCreators\":\"Loved by Creators\",\"PartnersLead\":\"Trusted by\"},\"Tabs\":{\"Environment\":\"Environment\",\"Logo\":\"Logo\",\"Material\":\"Material\"},\"Text\":{\"BevelEnableLabel\":\"Enable bevel\",\"BevelLabel\":\"Bevel\",\"BevelSizeLabel\":\"Bevel size\",\"BevelThicknessLabel\":\"Bevel thickness\",\"DepthLabel\":\"Depth\",\"SizeLabel\":\"Size\"},\"TextTo3DLink\":{\"Lead\":\"Prefer a text logo or wordmark? Type your brand name and extrude it into a 3D model — fonts, depth and bevel included.\",\"LinkLabel\":\"Open the 3D Text Generator\",\"Tail\":\"tool — same pipeline that ships to game studios, Roblox creators and product designers.\"},\"Title\":\"Free 3D Logo Generator Online: Export GLB, OBJ, STL \u0026 PNG\",\"Upload\":{\"DismissHint\":\"Dismiss\",\"Dropzone\":\"Drop your logo here\",\"ErrorBadFormat\":\"Unsupported format — use SVG, PNG or JPG.\",\"ErrorBadSvg\":\"That doesn't look like valid SVG markup.\",\"ErrorGeneric\":\"Something went wrong while processing your logo. Try a different file.\",\"ErrorNoPaths\":\"We couldn't find any shapes to extrude. Try a higher-contrast image or upload an SVG.\",\"ErrorTooLarge\":\"File too large — max 5MB.\",\"Hint\":\"SVG, PNG or JPG · max 5MB · transparent background recommended\",\"Label\":\"Your logo\",\"PasteLabel\":\"Paste SVG code\",\"PastePlaceholder\":\"Paste SVG markup here…\",\"PasteSubmit\":\"Use this SVG\",\"PastedLabel\":\"Pasted SVG\",\"Posterize\":\"Posterize to black \u0026 white\",\"Retrace\":\"Re-trace with current settings\",\"Sample\":{\"Diamond\":\"Diamond\",\"Hexagon\":\"Hexagon\",\"Monogram\":\"Monogram\",\"Shield\":\"Shield\",\"Star\":\"Star\",\"Wave\":\"Wave\"},\"Samples\":\"Or start from a sample\",\"Smoothing\":\"Smoothing\",\"TabPaste\":\"Paste SVG\",\"TabUpload\":\"Upload\",\"Tracing\":\"Tracing your image…\",\"WorkspaceHint\":\"Looking for a fully textured 3D logo? Try Meshy Workspace.\"}},\"MaxBanner\":\"You’ve reached your 3 times limit for free use without signup. Please create an account to convert more.\",\"OnlineViewer\":{\"About\":{\"BasedOn\":\"Based On\",\"Developer\":\"Developer\",\"Intro\":{\"3dm\":\"The .3dm file format is the native 3D model format of Rhino 3D, developed by Robert McNeel \u0026 Associates. Built on the open-source OpenNURBS toolkit, .3dm files store highly precise NURBS curves, surfaces, and solids along with meshes, layers, and material data. It is widely used in architecture, industrial design, jewelry CAD, and marine and automotive modeling where mathematically exact geometry matters.\",\"3ds\":\"The .3ds file format is the legacy native format of Autodesk 3D Studio, the predecessor of 3ds Max. A .3ds file stores mesh geometry, basic materials, texture references, and camera and light data in a compact binary chunk structure. Despite its age and limitations, it remains widely supported for exchanging older game assets and architectural-visualization models.\",\"dae\":\"The .dae file format, also called COLLADA (COLLAborative Design Activity), is an open XML-based interchange format managed by the Khronos Group. A .dae file stores geometry, materials, textures, scene hierarchy, and animation, making it a common bridge between digital-content-creation tools such as SketchUp, Blender, and Maya. It is frequently used for asset exchange in games, visualization, and AR pipelines.\",\"dxf\":\"The .dxf (Drawing Exchange Format) is a CAD data format created by Autodesk to interchange drawings between AutoCAD and other programs. A .dxf file stores 2D and 3D vector geometry — lines, arcs, polylines, and layers — as tagged ASCII or binary data. It is a long-standing interoperability standard across architecture, engineering, CNC machining, and laser cutting workflows.\",\"step\":\"The .step file format (Standard for the Exchange of Product model data) is an ISO 10303 standard for representing precise 3D product and manufacturing data. A .step file stores exact boundary-representation (B-rep) solid geometry that transfers cleanly between mechanical CAD systems such as SolidWorks, CATIA, and Fusion 360. It is the dominant neutral format for engineering, manufacturing, and PLM data exchange.\",\"stp\":\"The .stp file format is the short three-letter extension of the .step format — both are the same ISO 10303 STEP standard for exchanging precise 3D product model data. A .stp file stores exact boundary-representation (B-rep) solid geometry that moves losslessly between mechanical CAD systems such as SolidWorks, CATIA, and Fusion 360. The .stp spelling is common on Windows, where three-character extensions were historically preferred.\"},\"Software\":\"Common Software\",\"Title\":\"About the {format} File Format\"},\"Achievements\":{\"Trusted\":\"Trusted by\"},\"AllConverters\":\"All Online 3D Viewers\",\"Breadcrumb\":{\"OnlineViewer\":\"Online 3D Viewer\"},\"Description\":\"Open and view 3D models and animations online for free — no software to install, right in your browser. A fast, high-quality, secure 3D file viewer.\",\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Meshy's 3D viewer lets you inspect 3D models instantly in your browser — no software installation, no account required. Rotate, zoom, and pan around your model to check geometry, proportions, and surface quality before committing it to a pipeline. Whether you're reviewing assets from a client, validating an AI-generated model, or doing a quick sanity check before export, Meshy gives you a clean, fast preview with zero friction.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes. Files uploaded to Meshy are processed securely and never shared with third parties. Your model is only used to render the preview in your current session and is automatically deleted from our servers once you close or refresh the page. If you're handling sensitive or client-owned IP, we recommend reviewing our \u003cprivacy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacy\u003e for full details.\",\"Answer3\":\"Yes. Meshy's 3D viewer is fully browser-based and works on iOS, Android, and tablet devices without any app installation. For the best experience on mobile, use an up-to-date version of Chrome or Safari. Very large or high-polygon models may load more slowly on mobile hardware — if performance feels sluggish, try a decimated version of the file.\",\"Answer4\":\"Texture support depends on how the file is structured. Files that embed textures directly will display materials and colors correctly in the viewer. For formats that reference textures externally, you may see an untextured grey model — in this case, pack your textures into the file before uploading. Animation support varies by format; check the viewer toolbar to see if timeline controls appear after loading your file. Not happy with how your model looks? Use Meshy's \u003ctextureGen\u003eAI Texture Generator\u003c/textureGen\u003e to apply new surface materials directly in the editor.\",\"Answer5\":\"There are a few common causes: 1. The file may be corrupted — try opening it in another application first to confirm it's valid 2. External texture or material references may be missing, resulting in a blank or grey appearance — pack your textures into the file before uploading to avoid this 3. The model may have inverted normals, making faces appear invisible from the camera's perspective 4. Very large files may time out on slower connections — try a simplified or decimated version\",\"Answer6\":\"The viewer renders your model in real time using WebGL, which may display lighting and shading differently from offline renderers like Blender Cycles or V-Ray. Geometry, UV layout, and polygon structure remain unchanged — what you see reflects the actual mesh data in your file.\",\"Answer7\":\"Meshy's viewer currently supports the most widely used 3D formats, including OBJ, FBX, STL, GLB, and GLTF. Support for additional formats is being expanded. If your format isn't listed, convert it to GLB or OBJ first using Meshy's \u003cconverter\u003e3D File Converter\u003c/converter\u003e, then open the result in the viewer.\",\"Answer8\":\"The viewer accurately represents your model's geometry, UV coordinates, and embedded materials. Real-time WebGL rendering does not replicate path-traced lighting or physically accurate shading, so the preview may differ from a final render. For a close approximation of final output, ensure your textures use PBR-compatible maps (base color, roughness, metalness, normal) and are correctly embedded in the file before uploading. For more on how different formats handle PBR materials, see our \u003cformatGuide\u003e3D file format guide\u003c/formatGuide\u003e.\",\"Answer9\":\"$44\",\"Question1\":\"Why use Meshy's 3D File Viewer?\",\"Question2\":\"Is it safe to upload my proprietary 3D models to an online viewer?\",\"Question3\":\"Can I view 3D files on mobile or tablet?\",\"Question4\":\"Does the 3D viewer support animations and textures?\",\"Question5\":\"Why is my 3D model not loading or appearing blank?\",\"Question6\":\"Will my 3D model's visual quality change during the preview?\",\"Question7\":\"Which formats does the Meshy 3D viewer support?\",\"Question8\":\"How accurate is the 3D model rendering?\",\"Question9\":\"What's the best workflow to validate scale and real-world units in a 3D viewer before exporting for AR?\",\"SubpageAnswer1\":\"Meshy's {format} viewer lets you inspect 3D models instantly in your browser — no software installation, no account required. Rotate, zoom, and pan around your model to check geometry, proportions, and surface quality before committing it to a pipeline. Whether you're reviewing assets from a client, validating an AI-generated model, or doing a quick sanity check before export, Meshy gives you a clean, fast preview with zero friction.\",\"SubpageAnswer4\":\"Texture support depends on how the file is structured. {format} files that embed textures directly will display materials and colors correctly in the viewer. For formats that reference textures externally, you may see an untextured grey model — in this case, pack your textures into the file before uploading. Animation support varies by format; check the viewer toolbar to see if timeline controls appear after loading your file. Not happy with how your model looks? Use Meshy's AI Texture Generator to apply new surface materials directly in the editor.\",\"SubpageQuestion1\":\"Why use Meshy's {format} 3D File Viewer?\",\"SubpageQuestion2\":\"Is it safe to upload my proprietary 3D models to an online viewer?\",\"SubpageQuestion3\":\"Can I view {format} files on mobile or tablet?\",\"SubpageQuestion4\":\"Does the {format} viewer support animations and textures?\",\"SubpageQuestion5\":\"Why is my .{format} model not loading or appearing blank?\",\"SubpageQuestion6\":\"Will my 3D model's visual quality change during the preview?\",\"SubpageQuestion7\":\"Which formats does the Meshy 3D viewer support?\",\"SubpageQuestion8\":\"How accurate is the {format} model rendering?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"View your 3D designs on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Our responsive viewer ensures consistent quality whether you’re in the office, on-site, or on the move.\",\"Title\":\"View on any device\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"View industry-standard 3D formats including OBJ, STL, GLTF, GLB, FBX, USDZ, and more directly in your browser. No installation needed — instantly open and inspect any 3D file.\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Access professional-grade 3D viewing technology at zero cost. Preview, inspect, and share 3D models with no subscription or account required — empowering students, indie developers, and professional studios alike.\"},\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy's \u003chighlight\u003eOnline 3D Viewer\u003c/highlight\u003e\"},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Easily open and preview 3D files online for free. Preview 3D models and animations in your browser with no software install required. High-quality, fast loading, and secure 3D file viewer\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Easily open and preview .{format} files online for free. Preview 3D models and animations in your browser with no software install required. High-quality, fast loading, and secure {format} viewer.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"{format} File Viewer: Open .{format} Model Online [Free]\",\"Title\":\"3D File Viewer: Open 3D Models Online [Free]\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drag and drop your 3D model into the viewer or click to select files from your device. Our viewer supports all major formats including OBJ, FBX, STL, GLTF, USDZ, and many more without requiring any plugins.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Drag and drop your {format} file into the viewer or click to select files from your device. Our viewer supports all major formats including OBJ, FBX, STL, GLTF, USDZ, and many more without requiring any plugins.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"Upload a(an) {format} File\",\"Title\":\"Upload a 3D Model File\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Instantly interact with your 3D model using intuitive controls – rotate by dragging, zoom with scroll, and pan with right-click. Enjoy exploring your models from any angle.\",\"SubpageDescription\":\"Instantly interact with your {format} model using intuitive controls – rotate by dragging, zoom with scroll, and pan with right-click. Enjoy exploring your models from any angle.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"View {format} from Browser\",\"Title\":\"View Your 3D Model from Browser\"},\"SubpageTitle\":\"How to Open {format} File\",\"Title\":\"How to View 3D Models Online\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"SectionTitle\":\"Explore More 3D File Viewers\"},\"Popular\":{\"Group3DPrinting\":\"3D Printing\",\"GroupARVR\":\"AR / VR\",\"GroupGameDev\":\"Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"Popular Online 3D Viewers\"},\"PreviewError\":\"Failed to load 3D model preview.\",\"Reset\":\"View Another 3D File\",\"Select\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Select format\"},\"Stats\":{\"Dimensions\":\"Dimensions\",\"DimensionsValue\":\"{x} × {y} × {z}\",\"FileSize\":\"File size\",\"Materials\":\"Materials\",\"Meshes\":\"Meshes\",\"Title\":\"Model info\",\"Triangles\":\"Triangles\",\"Vertices\":\"Vertices\"},\"SubpageDescription\":\"Easily open and view .{format} 3D model online for free. Preview 3D models and animations in your browser with no software install required.\",\"SubpageTitle\":\"{format} Viewer: View .{format} 3D Files Online [Free]\",\"Title\":\"3D Viewer: View 3D Model Files Online [Free]\",\"Toolbar\":{\"ExitFullscreen\":\"Exit fullscreen\",\"FitView\":\"Reset view\",\"Fullscreen\":\"Fullscreen\",\"Grid\":\"Ground grid\",\"ModelInfo\":\"Model info\",\"Screenshot\":\"Take screenshot\",\"ScreenshotError\":\"Couldn't capture a screenshot of this model.\",\"Wireframe\":\"Wireframe\",\"ZoomIn\":\"Zoom in\",\"ZoomOut\":\"Zoom out\"},\"Viewer\":\"{format} Viewer\"},\"OtherNavigation\":{\"ConverterTitle\":\"3D File Converter\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D Generator\",\"TextureGeneratorTitle\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"Title\":\"Other Popular 3D Tools\",\"ViewerName\":\"{format} Viewer\",\"ViewerTitle\":\"Online 3D Viewer\"},\"ShapeGenerator\":{\"AutoRotateLabel\":\"Auto-rotate\",\"Breadcrumb\":{\"ShapeGenerator\":\"3D Shape Generator\"},\"Category\":{\"Flat\":\"Flat\",\"Hollow\":\"Hollow\",\"Solid\":\"Solid\"},\"ColorMode\":{\"Gradient\":\"Gradient\",\"Solid\":\"Solid\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"The Meshy 3D Shape Generator is a free online tool that builds parametric 3D shapes directly in your browser, including solid primitives, flat extrusions and hollow forms. You can customize each shape's material, color and style, then export it as a PNG image or a GLB or STL 3D model, with no signup required.\",\"Answer10\":\"Yes. PNG export uses a transparent background by default, so you can drop your 3D shape straight into presentations, thumbnails, websites and design mockups with no extra editing.\",\"Answer11\":\"Solid renders your 3D shape as a filled surface with full material and lighting, while Outline draws only the edges as clean 3D line art. Outline suits diagrams, blueprints and minimalist icons; either way, the GLB or STL model you download stays a solid, printable mesh.\",\"Answer12\":\"Yes. The GLB and STL exports are standard 3D formats that import directly into Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot and most other 3D and game engines, with no conversion required. GLB keeps materials and colors, while STL is best for 3D printing.\",\"Answer13\":\"No. Every 3D shape is parametric and ready-made, so you simply pick a primitive and adjust a few options, with no 3D modeling experience needed. You do not need software like Blender or Maya to create or export your shape.\",\"Answer14\":\"The 3D shape generator builds precise geometric primitives instantly in your browser with no AI prompt needed. When you want more detail, open your shape in Meshy's AI 3D workspace to add textures or turn text and images into fully detailed 3D models.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes. Creating and exporting 3D shapes as PNG, GLB or STL is completely free, with no signup, no credit card and no watermark. You can generate and download as many 3D shapes as you want.\",\"Answer3\":\"You can create eight solid primitives (cube, sphere, cylinder, cone, torus, capsule, octahedron and pyramid), six flat extruded shapes (circle, triangle, square, pentagon, plus and minus), and hollow variants of the flat shapes. Every shape is generated for you and ready to restyle, so you can change its material, color and finish before you export.\",\"Answer4\":\"You can export a transparent PNG image, a GLB 3D model for games, AR and VR, or an STL file for 3D printing and slicing. All three formats are free and have no watermark.\",\"Answer5\":\"Yes. Export your 3D shape as an STL file and load it into any slicer, such as Cura, PrusaSlicer or Bambu Studio, to 3D print it. STL is the standard 3D printing format, so it works with virtually every printer.\",\"Answer6\":\"No. The 3D shape generator runs entirely in your web browser, with no downloads, plugins or account required. It works on any modern browser across desktop, tablet and mobile.\",\"Answer7\":\"Yes. Choose from clay, glass, metal, glitter and other material presets, then pick a solid or gradient color. You can also switch between a solid fill and an outline (wireframe) style for a different look.\",\"Answer8\":\"Yes. The 3D shapes you create are yours to use in both personal and commercial projects, with no attribution and no watermark. That includes games, apps, videos, print designs and client work.\",\"Answer9\":\"Open the 3D shape generator and pick the cube or sphere from the shape picker, then customize its material, color and style. Your 3D cube or sphere renders instantly in the live preview and exports as a PNG image, GLB 3D model or STL file in one click.\",\"Question1\":\"What is the Meshy 3D Shape Generator?\",\"Question10\":\"Can I export a 3D shape as a transparent PNG?\",\"Question11\":\"What is the difference between the Solid and Outline styles?\",\"Question12\":\"Can I use the 3D models in Blender, Unity or Unreal?\",\"Question13\":\"Do I need any 3D modeling skills?\",\"Question14\":\"How is this different from Meshy's AI 3D model generator?\",\"Question2\":\"Is the 3D Shape Generator free?\",\"Question3\":\"Which 3D shapes can I create?\",\"Question4\":\"What file formats can I export?\",\"Question5\":\"Can I 3D print the shapes?\",\"Question6\":\"Do I need to install or sign up for anything?\",\"Question7\":\"Can I customize the material and color?\",\"Question8\":\"Can I use the shapes commercially?\",\"Question9\":\"How do I make a 3D cube or sphere online?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Pick from a full library of 3D shapes, including solid primitives like the cube, sphere, cylinder, cone and torus, flat extruded shapes, and hollow variants. Every geometric shape is generated for you, with zero 3D modeling.\",\"Title\":\"Ready-made 3D shapes\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Generate and download unlimited 3D shapes for free, with no signup and no watermark, and full rights to use them in commercial and personal projects.\",\"Title\":\"Free, with no watermark\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Finish any 3D shape with metallic, glass, clay or glitter materials, solid or gradient colors, and a solid or outline (wireframe) look, ready for icons, branding, slides and game art.\",\"Title\":\"Style shapes to fit your project\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Every shape is parametric, so a single click gives you a clean, perfectly formed 3D model, with no sculpting, no topology cleanup and no learning curve.\",\"Title\":\"Generate 3D shapes in seconds\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Take your shape into design tools as a transparent PNG, into Blender, Unity or Unreal as a GLB 3D model, or into your slicer as a print-ready STL, with no format conversion needed.\",\"Title\":\"Export for any 3D workflow\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"Need more than a primitive? Open your shape in Meshy's AI 3D workspace to add textures, or turn text and images into detailed, production-ready 3D models.\",\"Title\":\"Upgrade to AI 3D models\"}},\"GradientEndLabel\":\"Gradient end\",\"GradientStartLabel\":\"Gradient start\",\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's free 3D shape generator builds parametric 3D primitives in your browser. Customize material, color and gradient, then export a transparent PNG or a 3D model in GLB or STL. No signup, no watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Free Online 3D Shape Generator\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Open the free online 3D shape generator and pick a solid 3D primitive such as the cube, sphere, cylinder, cone, torus, pyramid, capsule or octahedron, or choose a flat extruded shape or hollow variant. Every 3D shape is parametric, so no 3D modeling skills are required.\",\"Title\":\"Pick a 3D shape\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Customize your 3D shape with a material such as metallic, glass, clay or glitter, a solid or gradient color, and a solid or outline style. Each change updates live on the auto-rotating 3D preview, so you can fine-tune the look before you export.\",\"Title\":\"Style your 3D shape\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Spin and orbit your 3D shape on the live preview to check every angle, then export it as a transparent PNG, a GLB 3D model for games and AR/VR, or a print-ready STL for 3D printing. It's free, with no login and no watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and export your 3D shape\"},\"Title\":\"How to make a 3D shape online\"},\"LastUpdatedLabel\":\"Last updated\",\"LightSource\":{\"LeftSide\":\"Left side\",\"RightSide\":\"Right side\",\"Top\":\"Top\"},\"LightSourceLabel\":\"Light source\",\"MetaDescription\":\"Free 3D shape generator. Create cubes, spheres, cylinders, cones, torus and more in your browser, then export as PNG, GLB or STL. No signup, no watermark.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Free 3D Shape Generator: Create \u0026 Export 3D Primitives | Meshy\",\"Perspective\":{\"Dimetric\":\"Dimetric\",\"Isometric\":\"Isometric\",\"Trimetric\":\"Trimetric\"},\"PerspectiveLabel\":\"Perspective\",\"PopularTools\":{\"Description\":\"Beyond 3D shapes, explore the full Meshy AI suite for 3D creators.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"PricingCta\":\"See Pricing\",\"Title\":\"Other Popular Meshy AI Tools\",\"Tools\":{\"FileConverter\":{\"Description\":\"Convert between GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL and more\",\"Title\":\"3D File Converter\"},\"OnlineViewer\":{\"Description\":\"Open and preview 3D models in your browser\",\"Title\":\"Online 3D Viewer\"}}},\"Randomize\":\"Randomize\",\"RelatedTools\":{\"Compressor\":\"Shrink 3D model file sizes without quality loss\",\"Converter\":\"Convert between GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL and more\",\"Description\":\"Pair the shape generator with the rest of Meshy's free 3D tools, all in your browser.\",\"HubCta\":\"Explore all 3D tools\",\"TextGenerator\":\"Turn any word into a 3D text model\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D Tools\",\"Viewer\":\"Open and preview 3D models in your browser\"},\"ScaleLabel\":\"Scale\",\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb3DTools\":\"3D Tools\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BrowserRequirements\":\"Requires a modern web browser with WebGL support.\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Item1\":\"Cube, sphere, cylinder, cone and torus primitives\",\"Item10\":\"Runs in the browser with no signup or install\",\"Item2\":\"Capsule, octahedron and pyramid solids\",\"Item3\":\"Extruded 2D shapes: circle, triangle, square, pentagon, plus and minus\",\"Item4\":\"Hollow shape variants\",\"Item5\":\"Clay, glass, metal and 12+ material presets\",\"Item6\":\"Solid or gradient color fill\",\"Item7\":\"Solid or outline rendering style\",\"Item8\":\"Transparent PNG export\",\"Item9\":\"GLB and STL 3D model export\"},\"Keywords\":{\"Item1\":\"3d shape generator\",\"Item2\":\"3d primitive generator\",\"Item3\":\"parametric 3d shapes\",\"Item4\":\"shape to stl\",\"Item5\":\"online 3d shapes\"},\"OfferDescription\":\"Free to use with no watermark or signup.\",\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Shape Generator\"},\"ShapePickerLabel\":\"Choose a shape\",\"Shapes\":{\"Capsule\":\"Capsule\",\"Circle\":\"Circle\",\"Cone\":\"Cone\",\"Cube\":\"Cube\",\"Cylinder\":\"Cylinder\",\"HollowCircle\":\"Ring\",\"HollowMinus\":\"Hollow Minus\",\"HollowPentagon\":\"Hollow Pentagon\",\"HollowPlus\":\"Hollow Plus\",\"HollowSquare\":\"Frame\",\"HollowTriangle\":\"Hollow Triangle\",\"Minus\":\"Minus\",\"Octahedron\":\"Octahedron\",\"Pentagon\":\"Pentagon\",\"Plus\":\"Plus\",\"Pyramid\":\"Pyramid\",\"Sphere\":\"Sphere\",\"Square\":\"Square\",\"Torus\":\"Torus\",\"Triangle\":\"Triangle\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"LovedByCreators\":\"Loved by 3D creators\",\"PartnersLead\":\"Trusted by teams building with 3D\"},\"Style\":{\"Outline\":\"Outline\",\"Solid\":\"Solid\"},\"StyleLabel\":\"Shape style\",\"Tabs\":{\"Environment\":\"Environment\",\"Material\":\"Material\",\"Shape\":\"Shape\"},\"WorkspaceCtaLabel\":\"Create in Workspace\"},\"SignUp\":\"Sign Up\",\"SketchTo3DConverter\":{\"AIComparison\":{\"Caption\":\"Comparison: AI image generators, manual 3D modeling, and hiring an artist versus the Meshy sketch-to-3D converter.\",\"Cells\":{\"DaysWeeks\":\"Days–weeks\",\"FlatImage\":\"Flat image\",\"HoursDays\":\"Hours–days\"},\"Columns\":{\"AiGenerators\":\"AI Image Generators\",\"Artist\":\"Hiring a 3D Artist\",\"Manual\":\"Manual Modeling\",\"Meshy\":\"Meshy\"},\"Description\":\"AI image generators only make flat pictures, hand-modeling takes real skill and time, and hiring an artist is slow and costly. Meshy turns your sketch into a real, editable, print-ready 3D model in minutes.\",\"Footnote\":\"Columns describe typical tools in each category (e.g. Midjourney / DALL·E for AI image generators); exact capabilities vary by product.\",\"No\":\"No\",\"Rows\":{\"Export\":\"Export \u0026 3D-print ready\",\"Fast\":\"Ready in minutes\",\"Free\":\"Free to start\",\"FromSketch\":\"Works from a hand-drawn sketch\",\"NoSkill\":\"No 3D skills needed\",\"RealMesh\":\"Real, editable 3D mesh\"},\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy's AI Sketch to 3D Converter\",\"Yes\":\"Yes\"},\"AIShowcase\":{\"Description\":\"Every model here began as a hand-drawn sketch and became a true 3D mesh you can rotate, edit, and export with Meshy's AI.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Made with Meshy AI\",\"PrimaryCta\":\"Convert My Sketch to 3D\",\"Title\":\"From a Sketch to a Real 3D Model\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"SketchConverter\":\"Sketch to 3D Converter\"},\"Cta\":{\"Convert\":\"Convert My Sketch to 3D\",\"Description\":\"Upload your sketch, drawing, or concept art and download a real, textured 3D model in minutes. Your first few generations are free.\",\"Title\":\"Got a Sketch? Turn It Into 3D.\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Upload a photo of your sketch, a 2D drawing, or concept art (PNG, JPG, or WEBP) to \u003clink\u003eMeshy's sketch to 3D converter\u003c/link\u003e. The AI image-to-3D pipeline reads the shapes and silhouette and rebuilds them into a real, textured 3D mesh in minutes. You can then export the result as OBJ, GLB, FBX, or STL.\",\"Answer2\":\"You can upload sketches as PNG, JPG, or WEBP files up to 5 MB. Once your model is generated, export it in every major \u003clink\u003e3D file format\u003c/link\u003e, including OBJ, GLB, FBX, and STL, ready for Blender, Unity, Unreal, or your 3D printing slicer.\",\"Answer3\":\"Clear, well-lit drawings with a single subject and a clean background work best, whether it's a rough pencil sketch, a line drawing, or finished concept art. Our \u003clink\u003estep-by-step sketch to 3D guide\u003c/link\u003e walks through real examples and tips for sharper, more accurate results.\",\"Answer4\":\"Yes. Meshy generates a watertight, solid mesh you can export as STL or OBJ and send straight to your slicer. It's a popular workflow for \u003clink\u003e3D printing\u003c/link\u003e figurines, tabletop miniatures, toys, and custom parts from a single drawing.\",\"Answer5\":\"None at all. The \u003clink\u003eAI image-to-3D\u003c/link\u003e engine handles the modeling, topology, and texturing for you, so anyone can turn a drawing into a usable 3D model without touching Blender or ZBrush. If you can sketch or upload an image, you can create in 3D.\",\"Answer6\":\"Yes. You can start converting sketches to 3D for free each month with no credit card required. Paid \u003clink\u003eplans\u003c/link\u003e add more credits, higher resolution, and a commercial license so you can use your models in games, products, prints, and client work.\",\"Question1\":\"How do I convert a sketch to a 3D model?\",\"Question2\":\"What image formats can I upload, and what can I export?\",\"Question3\":\"What kind of sketches and drawings work best?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I turn a hand-drawn sketch into a 3D print?\",\"Question5\":\"Do I need any 3D modeling skills?\",\"Question6\":\"Is the sketch to 3D converter free, and can I use the models commercially?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Convert a sketch and export to every major 3D format — GLB and FBX for game engines and AR, OBJ for Blender and Cinema 4D, STL for 3D printing. No watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Export your 3D model to OBJ, GLB, FBX or STL\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Skip the steep learning curve of Blender or ZBrush. Upload a sketch in your browser and let the AI do the 3D modeling for you — nothing to download.\",\"Title\":\"No modeling skills, no software install\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"A free image-to-3D converter for students, indie game devs, designers, and hobbyists. Start with free trial credits and no card required.\",\"Title\":\"Free AI sketch-to-3D for every creator\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"No render queue and no manual retopology — Meshy's AI turns your drawing into a textured, production-ready 3D model in just a couple of minutes.\",\"Title\":\"From sketch to 3D in minutes\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Your sketch is handed to the same image-to-3D AI trusted by millions of creators to generate clean, fully textured 3D meshes.\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline\"}},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI sketch to 3D converter turns a hand-drawn sketch or 2D drawing into a real, textured 3D model in minutes. Upload your sketch and export to OBJ, GLB, FBX, and STL for Blender, Unity, and 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"AI Sketch to 3D Converter\"},\"Hero\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Sketch to 3D\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Example 3D model generated from a 2D sketch with Meshy\",\"TitleAccent\":\"Converter\",\"TitleLead\":\"AI Sketch to 3D\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drop in a photo of a hand-drawn sketch, a 2D drawing, or concept art as a PNG, JPG, or WEBP. A clean, high-contrast sketch with one clear subject works best.\",\"Title\":\"Upload your sketch\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline reads your sketch and reconstructs it into a real, fully textured 3D mesh in minutes — no modeling skills required.\",\"Title\":\"Let the AI build your 3D model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Rotate your 3D model, then export it as OBJ, GLB, FBX, or STL for Blender, Unity, Unreal, or 3D printing. Free trial credits, no card required.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and export\"},\"Title\":\"How to Convert a Sketch to 3D in 3 Steps\"},\"MetaDescription\":\"Turn any 2D sketch or drawing into a real 3D model with Meshy's AI. Upload your sketch, generate a textured mesh, and export to OBJ, GLB \u0026 STL. Free to try.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Sketch to 3D Converter — Drawing to 3D Model Free | Meshy\",\"Pipeline\":{\"Card1Description\":\"Meshy reads your sketch's shapes and silhouette and reconstructs them into a true 3D mesh — no manual modeling.\",\"Card1Title\":\"AI image-to-3D\",\"Card2Description\":\"Studio-quality PBR textures are generated and applied automatically, with no manual UV unwrapping or shader setup.\",\"Card2Title\":\"Automatic PBR texturing\",\"Card3Description\":\"Get production-ready geometry you can open and refine in Blender, Maya, or any 3D app.\",\"Card3Title\":\"Clean, editable mesh\",\"Card4Description\":\"Export OBJ, GLB, FBX, and STL — ready for game engines, renderers, and 3D printers.\",\"Card4Title\":\"Multi-format export\",\"Description\":\"One converter handles the whole pipeline — read the sketch, build the mesh, texture it, and export.\",\"Title\":\"From sketch to game-ready model\"},\"PopularTools\":{\"Description\":\"Beyond sketch to 3D, explore the full Meshy AI suite for 3D creators.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"PricingCta\":\"See Pricing\",\"Title\":\"Other Popular Meshy AI Tools\"},\"RelatedBlog\":{\"Title\":\"Related Blog Articles\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"Compressor\":\"Shrink 3D model file sizes without quality loss\",\"Converter\":\"Convert between GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL and more\",\"Cta\":\"Convert now\",\"Heading\":\"Related Tools\",\"TextGenerator\":\"Turn any word into a 3D text model\",\"Title\":\"Popular 3D Tools\",\"Viewer\":\"Open and preview 3D models in your browser\"},\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb3DTools\":\"3D Tools\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BrowserRequirements\":\"Requires WebGL 2\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Item1\":\"Free online sketch to 3D converter — turn a hand-drawn sketch or 2D drawing into a real 3D model\",\"Item10\":\"Free to use with free trial credits and no card required\",\"Item11\":\"Free for commercial and personal use with no watermark\",\"Item12\":\"Works in any modern browser on desktop and mobile\",\"Item2\":\"Converts hand-drawn sketches, digital line art, doodles, and concept art\",\"Item3\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI image-to-3D pipeline with photoreal PBR textures\",\"Item4\":\"Accepts PNG, JPG, and WEBP uploads up to 5MB\",\"Item5\":\"Drag-and-drop or file-picker upload\",\"Item6\":\"Generates a clean, editable 3D mesh, not a flat image render\",\"Item7\":\"Export to GLB, OBJ, FBX for Blender, Unity, Unreal, and Godot\",\"Item8\":\"Export to STL for 3D printing\",\"Item9\":\"No 3D modeling skills and no software install required\"},\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy Sketch to 3D Converter\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"LovedByCreators\":\"Loved by Creators\",\"PartnersLead\":\"Trusted by\"},\"Upload\":{\"Dropzone\":\"Drag and drop sketch here or click to upload\",\"ErrorBadFormat\":\"Unsupported format — use PNG, JPG or WEBP.\",\"ErrorTooLarge\":\"File too large — max 5MB.\",\"Hint\":\"Max file size: 5 MB\",\"Label\":\"Your sketch\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Description\":\"Where creators turn drawings into real 3D models with Meshy.\",\"FilmProductionDescription\":\"Turn storyboard sketches and concept art into 3D assets for previz and VFX. Populate shots with props and characters in minutes, so artists can spend their time on the final look instead of asset prep.\",\"GameDevelopmentDescription\":\"Turn concept art and rough sketches into game-ready props, characters, and environment assets. Export GLB or FBX and drop them straight into Unity or Unreal, saving hours of manual modeling per asset.\",\"InteriorDesignDescription\":\"Sketch furniture and décor concepts, then generate 3D models to drop into room layouts and client renders. Move from a rough concept to a polished presentation without hiring a 3D artist.\",\"PrintingDescription\":\"Turn a hand-drawn sketch into a watertight, printable 3D model in seconds. Export STL or OBJ straight to your slicer, ideal for figurines, tabletop miniatures, toys, and custom one-off parts.\",\"ProductDesignDescription\":\"Turn napkin sketches and concept drawings into 3D mock-ups in minutes. Test form, proportion, and fit early, and lock down your idea long before you commit to full CAD or tooling.\",\"Title\":\"Sketch to 3D for Every Workflow\",\"ToyDesignDescription\":\"Convert character sketches into detailed 3D toy models ready for prototyping. Iterate on poses, proportions, and accessories in minutes, then export clean meshes for 3D printing or downstream sculpting.\"},\"Workflows\":{\"ConceptCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert concept art\",\"Description\":\"Convert character, prop, or product concept art into a 3D base mesh you can refine, texture, and animate downstream.\",\"Title\":\"Concept art to 3D\"},\"DrawingCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert a drawing\",\"Description\":\"Upload a flat digital drawing, line art, or doodle and let the AI read its shapes and silhouette to build real 3D geometry.\",\"Title\":\"2D drawing \u0026 line art to 3D\"},\"SketchCard\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert a sketch\",\"Description\":\"Snap a photo of a pencil or pen sketch and turn it into a clean, textured 3D model — no scanning rig or modeling skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Hand-drawn sketch to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"Every sketch becomes a 3D model\"}},\"SvgTo3d\":{\"AllConverters\":\"All file converters\",\"Breadcrumb\":{\"SvgTo3d\":\"SVG to 3D\"},\"Cta\":{\"Button\":\"Convert Your SVG\",\"Title\":\"Start Converting Your SVG to 3D\"},\"Description\":\"Convert SVG vector files into 3D models online, ready to export in popular 3D formats. Free, browser-based, no signup. Turn SVG into 3D in seconds.\",\"Faq\":{\"Heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"SVG to 3D conversion turns a flat vector graphic into a real three-dimensional mesh by extruding each of its paths to a depth you choose. Because an SVG is built from clean mathematical curves, the result is crisp, solid geometry rather than a blurry trace of an image. The model you get can be \u003csvgToStl\u003e3D printed\u003c/svgToStl\u003e, dropped into a game or app, or viewed in AR. It is a deterministic geometric process, so the same SVG always produces the same shape.\",\"Question\":\"What is SVG to 3D conversion?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"You can export to STL, OBJ, GLB, GLTF, PLY, 3MF, USDZ, and DXF, covering everything from 3D printing to game engines and AR. STL and 3MF are best for slicing and printing, GLB and GLTF suit the web and real-time engines, and USDZ is made for iOS Quick Look. OBJ and PLY are widely supported across DCC tools, while DXF fits 2D and CAD workflows. Just pick the format card that matches the tool you are heading into.\",\"Question\":\"Which output formats are supported?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes, the SVG to 3D converter is completely free to use. There is no signup, no watermark on your exported model, and no credits to spend. You can convert as many files as you like, as often as you need. Everything runs in your browser, so there is nothing to install either.\",\"Question\":\"Is it free?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"No. Conversion happens entirely inside your own browser, so your SVG is never uploaded to or stored on our servers. Your artwork stays private on your device from start to finish. As a bonus, this makes conversion instant, with no upload or download wait.\",\"Question\":\"Are my files uploaded to a server?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy builds watertight, manifold meshes that are ready to slice, so the result drops straight into your printing workflow. Export as STL for standard single-color slicing, or 3MF when you want multi-color FDM printing. Set the extrusion depth before converting to control how thick the printed part will be. If you are unsure which format to choose, see our \u003cprintGuide\u003e3D print file type guide\u003c/printGuide\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"Can I 3D print the result?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Each path's fill color is read from your SVG and baked into the mesh as vertex colors during conversion. Those colors are carried into the export formats that support them, such as GLB, PLY, and USDZ. Formats meant purely for geometry, like STL, stay color-free by design. So a multi-color logo or icon keeps its look wherever the target format allows.\",\"Question\":\"Does it keep my SVG's colors?\"},\"Q7\":{\"Answer\":\"This converter is built for vector SVGs, which it extrudes into 3D geometry, so it cannot do the same with a raster image like a PNG or JPG. For photos and bitmaps, use Meshy's AI-powered \u003cimageTo3d\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e instead, which reconstructs a full 3D model from a single picture. That is a generative AI workflow rather than a deterministic extrusion, so it is the right tool when you do not have clean vector paths. If you can re-export your artwork as an SVG, this converter will give you sharper, print-ready results.\",\"Question\":\"I have a raster image (PNG/JPG), not an SVG — what should I use?\"}},\"Features\":{\"ClientSide\":{\"Description\":\"Conversion runs entirely in your browser. Your files never leave your device.\",\"Title\":\"100% Client-Side\"},\"ColorPreserving\":{\"Description\":\"Per-path SVG fill colors are baked into the mesh as vertex colors and survive export.\",\"Title\":\"Color-Preserving Conversion\"},\"ExtrusionDepth\":{\"Description\":\"Control how far each vector path is extruded to fine-tune thickness for your use case.\",\"Title\":\"Adjustable Extrusion Depth\"},\"FreeInstant\":{\"Description\":\"No signup, no watermark, and no credits. Most conversions finish in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Free \u0026 Instant\"},\"Heading\":\"Advanced Features\",\"MultipleFormats\":{\"Description\":\"STL, OBJ, GLB, GLTF, PLY, 3MF, USDZ, and DXF, compatible with every major slicer, engine, and DCC tool.\",\"Title\":\"Multiple Export Formats\"},\"PrintReady\":{\"Description\":\"Paths are merged into watertight, manifold meshes optimized for slicing.\",\"Title\":\"Print-Ready Geometry\"}},\"Formats\":{\"Description\":\"Pick the 3D format that matches your tool — jump straight to any SVG converter below.\",\"Dxf\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to DXF\",\"Description\":\"2D/CAD interchange format.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to DXF\"},\"Glb\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to GLB\",\"Description\":\"Compact format for web \u0026 real-time engines.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to GLB\"},\"Gltf\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to GLTF\",\"Description\":\"Open standard for 3D scenes.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to GLTF\"},\"Heading\":\"Choose Your Target Format\",\"Obj\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to OBJ\",\"Description\":\"Universal mesh format for DCC tools.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to OBJ\"},\"Ply\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to PLY\",\"Description\":\"Point-cloud / mesh format with vertex colors.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to PLY\"},\"Stl\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to STL\",\"Description\":\"The standard format for 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to STL\"},\"ThreeMf\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to 3MF\",\"Description\":\"Modern format for multi-color FDM printing.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to 3MF\"},\"Usdz\":{\"Cta\":\"Convert to USDZ\",\"Description\":\"AR-ready format for iOS Quick Look.\",\"Title\":\"SVG to USDZ\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Extrude any SVG into a real 3D model right in your browser, then export it in the 3D format your workflow needs. Free, instant, no signup, no upload.\",\"Title\":\"Free SVG to 3D Converter\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Heading\":\"How to Convert SVG to 3D\",\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drag and drop any SVG vector file, or click to browse. Clean, closed paths give the best results, and everything runs locally in your browser with a 50MB limit.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Upload an SVG vector file to start the SVG to 3D conversion\",\"Title\":\"Upload your SVG\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Choose your target 3D format and set the extrusion depth, then convert with a single click. Our converter builds clean, watertight geometry and bakes in each path's colors, no extra software needed.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Adjust extrusion depth and preview the SVG to 3D model\",\"Title\":\"Convert to 3D formats\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"When conversion finishes in seconds, download your model as STL, OBJ, GLB, GLTF, PLY, 3MF, USDZ, or DXF. Every file is processed locally, so your artwork never leaves your device.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Export the SVG to 3D model as STL, OBJ, GLB and more\",\"Title\":\"Export your 3D model\"}},\"Showcase\":{\"Badge\":{\"Description\":\"A vector emblem extruded with its colors preserved.\",\"Title\":\"SVG badge to 3D model\"},\"Description\":\"See how flat vector art like logos, icons, badges, and signs becomes a usable 3D model.\",\"Heading\":\"SVG to 3D Model Showcase\",\"Icon\":{\"Description\":\"A simple vector icon turned into a solid 3D shape.\",\"Title\":\"SVG icon to 3D model\"},\"Logo\":{\"Description\":\"A flat brand logo extruded into a printable 3D badge.\",\"Title\":\"SVG logo to 3D model\"},\"Sign\":{\"Description\":\"Vector lettering converted to a 3D nameplate.\",\"Title\":\"SVG sign to 3D model\"}},\"Title\":\"SVG to 3D Converter | Free Online Vector to 3D Model — Meshy\",\"Upload\":{\"FormatLabel\":\"Convert to\",\"FormatPlaceholder\":\"Select format\"}},\"TextGenerator\":{\"AIShowcase\":{\"Description\":\"Need photoreal PBR textures, animated 3D text or a custom AI style beyond the browser tool? Switch to Meshy Workspace, the text-to-3D pipeline trusted by 10M creators.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI in Workspace\",\"PrimaryCta\":\"Create My AI 3D Model\",\"Title\":\"Production-grade AI text-to-3D models with Meshy\"},\"AdobeComparison\":{\"Description\":\"Adobe's 3D tools are powerful but require a paid Creative Cloud subscription and a desktop install, and their 3D output is a rendered image or video, not a mesh file. Meshy runs free in your browser and exports a real 3D mesh.\",\"Features\":{\"animation\":\"Animation built in\",\"fastResult\":\"Result in seconds\",\"free\":\"Free to use\",\"meshExport\":\"Real 3D mesh export\",\"noInstall\":\"Browser-only, no install\"},\"Footnote\":\"Adobe, Photoshop, Illustrator and After Effects are trademarks of Adobe Inc. Comparison reflects each app's documented 3D output capability: Illustrator's 3D and Materials effect renders to the 2D artboard, and After Effects 3D layers render to video frames. Neither path exports a GLB, OBJ or STL mesh file.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy 3D text at a glance vs Adobe Creative Cloud tools\"},\"AiEnhance\":{\"Label\":\"Generate My 3D Text Model\",\"LabelMultilingual\":\"Generate with AI\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"TextGenerator\":\"3D Text Generator\"},\"CameraPresets\":{\"Front\":\"Front\",\"Label\":\"Camera\",\"ThreeQuarter\":\"3/4\",\"Top\":\"Top\"},\"Description\":\"Create custom 3D typography in your browser with WebGL. Style, preview, then export to GLB, OBJ, STL, or PNG. Free 3D file tools, no signup, no install.\",\"Environment\":{\"IntensityLabel\":\"Intensity\",\"LightingLabel\":\"Lighting\",\"Preset\":{\"Cozy\":\"Cozy\",\"Daylight\":\"Daylight\",\"Outdoor\":\"Outdoor\",\"Studio\":\"Studio\",\"Sunset\":\"Sunset\"},\"ShowBackground\":\"Show background\"},\"Export\":{\"ChooseFormat\":\"Choose format\",\"Download\":\"Download\",\"GlbCaption\":\"Unity, Unreal, Roblox Studio\",\"ImageGroup\":\"Image\",\"MeshExportNote\":\"What you see uses bloom and HDRI lighting that won't be saved in the file.\",\"ModelGroup\":\"3D Model\",\"ObjCaption\":\"Blender, Cinema 4D, all 3D apps\",\"PngCaption\":\"Thumbnails \u0026 social\",\"PngPillTemplate\":\"PNG · {size}\",\"PrintGroup\":\"3D Print\",\"Size\":{\"HdShort\":\"HD\",\"SquareHdShort\":\"2K\",\"X1Short\":\"1×\",\"X2Short\":\"2×\"},\"SizeLabel\":\"Export size\",\"SizeOption\":{\"Hd\":\"HD (1920×1080)\",\"SquareHd\":\"Square HD (2048×2048)\",\"X1\":\"1× (480×480)\",\"X2\":\"2× (960×960)\"},\"StlCaption\":\"3D printers (no color)\",\"Working\":\"Rendering…\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Yes, fully free with no login required. Every font, every material and every export format is free for every user.\",\"Answer10\":\"Yes. Export your design as an STL file, then open it in a slicer such as Bambu Studio, ELEGOO Cura or PrusaSlicer. Scale it to the size you need and 3D print custom signs, name plates, keychains or cake toppers. STL exports are single-color, so any painting or multi-material work depends on your printer setup.\",\"Answer11\":\"Yes. Choose GLB in the export menu to download your 3D text as a real mesh. GLB imports into Unity, Unreal Engine and Roblox Studio with materials intact, while OBJ works well in Blender and Cinema 4D. Everything exports directly in your browser — free, with no login and no watermark.\",\"Answer12\":\"This free online 3D text generator runs right in your browser, turning your words into a real text-to-3D model — GLB, OBJ or STL — instantly, with no login. For AI-generated textures, animation and production-grade meshes beyond plain lettering, use the tool's AI generation option to run Meshy's full AI text-to-3D pipeline on free trial credits.\",\"Answer13\":\"A 3D font generator turns letters into three-dimensional shapes you can light, rotate and export. Meshy ships with 20 built-in typefaces — pick one, type your word and download the result as a transparent PNG or a real 3D model in GLB, OBJ or STL. It runs free in your browser with no login.\",\"Answer14\":\"Yes. The 3D text and models you export are yours to use in commercial work — logos, videos, games, signage and 3D prints for sale. There is no watermark and no attribution requirement. For AI-generated models made in Meshy Workspace, commercial rights follow your Meshy plan, so check the license on your current tier.\",\"Answer15\":\"Yes. This tool instantly builds 3D typography from any word using built-in fonts, materials and lighting — no design skills needed. For lettering that goes beyond standard fonts, with photoreal PBR textures or animation, use the tool's AI generation option to run Meshy's full text-to-3D pipeline on free trial credits.\",\"Answer16\":\"A 3D bubble text generator makes letters with rounded, inflated, balloon-like surfaces. Meshy is a true 3D text generator: it gives every letter real depth and geometry you can export as GLB, OBJ or STL, rather than a flat 2D bubble graphic. Pick a rounded font and add depth and bevel to get a puffy, bubble-style look you can rotate and 3D print.\",\"Answer17\":\"A rotating 3D text generator lets you spin your 3D text to view it from any angle. In Meshy you can orbit the live preview to inspect every side of your 3D letters before exporting. The download is a real 3D model (GLB, OBJ or STL), so you can add your own spin or turntable animation in Blender, Unity or any 3D tool.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes, you can export a transparent PNG at high resolution. Drop it straight into a YouTube thumbnail, an Instagram post, a slide or a flyer.\",\"Answer3\":\"GLB, OBJ and STL. They work in Blender, Unity, Unreal, Roblox Studio and most consumer 3D printers without extra conversion.\",\"Answer4\":\"The 3D text generator ships with 20 built-in typefaces including Roboto Bold, Permanent Marker, Bungee, Lobster and Press Start 2P. Press Start 2P is perfect for Minecraft 3D text output, pixel intros and animated 3D text overlays. Custom font upload is on the roadmap. Any of the 20 bundled typefaces is free to use in the tool with no extra download.\",\"Answer5\":\"Yes, the 3D text generator runs in any modern browser including mobile Safari and Chrome. Desktop is recommended for fine-tuning the depth, bevel and lighting controls.\",\"Answer7\":\"Yes. Toggle Glow in the Material panel and pick a dark Environment preset like Cozy or Studio for neon-sign style 3D text. The bloom post-processing renders live in the preview and bakes into the PNG export, so your transparent PNG keeps the glow when dropped onto a YouTube thumbnail or social post.\",\"Answer8\":\"Most text to 3D model AI services charge per generation and take 30 to 60 seconds. Meshy's browser 3D text generator gives you instant text 3D output for free. Pick a font, material and lighting, then see it render live. For richer text to 3D model output with photoreal PBR textures, click Generate My 3D Text Model and Meshy's full text to 3D model AI pipeline kicks in. Free trial credits, no card required.\",\"Answer9\":\"Photoshop discontinued PSD 3D effects in 2021, so no current tool exports a true PSD with editable 3D layers. Our transparent PNG is the closest practical replacement. Drag it onto a Photoshop layer or any design tool and it behaves like a PSD layer with a built-in 3D effect. For an editable mesh, export GLB and bring it into Blender or Cinema 4D.\",\"Question1\":\"Is Meshy 3D Text Generator free?\",\"Question10\":\"Can I 3D print my 3D text?\",\"Question11\":\"Can I export my 3D text as a GLB file for Unity or Roblox?\",\"Question12\":\"Is this a free AI text-to-3D model generator?\",\"Question13\":\"What is a 3D font generator?\",\"Question14\":\"Can I use my 3D text commercially?\",\"Question15\":\"Can AI create 3D typography?\",\"Question16\":\"What is a 3D bubble text generator?\",\"Question17\":\"What is a rotating 3D text generator?\",\"Question2\":\"Can I download my 3D text as a PNG image?\",\"Question3\":\"What 3D model formats can I export?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I use my own font in the 3D text generator?\",\"Question5\":\"Does the 3D text maker work on mobile?\",\"Question7\":\"Can I add a glow or neon effect to my 3D text?\",\"Question8\":\"How is this different from a paid text to 3D model AI service?\",\"Question9\":\"Can I get my 3D text as a PSD file?\"},\"Features\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D text effect to PNG, GLB, OBJ and STL. Drop the result straight into Photoshop, Blender, Unity or a 3D printer with no extra conversion step.\",\"Title\":\"Export your 3D text effect to PNG, GLB, OBJ or STL\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Run our 3D text creator entirely in your browser. No 3D text Photoshop, 3D text Illustrator or 3D text After Effects install needed. Type your text, style it and download. No account, no software install, no upload queue.\",\"Title\":\"Make 3D text online, a free alternative to 3D text in Photoshop\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Professional 3D text creator free for students, indie creators and studios alike. Every font, every material and every export format is free with no watermark, no paywall and no usage cap.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D text \u0026 letter generator for every creator\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"See your 3D text effect update live as you type. Real-time WebGL rendering on your hardware with no server roundtrip and no rendering wait.\",\"Title\":\"Real-time 3D text maker preview in your browser\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Text to 3D model rendering runs entirely in your browser with no upload. PNG, GLB, OBJ and STL files are generated client-side, so nothing leaves your device.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D model rendering, on your device\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"Download your 3D text as an STL file and open it in slicers like Bambu Studio, ELEGOO Cura or PrusaSlicer. 3D print custom signs, name plates, keychains and cake toppers — STL exports are single-color, ready for your printer.\",\"Title\":\"3D Print Your Text — Export STL Files for Any Slicer\"}},\"Font\":{\"Bungee\":\"Bungee\",\"CaveatBold\":\"Caveat Bold\",\"DroidSansBold\":\"Droid Sans Bold\",\"DroidSansRegular\":\"Droid Sans Regular\",\"DroidSerifBold\":\"Droid Serif Bold\",\"DroidSerifRegular\":\"Droid Serif Regular\",\"GentilisBold\":\"Gentilis Bold\",\"GentilisRegular\":\"Gentilis Regular\",\"HelvetikerBold\":\"Helvetiker Bold\",\"HelvetikerRegular\":\"Helvetiker Regular\",\"Lobster\":\"Lobster\",\"NovaMono\":\"Nova Mono\",\"OptimerBold\":\"Optimer Bold\",\"OptimerRegular\":\"Optimer Regular\",\"PermanentMarker\":\"Permanent Marker\",\"PressStart2P\":\"Press Start 2P\",\"RobotoBold\":\"Roboto Bold\",\"SilkscreenBold\":\"Silkscreen Bold\",\"SpaceGroteskBold\":\"Space Grotesk Bold\",\"TrainOne\":\"Train One\"},\"Header\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy is a free online 3D text generator that converts text into 3D letters, fonts, and high-quality 3D typography ready for 3D printing. Customize fonts, materials, and effects, then export as a transparent PNG or a real text to 3D model in GLB, OBJ or STL. No signup, no watermark.\",\"Title\":\"Free Online 3D Text Generator\"},\"HowTo\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Enter any word or phrase up to 20 characters into the 3D text generator. The tool ships with 20 built-in typefaces. Pick one to get started.\",\"Title\":\"Type your text\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Choose a material, color and lighting to design your 3D text effect. Adjust depth and bevel or add glow for extra dimension. Every change updates the 3D text maker preview live.\",\"Title\":\"Style your 3D text\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D text effect as a transparent PNG image, or download the 3D model in GLB, OBJ or STL. Free, no watermark and no login required.\",\"Title\":\"Download your 3D text\"},\"Title\":\"How to make 3D text in 3 steps\"},\"LastUpdatedLabel\":\"Last updated\",\"Material\":{\"Category\":{\"Fabric\":\"Fabric\",\"Natural\":\"Natural\",\"Reflective\":\"Reflective\"},\"ColorLabel\":\"Color\",\"Customize\":{\"Label\":\"Customize PBR\"},\"GlowIntensityLabel\":\"Intensity\",\"GlowLabel\":\"Glow\",\"Preset\":{\"Balloon\":\"Balloon\",\"Cactus\":\"Cactus\",\"DiscoGlitter\":\"Disco Glitter\",\"Floral\":\"Floral\",\"Gem\":\"Gem\",\"LiquidGlass\":\"Liquid Glass\",\"Marble\":\"Marble\",\"Moss\":\"Moss\",\"PinkVelvet\":\"Pink Velvet\",\"Rainbow\":\"Rainbow\",\"WetGlass\":\"Wet Glass\",\"Wood\":\"Wood\"},\"Type\":{\"Clay\":\"Clay\",\"Custom\":\"Custom\",\"Glass\":\"Glass\",\"Metallic\":\"Metallic\",\"Plastic\":\"Plastic\",\"RoughGlass\":\"Rough Glass\"}},\"MetaDescription\":\"Free online 3D text generator and text-to-3D model maker. Pick a font, export as PNG, GLB, OBJ or STL. Faster than 3D text in Photoshop. No login.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Free 3D Text Generator: Make 3D Letters With Fonts \u0026 Effects | Meshy\",\"MultilingualHint\":\"Custom letters detected. Generate the full quality version with AI for non-Latin scripts.\",\"PopularTools\":{\"Description\":\"Beyond 3D text, explore the full Meshy AI suite for 3D creators.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"PricingCta\":\"See Pricing\",\"Title\":\"Other Popular Meshy AI Tools\"},\"RelatedStlGuide\":\"Want print-ready files? Read our guide on exporting \u003clink\u003e3D text as an STL\u003c/link\u003e for 3D printing.\",\"RelatedTextTo3D\":\"Need AI-generated 3D models from a prompt instead of typed letters? Try our \u003clink\u003eText to 3D model\u003c/link\u003e generator.\",\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb3DTools\":\"3D Tools\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BrowserRequirements\":\"Requires WebGL 2\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Item1\":\"Free online 3D text generator and text-to-3D model maker\",\"Item10\":\"Glow effect with bloom post-processing for neon 3D text\",\"Item11\":\"Camera presets: Front, 3/4 and Top\",\"Item12\":\"Transparent PNG export for 3D text logos at 480, 960, 1920×1080 and 2048 resolutions\",\"Item13\":\"GLB, OBJ and STL 3D model export for Blender, Unity, Unreal, Roblox Studio and 3D printers\",\"Item14\":\"Free for commercial and personal use with no watermark\",\"Item15\":\"No login, no software install required\",\"Item2\":\"3D text effect creator, a free alternative to 3D text in Photoshop, Illustrator or After Effects\",\"Item3\":\"Text-to-3D model rendering with client-side WebGL\",\"Item4\":\"Real-time 3D text maker preview in the browser\",\"Item5\":\"20 built-in 3D fonts including Roboto Bold, Permanent Marker, Bungee, Lobster and Press Start 2P for Minecraft-style pixel 3D text\",\"Item6\":\"12 quick material presets: Liquid Glass, Wet Glass, Gem, Balloon, Cactus, Moss, Wood, Marble, Pink Velvet, Floral, Rainbow and Disco Glitter\",\"Item7\":\"Six PBR material primitives: Metallic, Clay, Plastic, Rough Glass, Glass and Custom\",\"Item8\":\"Five HDRI lighting environments: Daylight, Sunset, Outdoor, Cozy and Studio\",\"Item9\":\"Adjustable depth and bevel for 3D letter geometry\"},\"Keywords\":{\"Item1\":\"3D text generator\",\"Item2\":\"generate 3D text online\",\"Item3\":\"free 3D text maker\",\"Item4\":\"free 3D letter generator\",\"Item5\":\"3D font generator\"},\"OfferDescription\":\"100% free online tool\",\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Text Generator\"},\"Slider\":{\"DefaultTooltip\":\"Default: {value}\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"LovedByCreators\":\"Loved by Creators\",\"PartnersLead\":\"Trusted by\"},\"Tabs\":{\"Environment\":\"Environment\",\"Material\":\"Material\",\"Text\":\"Text\"},\"Text\":{\"BevelEnableLabel\":\"Enable bevel\",\"BevelLabel\":\"Bevel\",\"BevelSizeLabel\":\"Bevel size\",\"BevelThicknessLabel\":\"Bevel thickness\",\"DepthLabel\":\"Depth\",\"FontLabel\":\"Font\",\"InputLabel\":\"Your text\",\"SizeLabel\":\"Size\"},\"TextTo3DLink\":{\"Lead\":\"Need PBR-textured 3D text, animation, or production-grade meshes?\",\"LinkLabel\":\"text-to-3D model\",\"Tail\":\"tool — same pipeline that ships to game studios, Roblox creators and product designers.\"},\"Title\":\"Free 3D Text Generator Online: Export GLB, OBJ, STL \u0026 PNG\"},\"Upload\":{\"Accept\":\"Supported file format: {accept}\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"Converting\":\"Converting...\",\"FileName\":\"File name: {fileName}\",\"FileSize\":\"File size: {fileSize}\",\"MaxSize\":\"Max file size: {maxSize}\",\"PreviewAlt\":\"Uploaded image preview\",\"ReUpload\":\"Re-upload\",\"SizeError\":\"File size exceeds the limit. Please upload a smaller file.\",\"Tips\":\"Drag and drop file here or click to upload\",\"TrustBadge\":\"Files processed locally in your browser. Never uploaded to our servers.\",\"TypeError\":\"Unsupported file type. Please upload a valid file format.\"}},\"API\":{\"APIAccessByTier\":{\"Description\":\"Compare rate limits, concurrency, and access levels across Meshy API tiers.\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Compare Plans\"},\"Table\":{\"Header\":{\"Enterprise\":\"Enterprise\",\"Feature\":\"Feature\",\"Free\":\"Free\",\"FreeStarter\":\"Free / Starter\",\"Pro\":\"Pro\",\"ProPremium\":\"Pro / Premium\",\"ProPremiumUltra\":\"Pro / Premium / Ultra\",\"Studio\":\"Studio\"},\"Row\":{\"ApiConsole\":\"API Console\",\"ApiPlayground\":\"API Playground\",\"AssetRetention\":\"Asset retention\",\"ConcurrentQueueTasks\":\"Concurrent queue tasks\",\"ConfigurableDataRetention\":\"Configurable data retention\",\"CreditAutoRecharge\":\"Credit auto recharge\",\"CustomEndpoints\":\"Custom endpoints\",\"Customizable\":\"customizable\",\"Days\":\"days\",\"Default\":\"Default\",\"DirectAccountSupport\":\"Direct account support\",\"FastestGeneration\":\"fastest generation + premium model access\",\"HigherThanPro\":\"Higher than Pro\",\"Highest\":\"Highest\",\"Indefinite\":\"Indefinite\",\"Limited\":\"Limited\",\"PriorityLevel\":\"Priority level\",\"PriorityProPremium\":\"Default / Higher\",\"PriorityProPremiumUltra\":\"Default / Higher / Highest\",\"RequestsPerSecond\":\"Requests per second\",\"SLAGuarantee\":\"SLA guarantee\",\"SecurityCertification\":\"Security certification\",\"UptimeSLA\":\"99.9% uptime SLA\",\"Upto\":\"Up to\"}},\"Title\":\"API Access by Tier\"},\"APICapabilities\":{\"AITexturing\":{\"Description\":\"Texture any of your assets using our AI models with prompts of your choosing to further customize your 3D designs.\",\"Label\":\"AI Texturing\"},\"Description\":\"Our API is used regularly across a myriad of domains and use cases. Whether it's Text to 3D, Image to 3D, or AI texturing, our API is continually evolving to create the most seamless experience for our users.\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Core Features\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Generate 3D assets from your 2D images with our image to 3D and multi-image to 3D endpoints.\",\"Label\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"Remesh\":{\"Description\":\"Remesh previously generated Meshy assets with the Remesh endpoint to quickly change topology and target polycount.\",\"Label\":\"Remesh\"},\"RiggingAndAnimation\":{\"Description\":\"Automatically rig and apply 500+ unique animations in a matter of seconds with our auto-rigging and animation endpoints.\",\"Label\":\"Rigging and Animation\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Create and manage 3D assets at scale within your own applications using our text to 3D endpoint.\",\"Label\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"API Capabilities\",\"WebhookSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Set up webhooks and get instant notifications for API task progress and completions to streamline your workflows.\",\"Label\":\"Webhook Support\"}},\"APIConsole\":{\"CTA\":\"Try the Console\",\"DashboardAlt\":\"Meshy API Console dashboard showing request volume, success rate, and per-endpoint metrics\",\"Description\":\"Track success rates, latency, and credit usage across every API call your integration makes. Open any task to inspect its full request, response, and timeline.\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Console\"},\"LogsAlt\":\"Meshy API Console logs showing recent API requests with status and task details\",\"Note\":\"Available on Studio and Enterprise plans.\",\"Title\":\"Monitor Every Request You Make\"},\"Description\":\"Generate 3D models at scale with the Meshy API — Text \u0026 Image to 3D, remesh, rigging and webhooks. 99.9% uptime SLA, SOC 2 and GDPR compliant.\",\"Enterprise-GradeAPIAccess\":{\"Access\":{\"Description\":\"Access to enterprise-only API endpoints\",\"Title\":\"Access\"},\"CertifiedSecurity\":{\"Description\":\"GDPR certified for enterprise-grade information security\",\"Title\":\"Certified Security\"},\"Description\":\"Unlock advanced performance, exclusive endpoints, and security you can trust.\",\"Exclusive\":{\"Description\":\"Access to enterprise-only API endpoints\",\"Title\":\"Exclusive API Endpoints\"},\"Guaranteed\":{\"Description\":\"Guaranteed highest rate limits, concurrency, and task priority — with 99.9% uptime SLA\",\"Title\":\"Guaranteed\"},\"ISO\":{\"Description\":\"ISO/IEC 27001 certified for enterprise-grade information security\",\"Description2\":\"ISO/IEC 27001 certified for enterprise-grade information security\",\"Title\":\"certified\",\"Title2\":\"Certified Security\"},\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Scalability \u0026 Security\"},\"Indefinite\":{\"Description\":\"Indefinite retention of API-generated assets\",\"Title\":\"Indefinite\"},\"Performance\":{\"Description\":\"Guaranteed highest rate limits, concurrency, and task priority — with 99.9% uptime SLA\",\"Title\":\"Enterprise-Grade Performance\"},\"Retention\":{\"Description\":\"Indefinite retention of API-generated assets\",\"Title\":\"Asset Retention Without Limits\"},\"SOC2\":{\"Description2\":\"SOC2 - Type II certified for enterprise-grade information security\",\"Title\":\"SOC2 - Type II certified for enterprise-grade information security\",\"Title2\":\"Certified Security\"},\"Title\":\"Enterprise-Grade API Access\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"You will need to first create a Meshy account and be on the pro tier or above to use the API. After you log in, you can navigate to the \\\"API\\\" page at the top and you will see a section to create an API key. Please also consult our \u003clink\u003eAPI docs\u003c/link\u003e for more detailed instructions\",\"Answer10\":\"Yes. Use the \u003clink\u003eAPI Playground\u003c/link\u003e to try endpoints live in your browser: tune prompts, generate models, and copy ready-to-use code before you integrate. Available on Pro, Studio, and Enterprise plans — Pro and Studio can use a limited set of endpoints, while Enterprise unlocks them all.\",\"Answer2\":\"Every Meshy API task call costs credits, which can be purchased at any time. Untextured mesh generation tasks cost 5 credits per call, and texturing tasks cost 10 credits per call. Please see our \u003clink\u003epricing docs\u003c/link\u003e for more details.\",\"Answer3\":\"Should you require a customized solution requiring higher volume API usage, please \u003clink\u003econtact our team\u003c/link\u003e, and we can discuss your needs with you.\",\"Answer4\":\"We have rate limits in place on our API to help create a smooth experience across all our users. Rate limits are important and ensure our service remains safe/sound, grants everyone fair access, and maintains reliable service. Rate limits are measured in 2 ways: requests per second (RPS) and queued tasks. Pro users have a rate limit of 20 RPS and a maximum of 10 queued tasks. Max and Max Unlimited users have a rate limit of 20 RPS and a maximum of 20 queued tasks. Enterprise users have a rate limit of 100 RPS and a customizable number of queued tasks that defaults to 50. Exceeding limits in API calls will throw a 429 Too Many Requests response from our API. Please see our \u003clink\u003eRate Limits docs\u003c/link\u003e for more details.\",\"Answer5\":\"If you are not an Enterprise user, your models generated through our API will only be retained for a maximum of 3 days. After this period, API-generated models will be deleted automatically from our servers. We recommend you download and store your models locally if you need them for a longer duration. Enterprise users can retain their assets indefinitely.\",\"Answer6\":\"No. Your API inputs and generated models are never used for training.\",\"Answer7\":\"We currently offer plugins for both Blender and Unity. You can find more details about the Blender plugin here and the Unity plugin here.\",\"Answer8\":\"Your API-generated assets will be deleted automatically after 3 days if you are not an enterprise user.\",\"Answer9\":\"No, we do not support CORS requests to our API from other sites.\",\"Question1\":\"How should I get started?\",\"Question10\":\"Can I test the API before building?\",\"Question2\":\"How is API usage priced?\",\"Question3\":\"I am part of a business that would require substantially more API credits every month with higher volume usage. Do you offer customized solutions and pricing?\",\"Question4\":\"Are there rate limits imposed upon the API?\",\"Question5\":\"Does Meshy retain API-generated assets?\",\"Question6\":\"Are API inputs and user-generated models used for training?\",\"Question7\":\"Can I connect to other 3D software like Blender through the API?\",\"Question8\":\"Will my API-generated assets be deleted?\",\"Question9\":\"Can I access your API through other websites (i.e. CORS request)?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"Title2\":\"FAQ\"},\"GetStarted\":{\"Description\":\"Our API is used regularly across a myriad of domains and use cases. Whether it's Text to 3D, Image to 3D, or AI texturing, our API is continually evolving to create the most seamless experience for our users.\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Start Creating\"},\"Integrations\":{\"Description\":\"Use Meshy directly in traditional 3D software or game engines like Blender and Unity.\",\"Title\":\"Integrations\"},\"ManageUsage\":{\"Description\":\"Keep track of your credit usage and enable automatic refills once it's depleted.\",\"Title\":\"Manage Usage\"},\"QuickStart\":{\"Description\":\"Quickly generate 3D assets programmatically within minutes using a straightforward API implementation.\",\"Description2\":\"Quickly generate 3D assets programmatically within minutes using a straightforward API implementation.\",\"Title\":\"Quickstart\"},\"Title\":\"Get Started with the Meshy API\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":{\"Contact\":\"Contact Sales\",\"Explore\":\"Explore More\",\"Playground\":\"Try the Playground\"},\"Description\":\"Programmatically Generate \u003cspan\u003eHigh-Quality 3D Models\u003c/span\u003e Using \u003cspan\u003eText, Images, or Custom Workflows\u003c/span\u003e\",\"Label\":\"API Platform\",\"Title\":\"Create 3D Assets at Scale with the Meshy API\"},\"Pricing\":{\"Description\":\"API usage is available to Meshy users on Pro tier and above and is paid on a credits basis. See our \u003clink\u003eplan pricing page\u003c/link\u003e for more details on acquiring credits and credit costs. More specific details on API pricing can also be found in our API docs.\",\"Description2\":\"API usage is available to Meshy users on Pro tier and above and is paid on a credits basis. See our \u003cpricing\u003eplan pricing page\u003c/pricing\u003e for more details on acquiring credits and credit costs. For Enterprise API pricing, feel free to reach out directly to \u003ccontact\u003eour team\u003c/contact\u003e\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Usage \u0026 Credits\"},\"Table\":{\"Header\":{\"Endpoint\":\"API Endpoint\",\"FullyTextured\":\"Fully Textured\",\"Price\":\"Price per Call\"}},\"Title\":\"Pricing\"},\"Title\":\"3D Model Generation API — Text \u0026 Image to 3D | Meshy\",\"TrustedBy\":{\"Title\":\"Trusted by top game studios, 3D printer manufacturers, and enterprises\"},\"TryBeforeYouBuild\":{\"Description\":\"Test Meshy API endpoints live in the Playground before you write a line of integration code. Tune a prompt, generate a model, and copy the working request straight into your codebase.\",\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Playground\"},\"Note\":\"Available on Pro, Studio, and Enterprise plans. Pro and Studio include a limited set of endpoints; Enterprise unlocks them all.\",\"ScreenshotAlt\":\"Meshy API Playground interface showing a text-to-3D request and a live model preview\",\"Title\":\"Try Before You Build\"},\"UseCases\":{\"3DPrinting\":{\"Description\":\"Create and refine 3D printing miniatures in minutes\",\"Title\":\"3D Printing\"},\"Description\":\"Our API is used regularly across a myriad of domains and use cases. Whether it's Text to 3D, Image to 3D, or AI texturing, our API is continually evolving to create the most seamless experience for you.\",\"Education\":{\"Description\":\"Produce educational 3D simulations, assets, and avatars\",\"Title\":\"Education\"},\"GameDevelopment\":{\"Description\":\"Rapidly generate 3D assets of high quality at scale\",\"Title\":\"Game Development\"},\"Icon\":{\"Title\":\"Solutions in Action\"},\"Title\":\"Use Cases\",\"XR\":{\"Description\":\"Build worlds in VR/AR with models of your own\",\"Title\":\"XR\"}}},\"About\":{\"AboutUs\":{\"Heading\":\"About Us\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"About\":\"About\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Careers\":{\"Heading\":\"Careers\",\"JoinOurTeam\":\"JOIN OUR TEAM\",\"JoinOurTeamHighlight\":{\"FirstPart\":\"Let's build together.\",\"SecondPart\":\"Join us in shaping the future of 3D content creation.\"},\"Paragraph\":{\"1\":\"We are building the next-generation tools for 3D content creators, and we share the belief that in the future, with the power of AI, everyone should be able to effortlessly create stunning 3D assets.\",\"2\":\"We’d like to bring that future closer. Yet this journey could never be completed alone.\",\"3\":\"If you share our vision, join us and let’s shape the future together.\"},\"ViewOpenPositions\":\"View Open Positions\"},\"Categories\":{\"Description\":\"From product design to game development — see how creators and teams use Meshy across industries.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"OUR CAPABILITIES\",\"Heading\":\"What Meshy Can Do\"},\"Community\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"VOICES FROM OUR COMMUNITY\",\"Heading\":\"Loved by creators and teams\"},\"Contact\":{\"Community\":{\"Description\":\"Connect with enthusiasts of 3D generative AI and talk directly with the Meshy team. Join our Discord channel and help us shape the future of Meshy.\",\"JoinDiscord\":\"Join Discord\",\"Title\":\"Community\"},\"Heading\":\"Contact\",\"Partnerships\":{\"Description\":\"Get in touch with our team for customized pricing plans or potential partnerships.\",\"TalkWithUs\":\"Talk with Us\",\"Title\":\"Partnerships\"},\"SocialMedia\":{\"Description\":\"Follow us on our social media platforms for the latest updates, exciting news, and more.\",\"Instagram\":\"Instagram\",\"LinkedIn\":\"LinkedIn\",\"TikTok\":\"TikTok\",\"Title\":\"Social Media\",\"X\":\"X\",\"YouTube\":\"YouTube\"},\"Support\":{\"Description\":\"Ask questions about our product, get help, report issues or give us general feedback.\",\"JoinDiscord\":\"Join Discord\",\"Title\":\"Support\"}},\"Cta\":{\"Button\":\"Start Creating\",\"Description\":\"Generate your first 3D model in under a minute. No credit card required.\",\"Heading\":\"Start Creating in 3D Today\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy is the AI-powered 3D content platform for Text to 3D, Image to 3D, AI Texturing, and Animation. Learn about our team, story, and mission.\",\"Explore\":{\"Description\":\"Latest stories from our blog, customer wins, and real-world use cases across game, XR, e-commerce, and 3D printing.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"WHAT IS NEW\",\"Heading\":\"Latest From Meshy\"},\"Hero\":{\"ExploreUseCases\":\"Explore Use Cases\",\"Eyebrow\":\"About Us\",\"Slogan\":\"Meshy Brings Every Idea to 3D\",\"StartCreating\":\"Start Creating\"},\"Mission\":{\"Heading\":\"Mission\",\"Paragraph\":{\"1\":\"The future of content is vivid, alive, and interactive. As we catapult into this dynamic era, 3D and interactive components aren't just on the horizon - they're already here. And with this surge, the clamor for distinctive 3D models has grown louder and more insistent.\",\"2\":\"For the seasoned 3D craftspeople, producing such detailed models can stretch out over long weeks. For the everyday content creator, mastering complex tools like Maya or Blender seems an almost Herculean task. This chasm between demand and actual, efficient supply, amplified by the hurdles of cost and complexity, cried out for a solution.\",\"3\":\"Enter Meshy. Born from a fusion of passion and generative AI, Meshy transforms your text and images into dazzling 3D masterpieces in mere moments. We're not just streamlining 3D design; we're unlocking a universe of creative possibilities. Dive in and let your imagination soar!\"}},\"MissionV2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy is an AI-powered 3D content creation platform that supports Text to 3D, Image to 3D, AI Texturing, Animation, and API workflows. Users can start from a text description, a reference image, or a creative concept to generate previewable, editable, and exportable 3D assets, ready for use in game development, 3D printing, AR/VR, product design, education, and content creation.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"OUR MISSION\",\"Heading\":\"What is Meshy\"},\"Partners\":{\"Description\":\"We're honored by the trust from partners across entertainment, gaming, AR/VR, and rendering engines. Together, we tirelessly refine and elevate Meshy.\",\"Heading\":\"Partners\"},\"Stats\":{\"GeneratedModels\":\"Generated Models\",\"MonthlyVisits\":\"Monthly Visits\",\"MonthlyVisitsSource\":\"SimilarWeb\",\"TopAITool\":\"3D AI Tool\",\"TopAIToolSource\":\"A16Z Games 2024\",\"Users\":\"Users\"},\"Story\":{\"Description\":\"Rooted in Silicon Valley with a global team, alumni from MIT and Harvard and veterans from NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Google, united in advancing GenAI for 3D.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"OUR JOURNEY\",\"Heading\":\"How We've Grown\",\"JumpTo\":\"Jump to {version}\",\"ReadAnnouncement\":\"Read: {title}\"},\"Team\":{\"Heading\":\"Team\",\"Paragraph\":{\"1\":\"Rooted in Silicon Valley, Meshy boasts a global consortium of professionals. Our team's backbone consists of esteemed alumni and veterans from academic giants like MIT and Harvard, as well as industry juggernauts including NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Google. Specializing in computer graphics, AI, and CG art, our team is united in their commitment to pioneering advancements in the realm of GenAI for 3D.\"}},\"Timeline\":{\"Meshy1\":{\"Description\":\"A fast generative AI for 3D that turns text and images into captivating 3D models in under a minute — the first step toward materializing everyone's 3D imagination.\",\"Title\":\"Generate 3D Models with AI in Just a Minute\"},\"Meshy2\":{\"Description\":\"A massive improvement in Text to 3D quality, a redesigned web app, and a growing community where creators share and learn together.\",\"Title\":\"Introducing Meshy-2\"},\"Meshy25\":{\"Description\":\"An incremental release focused on Text to 3D quality — sharper geometry, faster iteration, and refinements to the generation pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D, Reloaded!\"},\"Meshy3\":{\"Description\":\"Production-grade PBR textures arrive alongside a new Image to 3D pipeline — celebrating Meshy's first anniversary with a major leap in 3D generative AI.\",\"Title\":\"Sculptures, PBR, and Image to 3D\"},\"Meshy4\":{\"Description\":\"A groundbreaking update for geometry quality and creator workflow — remastered topology and a redesigned Text to 3D experience for game-ready assets.\",\"Title\":\"Break Grounds — Production-Grade Geometry\"},\"Meshy5\":{\"Description\":\"Best practices, examples, and 12 expert tips to unlock better Text-to-3D results — written for the new Meshy-5 generation models.\",\"Title\":\"Perfecting Text to 3D Prompts in Meshy-5\"},\"Meshy6\":{\"Description\":\"Cleaner geometry, sharper hard-surface details, and powerful new workflows including Low Poly Mode, multi-color 3D printing, and upgraded APIs.\",\"Title\":\"Smarter Geometry, Faster Workflows\"}},\"Title\":\"About Us — Meshy AI 3D Generator\"},\"Affiliates\":{\"AffiliateResources\":{\"AffiliateDashboard\":{\"Description\":\"Track your performance and commissions through dashboard.\",\"Title\":\"Affiliate dashboard\"},\"BannersAndLogos\":{\"Description\":\"A variety of eye-catching banners and logos optimized for different platforms and ad sizes.\",\"Title\":\"Banners and logos\"},\"Description\":\"To help you succeed as a Meshy affiliate, we provide a range of powerful marketing resources:\",\"ProductVideosAndImages\":{\"Description\":\"Engaging videos and images showcasing Meshy's features and benefits, perfect for social media and blog posts.\",\"Title\":\"Product videos and images\"},\"Title\":\"Affiliate Resources\"},\"CTA\":{\"ApplyNow\":\"Apply Now\"},\"Description\":\"Join the Meshy affiliate program and earn money by promoting our 3D design platform.\",\"FAQ\":{\"Earnings\":{\"Answer\":\"Every affiliate can earn 20% commission for the first 12 months of every subscriber through the link.\",\"Question\":\"How much can I earn as a Meshy affiliate?\"},\"Eligibility\":{\"Answer\":\"Anyone with an audience interested in 3D modeling, design, or AI-assisted content creation can join our affiliate program. This includes bloggers, influencers, 3D artists, designers, and more.\",\"Question\":\"Who can join the Meshy affiliate program?\"},\"Payment\":{\"Answer\":\"The payment will be sent by PayPal. The payment period is NET-30, meaning all revenue from January will be settled on March 1st, with any holidays causing a delay in payment.\",\"Question\":\"How do I get paid?\"},\"PayoutThreshold\":{\"Answer\":\"From Jan 1st 2025, the minimum payout threshold for affiliate commissions is set at 20 USD. Any unpaid balance below this threshold will carry over to the next payout period until the minimum amount is reached.\",\"Question\":\"What is the minimum payout threshold?\"},\"Prohibitions\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"To ensure compliant and effective affiliate marketing, avoid deceptive, illegal, or unethical practices such as misleading users, infringing on intellectual property, exploiting sensitive events, or disclosing user privacy.\",\"Part2\":\"Focus on creating high-quality, honest promotional content that highlights Meshy's unique advantages while respecting users and maintaining the brand's reputation.\",\"Part3\":\"Bidding branded keywords and certain non-branded keywords on advertising platforms is strictly prohibited. For more details, please refer to the Affiliate Advertising Policy in our Affiliate Program Terms.\"},\"Question\":\"Is there any prohibition when promoting Meshy?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"HowCreatorsArePromotingMeshy\":{\"Title\":\"How Creators are Promoting Meshy\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Sign up and get a unique affiliate link that tracks who clicked and signed up.\",\"Title\":\"Sign up and get a link\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Promote Meshy to your audience using your unique affiliate link on blogs, Twitter, YouTube, and other channels.\",\"Title\":\"Promote Meshy\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Receive 20% recurring commission for the first 12 months of every subscriber through the affiliate link.\",\"Title\":\"Earn commissions\"},\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"Page\":{\"AffiliateProgramTerms\":\"Affiliate Program Terms\",\"Description\":\"As a Meshy affiliate, you'll have the opportunity to earn generous commissions and help your audience to streamline their 3D workflows.\",\"Label\":\"Affiliate Program\",\"Title\":{\"MaximizeYourEarnings\":\"Maximize Your Earnings as an Affiliate Partner\"}},\"SignUpNow\":\"Sign up now and unlock your earning potential with Meshy!\",\"Title\":\"Affiliates Program - Meshy\",\"WhyJoin\":{\"ComprehensiveResources\":{\"Description\":\"Access an \u003cemphasis\u003eextensive library\u003c/emphasis\u003e of marketing assets, including banners, logos, videos, images, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Comprehensive resources\"},\"GenerousCommissions\":{\"Description\":\"Earn \u003cemphasis\u003e20% commission\u003c/emphasis\u003e on each sale made through your affiliate link.\",\"Title\":\"Generous commissions\"},\"HighQualityProduct\":{\"Description\":\"Promote a \u003cemphasis\u003epowerful and innovative\u003c/emphasis\u003e 3D modeling tool that delivers real value to your audience, helping them create stunning 3D models in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"High-quality product\"},\"RecurringRevenue\":{\"Description\":\"Benefit from Meshy's subscription-based model, earning commissions for the \u003cemphasis\u003efirst 12 months\u003c/emphasis\u003e of every subscriber.\",\"Title\":\"Recurring revenue\"},\"Title\":\"Why Join Meshy Affiliates\"}},\"Arena\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"BackToWorkspace\":\"Back to workspace\",\"ConfirmAndNext\":\"Confirm \u0026 Next\",\"Description\":\"Vote for your favorite 3D models and earn Meshy credits — Let's build the future of 3D GenAI together!\",\"EmptyState\":{\"AlreadyVoted\":\"You’ve already voted today.\\nCome back tomorrow to vote again!\",\"Error\":\"Oops, something went wrong. Please try again later.\",\"Forbidden\":\"This event is exclusive to subscribed users. Please upgrade your plan.\",\"Loading\":\"Loading\",\"VotingComplete\":{\"Free\":\"Voting complete! Subscribe to Pro and earn {credits} credits from your first round of voting every day!\",\"Time1\":\"Voting complete! You've earned {credits} credits!\\nYou can earn {creditsTotal} credits in total from voting per day.\",\"Time2\":\"Voting complete! You've earned your credits today. \\nCome back tomorrow to get more!\"}},\"Error\":{\"CommentRequired\":\"Please share why you chose this model.\",\"SelectModel\":\"Please select your preferred model.\",\"SelectOption\":\"Please select a reason for choosing this model.\",\"WaitModelLoad\":\"Please wait for the model to load\"},\"Next\":\"Next Image\",\"PreferThisModel\":\"Prefer this model\",\"Question\":{\"Question1\":{\"Description\":\"Vote on {pairs} pairs of generated 3D models and select your reasons to earn free credits.\",\"Title\":\"Which 3D model generated from the image is better?\"},\"Question2\":{\"Answer1\":{\"Description\":\"mesh does not have broken parts, fractures, or distortions.\",\"Title\":\"Correctness\"},\"Answer2\":{\"Description\":\"mesh agrees well with input image.\",\"Title\":\"Mesh alignment\"},\"Answer3\":{\"Description\":\"mesh reproduces fine details in the input image.\",\"Title\":\"Mesh details\"},\"Answer4\":{\"Description\":\"mesh gives cleaner and sharper hard surface structure.\",\"Title\":\"Hard surface\"},\"Answer5\":{\"Description\":\"texture closely matches the same art style as the input image.\",\"Title\":\"Texture alignment\"},\"Answer6\":{\"Description\":\"texture agrees with geometry and has uniform colors.\",\"Title\":\"Texture consistency\"},\"Answer7\":{\"Description\":\"texture has high resolution and produces sharp details.\",\"Title\":\"Texture sharpness\"},\"Answer8\":{\"Description\":\"generated model gives an aesthetically pleasing interpretation of the input image.\",\"Title\":\"Aesthetics\"},\"Answer9\":{\"Title\":\"Others\"},\"Description\":\"Select all that apply\",\"OthersPlaceholder\":\"Please describe the reason\",\"Title\":\"Why did you vote for this model?\"},\"QuestionV2\":{\"Question1\":\"Which texture-less 3D model generated from the image is better?\",\"Question10\":\"Which 3D model has a texture with clearer contrast, less overexposure or underexposure, and more details?\",\"Question11\":\"Which 3D model has a texture that aesthetically better?\",\"Question2\":\"Which textured 3D model generated from the image is better?\",\"Question3\":\"Which texture-less 3D model has fewer incorrectly broken parts, fractures, or distortions?\",\"Question4\":\"Which texture-less 3D model agrees better with the reference image?\",\"Question5\":\"Which texture-less 3D model has finer details?\",\"Question6\":\"Which texture-less 3D model looks aesthetically better?\",\"Question7\":\"Which texture-less 3D model has a cleaner and sharper structure?\",\"Question8\":\"Which 3D model agrees better with the image in materials, colors, and texture style?\",\"Question9\":\"Which 3D model has a more natural texture with fewer distortions, artifacts, or imperfections?\"}},\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Sunset\":{\"BackToHome\":\"Back to Home\",\"Description\":\"Thanks for being part of the ride. Discover other ways to power up your Meshy journey.\",\"ExploreButton\":\"Explore Ways to Earn Credits\",\"IllustrationAlt\":\"Arena mascot\",\"Title\":\"Oops, Arena Is No Longer Live\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy Arena - Build the Future of 3D GenAI\",\"VoteAgain\":\"Vote Again\"},\"Blog\":{\"Blog\":\"Blog\",\"Categories\":{\"Categories\":\"Categories\"},\"Category\":{\"3DPrinting\":{\"Description\":\"Print AI-generated 3D models with confidence. STL conversion, model prep, slicing tips, and troubleshooting for 3D printing enthusiasts.\",\"Label\":\"3D Printing\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Models for 3D Printing: Tutorials | Meshy Blog\"},\"AITexturing\":{\"Description\":\"Apply photorealistic AI textures to 3D models. PBR material guides, retexturing tutorials, and Meshy AI texturing feature walkthroughs.\",\"Label\":\"AI Texturing\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing for 3D Models: PBR \u0026 Materials | Meshy\"},\"Animation\":{\"Description\":\"Animate AI-generated 3D characters with ease. Auto-rigging tutorials, animation guides, and motion tips for game-ready 3D characters.\",\"Label\":\"Animation\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Animation, Rigging \u0026 Motion Tutorials | Meshy\"},\"Announcements\":{\"Description\":\"Stay up to date with official Meshy AI announcements. New features, product launches, partnerships, and major platform updates—all in one place.\",\"Label\":\"Announcements\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Product Updates \u0026 Launch News | Meshy Blog\"},\"Comparisons\":{\"Description\":\"In-depth comparisons of AI 3D generation tools. See how Meshy stacks up against competitors in quality, speed, features, and workflow.\",\"Label\":\"Comparisons\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Tool Comparisons: Meshy vs Alternatives | Meshy Blog\"},\"CustomerStories\":{\"Description\":\"Discover how world-class companies are transforming their 3D workflows with Meshy, cutting production time, reducing costs, and unlocking new creative potential.\",\"Label\":\"Customer Stories\",\"Title\":\"Customer Stories - Blog - Meshy\"},\"Events\":{\"Description\":\"Join Meshy at upcoming events, webinars, GDC, SIGGRAPH, and more. Discover opportunities to connect with the AI 3D generation community.\",\"Label\":\"Events\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Events, Webinars \u0026 Conferences | Meshy Blog\"},\"GameDevelopment\":{\"Description\":\"Use AI-generated 3D models in your games. Unity, Unreal, Godot tutorials. Optimize, rig, and integrate Meshy assets into game projects.\",\"Label\":\"Game Development\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Assets for Game Development | Meshy Blog\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Turn images and photos into 3D models with AI. Step-by-step image-to-3D tutorials, comparisons, and tips for the best results with Meshy.\",\"Label\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D AI: Convert Photos to 3D Models | Meshy\"},\"Insights\":{\"Description\":\"Expert insights on the AI 3D generation space. Industry trends, market analysis, and the future of generative AI for 3D content creation.\",\"Label\":\"Insights\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Industry Insights, Trends \u0026 Analysis | Meshy\"},\"News\":{\"Description\":\"Latest news on AI 3D generation, generative AI tools, and the 3D modeling industry. Stay informed with curated updates from Meshy.\",\"Label\":\"News\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Generation News \u0026 Industry Updates | Meshy\"},\"PromptGuide\":{\"Description\":\"Master prompt engineering for AI 3D generation. Examples, techniques, and proven formulas to create better 3D models with text prompts.\",\"Label\":\"Prompt Guide\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Prompt Engineering: Guides \u0026 Examples | Meshy\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Create 3D models from text descriptions using AI. Tutorials, prompt examples, and guides for getting professional results from text-to-3D.\",\"Label\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D AI: Generate Models from Prompts | Meshy\"},\"TextToTexture\":{\"Description\":\"Convert your text into intricate textures with Meshy. Explore expert tips, detailed tutorials, and the latest innovations in Meshy's text-to-texture feature to enhance your creative projects.\",\"Label\":\"Text to Texture\",\"Title\":\"Text to Texture - Blog - Meshy\"},\"UserStories\":{\"Description\":\"Discover how creators, artists, and designers use Meshy AI to build 3D models. Real user stories, workflows, and results from the Meshy community.\",\"Label\":\"User Stories\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Creator Stories: Real Workflows \u0026 Results | Meshy\"},\"Workflow\":{\"Description\":\"Step-by-step 3D workflow tutorials: from AI generation to game-ready assets. Pipeline guides for Blender, Unity, Unreal, and more.\",\"Label\":\"Workflow\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Workflow Tutorials \u0026 Pipeline Guides | Meshy\"},\"XR\":{\"Description\":\"Create immersive XR experiences with AI-generated 3D content. VR, AR, MR tutorials and asset optimization guides for headset platforms.\",\"Label\":\"XR\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Models for VR, AR \u0026 XR Experiences | Meshy\"}},\"Description\":\"Read the latest articles on new features, insights, tutorials, and more.\",\"Post\":{\"CopyLink\":\"Copy Link\",\"Posted\":\"Posted: {date}\",\"RateAndReview\":{\"FeedbackSubmitted\":\"Your feedback has been submitted successfully!\",\"NotReally\":\"NOT REALLY\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"ThanksForTheFeedback\":\"🥰 Thanks for the feedback!\",\"WasThisPostUseful\":\"Was this post useful?\",\"YesThanks\":\"YES, THANKS!\"},\"RelatedPosts\":{\"Title\":\"Related Posts\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"Title\":\"Related 3D Tools\"},\"RightSection\":{\"CopyLink\":\"Copy Link\",\"Description\":\"Click below to sign up. Get \u003cstrong\u003e{count} free credits\u003c/strong\u003e every month and a \u003cstrong\u003e50% off first month of Pro\u003c/strong\u003e to try our generation features.\",\"Share\":\"Share this article\",\"SignUp\":\"Sign up\",\"Title\":\"Try Meshy for free\"},\"TableOfContents\":{\"OnThisPage\":\"On this page\"},\"Title\":\"{title} - Blog - Meshy\"},\"PostPagination\":{\"Next\":\"Next\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\"},\"Search\":{\"Button\":\"Search\",\"NoResults\":\"No results for {query}\",\"Placeholder\":\"Search articles...\"},\"Subscribe\":{\"Description\":\"Join our newsletter to stay informed on all things Meshy\",\"Title\":\"Subscribe to updates\"},\"Title\":\"Blog - Meshy\",\"ViewAll\":\"View all\"},\"CTA\":{\"ContactSales\":\"Contact Sales\",\"Description\":\"Transform your design process with Meshy. Try it now and see your creativity come to life effortlessly!\",\"JoinCommunity\":\"Join the community\",\"StartForFree\":\"Start for free\",\"Title\":\"Unlock a faster 3D workflow.\"},\"Careers\":{\"AllPositions\":{\"Title\":\"All Positions\"},\"Departments\":{\"All\":\"All Departments\",\"applied_r_e\":\"Applied Research and Engineering\",\"art\":\"Art\",\"ceo_office\":\"CEO Office\",\"customer_success_support\":\"Customer Success \u0026 Support\",\"data\":\"Data\",\"design\":\"Design\",\"engineering\":\"Engineering\",\"g_a\":\"G \u0026 A\",\"growth\":\"Growth\",\"marketing_growth\":\"Marketing \u0026 Growth\",\"people\":\"People\",\"product\":\"Product\",\"research\":\"Research\",\"sales\":\"Sales\"},\"FeaturedJobs\":{\"Title\":\"Featured Jobs\"},\"Hero\":{\"Button\":\"See Open Positions\",\"Description\":\"Join Meshy AI to shape the future of \u003cstrong\u003e3D creative tools\u003c/strong\u003e. Explore \u003cstrong\u003eopen positions\u003c/strong\u003e across engineering, research, design, product, growth, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Careers at Meshy\"},\"LocationSeparator\":\"; \",\"Locations\":{\"All\":\"All Locations\",\"bay_area_us\":\"Bay Area, US\",\"beijing\":\"Beijing\",\"canada\":\"Canada\",\"canada_remote\":\"Canada Remote\",\"china\":\"China\",\"china_remote\":\"China Remote\",\"shanghai\":\"Shanghai\",\"shenzhen\":\"Shenzhen\",\"singapore\":\"Singapore\",\"singapore_remote\":\"Singapore Remote\",\"sunnyvale\":\"Sunnyvale, CA (On-Site)\",\"sunnyvale_us_remote_possible\":\"Sunnyvale, CA (Hybrid) or US Remote (Possible)\",\"us\":\"US\",\"us_remote\":\"US Remote\",\"us_remote_possible\":\"US Remote (Possible) \"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Join Meshy AI to shape the future of 3D creative tools. Explore open positions across engineering, research, design, product, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Careers - Meshy AI\"},\"OpenPositions\":{\"Description\":\"Explore career opportunities at Meshy and help shape the future of 3D creativity. We’re building not only groundbreaking products but also a culture where innovation and collaboration thrive.\",\"Tag\":\"Join Our Team\",\"Title\":\"Open Positions at Meshy\"},\"Values\":{\"Card1\":{\"Description\":\"We value intelligence and the pursuit of knowledge. Our team is composed of some of the brightest minds in the industry.\",\"Title\":\"Brain\"},\"Card2\":{\"Description\":\"We care deeply about our work, our users, and each other. Empathy and passion drive us forward.\",\"Title\":\"Heart\"},\"Card3\":{\"Description\":\"We trust our instincts and are not afraid to take bold risks. Innovation requires courage.\",\"Title\":\"Gut\"},\"Card4\":{\"Description\":\"We have a keen eye for quality and aesthetics. Our products are not just functional but also beautiful.\",\"Title\":\"Taste\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy's mission is to unleash 3D creativity. Our values guide how we bring this vision to life—shaping not only the products we build but also the culture we foster as a team.\",\"Tag\":\"What We Stand For\",\"Title\":\"Our Values\"}},\"Challenges\":{\"ChristmasAdventure\":{\"Description\":\"Create stunning 3D models, print your creations, and win amazing prizes like ELEGOO 3D Printer, Meshy credits, and more!\",\"Intro\":{\"Paragraph\":{\"1\":\"Santa's off on a brave journey, and he needs YOUR help! Can you create magical items and characters to help him succeed?\",\"2\":\"Here's how to join:\",\"3\":\"Use Image to 3D or Text to 3D to create 4 festive 3D models (The Christmas Star, The Mysterious Creatures, Magical Tools, and Santa's Companions).\",\"4\":\"Tag Your Creation: For Text to 3D, add #ChristmasAdventure# to your prompt. For Image to 3D, add it to the model name.\",\"5\":\"Render a scene or create an animation featuring your models as the cover images.\",\"6\":\"Submit a collection of your top 4 models to help Santa on his journey, including the cover images and a fun description.\",\"7\":\"Win Meshy credits, an exclusive badge, a Meshy bundle, or even an ELEGOO 3D Printer!\",\"8\":\"💡 Click \\\"\u003cb\u003eView Rules\u003c/b\u003e\\\" for full rules and prize details.\u003cb\u003eMake sure to read them before you start!\u003c/b\u003e\"},\"ViewRules\":\"View Rules\"},\"Page\":{\"Description\":\"Join the challenge and win amazing prizes like ELEGOO 3D Printer, Meshy credits, and more!\",\"Title\":\"Help Santa this Christmas and Win a 3D Printer!\"},\"Sorter\":{\"AllCollections\":\"All Collections\",\"Hottest\":\"Hottest\",\"MySubmissions\":\"My Collections\",\"Newest\":\"Newest\"},\"Title\":\"Christmas Adventure - Challenges - Meshy\"}},\"CharacterAlive\":{\"AITexture\":{\"Caption\":\"Meshy-textured armor sets created by rolfy, our beloved 3D artist developing an indie game called Madrigal.\",\"Subtitle\":\"Generate high-resolution PBR textures ready for Unity, Unreal, Blender, and more. Make your assets look detailed and realistic in any lighting.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texture in 4K\"},\"CTA\":{\"Button\":\"Start creating\",\"Title\":\"Join the community and unleash your creativity\"},\"CustomPose\":{\"PoseAlt\":\"Custom pose example {index}\",\"Subtitle\":\"Control your model’s pose with ease. Create hero stances, action poses, or scene-ready compositions with Custom Pose.\",\"Title\":\"Custom Pose\"},\"Hero\":{\"Cta\":\"Try it now — for FREE\",\"Eyebrow\":\"For 3D artists\",\"Subcopy\":\"Upload one sketch and watch it become a 3D character in about a minute. Spin to any angle, drop into a pose, or bring into motion — you're in full control.\",\"Title\":\"Bring your character concept \u003cgrad\u003eto life\u003c/grad\u003e\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Upload one sketch and watch it become a rigged 3D character in about a minute. Spin to any angle, pose it, or bring it into motion.\",\"Title\":\"Bring Your Character Concept to Life | Meshy\"},\"MultiView\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Front\":\"Front\",\"Side\":\"Side\",\"Subtitle\":\"Upload multiple views of one design to create a more accurate 3D model. Meshy combines front, side, and back angles to match your concept.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-view Image to 3D Models\"},\"SmartRig\":{\"Callout\":\"Fully automatic rigging—no manual markers required.\",\"ExampleAlt\":\"Smart Rig example {index}: an auto-rigged 3D model\",\"ExampleFormat\":\"Works beyond humanoids:\",\"MainDisplayAlt\":\"A 3D character automatically rigged with Meshy Smart Rig\",\"Subtitle\":\"Smart Rig detects movable parts and builds a ready-to-animate rig in seconds. Rig creatures, robots, and stylized props with less manual setup.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Rig\"},\"UserStories\":{\"QuoteFamished\":\"Because life's too short to spend hand-crafting teeth!!\",\"QuoteFunkatron\":\"A prop becomes a room. A room becomes a building. A building becomes a district. A district becomes lore.\",\"QuoteSoliloquis\":\"I'd been on the hunt for something, anything, that would help me create a collection of walk-about NPCs for the towns in my tech demo.\",\"QuoteStudentSketches\":\"Meshy shortens the distance between I have an idea and I can see it in a game.\",\"Tag\":\"User Story\",\"Title\":\"User Stories\"}},\"CinematicScene\":{\"CTA\":{\"Button\":\"Start creating\",\"Title\":\"Join the community and unleash your creativity\"},\"Export\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Production Readiness\",\"PlatformPlugins\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Native plugins for every major game engine and 3D printing tool.\",\"Title\":\"3D Platform Plugins\"},\"Title\":\"Export and Integration\"},\"Hero\":{\"Cta\":\"Try it now — for FREE\",\"Subcopy\":\"Generate multiple matching assets for the same cinematic scene in one fast workflow. Build richer scenes faster, without starting from scratch each time.\",\"Title\":\"Generate scene assets \u003cgrad\u003ein batches\u003c/grad\u003e.\"},\"MeshStyle\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Standard vs Low Poly\",\"LowPoly\":\"Low Poly\",\"LowPolyBullets\":{\"FewerPolys\":\"Fewer polygons\",\"GamesPrototypes\":\"Great for games and prototypes\",\"RealTime\":\"Better for real-time scenes\",\"SmallerFiles\":\"Smaller file sizes\"},\"Standard\":\"Standard\",\"StandardBullets\":{\"CloseUp\":\"Best for close-up renders\",\"CrispDetails\":\"Crisp surface details\",\"HeroAssets\":\"Great for hero assets\",\"HighRes\":\"High-resolution mesh\"},\"Title\":\"Choose the right mesh style for your project\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Generate cinematic 3D scene assets in batches. Turn your concepts into rigged, animation-ready models in minutes—spin to any angle, pose them, and texture them for any scene.\",\"Title\":\"Generate Scene Assets in Batches | Meshy\"},\"OnePrompt\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Powerful 3D Agent\",\"Header\":\"One prompt to a full scene of game assets.\",\"Prompt\":\"Generate a set of assets in a Japanese style ramen shop.\",\"TextInputLabel\":\"Text input:\"},\"TextureStyle\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Creative Flexibility\",\"Style\":{\"IndustrialLoft\":\"Industrial Loft\",\"MediterraneanCoastal\":\"Mediterranean Coastal\",\"StorybookCottage\":\"Storybook Cottage\",\"StylizedRealistic\":\"Stylized Realistic\",\"TacticalMilitary\":\"Tactical Military\",\"VintageSeasideMarket\":\"Vintage Seaside Market\"},\"Title\":\"Stunning Textures in Any Style\",\"Untextured\":\"Untextured Model\"},\"UserStories\":{\"QuoteArenaPong\":\"Meshy removes reliance on Rosie for 3D assets, allowing me to take my time to create the desired image — even drawing it — and then having Meshy create the asset.\",\"QuoteCosmicrafts\":\"It felt like the whole system was built for AAA studios with armies of artists, not for a solo dev.\",\"QuoteFamished\":\"Because life's too short to spend hand-crafting teeth!!\",\"QuoteFunkatron\":\"A prop becomes a room. A room becomes a building. A building becomes a district. A district becomes lore.\",\"Tag\":\"User Story\",\"Title\":\"User Stories\"}},\"Collections\":{\"AddToCollection\":\"Add to New Collection\",\"AddToCollectionTooltip\":\"After the event ends, models cannot be added to event collection.\",\"Collaborators\":\"Collaborators\",\"Create\":{\"Title\":\"Create Collection\"},\"CreateFor\":\"Create for \u003cslot\u003e\u003c/slot\u003e\",\"Description\":\"View a 3D model collection generated with Meshy.\",\"Edit\":{\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"DeleteCollection\":\"Delete Collection\",\"DeleteCollectionDescription\":\"Collection will be permanently deleted, models will not be affected.\",\"DeleteCollectionTitle\":\"Delete Collection\",\"Edit\":\"Edit\",\"EventEndedTip\":\"After the event ends, event collections can’t be changed.\",\"EventThemeWarning\":\"To ensure your collection qualifies for the event, please avoid making frequent edits. Once the event ends, event collections are locked — models cannot be added, removed, or changed.\",\"FeaturedWarning\":\"This collection has been marked as a featured collection. Significant changes may result in the loss of its featured status.\",\"Form\":{\"3DToImageTip\":\"Create a collection to enable\",\"Add\":\"Add\",\"Description\":\"Description\",\"DescriptionPlaceholder\":\"Gallery Description\",\"MarkEvent\":\"Mark as Event Collection\",\"MarkEventTip\":\"Can be modified during the event period\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"NamePlaceholder\":\"Gallery Name\",\"NameTip\":\"Please input 4-50 valid characters (English letters, hyphen, underscore, or numbers)\",\"Optional\":\"Optional\",\"ShowBoth\":\"Show on both the collection page and in the community feed\",\"ShowOnly\":\"Show only on the collection page\",\"ShowcaseImage\":\"Showcase Images\",\"ShowcaseImageTip\":\" (Format: .png / .jpg / .jpeg / .webp; Max size: 20MB; Proportion: 16:9; Up to 8 images)\",\"ValidBgImage\":\"To display on both the collection page and in the community feed, please upload at least one showcase image.\",\"Video\":{\"Name\":\"Video\",\"Option\":\"Optional: Add up to 3 YouTube videos. Proportion: 16:9\",\"Placeholder\":\"YouTube video link or ID\"}},\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Submitting\":\"Submitting...\",\"Title\":\"Edit Collection\"},\"Exploring\":\"Start Exploring\",\"IncludedInCollection\":\"Included in Collection\",\"LinkCopied\":\"Collection link copied.\",\"MyCollection\":\"{nickname}'s Collection\",\"NoCollectionYet\":{\"Line1\":\"There is no collection yet.\",\"Line2\":\"You can create collection and add models you like to this collection.\"},\"NoCoverYet\":\"No cover yet\",\"NoFeaturedModels\":\"No featured model has been added to this collection yet.\",\"NoModelsYet\":\"\u003cline1\u003eThis collection has no models yet.\u003c/line1\u003e\u003cline2\u003eYou can browse the community and add models you like to this collection.\u003c/line2\u003e\",\"NotFound\":{\"Description\":\"The collection you are looking for does not exist.\",\"Title\":\"Collections Not Found - Meshy\"},\"ProjectLink\":\"Project Link\",\"ReachMaxCollections\":\"You've reached the maximum number of collections (500).\",\"Remove\":{\"Description\":\"Remove this model from the collection? You can always add it back later.\",\"Remove\":\"Remove\",\"Title\":\"Remove model from Collection?\"},\"RemoveCollection\":\"Remove from Current Collection\",\"RemoveCollectionTooltip\":\"After the event ends, models cannot be removed from current collection.\",\"SearchCollections\":\"Search Collections\",\"SearchModels\":\"Search Models\",\"Share\":\"Share\",\"Subscribe\":\"Subscribe\",\"Subscribed\":\"Subscribed\",\"Title\":\"{name} - A 3D model collection generated with Meshy - Meshy\",\"Toast\":{\"AddToCollection\":{\"Failed\":\"Failed to add Model to collection.\",\"Succeeded\":\"Model added to collection successfully!\"},\"CreateCollection\":{\"DescriptionValidation\":\"Description cannot exceed 500 characters\",\"Failed\":\"Failed to create collection.\",\"Succeeded\":\"Collection created successfully!\",\"TitleValidation\":\"Please input valid name (4-50 characters)\"},\"DeleteCollection\":{\"Succeeded\":\"Collection deleted successfully!\"},\"Form\":{\"InvalidLinkOrId\":\"Invalid link or ID\",\"VideoAlreadyAdded\":\"This video is already added\",\"VideoNotFound\":\"YouTube video does not exist\"},\"RemoveFromCollection\":{\"Failed\":\"Failed to remove Model from this collection.\",\"Succeeded\":\"Model removed from this collection successfully!\"},\"UpdateCollection\":{\"Failed\":\"Failed to update collection.\",\"Succeeded\":\"Collection updated successfully!\"}},\"Unsubscribe\":{\"Description\":\"Are you sure you want to unsubscribe from this collection? You can subscribe again anytime.\",\"Title\":\"Confirm Unsubscribe?\",\"Unsubscribe\":\"Unsubscribe\"}},\"Compare\":{\"AllComparisons\":{\"Title\":\"Meshy Alternatives: Detailed Comparison\"},\"Cards\":{\"Hunyuan3D\":{\"Description\":\"Head-to-head against Tencent's open-source 3D foundation model on quality, animation, and commercial use.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs. Hunyuan3D\",\"Verdict\":\"Built-in auto-rigging and full commercial rights vs. geo-restricted open-source weights.\"},\"Trellis2\":{\"Description\":\"SaaS vs. open-source: instant browser access vs. Linux + 24GB GPU.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs. Trellis 2\",\"Verdict\":\"7 integrations vs. research-grade open source\"},\"Tripo\":{\"Description\":\"Head-to-head on generation quality, speed, and commercial workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs. Tripo\",\"Verdict\":\"Meshy 6 preferred by 63.8% of professional evaluators\"}},\"FAQ\":{\"A1\":\"Meshy 6 leads in independent benchmarks, preferred 63.8% of the time by professional evaluators for overall quality and pipeline completeness. The \\\"best\\\" tool still depends on your use case — speed, openness, or specific integrations may shift the answer. Each comparison on this page breaks down the trade-offs in detail.\",\"A10\":\"No AI 3D generator beats Meshy across every dimension, but specific competitors lead in narrow areas. Tripo's Turbo mode wins on raw mesh generation speed (~10 seconds). Trellis 2, Hunyuan3D, and TripoSR offer open-source weights for self-hosted research. Each comparison page on this hub breaks down the trade-offs in detail so you can pick what fits your workflow.\",\"A11\":\"Yes — Meshy is built for 3D printing workflows. It generates watertight, manifold meshes with a 97% slicer pass rate, exports to STL, 3MF, or OBJ, and sends models directly to Bambu Studio with one click. Other AI 3D tools typically require manual mesh repair before printing. See the 3D Printing use-case page for the full workflow.\",\"A12\":\"Yes. Meshy has a free plan with no credit card required, so you can test generation quality on your own prompts. The free tier includes monthly credits suitable for evaluation and personal projects. Paid plans unlock higher resolution, more generations, and commercial licensing. \u003cpricing\u003eSee pricing.\u003c/pricing\u003e\",\"A2\":\"Meshy offers a more complete production pipeline — 500+ preset animations, auto-rigging, and native plugins for Unity, Unreal, Godot, and Roblox. Tripo is competitive on generation speed and offers a ComfyUI integration. See the full Meshy vs Tripo comparison for benchmarks and pricing.\",\"A3\":\"Trellis 2 is Microsoft's open-source model — free to self-host if you have the GPU and technical setup. Meshy is a hosted, production-ready platform with built-in texturing, rigging, animation, and engine integrations, so you can ship assets without managing infrastructure. See the full Meshy vs Trellis 2 comparison for side-by-side outputs.\",\"A5\":\"Yes — paid Meshy plans include full commercial rights to your generated assets, covering games, products, films, 3D prints, and client work. The free plan is intended for personal and evaluation use. See the pricing page for current terms.\",\"A6\":\"Yes — Trellis 2, Hunyuan3D, and TripoSR are open-source AI 3D generators that are free to use if you self-host on your own GPU. Most hosted alternatives (Tripo, Rodin, Sloyd) offer limited free tiers similar to Meshy's. Meshy's own free plan is often the lowest-friction starting point since it requires no setup, no GPU, and no credit card — see the Meshy vs Trellis 2 comparison for a hosted vs open-source breakdown.\",\"A7\":\"Yes — Meshy is used by 10M+ creators worldwide and has generated 100M+ 3D models, with a 4.8/5 rating on G2. In an independent benchmark, Meshy 6 won 63.8% of professional preferences over Tripo, and SimilarWeb ranks Meshy #1 among AI 3D tools by website traffic. Results vary by use case, but the platform consistently leads on production-readiness.\",\"A8\":\"Yes. Meshy is a fully licensed SaaS product. Paid plans include full commercial rights to your generated 3D assets — games, products, films, 3D prints, and client work. The free plan covers personal and evaluation use. Meshy is SOC 2 Type II and ISO 27001 certified and operates under GDPR, so enterprise and EU customers can adopt it without legal friction.\",\"A9\":\"In independent community benchmarks, Meshy 6 leads Hyper3D's Rodin model on both mesh quality (ELO 1048 vs Rodin 2.0's 942) and texture quality (1014 vs 970). Meshy also covers the full pipeline — auto-rigging, 500+ preset animations, native plugins for Unity/Unreal/Blender, and one-click 3D printing — whereas Hyper3D focuses primarily on shape and texture generation.\",\"Q1\":\"Which AI 3D generator is the best in 2026?\",\"Q10\":\"What's better than Meshy?\",\"Q11\":\"Is Meshy AI the best for 3D printing?\",\"Q12\":\"Is Meshy 3D free?\",\"Q2\":\"How does Meshy compare to Tripo?\",\"Q3\":\"How does Meshy compare to Trellis 2?\",\"Q5\":\"Does Meshy include commercial rights?\",\"Q6\":\"Are there any free Meshy alternatives?\",\"Q7\":\"Is Meshy AI actually good?\",\"Q8\":\"Is Meshy AI legal?\",\"Q9\":\"Is Meshy AI better than Hyper3D?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Button\":\"Try Meshy Free\",\"Description\":\"No credit card required. Generate your first 3D model in under 60 seconds — and see for yourself why 10M+ creators choose Meshy over every alternative.\",\"SecondaryButton\":\"View Pricing\",\"Title\":\"Start Creating 3D Models — Free\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Try Meshy Free\",\"Description\":\"Honest, benchmark-backed comparisons between Meshy and major AI 3D generators. Side-by-side feature breakdowns, generation quality tests, and pricing transparency so you can pick what fits your workflow.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"AI-generated 3D models made with Meshy\",\"Label\":\"AI 3D Tool Comparisons\",\"Title\":\"\u003cline\u003eMeshy Alternatives:\u003c/line\u003e\u003cline\u003eAI-Powered 3D Model Generators\u003c/line\u003e\",\"TrustSignal\":\"Preferred by 63.8% of professional evaluators over Tripo — independent benchmark, 2026\"},\"Links\":{\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Pricing\":\"Plans \u0026 Pricing\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Explore Meshy\"},\"Matrix\":{\"CTA\":{\"FullComparison\":\"Full comparison\",\"GetStarted\":\"Get started\"},\"Feature\":{\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing (PBR)\",\"AutoRigging\":\"Auto-Rigging\",\"BambuIntegration\":\"One-Click Slicer Integration\",\"CloudBased\":\"Browser-Based (no setup)\",\"Compliance\":\"SOC 2 + ISO 27001\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image-to-3D\",\"Plugins\":\"Native Game Engine Plugins\",\"PrintReady\":\"Print-Ready Watertight Meshes\",\"Retexture\":\"Retexture Existing Meshes\",\"TeamWorkspace\":\"Team Workspace \u0026 Permissions\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text-to-3D\"},\"Limited\":\"Limited\",\"Section\":{\"Animation\":\"Animation \u0026 Workflow\",\"Generation\":\"3D Generation\",\"Platform\":\"Platform \u0026 Integrations\"}},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"See how Meshy compares to other AI 3D model generators. Quality benchmarks, feature breakdowns, and pricing — updated for 2026.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Alternatives: AI-Powered 3D Model Generators\"},\"PageMeta\":{\"Hunyuan3D\":{\"Description\":\"Compare Meshy and Hunyuan3D on features, setup, and output. Meshy has text-to-3D, animation, and 7 plugins. Hunyuan3D needs 10–29GB GPU, static meshes only.\",\"OgDescription\":\"Compare Meshy and Hunyuan3D: SaaS vs. open-source. Meshy has text-to-3D, animation, and 7 plugins. Hunyuan3D needs 10–29GB GPU, no rigging. Updated 2026.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs Hunyuan3D: Best AI 3D Model Generator in 2026\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Meshy vs Hunyuan3D: Which AI 3D Generator Is Right for You?\"},\"Trellis2\":{\"Description\":\"Compare Meshy and Trellis 2 on features, setup, and commercial rights. Meshy has text-to-3D, animation, and 7 plugins. Trellis 2 requires Linux + 24GB GPU.\",\"OgDescription\":\"Compare Meshy and Trellis 2: SaaS vs. open-source. Meshy has text-to-3D, animation, and 7 plugins. Trellis 2 requires Linux + 24GB GPU. Updated 2026.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs Trellis 2: Best AI 3D Model Generator in 2026\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Meshy vs Trellis 2: Which AI 3D Generator Is Right for You?\"},\"Tripo\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy vs Tripo (2026): the best AI 3D model generator for 3D printing, games \u0026 animation. Meshy leads with watertight meshes, auto-repair, Bambu Studio integration \u0026 500+ animations. Full comparison.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy vs Tripo: Best AI 3D Model Generator (2026)\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Meshy vs Tripo: Best AI 3D Model Generator (2026)\"}},\"Section\":{\"Features\":{\"Animation\":{\"Action\":\"Explore AI Animation\",\"CoverAlt\":\"AI Animation Generator — automatically rig and animate 3D characters with Meshy\",\"Description\":\"Rig and animate characters automatically — no 3D software expertise required.\",\"Title\":\"AI Animation Generator\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy combines text-to-3D, image-to-3D, and AI animation in one browser-based platform — no GPU, no local setup, full commercial rights on paid plans.\",\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Action\":\"Explore Image to 3D\",\"CoverAlt\":\"Image to 3D — convert any image to a game-ready 3D asset with Meshy\",\"Description\":\"Upload any reference image and convert it to a game-ready 3D asset in under a minute.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"Printing\":{\"Action\":\"Explore 3D Printing\",\"CoverAlt\":\"3D Print-Ready Models — generate watertight meshes ready for FDM and resin printers with Meshy\",\"Description\":\"Generate watertight, manifold meshes ready for FDM, SLA, and resin printers. Export directly to STL or OBJ — no manual repair needed.\",\"Title\":\"3D Print-Ready Models\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Action\":\"Explore Text to 3D\",\"CoverAlt\":\"Text to 3D — generate a 3D model from a text prompt with Meshy\",\"Description\":\"Type a prompt, get a detailed 3D model in 20–30 seconds. Export to FBX, OBJ, GLB, or STL.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"What Makes Meshy Different\"},\"PickComparison\":\"Meshy Alternatives: Side-by-Side Comparison\",\"TrustedBy\":{\"Description\":\"Join 10M+ creators — from indie game developers to professional studios — who generate, animate, and export production-ready 3D assets with Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Trusted by Creators Worldwide\"}},\"Stats\":{\"Creators\":{\"Label\":\"creators using Meshy\",\"Number\":\"10M+\"},\"Models\":{\"Label\":\"3D models generated\",\"Number\":\"100M+\"},\"Rating\":{\"Label\":\"rated on G2\",\"Number\":\"4.8/5\"},\"Title\":\"Why 10M+ Creators Choose Meshy\",\"Traffic\":{\"Label\":\"AI 3D tool by website traffic (SimilarWeb)\",\"Number\":\"#1\"}},\"Testimonials\":{\"Heading\":\"Loved by \u003chighlight\u003e{count} Creators\u003c/highlight\u003e Worldwide\"}},\"Contact\":{\"APIIntegration\":\"API Integration\",\"Ads\":\"Ads (Google Ads, Social Media Ads, etc.)\",\"BlogPostArticleNewsletter\":\"Blog Post, Article, Newsletter\",\"CompanyName\":\"Company Name\",\"ConferenceEvents\":\"Conference / Events\",\"Country\":\"Country or Region\",\"Description1\":\"The only enterprise-grade 3D AI platform with full security and compliance.\",\"Description2\":\"Where professionals and enthusiasts create high-quality 3D models\",\"Description3\":\"We received rave reviews on G2 and Trustpilot\",\"EducationPlans\":\"Education Plans\",\"Email\":\"Work Email\",\"EnterpriseSolutions\":\"Enterprise Solutions\",\"Failed\":\"Form submission failed.\",\"FirstName\":\"First Name\",\"FormDescription\":\"Hi, we're so glad you're interested in Meshy. \\nBefore we get started, let's get some basic information for our records!\",\"FormTitle\":\"Contact Us\",\"FriendColleague\":\"Friend, Colleague\",\"HowDidYouHearAboutUs\":\"How did you hear about us?\",\"Industry\":\"Industry\",\"InvalidEmail\":\"Invalid email address\",\"InvalidWebsiteTLD\":\"Invalid top-level domain. Please check.\",\"JobTitle\":\"Job Title\",\"LastName\":\"Last Name\",\"LearnMore\":\"Learn More\",\"Message\":\"How are you looking to use Meshy?\",\"MessagePlaceholder\":\"Please share how you want to use Meshy\",\"MonthlyAnticipatedGenerations\":\"Monthly Anticipated Generations\",\"NumberOfEmployees\":\"Number of Employees\",\"OnlyMe\":\"Only me\",\"Optional\":\"(Optional)\",\"Other\":\"Other\",\"OtherTopic\":\"Other\",\"PartnerReferral\":\"Partner Referral\",\"PhoneNumbers\":\"Phone Number\",\"ReadOurReviews\":\"Read our reviews\",\"Required\":\"Please complete this required field.\",\"SalesTeamOutreach\":\"Sales Team Outreach\",\"SelectPlaceholder\":\"Please Select\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Subtitle1\":\"Premier Enterprise\",\"Subtitle1Suffix\":\"3D GenAI Platform\",\"Subtitle2\":\"100 Million+\",\"Subtitle2Suffix\":\"3D Assets\",\"Subtitle3\":\"10 Million+\",\"Subtitle3Suffix\":\"3D Creators\",\"Success\":\"Thank you for submitting the form! We have received your inquiry and will respond within 2 business days.\",\"SupportEmail\":{\"Body\":\"Hi {firstName},\\n\\nThanks for contacting Meshy Support — we received your request and our team will get back to you shortly.\\n\\n{details}\\n\\n— Meshy Support\",\"DetailsHeading\":\"Submitted details\",\"MessageLabel\":\"Message\",\"Subject\":\"We received your support request\",\"TopicLabel\":\"Topic\"},\"SupportInquiries\":\"Support Inquiries (product issues, subscription cancellations and refunds)\",\"TeamPlans\":\"Team Plans\",\"Title1\":\"The #1\",\"Title2\":\"GenAI 3D Generator\",\"Title3\":\"for Businesses\",\"Topic\":\"Which topic best fits your needs?\",\"TrustedBy\":\"Trusted by 2000+ partners and customers across industries.\",\"Website\":\"Website URL\"},\"ContactUs\":{\"Description\":\"Contact the Meshy team to explore collaboration opportunities, enterprise solutions, technical support, or general inquiries.\",\"Title\":\"Contact Us - Meshy\"},\"CreativeLab\":{\"BrickFigure\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"BrickFigure\":\"Brick Figure\",\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Meshy's AI brick figure generator is a free web tool that turns a photo into a custom 3D brick figure. It generates a fully textured, poseable brick figure you can adjust, then download as GLB, STL, OBJ, or 3MF to 3D-print at home.\",\"Q\":\"What is Meshy's AI brick figure generator?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"Models generated on paid Meshy plans come with commercial-use rights and can be used in games, films, and 3D prints you sell. Free-tier outputs are for personal and evaluation use. Always check the license terms on your current plan before using a brick figure commercially.\",\"Q\":\"Can I use my brick figure commercially?\"},\"Q11\":{\"A\":\"You don't need a template or any DIY modeling. Meshy generates a ready-to-print 3D brick figure from your photo automatically — just download the STL or 3MF and print. There's a free tier, so you can start designing without a credit card.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need a brick figure template, or can I make one myself for free?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Use Meshy's AI brick figure maker — it runs right in your browser, with nothing to install. Upload a photo of a person or character, and Meshy generates several brick-figure designs. Pick one, set the pose, and download the model. No 3D modeling experience is needed.\",\"Q\":\"How do I turn a photo into a brick figure?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Download your brick figure as STL, OBJ, or 3MF, open it in a slicer like Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, or Cura, and print on any home FDM or resin printer. The brick texture and stud details are baked into the mesh, so they print exactly like the preview. Use the 3MF export for multi-color printing on supported machines.\",\"Q\":\"Can I 3D-print the brick figure at home, including the brick texture?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Meshy exports your brick figure as GLB, STL, OBJ, and 3MF. Use GLB for Blender, Unity, and Unreal Engine, STL or OBJ for standard 3D printing, and 3MF for multi-color prints. Each download keeps the colors generated with the model.\",\"Q\":\"What file formats can I download?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Before you export, you can move the head, arms, and legs to set your brick figure's pose, just like a buildable brick figure. The pose is baked into the model you download.\",\"Q\":\"Can I pose the brick figure?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Yes. A clear, well-lit photo where the face and body are visible works best. Meshy keeps the face, outfit, and pose recognizable, so the brick figure looks like you or the person you upload. Just upload a single image and let Meshy handle the rest.\",\"Q\":\"Can I make a brick figure of myself or a friend?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Yes, there is a free tier — you can start designing brick figures without a credit card. Creative Lab gives every account a daily number of free design attempts; a paid Meshy plan unlocks unlimited attempts and higher limits. See the pricing page for current plan details.\",\"Q\":\"Is the AI brick figure maker free?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Not yet — today the brick figure generator is print-at-home: you download the model as STL, OBJ, or 3MF and print it yourself or through a local 3D-print service. A made-and-shipped option is coming soon, like the custom keychains Meshy already prints and ships to 9 countries.\",\"Q\":\"Can I order a printed brick figure shipped to me?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"No experience is needed. You upload a photo and Meshy handles the modeling and texturing for you — no sculpting, no software. Generating designs takes a couple of minutes, and posing and downloading happen right in the browser.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience, and how long does it take?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo and watch Meshy turn it into a custom, poseable, printable brick figure.\",\"Button\":\"Create My Brick Figure\",\"FooterLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Looking for more 3D products?\",\"Title\":\"Make Your First 3D Brick Figure\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Meshy's AI turns any photo into a custom, poseable 3D brick figure — pick a pose, then download a multi-color model you can 3D-print at home.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003eBrick Figures\u003c/accent\u003e from Your Photo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From a single photo to a printable 3D brick figure in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in any photo — yourself, a friend, or a character. No modeling skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for 3D conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading a photo to the Meshy brick figure generator\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy creates several designs from your photo. Regenerate until it looks right.\",\"Title\":\"Generate and refine your brick figure\",\"Visual\":\"Choosing and refining a brick figure design in the browser\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Pose the head, arms, and legs, then export as GLB, STL, OBJ, or 3MF.\",\"Title\":\"Pose it and export in 4 formats\",\"Visual\":\"Posing a brick figure and exporting it for 3D printing\"},\"Title\":\"How to Make a Brick Figure from a Photo\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Auto-rig and animate any 3D character in seconds.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation Generator\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate multi-view images optimized for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic PBR textures to any 3D model with AI.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a textured 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that builds your brick figure powers games, animations, and 3D-printable models. Explore the rest of the toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"Generate print-ready 3D models for your home printer.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printer Files\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it and generate a 3D model from a text prompt.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your photo into a custom brick figure with Meshy AI. Generate designs, pose it, and download a print-ready 3D model — free to try.\",\"OGDescription\":\"Generate a custom, poseable brick figure from any photo. Multi-color and ready to 3D-print at home.\",\"OGTitle\":\"AI Brick Figure Generator: Turn a Photo Into a Minifigure\",\"Title\":\"AI Brick Figure Generator – Photo to 3D | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Generate a custom, poseable brick figure from any photo. Multi-color and ready to 3D-print at home.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"AI Brick Figure Generator: Turn a Photo Into a Minifigure\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy reads your photo and captures the real face, hair, and outfit in brick-figure style — not a generic, assemble-from-parts character.\",\"Title\":\"It actually looks like them\",\"Visual\":\"A photo being turned into a matching brick figure\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Move the head, arms, and legs to set any pose before you export — a buildable brick figure, not a frozen statue.\",\"Title\":\"Poseable, like a real brick figure\",\"Visual\":\"Adjusting the pose of a 3D brick figure\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Export a full-color model in GLB, STL, OBJ, or 3MF — ready for multi-color 3D printing at home.\",\"Title\":\"Full color, print-ready\",\"Visual\":\"A fully textured, multi-color 3D brick figure\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most custom brick figures are either pieced together from stock parts that never quite look like the real person, or modeled by hand over days. Meshy turns your photo into a finished, poseable, full-color brick figure — and hands you the file.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Brick Figures Are Different\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy AI Brick Figure Generator\"},\"Showcase\":{\"AltCouple\":\"A pair of matching brick figures of a couple, made with Meshy\",\"AltDesk\":\"A custom 3D-printed brick figure standing on a desk, made with Meshy\",\"AltHero\":\"A hand holding a custom 3D-printed brick figure beside the real person's photo, made with Meshy\",\"AltPet\":\"A brick figure of a person holding a pet, made with Meshy\",\"AltPose\":\"A poseable brick figure with arms and legs adjusted into an action pose, made with Meshy\",\"AltPrinter\":\"A multi-color brick figure beside a 3D printer, made with Meshy\",\"AltShelf\":\"A row of custom brick figures displayed on a shelf, made with Meshy\",\"Kicker\":\"Brick figures created by Meshy creators from a single photo.\",\"Title\":\"Brick Figures People Are Making\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"Delivery\":\"Shipping\",\"DeliveryValue\":\"Coming soon\",\"Formats\":\"Formats\",\"FormatsValue\":\"GLB · STL · OBJ · 3MF\",\"Price\":\"Price\",\"PriceValue\":\"Free to start\",\"Print\":\"Print\",\"PrintValue\":\"At home\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"Jun 22, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Built to standard minifigure scale, so your custom figure fits right into the brick cities, sets, and dioramas you already own.\",\"Title\":\"Drop into your brick world\",\"Visual\":\"A custom brick figure standing among an existing brick set\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a family, sports team, D\u0026D party, or whole office into one matching set of brick figures — each from a single photo.\",\"Title\":\"A set of the whole crew\",\"Visual\":\"A matching set of brick figures of a family\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Pose the head, arms, and legs frame by frame and star your own custom figures in stop-motion brick films.\",\"Title\":\"Brick film characters\",\"Visual\":\"A poseable brick figure used in a stop-motion brick film\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Print the guest of honor as a brick figure — a wedding or birthday cake topper, or a party favor no store can sell.\",\"Title\":\"Cake toppers \u0026 party favors\",\"Visual\":\"A custom brick figure used as a wedding cake topper\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: tabletop game pieces, a desk-side mini-you, and custom brand mascots.\",\"Kicker\":\"One photo, many ways to play with your 3D brick figure.\",\"Title\":\"What You Can Make with Custom Brick Figures\"}},\"FidgetCollapsible\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"FidgetCollapsible\":\"Collapsible Fidget\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Most collapsible fidget toys print in 1–2 hours on a standard FDM printer at 0.2mm layer height. Larger sizes or denser infill add time; TPU prints slightly slower than PLA. The Meshy generation step takes under 30 seconds — the printer is the main variable.\",\"Q\":\"How long does a collapsible fidget toy take to print?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Any photo with a clear, distinct silhouette works well — pets against a plain background, cartoon characters, logos, and simple icons all produce clean results. Avoid photos where the subject blends into the background or has very thin features like whiskers or hair strands.\",\"Q\":\"What kind of photo works best?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Designing and previewing your fidget is free, and generation uses Meshy credits. Downloading the STL file for home printing requires a Meshy Pro plan. Once exported, print it on any FDM printer, or order a professionally finished part as a paid add-on.\",\"Q\":\"Is the STL download really free?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"TPU (thermoplastic polyurethane) is the recommended material for home printing — it is flexible, durable, and gives the satisfying spring-back feel. Standard PLA works but produces a stiffer, more brittle toy. For ordered parts we use professional-grade flexible resin.\",\"Q\":\"What filament should I use for a collapsible fidget toy?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Yes. You own the 3D model you generate and may print and sell physical copies. Please do not redistribute the digital STL file itself or claim it as your own original design.\",\"Q\":\"Can I sell the fidget toys I print?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Use the size slider in the preview step before downloading. The default output is 80 mm along the longest edge — a comfortable palm size. You can scale it up or down depending on your printer and preference.\",\"Q\":\"How big are the collapsible fidget toys, and can I resize them?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Yes, when printed in non-toxic PLA or TPU. The default 80mm size is too large to be a choking hazard. Avoid ABS, which releases fumes during printing. For children under 6, supervise use and avoid scaling the fidget toy below 60mm.\",\"Q\":\"Are collapsible fidget toys safe for kids?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Use 0.2mm layer height, 3–4 perimeter walls, and 15% infill. The most important setting is flow rate — reduce to 97–98% to prevent links from fusing. For TPU, set retraction very low (0.5–1mm) or disable it entirely to avoid jams. Print at 30–40mm/s for the cleanest joint separation.\",\"Q\":\"What print settings give the best results for a collapsible fidget toy?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload any photo, generate your custom collapsible fidget toy in seconds, and export a print-ready STL with Meshy Pro to print at home.\",\"Button\":\"Create My Collapsible Fidget Toy\",\"FooterLink\":\"Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Or explore other products on\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Custom Fidget Toy?\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Cats, dogs, dinosaurs, butterflies — upload any photo with a clear silhouette and Meshy generates a custom folding fidget toy that prints at home with no supports. Collapses flat, springs back satisfyingly.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Photos Into a Custom \u003caccent\u003eCollapsible Fidget Toy\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"Three steps. No design skills. Your custom collapsible fidget toy, ready to print.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo of your pet, a dinosaur, a butterfly — anything with a clear outline. Meshy reads the silhouette automatically, no cropping or editing needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload Your Photo\",\"Visual\":\"Photo upload interface showing image selection\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy traces the outline and generates a smooth, structurally-sound collapsible geometry — no design skills or 3D software needed.\",\"Title\":\"AI Builds Your Shape\",\"Visual\":\"AI-generated collapsible 3D shape from the silhouette\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Adjust size and spring gap, then export a print-ready STL for home printing.\",\"Title\":\"Preview, Customize \u0026 Print\",\"Visual\":\"Customization sliders for size, layers, and gap width beside an Export STL button\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Animate your 3D models automatically with AI-powered motion.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate stunning images from text prompts with Meshy AI.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Apply realistic AI-generated textures to any untextured 3D model.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Convert any image to a textured 3D model in seconds using AI.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"From text to 3D, images to models — discover the full AI creative suite.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Go to {label}\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"End-to-end workflow to turn your AI models into printable 3D files.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printing Workflow\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe anything in words and watch Meshy generate a 3D model.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Explore More Meshy Tools\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any pet, character, or silhouette into a 3D collapsible fidget toy. Upload a photo and Meshy AI instantly designs your custom fidget — free to start and print at home.\",\"OGDescription\":\"Turn any pet, character, or silhouette into a 3D collapsible fidget toy. Upload a photo and Meshy AI instantly designs your custom fidget.\",\"OGTitle\":\"Custom Collapsible Fidget Toy from Your Photo\",\"Title\":\"Custom Collapsible Fidget Toy from Your Photo | Meshy AI\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Turn any photo into a collapsible 3D fidget toy with Meshy AI.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Custom Collapsible Fidget Toy from Your Photo | Meshy AI\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Every collapsible fidget toy starts with a silhouette — and yours can come from any photo. A cat, a dinosaur, a flower: Meshy reads the outline and builds a print-ready shape in under 30 seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Any Photo, Any Shape\",\"Visual\":\"An assortment of collapsible fidget toys 3D-printed from photos, beside a phone photo gallery\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Generic print-in-place fidgets are often too floppy or too stiff. Ours are generated with calibrated gap width and hinge geometry so each link collapses flat and springs back with consistent, satisfying resistance — not by accident.\",\"Title\":\"Engineered to Collapse Satisfyingly\",\"Visual\":\"Smooth collapsible mechanism demonstrating spring and fold action\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Download the STL and print it on any FDM printer, or let us produce a finished part in professional flexible resin — your choice.\",\"Title\":\"Prints in One Piece, No Supports\",\"Visual\":\"A collapsible fidget toy printed on an FDM printer bed\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Size, gap width, contour smoothing — tune every parameter in the 3D preview before you export. Download the STL and print the exact fidget toy you want, not a fixed template.\",\"Title\":\"Adjust Before You Print\",\"Visual\":\"Size, gap-width, and layer sliders on a tablet beside a 3D-printed fidget toy\"},\"Kicker\":\"Custom shape. Satisfying mechanics. No design skills required.\",\"Title\":\"What Makes Our Collapsible Fidget Toys Stand Out\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Alt\":\"{subject} collapsible fidget toy made with Meshy AI\",\"Kicker\":\"Fidget toys our community has already made with Meshy AI.\",\"Subject1\":\"Cat\",\"Subject2\":\"Dog\",\"Subject3\":\"Rabbit\",\"Subject4\":\"Bird\",\"Subject5\":\"Star\",\"Subject6\":\"Character\",\"Subject7\":\"Butterfly\",\"Title\":\"Community Creations\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"From\":\"Delivery\",\"FromValue\":\"Coming soon\",\"Price\":\"Price\",\"PriceValue\":\"Free to start\",\"Production\":\"Print At\",\"ProductionValue\":\"Home\",\"Shipping\":\"Format\",\"ShippingValue\":\"STL\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"Jun 24, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"The collapsible mechanism gives quiet, one-handed feedback — discreet enough for classrooms, open offices, and long Zoom calls. Subtle enough to go unnoticed, satisfying enough to actually help.\",\"Title\":\"A Fidget Toy for Adults Who Need to Focus\",\"Visual\":\"A collapsible fidget toy held at a work desk with a laptop and coffee\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Print-in-place design — no supports, no assembly, straight off the printer and ready to play. Knock one out in under an hour, or run a batch in every color you have.\",\"Title\":\"A Weekend Print for the Maker in You\",\"Visual\":\"A collapsible fidget toy fresh off a 3D printer\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"The repetitive collapse-and-expand motion gives quiet, one-handed input that helps kids with ADHD, autism, or sensory processing needs stay regulated — in class, at the dinner table, or in the car.\",\"Title\":\"A Sensory Toy Kids Actually Want to Use\",\"Visual\":\"A child pressing a collapsible fidget toy flat at a play table\"},\"Kicker\":\"For staying focused, for a weekend print project, and for the kids who can't put it down.\",\"Title\":\"One Folding Fidget Toy. Three Kinds of People.\"}},\"FidgetPixel\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"FidgetPixel\":\"Fidget Pixel\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"No. Each color in the pixel design is saved as a separate object in the 3MF file, so a multi-filament system like an AMS prints it in full color automatically. On a single-extruder printer you can still print it by swapping filament at each color change.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need a multi-color 3D printer?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"You can upload a photo, preview the pixel conversion, and customize the grid for free. Generating and exporting the final 3MF uses Meshy credits. New accounts receive free credits so you can try the full workflow — no credit card required to start.\",\"Q\":\"Is Meshy Fidget Pixel free?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"High-contrast images with a clear subject produce the sharpest results — portraits, pet faces, logos, and simple icons all work well. Busy backgrounds or very low-resolution photos can produce muddier conversions; crop and adjust the image before generating for the cleanest result.\",\"Q\":\"What photos work best for a pixel art fidget toy?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Yes. You can switch between a 16×16 and 32×32 pixel grid and set anywhere from 1 to 8 colors before exporting. Lower resolution gives a bolder retro look; higher resolution preserves more detail. Fewer colors means fewer filament changes when printing.\",\"Q\":\"Can I control the pixel grid size and number of colors?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Your design exports as a 3MF file optimized for FDM printing. 3MF saves each color as a separate object, so modern slicers like PrusaSlicer, OrcaSlicer, Bambu Studio, and Cura open it with the colors already separated — just map each one to a filament and print.\",\"Q\":\"What file format does Meshy export, and which slicers support it?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"The AI generates your pixel art and 3D model in roughly 1–3 minutes. A simple low-resolution design typically prints in under an hour on a standard FDM printer. More detailed designs at higher resolution take longer but still complete in a single print session.\",\"Q\":\"How long does the whole process take — photo to printed toy?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Files you download from Meshy are yours to print and sell. Commercial use is permitted under our standard Creative Lab license. We just ask that you don't resell the 3MF file itself — the value is in the printed object.\",\"Q\":\"Can I sell the pixel art fidget toys I print?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Personalized pixel art fidget toys are among the most popular custom 3D-printed gifts. Turn a pet photo, a favorite character, or a portrait into a one-of-a-kind desk toy for birthdays, holidays, or just-because moments. Each design is unique — two people who upload different photos get completely different toys.\",\"Q\":\"Is this a good gift idea?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"None at all. Upload a photo, adjust the resolution and color sliders, click Export — Meshy handles the entire conversion from image to pixel art to printable 3D model automatically. No CAD software, no manual modeling, no technical knowledge required.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need any design or coding skills?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Most pixel art converters stop at a flat PNG image. Meshy Fidget Pixel goes three steps further: it converts your photo to editable pixel art, saves each color as a separate print object, and exports a structurally sound, print-ready 3D model — all in one workflow. No other tool connects photo → pixel art → physical 3D-printable toy in a single session.\",\"Q\":\"How is this different from a regular pixel art converter?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo, customize the pixel grid and colors, export a print-ready 3MF — done in under 5 minutes. Free to start, no design experience required.\",\"Button\":\"Generate My Fidget Pixel\",\"FooterLink\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Want to see other Creative Lab products?\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Pixel Art Fidget Toy?\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Upload a photo, pick your pixel grid and colors, then download a print-ready 3MF file — no design skills needed. Works with portraits, pets, logos, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003ePixel Art Fidget Toys\u003c/accent\u003e From Any Photo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From any photo to a print-ready pixel art fidget toy in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in a portrait, pet photo, or logo — PNG, JPG, and WebP all work. Meshy converts it into an editable pixel art grid in about a minute, no design or 3D skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for pixel art conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading a photo into Meshy's pixel art fidget toy maker\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Choose a 16×16 or 32×32 pixel grid and 1 to 8 colors. Lower resolution gives a bold retro look; higher preserves fine detail. Each color becomes its own object in the 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Customize the pixel grid and colors\",\"Visual\":\"Adjusting the pixel grid resolution and color count for a fidget toy\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Click Export and Meshy builds a 3D model with each color as its own object, then saves a print-ready 3MF. Open it in any modern slicer, map each color to a filament, and print.\",\"Title\":\"Export a print-ready 3MF in one click\",\"Visual\":\"Exporting a print-ready multi-color 3MF pixel art model\"},\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Rig and animate the 3D character you created from pixel art — takes your fidget toy design into motion.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate a reference image from a text prompt first, then use it as the source photo for your pixel art fidget toy.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add painted surface textures and fine detail to any 3D model — useful when you want to go beyond flat pixel color layers.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"The underlying AI that reads your photo and converts it into the pixel fidget's 3D geometry. Go beyond pixel art — generate full 3D models directly from any image.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that converts your photo into a pixel art fidget toy is what creators use to build games, characters, and 3D-printable models. Explore the full toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"{label} — explore this Meshy feature\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"How Meshy optimizes geometry for FDM printing — the same pipeline that makes every Fidget Pixel file print-ready out of the box.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printing Workflow\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Don't have a photo? Describe what you want in text, generate a reference image, then drop it into Fidget Pixel to turn it into a printable pixel art toy.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom pixel art fidget toy. Pick a 16×16 or 32×32 grid and your colors, then download a print-ready, multi-color 3MF file — no design skills needed.\",\"OGDescription\":\"Upload a photo, customize the pixel grid and colors, and download a print-ready multi-color 3MF model. Make a one-of-a-kind 3D-printable fidget toy in minutes.\",\"OGImageAlt\":\"Custom pixel art fidget toy 3D printed from a photo with Meshy\",\"OGTitle\":\"Custom Pixel Art Fidget Toys From Any Photo\",\"Title\":\"Pixel Art Fidget Toy from Your Photo — 3D Print Ready | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Turn any photo into a 3D-printable, multi-color pixel art fidget toy. Free to start — no design skills needed.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Custom Pixel Art Fidget Toys From Any Photo\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Choose a 16×16 or 32×32 pixel grid and set the color count from 1 to 8 before you export anything. Low resolution gives bold, chunky pixel art with a classic retro feel; higher resolution preserves facial features and fine detail. You see the result in real time before a single credit is spent.\",\"Title\":\"Full control over grid and colors\",\"Visual\":\"Selecting a 16×16 or 32×32 pixel grid and color count in Meshy’s pixel art fidget toy editor\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Every design exports as a print-optimized 3MF with each color saved as its own object. Load the file into any modern slicer, map each color to a filament, and print. No manual modeling, no CAD edits, no geometry fixes — the file is ready to slice exactly as exported.\",\"Title\":\"Print-ready 3MF, no extra software\",\"Visual\":\"A print-ready 3MF pixel art fidget toy file opened in a 3D printing slicer\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Each color in your pixel art becomes a separate object in the 3MF file. A multi-filament system like an AMS prints it in full color automatically, or you can swap filament at each color change on a standard FDM printer. The result is a physical, full-color pixel art toy — no painting or post-processing needed.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-color without manual painting\",\"Visual\":\"A full-color pixel art fidget toy 3D printed with a multi-filament AMS, each color a separate object\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Portraits, pet photos, logos, game sprites, memes — if you can photograph or screenshot it, Meshy converts it to pixel art and generates a printable fidget toy from it. The AI handles color reduction and edge detection automatically, so even complex images simplify cleanly into a bold pixel grid.\",\"Title\":\"Works with any photo or image\",\"Visual\":\"Converting a photo into a printable pixel art fidget toy with Meshy’s AI\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most pixel art tools stop at a flat image. Fidget Pixel goes further — converting your photo into editable pixel art and exporting a structurally sound, print-ready 3D model in a single workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Why Fidget Pixel Stands Apart\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy Fidget Pixel\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Kicker\":\"From pet portraits to game characters — any photo makes a one-of-a-kind 3D-printable fidget toy.\",\"Tile1\":{\"Alt\":\"Custom pixel art pet portrait fidget toy 3D printed from a photo\",\"Desc\":\"Upload a photo of your dog, cat, or any pet — Meshy converts it to pixel art and exports a print-ready 3MF. A custom fidget toy that looks exactly like them.\",\"Title\":\"Pet Portrait Fidget Toy\"},\"Tile2\":{\"Alt\":\"3D printable pixel art game character fidget toy made from a retro sprite\",\"Desc\":\"Turn any retro sprite, game screenshot, or fan art into a 3D-printable pixel art fidget toy.\",\"Title\":\"Game Character Pixel Art Toy\"},\"Tile3\":{\"Alt\":\"Personalized pixel art fidget toy gift made from a portrait photo\",\"Desc\":\"Convert a portrait photo into a personalized pixel art fidget toy — a unique 3D-printed gift for birthdays and holidays.\",\"Title\":\"Custom Portrait Gift\"},\"Title\":\"Pixel Art Fidget Toy Ideas\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"Delivery\":\"Delivery\",\"DeliveryValue\":\"Coming soon\",\"Formats\":\"Format\",\"FormatsValue\":\"3MF (multi-color)\",\"Price\":\"Price\",\"PriceValue\":\"Free to start\",\"Print\":\"Print At\",\"PrintValue\":\"Home\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"Jun 22, 2026\"}},\"Figurine\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Figurine\":\"Figurine\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Meshy's AI figurine generator is a free web tool that turns a photo into a custom 3D figurine. It generates a fully textured, multi-color 3D model you can preview in AR and download as FBX, OBJ, GLB, or STL to 3D-print at home.\",\"Q\":\"What is Meshy's AI figurine generator?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"Most AI action figure generators only restyle a photo into a 2D image of a toy. Meshy generates a real 3D model — one you can rotate, relight, view in AR, and 3D-print. You also own exportable FBX, OBJ, GLB, and STL files, instead of a single flat picture.\",\"Q\":\"How is Meshy different from other AI action figure generators?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Upload a photo of a person, pet, or character. Meshy generates a chibi-style 3D figurine for you, and you can preview it in AR, regenerate until it matches your photo, or download the model. No 3D modeling experience is needed.\",\"Q\":\"How do I turn a photo into a 3D figurine?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Download your figurine as an STL or OBJ file, open it in a slicer like Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, or Cura, and print it on any home FDM or resin printer. You control the size and material, so the same figurine can be a desk piece or a tabletop miniature.\",\"Q\":\"Can I 3D-print the figurine at home?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Meshy exports your figurine as FBX, OBJ, GLB, and STL. Use GLB or FBX for Blender, Unity, and Unreal Engine, and STL or OBJ for 3D printing. Each download includes the multi-color textures generated with the model, so it looks the same as the preview.\",\"Q\":\"What file formats can I download?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Not yet. Today the figurine generator is print-at-home: you download the model and print it yourself or with a local print service. A made-and-shipped delivery option is coming soon, similar to the printed keychains Meshy already ships in the United States.\",\"Q\":\"Can I order a printed figurine shipped to me?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Yes. A clear, well-lit photo where the face and body are visible works best. Meshy keeps the face, outfit, and pose recognizable, so the figurine looks like you, your pet, or your character. Just upload a single image and let Meshy handle the rest.\",\"Q\":\"Can I make a figurine of myself or my pet?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Yes, there is a free tier — you can start designing figurines without a credit card. Creative Lab gives every account a daily number of free design attempts; a paid Meshy plan unlocks unlimited attempts and higher limits. See the pricing page for current plan details.\",\"Q\":\"Is the AI figurine generator free?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Models generated on paid Meshy plans come with commercial-use rights and can be used in games, films, and 3D prints you sell. Free-tier outputs are for personal and evaluation use. Always check the license terms on your current plan before using a figurine commercially.\",\"Q\":\"Can I use my figurine commercially?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"No experience is needed. You upload a photo and Meshy handles the modeling and texturing for you — no sculpting, no software. Upload, generate, preview, and download all happen in the browser, so you can iterate without any 3D tools.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience, and how long does it take?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo and watch Meshy turn it into a custom, printable 3D figurine.\",\"Button\":\"Create My Figurine\",\"FooterLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Looking for more 3D products?\",\"Title\":\"Make Your First 3D Figurine\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Meshy's AI turns any photo into a custom, multi-color 3D figurine — preview it in AR and download a model you can 3D-print at home.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003e3D Figurines\u003c/accent\u003e from Your Photo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From a single photo to a printable 3D figurine in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in any photo of a person, pet, or character. Meshy's AI builds a full-color 3D figurine from that single image automatically — no modeling skills, software, or prompt-writing needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for 3D conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading a photo to the Meshy figurine generator\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Rotate, zoom, and inspect your figurine in the browser. If a detail looks off, regenerate and iterate until the face, outfit, and pose match your photo.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and refine your 3D figurine\",\"Visual\":\"Previewing and refining a 3D figurine in the browser\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"See your figurine in AR, then export it as GLB, FBX, OBJ, or STL for Blender, your slicer, or any 3D tool — and 3D-print it at home.\",\"Title\":\"View it in AR and export in 4 formats\",\"Visual\":\"Viewing a 3D figurine in AR and exporting it in multiple formats\"},\"Title\":\"How to Make a 3D Figurine from a Photo\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Auto-rig and animate any 3D character in seconds.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation Generator\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate multi-view images optimized for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic PBR textures to any 3D model with AI.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a textured 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that builds your figurine powers games, animations, and 3D-printable models. Explore the rest of the toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"Generate print-ready 3D models for your home printer.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printer Files\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it and generate a 3D model from a text prompt.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom 3D figurine with Meshy. Generate a printable, multi-color figure, preview it in AR, then download. Free to start.\",\"OGDescription\":\"Generate a custom, multi-color 3D figurine from any photo. Preview it in AR and download to 3D-print at home.\",\"OGTitle\":\"AI Figurine Generator: Turn a Photo Into a 3D Figure\",\"Title\":\"AI Figurine Generator: Photo to 3D Figure | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Generate a custom, multi-color 3D figurine from any photo. Preview it in AR and download to 3D-print at home.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"AI Figurine Generator: Turn a Photo Into a 3D Figure\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy reads your photo and captures the real face, hair, outfit, and pose — not a generic, assemble-from-parts character.\",\"Title\":\"It actually looks like them\",\"Visual\":\"A photo being turned into a matching chibi-style 3D figurine\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Regenerate and refine as many times as you need, then print only once the figurine is exactly right.\",\"Title\":\"Iterate until you love it\",\"Visual\":\"Regenerating a 3D figurine to refine the result\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Every figurine comes fully textured in full color — face, hair, and clothing already applied. No gray model, no hand-painting.\",\"Title\":\"Full color out of the box\",\"Visual\":\"A fully textured, full-color 3D figurine\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most custom figurines are either pieced together in a character creator that never quite looks like the real person, or sculpted by a studio that takes weeks and costs a fortune. Meshy turns your photo into a finished, full-color 3D figurine — and hands you the file.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Figurines Are Different\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy AI Figurine Generator\"},\"Showcase\":{\"AltArcher\":\"A hand holding a pink-haired archer mini figurine, made with Meshy\",\"AltCat\":\"A 3D-printed cat figurine wearing headphones, made with Meshy\",\"AltDesk\":\"A custom 3D figurine of a boy on a desk, made with Meshy\",\"AltHero\":\"A hand holding a 3D-printed mini figurine of a Bernese Mountain Dog beside the real dog, made with Meshy\",\"AltKnight\":\"A custom 3D-printed knight figurine on a desk, made with Meshy\",\"AltPrinter\":\"A custom 3D figurine of a boy beside a 3D printer, made with Meshy\",\"AltShelf\":\"A chibi figurine of Vermeer's Girl with a Pearl Earring displayed on a shelf, made with Meshy\",\"Kicker\":\"Figurines created by Meshy creators from a single photo.\",\"Title\":\"Designs People Are Making\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"Delivery\":\"Shipping\",\"DeliveryValue\":\"Coming soon\",\"Formats\":\"Formats\",\"FormatsValue\":\"GLB · FBX · OBJ · STL\",\"Price\":\"Price\",\"PriceValue\":\"Free to start\",\"Print\":\"Print\",\"PrintValue\":\"At home\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"Jun 15, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a friend, partner, or pet photo into a one-of-a-kind figurine — a birthday, wedding, or holiday gift no store can sell.\",\"Title\":\"Personalized gifts\",\"Visual\":\"A custom figurine given as a personalized gift\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Bring an original character or a favorite look to life as a chibi collectible for your shelf or desk.\",\"Title\":\"Collectibles \u0026 fan art\",\"Visual\":\"A chibi collectible figurine on a shelf\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Generate custom minis for your campaign and 3D-print them at home in the size your game needs.\",\"Title\":\"Tabletop miniatures\",\"Visual\":\"Custom tabletop miniature figurines\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Make a small figurine of yourself or your team for a desk, studio, or office display.\",\"Title\":\"Desk \u0026 shelf decor\",\"Visual\":\"A small figurine used as desk decor\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: couple and family keepsakes, pet portraits, original-character collectibles, content-creator merch, and team mascots.\",\"Kicker\":\"One photo, many ways to use your 3D figurine.\",\"Title\":\"What You Can Make with Custom Figurines\"}},\"FridgeMagnet\":{\"ExploreCL\":{\"BrickDesc\":\"Turn your selfie into a custom brick figure.\",\"BrickTitle\":\"Brick Figure\",\"BrowseButton\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"CardAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"FigurineDesc\":\"Turn your photos into chibi-style collectible figures.\",\"FigurineTitle\":\"Chibi Figure\",\"KeychainDesc\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"KeychainTitle\":\"3D Keychain\",\"Kicker\":\"The Fridge Magnet is one of many ways to turn your photos into personal 3D art. Explore the rest of Creative Lab.\",\"LampDesc\":\"Turn any idea into a glowing 3D-printed lamp.\",\"LampTitle\":\"Lamp\",\"Title\":\"Part of Meshy Creative Lab\",\"TwistEggDesc\":\"Design and print your own Twist Egg.\",\"TwistEggTitle\":\"Twist Egg\",\"VinylDesc\":\"Turn your photos into big-head vinyl collectibles.\",\"VinylTitle\":\"Vinyl Figure\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Not a literal copy. Meshy reimagines it as stylized bas-relief art with a soft, painted look and a decorative frame. The subject and composition stay faithful, and you'll see every design in 3D before you decide.\",\"Q\":\"Will it look exactly like my photo?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"AI builds real relief depth (raised geometry), a tactile bas-relief you can feel, not a flat printed magnet.\",\"Q\":\"What makes it “3D”?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"4 by default, adjustable from 1 to 8, at 6 credits per design.\",\"Q\":\"How many designs do I get, and what does it cost?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Every design renders in full 3D in your browser to rotate and zoom.\",\"Q\":\"Can I see it before I decide?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Right now you can preview and download your design to bring it to life. We're rolling out print-and-ship for magnets soon.\",\"Q\":\"How do I get a physical magnet?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"No. Upload a photo and Meshy does the sculpting for you.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Your photos are only used to generate your designs. We don't sell them or use them for AI training.\",\"Q\":\"Is my photo private?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"You retain rights to use designs made from your own photos for personal purposes; see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e.\",\"Q\":\"Do I own what I create?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo, generate your bas-relief designs, and preview them live in 3D. From 6 credits per design.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"SecondaryLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Magnet?\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From a photo to a downloadable 3D bas-relief magnet in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo and pick how many designs to generate (4 by default, 1 to 8, 6 credits each), then start your design.\",\"Title\":\"Upload your photo\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading a photo to start a fridge magnet design\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy turns your photo into a set of framed bas-relief designs in a soft, hand-painted style.\",\"Title\":\"Generate your designs\",\"Visual\":\"A set of AI-generated bas-relief magnet designs\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Choose the design you like and generate a 3D preview. Rotate, zoom, and fine-tune the relief, then download it as a GLB.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and download\",\"Visual\":\"Previewing a 3D bas-relief magnet in the browser\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"Intro\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Designing\",\"Slogan\":\"Snap, stick, and feel your photos in 3D.\",\"Subhead\":\"Upload a photo and Meshy's AI turns it into a framed bas-relief magnet with real 3D depth. Generate a set of designs and preview them live in 3D.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Any Photo into a \u003caccent\u003e3D Bas-Relief Fridge Magnet\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom 3D bas-relief fridge magnet with AI. Generate up to 8 designs, preview them live in 3D, and bring your favorite to life.\",\"OGDescription\":\"AI turns your photo into a 3D bas-relief fridge magnet. Generate designs, preview in 3D, and bring your favorite to life.\",\"OGTitle\":\"Custom 3D Bas-Relief Fridge Magnets from Your Photos\",\"Title\":\"Custom 3D Fridge Magnets from Your Photos | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"AI turns your photo into a 3D bas-relief fridge magnet. Generate designs, preview in 3D, and bring your favorite to life.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Custom 3D Bas-Relief Fridge Magnets from Your Photos\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy Fridge Magnet Maker\"},\"SpecBar\":{\"Cost\":\"Cost\",\"CostValue\":\"6 credits each\",\"Designs\":\"Designs\",\"DesignsValue\":\"4 by default (1–8)\",\"Preview\":\"Preview\",\"PreviewValue\":\"Live 3D in browser\",\"Style\":\"Style\",\"StyleValue\":\"Hand-painted bas-relief\"},\"Toolkit\":{\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate images ready for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic textures to any 3D model.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI behind your magnet powers Meshy's full 3D suite.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it, generate it, and get 3D models from text prompts.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a favorite family photo into a framed bas-relief magnet for the fridge.\",\"Title\":\"Family photos, in 3D relief\",\"Visual\":\"Family photo turned into a 3D relief fridge magnet\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Capture your pet's markings and character as raised, hand-painted relief art.\",\"Title\":\"Pet portraits\",\"Visual\":\"Pet portrait as a 3D bas-relief magnet\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Save-the-dates, wedding favors, and new-baby announcements people actually keep.\",\"Title\":\"Weddings \u0026 baby keepsakes\",\"Visual\":\"Wedding and baby keepsake magnets\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Reimagine a trip snapshot or your kid's drawing as 3D relief.\",\"Title\":\"Travel memories \u0026 kids' artwork\",\"Visual\":\"Travel photo and kids' drawing as 3D relief magnets\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: fan art, small-business and event keepsakes, and team mascots.\",\"Kicker\":\"A personal piece of 3D art to keep or gift.\",\"Title\":\"What People Make with Them\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"AI builds real, raised depth, so the subject rises off the surface and you can feel it.\",\"Title\":\"True 3D relief, not a flat print\",\"Visual\":\"Close-up of raised 3D relief on a fridge magnet\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"A soft, painterly look with a carved decorative frame and a matte finish. It's a keepsake artwork, not a literal printout.\",\"Title\":\"Reimagined as hand-painted art\",\"Visual\":\"Hand-painted bas-relief magnet with a decorative frame\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"One generation gives you up to 8 designs to compare, so you can pick the one that feels right.\",\"Title\":\"A whole set, every time\",\"Visual\":\"Multiple magnet design variations to compare\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"No ZBrush, no manual depth work, no 3D experience. Meshy generates the relief for you.\",\"Title\":\"AI does the sculpting\",\"Visual\":\"AI generating 3D relief from a photo\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most photo magnets are flat prints, and real relief art normally takes sculpting software and hours of work. Meshy turns one photo into true, feelable 3D relief, automatically.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Magnets Are Different\"}},\"Keycap\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Keycap\":\"Keycap\"},\"ExploreCL\":{\"BrickDesc\":\"Turn your selfie into a custom brick figure.\",\"BrickTitle\":\"Brick Figure\",\"BrowseButton\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"CardAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"FigurineDesc\":\"Turn your photos into chibi-style collectible figures.\",\"FigurineTitle\":\"Chibi Figure\",\"FridgeMagnetDesc\":\"Snap, stick, and feel your photos in 3D.\",\"FridgeMagnetTitle\":\"3D Fridge Magnet\",\"KeychainDesc\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"KeychainTitle\":\"3D Keychain\",\"Kicker\":\"The Keycap is one of many ways to turn your ideas into 3D you can make. Explore the rest of Creative Lab.\",\"LampDesc\":\"Turn any idea into a glowing 3D-printed lamp.\",\"LampTitle\":\"Lamp\",\"Title\":\"Part of Meshy Creative Lab\",\"TwistEggDesc\":\"Design and print your own Twist Egg.\",\"TwistEggTitle\":\"Twist Egg\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Meshy's keycap maker is an AI tool that turns any image into a set of custom keycap designs you can preview and download.\",\"Q\":\"What is Meshy's keycap maker?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Upload an image, choose how many designs to generate, and start your design. Meshy creates a set of keycap designs from your photo in about a minute.\",\"Q\":\"How do I make a custom keycap design from a photo?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Upload an anime or game character, a pet photo, a logo, an emoji, or any image, and Meshy designs a keycap from it.\",\"Q\":\"Can I make an anime, character, or pet keycap?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Each keycap design downloads as a PNG image.\",\"Q\":\"What file do I get, and in what format?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"4 designs by default, adjustable from 1 to 8, at 6 credits each.\",\"Q\":\"How many keycap designs do I get, and what does it cost?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"About a minute.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take to generate a keycap design?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"No. There's no software to install and no design skills needed. Just upload an image and Meshy designs the keycap for you.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need design or 3D modeling skills?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"A clear image with a single, well-defined subject works best, and a simple background helps Meshy focus on it.\",\"Q\":\"What kind of image works best?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Meshy does not use your uploaded content for model training. Your image is used only to process your generation, never kept as training data. You keep full ownership of both your inputs and outputs; see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e.\",\"Q\":\"Is my image private, and do I own the keycap designs I create?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload an image, generate a set of keycap designs, and download your favorites. From 6 credits per design.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"SecondaryLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Keycap?\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From an image to a set of keycap designs in two steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Upload an image and pick how many designs to generate (4 by default, 1 to 8, 6 credits each), then start your design.\",\"Title\":\"Upload Your Image\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading an image in the Meshy keycap designer\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy generates your keycap designs in about a minute. Preview them and download your favorites as PNG.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and Download\",\"Visual\":\"Previewing and downloading generated keycap designs\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"Intro\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Designing\",\"Slogan\":\"3D art at your fingertips.\",\"Subhead\":\"Upload an image and Meshy designs a set of custom keycaps from it. Preview the designs and download your favorites as PNG.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Any Image into a \u003caccent\u003eCustom Keycap\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom keycap design with Meshy. Generate keycap designs from a pet, character, or logo, then download them as PNG. Free to start.\",\"Title\":\"Custom Keycap Maker: Design Keycaps from a Photo | Meshy\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy Keycap Maker\"},\"SpecBar\":{\"Cost\":\"Cost\",\"CostValue\":\"6 credits each\",\"Designs\":\"Designs\",\"DesignsValue\":\"4 by default (1–8)\",\"Input\":\"Input\",\"InputValue\":\"Image\",\"Time\":\"Time\",\"TimeValue\":\"~1 min\"},\"Toolkit\":{\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate images ready for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic textures to any 3D model.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI behind your keycap powers Meshy's full 3D suite.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it, generate it, and get 3D models from text prompts.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Cats, dogs, and other companions.\",\"Title\":\"Pets\",\"Visual\":\"Pet keycap designs\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Your favorite characters and fandoms.\",\"Title\":\"Anime and Game Characters\",\"Visual\":\"Anime and game character keycap designs\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Brand marks, symbols, and simple graphics.\",\"Title\":\"Logos and Icons\",\"Visual\":\"Logo and icon keycap designs\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Anything you can drop in as an image.\",\"Title\":\"Emoji, Memes, and More\",\"Visual\":\"Emoji and meme keycap designs\"},\"Kicker\":\"Bring any kind of image and make it a keycap.\",\"Title\":\"What Can Be Designed with It\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a pet, a character, or a logo into a custom keycap design.\",\"Title\":\"From Any Image\",\"Visual\":\"A pet photo turned into a custom keycap design\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Generate up to 8 designs at once and keep the ones you like.\",\"Title\":\"A Whole Set to Choose From\",\"Visual\":\"A set of generated keycap designs to choose from\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Just upload an image and Meshy designs the keycap for you.\",\"Title\":\"No Design Skills Needed\",\"Visual\":\"An image upload that needs no manual design work\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Your image comes back as a clean keycap design with real depth and shading, not a flat sticker.\",\"Title\":\"A Polished, Dimensional Design\",\"Visual\":\"A keycap design with real depth and shading\"},\"Kicker\":\"Custom keycap designs from anything you can picture.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Keycaps Are Different\"}},\"Keychain\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"Keychain\":\"3D Keychain\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"We use industrial-grade Color Jet Printing (CJP) — full-color inkjet 3D printing on a sandstone composite. This is the same technology used by professional product studios and miniature makers, not the FDM filament printers you might have at home. Color is printed directly into the material, so what you see in the AI preview is what ships.\",\"Q\":\"How is it 3D printed?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"No. Upload a photo — Meshy's AI generates the 3D model, our pipeline prepares it for industrial printing, and our partners ship the finished product. No Blender, no STL files, no slicer settings.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience?\"},\"Q11\":{\"A\":\"Meshy generates the 3D model from your photo; trusted industrial 3D print partners handle production. We work with partners who specialize in CJP full-color printing and have shipped finished pieces for D\u0026D miniature campaigns and design studio runs.\",\"Q\":\"Who actually prints these?\"},\"Q12\":{\"A\":\"You retain rights to the 3D models you generate from your own photos, subject to Meshy's Terms of Service. Models generated from copyrighted source material (e.g. someone else's character or photo) carry the same copyright restrictions as the original — you can print one for personal use, but commercial resale of likeness-based or fan-art products may infringe.\",\"Q\":\"Do I own the model I create?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"About 2–3 weeks end-to-end. That breaks down as 7–10 business days for AI generation + industrial CJP printing + quality inspection at our print partner, plus another 7–12 business days for shipping. You'll receive a tracking number when your order ships.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take to receive my order?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"We currently ship to 24 countries: the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, South Korea, France, Turkey, Brazil, Canada, Italy, Japan, Spain, Australia, Poland, Mexico, China, Netherlands, Switzerland, Ukraine, Israel, Sweden, Hong Kong, Belgium, Czech Republic, and Austria. Other regions are not yet supported — if your shipping address is outside these countries, the checkout page will let you know before payment. We're working to expand coverage; follow @meshy_ai for launch updates.\",\"Q\":\"Where do you ship?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Yes. The 3D preview you see in the design tool above is what we print — the same model, the same colors. There's no separate \\\"we'll send you a sketch first\\\" step that adds days. Rotate it, zoom in, regenerate if you want a different look. When it's right, place the order.\",\"Q\":\"Can I see what it looks like before you print it?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Use the design tool's regenerate option to try different AI passes before checkout — preview is free. Once printed, every piece goes through visual inspection at the print partner before shipping. If the finished keychain doesn't match the preview you approved, contact support@meshy.ai with photos within 14 days and we'll work it out.\",\"Q\":\"What if the keychain doesn't look like my photo?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Keychains start at $39 USD per piece. All keychains print at a fixed 2 inch (50 mm) size during the beta — final price is shown at checkout based on color coverage and the complexity of your specific design.\",\"Q\":\"How much does a keychain cost?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"All keychains print at a fixed 2 inch (50 mm) size — sized to sit comfortably on a keyring, lanyard, or bag zipper. Custom sizing isn't offered during the beta.\",\"Q\":\"How big is the keychain?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Each keychain is generated separately, so a couple keychain (two figures together) and a set of matching keychains (one each for a couple, family, or friend group) both work. During the beta, orders are placed one keychain at a time — there's no shopping cart yet. For bulk orders (10+), email support@meshy.ai for volume pricing.\",\"Q\":\"Can I order a matching pair or a set?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Your photos are used only to generate your 3D model and produce your order. We don't share, sell, or use uploaded photos for marketing or AI training. Once your order ships, the source photo is retained only as long as needed for warranty/remake claims, then deleted in line with Meshy's privacy policy.\",\"Q\":\"Is my photo private? Who can see what I upload?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo, refine the 3D preview, and we'll print and ship it. Shipped in about 2–3 weeks. Starts at $39.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"FooterLink\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Want to see other Creative Lab products?\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Keychain?\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Made from your photo by Meshy's AI, printed in full color by industrial-grade CJP 3D printers, and shipped to your door in about 2–3 weeks. Available now in 24 countries across North America, South America, Europe, Asia, and Oceania.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003e3D Printed Keychain\u003c/accent\u003e from Your Photo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From your photo to a finished, full-color keychain in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in any photo — a person, pet, logo, or meme. Meshy's AI generates a full-color 3D model from a single image in about a minute, no 3D modeling experience or software required.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for 3D conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Meshy upload screen with a sample photo of a corgi and a Start Design button\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Rotate, zoom, and inspect the model directly in your browser. Each regeneration uses generation credits, so you can iterate until the model matches your photo. Every keychain prints at a fixed 2 inch (50 mm) size for consistent quality.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and refine your 3D model\",\"Visual\":\"Meshy design step on a desktop showing four 3D keychain previews and finish, color, and quantity controls\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Your model is produced by a trusted print partner on industrial-grade CJP (ColorJet) printers — not desktop FDM — then cured, sealed, and inspected before shipping. Production takes 7–10 business days, and shipping adds another 7–12 business days, so plan on about 2–3 weeks end-to-end for a finished, full-color, color-locked piece.\",\"Title\":\"Industrial 3D printing, delivered to your door\",\"Visual\":\"Industrial color 3D printer producing a finished corgi keychain alongside a packaged keychain handoff\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Rig and animate your 3D models — useful for the same characters you turn into keychains.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate the source photo from text first, then drop it into the keychain designer.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add full-color texturing to existing 3D models you didn't create in Meshy.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"The underlying AI that turns your photo into the 3D keychain model.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that designs your keychain is what creators use to build games, animations, and 3D-printable models. Explore the rest of the toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"{label} — Meshy AI feature\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"How Meshy generates print-ready meshes for any 3D printer, not just our partners.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printing workflow\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Start from a text prompt instead of an image — same workflow, different input.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom 3D printed keychain. Designed by AI, printed in full color by industrial CJP partners, shipped in about 2–3 weeks. From $39.\",\"OGDescription\":\"AI-designed, industrially CJP-printed in full color. From $39. Ships in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"OGImageAlt\":\"Custom 3D printed keychain designed with Meshy AI, printed in full color\",\"OGTitle\":\"Custom 3D Printed Keychains from Your Photo\",\"Title\":\"Custom 3D Printed Keychains from Your Photo | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Photo → AI 3D model → industrial CJP keychain. From $39, ships in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"TwitterImageAlt\":\"Custom 3D printed keychain designed with Meshy AI\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Custom 3D Printed Keychains from Your Photo\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Industrial CJP printers reproduce millions of colors directly into the material — no painting, no decals, no color drift. What you see in the AI preview is what arrives at your door, accurate down to subtle skin tones, fabric textures, and gradients.\",\"Title\":\"Full color, photo-accurate\",\"Visual\":\"Side-by-side comparison of a Meshy full-color portrait keychain and a flat single-color version\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Each piece arrives finished and ready to use. No supports to remove, no resin to cure, no paint to apply. The print itself is the product. This is the difference between consumer-grade FDM and industrial CJP.\",\"Title\":\"No assembly, no painting, no post-processing\",\"Visual\":\"Two portrait keychains in a black gift box — one full-color from Meshy and one single-color marked out\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"CJP starts as composite sandstone, then is sealed with a polymer infiltrant that locks in color and rigidity. Don't confuse \\\"sandstone\\\" with fragile — that's the raw substrate, not the finished product. The cured keychain handles being clipped to keys, dropped on floors, and bouncing in bags. Fine details that consumer FDM printers miss — facial features, fabric weave, individual hairs — print sharply and stay sharp.\",\"Title\":\"Built for everyday carry, not just display\",\"Visual\":\"A full-color portrait keychain on a desktop alongside sunglasses, a wallet, and a watch\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Production runs on industrial 3D printers operated by trusted print partners — the same partners who print models for D\u0026D miniature campaigns and design studios. Meshy generates the model; our print partners make sure each piece ships at production quality.\",\"Title\":\"Made by experienced print partners\",\"Visual\":\"Gloved hands at an industrial color 3D printer holding several finished portrait keychains\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most \\\"3D printed\\\" keychains you'll find are FDM filament — single-color, layer lines visible, fragile in detail. Meshy keychains are made on industrial-grade Color Jet Printing (CJP) machines, the same technology professional product studios use. The difference is visible.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Keychains Are Different\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Alt\":\"Custom 3D printed keychain by Meshy AI, full-color CJP printing — {subject}\",\"Kicker\":\"Real keychains from the Meshy community — printed in full color on industrial-grade CJP.\",\"SubjectCat\":\"cat portrait\",\"SubjectCats\":\"two cats together\",\"SubjectDog\":\"dog portrait\",\"SubjectRabbit\":\"rabbit portrait\",\"SubjectSelfWithPet\":\"self-portrait with pet\",\"SubjectShiba\":\"Shiba Inu portrait\",\"SubjectSleepingCat\":\"sleeping cat portrait\",\"SubjectTabbyCat\":\"tabby cat portrait\",\"Title\":\"Designs People Are Making\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"From\":\"From\",\"FromValue\":\"$$39\",\"Production\":\"Delivery\",\"ProductionValue\":\"2–3 weeks\",\"Shipping\":\"Ships to\",\"ShippingValue\":\"24 countries\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"June 12, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Carry the two of you wherever you go. A \\\"Mini-Me\\\" couple keychain works as an engagement gift, a wedding favor, or an anniversary keepsake. The full-color print captures both faces in one piece — no photo holder, no fading.\",\"Title\":\"Couples and anniversaries\",\"Visual\":\"Two hands holding matching couple-portrait keychains in warm bokeh light\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Honor a pet by carrying their face with you. Photo-accurate full-color CJP printing captures the markings, eye color, and fur texture that generic pet jewelry can't. Works for living pets too — a tribute to a cat, dog, rabbit, or bird, sized to fit on a key ring or backpack zipper.\",\"Title\":\"Pet memorials and pet portraits\",\"Visual\":\"A hand holding a Shiba Inu portrait keychain next to the real Shiba Inu dog\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"A photo of mom from 30 years ago. A favorite picture of grandpa. A childhood pet that the recipient still talks about. Occasion gifting is where custom 3D keychains shine — small enough to mail in a card-sized envelope, personal enough that the receiver actually keeps it.\",\"Title\":\"Mother's, Father's, and birthday gifts\",\"Visual\":\"A family-portrait keychain presented in a gift box with flowers and decorative paper\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"A figurine of yourself, your kid's first soccer game pose, your D\u0026D character — Meshy's AI works from any photo, including stylized ones. Carry yourself or your favorite character on your keys. (For copyright-protected characters, see the FAQ on commercial use.)\",\"Title\":\"Mini-Me and self-portraits\",\"Visual\":\"A portrait keychain clipped to a beige backpack strap outdoors\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: brand merchandise and event giveaways, fan-art keychains, convention swag, and team mascots.\",\"Kicker\":\"Custom keychains aren't just an accessory — they're a way to carry something specific. Here's what people are actually making with Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"What People Make with Them\"}},\"Lamp\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Lamp\":\"Lamp\"},\"ExploreCL\":{\"BrickDesc\":\"Turn your selfie into a custom brick figure.\",\"BrickTitle\":\"Brick Figure\",\"BrowseButton\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"CardAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"FidgetPixelDesc\":\"Turn your images into pixel art fidget toys for 3D printing.\",\"FidgetPixelTitle\":\"Fidget: Pixel\",\"FigurineDesc\":\"Turn your photos into chibi-style collectible figures.\",\"FigurineTitle\":\"Chibi Figure\",\"FridgeMagnetDesc\":\"Snap, stick, and feel your photos in 3D.\",\"FridgeMagnetTitle\":\"3D Fridge Magnet\",\"KeychainDesc\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"KeychainTitle\":\"3D Keychain\",\"Kicker\":\"The Lamp is one of many ways to turn your ideas into 3D you can make. Explore the rest of Creative Lab.\",\"Title\":\"Part of Meshy Creative Lab\",\"TwistEggDesc\":\"Design and print your own Twist Egg.\",\"TwistEggTitle\":\"Twist Egg\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Pick a light source and Meshy cuts an opening sized to fit it (for example, the Bambu Lab Lamp Kit MH001). After printing, add the light and switch it on. Prefer just the shape? Choose No Light Source for a pure shell.\",\"Q\":\"Does it actually light up?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"The shade is printed in PLA, so use only LED bulbs rated 5W or less. Do not use incandescent, halogen, or high-wattage bulbs, as excessive heat can deform the shade or create a fire hazard.\",\"Q\":\"What light should I use?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"A print-ready STL with the lamp shade and a base. Print both and assemble them as shown.\",\"Q\":\"What files do I get?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"You print the STL on your own 3D printer, or use any online print service.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need a 3D printer?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"No. Start from text, an image, or your own model, and Meshy shapes it, hollows it, and prepares it for printing.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Yes. You can adjust the wall thickness and surface settings in your browser before you export.\",\"Q\":\"Can I change the wall thickness?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Generating a lamp takes about a minute and uses 30 credits.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take, and what does it cost?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Meshy does not use your uploaded content for model training. Your input is used only to process your generation, never kept as training data. You keep full ownership of both your inputs and outputs; see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e.\",\"Q\":\"Is my input private, and do I own what I create?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Start from text, an image, or your own model, then download a print-ready STL. Starts at 30 credits.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"SecondaryLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Lamp?\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From an idea to a lamp you can print in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Upload an image, or bring your own 3D model, then pick a style (Character or Landscape). Or start from a sample. Hit Start Design and Meshy generates your shape in about a minute.\",\"Title\":\"Start from an image, or your own model\",\"Visual\":\"Starting a lamp design from an image or 3D model\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"It hollows your shape into an even-walled shade that light shines through, cuts an opening for your light source, and adds a base. Adjust the wall thickness, then process to preview your lamp glowing, right in your browser.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy makes it a printable shade\",\"Visual\":\"Meshy hollowing a shape into a printable lamp shade\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Export a print-ready STL, 3D print your lamp at home, add a light, and switch it on.\",\"Title\":\"Download and 3D print\",\"Visual\":\"Downloading and 3D printing a finished lamp\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"Intro\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Designing\",\"Subhead\":\"Start from text, an image, or your own 3D model. Meshy turns it into a hollow, even-walled lamp shade with a base and a fitting for a real lamp kit, then exports a print-ready STL you can 3D print at home.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Any Idea into a \u003caccent\u003eGlowing 3D Printable Lamp\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn text, a photo, or your own model into a glowing 3D printed lamp. Get an even-walled shade with a fitting, then download the STL to print at home.\",\"Title\":\"Custom 3D Printed Lamp Maker: Photo or Text | Meshy\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy Lamp Maker\"},\"SeeItLightUp\":{\"Lit\":\"Lit\",\"Sub\":\"Drag to see your lamp go from print to glow.\",\"Title\":\"See It Light Up\",\"Unlit\":\"Unlit\"},\"SpecBar\":{\"Generate\":\"Generate\",\"GenerateValue\":\"~1 min · 30 credits\",\"Input\":\"Input\",\"InputValue\":\"Text / image / 3D model\",\"LightSource\":\"Light source\",\"LightSourceValue\":\"Fits a lamp kit (optional)\",\"Output\":\"Output\",\"OutputValue\":\"STL (shade + base)\"},\"Toolkit\":{\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate images ready for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic textures to any 3D model.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI behind your lamp powers Meshy's full 3D suite.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it, generate it, and get 3D models from text prompts.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Soft, glowing light for a bedroom, shelf, or reading nook.\",\"Title\":\"Ambient and mood lighting\",\"Visual\":\"Ambient mood lighting from a 3D-printed lamp\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a favorite character or a kid's drawing into a gentle night light.\",\"Title\":\"Night lights\",\"Visual\":\"A night light made from a 3D-printed lamp\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"A lamp shaped like a pet, a place, or an inside joke.\",\"Title\":\"Personalized gifts and decor\",\"Visual\":\"A personalized gift lamp shaped like a pet\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Holidays, fandoms, game and movie themes, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Themed and seasonal lamps\",\"Visual\":\"A themed seasonal 3D-printed lamp\"},\"Kicker\":\"Custom light for any corner.\",\"Title\":\"What People Make with Them\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Turn a character, a pet, a logo, or a scene into a lamp that's yours alone, not another generic shade.\",\"Title\":\"A one-of-a-kind lamp\",\"Visual\":\"A unique custom 3D-printed lamp\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy hollows your shape into an even-walled shade, so light shines through smoothly with no thin spots or broken surfaces.\",\"Title\":\"Even walls, made to glow\",\"Visual\":\"Close-up of an even-walled lamp shade glowing\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Hollowing a shape into a printable shade usually means manual work in Blender. Meshy does it for you and fixes the model for printing automatically.\",\"Title\":\"Print-ready, no modeling\",\"Visual\":\"Print-ready lamp shade and base without manual modeling\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Begin from text, an image, or your own 3D model, and watch it become a lamp.\",\"Title\":\"Three ways to start\",\"Visual\":\"Starting a lamp from text, image, or 3D model\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most AI tools give you a shape. Meshy gives you a lamp you can print and actually light up.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Lamps Are Different\"}},\"PetKeychain\":{\"Assurance\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Every keychain is custom-made from your photo, never a template. Most orders arrive in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"Title\":\"Made to order\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Right now, tracked shipping is free — with no surprise fees at checkout.\",\"BodyNoPromo\":\"Tracked, insured shipping — with no surprise fees at checkout.\",\"Title\":\"Limited-time free shipping\",\"TitleNoPromo\":\"Tracked shipping\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"If it arrives damaged or doesn't match the design you approved, we'll send a free replacement — no return needed.\",\"Title\":\"Quality guarantee\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Questions about your preview or order? Email \u003cmail\u003ecreative-lab-support@meshy.ai\u003c/mail\u003e with your order number and we'll take a look.\",\"Title\":\"Here to help\"},\"Kicker\":\"No surprises. Here's exactly what happens after you hit order.\",\"Title\":\"Made to order — and backed by us.\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"Home\":\"Home\",\"Keychain\":\"Keychain\",\"Pet\":\"Pet\"},\"Everyday\":{\"Body\":\"Clipped to your keys, your bag, your everyday carry — a little piece of them you'll catch yourself smiling at on the worst Mondays.\",\"MemorialEyebrow\":\"In loving memory\",\"MemorialText\":\"Some friends never really leave. Keep them close, wherever the day takes you.\",\"Scene1Alt\":\"Custom pet keychain clipped to a set of keys\",\"Scene2Alt\":\"Custom pet keychain on a bag strap\",\"Scene3Alt\":\"Custom pet keychain held next to the real pet\",\"Scene4Alt\":\"Custom pet keychain in everyday use\",\"Title\":\"They go where you go.\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"A clear, well-lit photo where we can see their face. One pet facing the camera is ideal — but if you're not sure, send it over and we'll help.\",\"Q\":\"What kind of photo works best?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"Not at all. Upload one photo and our AI does the 3D work — no apps, no software, no 3D know-how needed.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need any design skills?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"About 2–3 weeks end-to-end — 7–10 business days to make it, then another 7–12 to ship. You'll get tracking as soon as it's on the way.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Because each keychain is custom-made, we can't take change-of-mind returns once production starts — but you approve a 3D preview first, so there are no surprises. If it arrives damaged or doesn't match your approved design, email creative-lab-support@meshy.ai within 7 days with your order number and we'll send a free replacement — no return needed.\",\"Q\":\"Can I return it?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Yes to all of the above. Upload your photo and we'll take it from there.\",\"Q\":\"Can you do cats, rabbits, multiple pets, or me and my pet?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"That's the whole point. You'll see a 3D preview and approve it before we make a thing — if it's not them, we fix it.\",\"Q\":\"Will it really look like my pet?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Each one is printed in full color on industrial CJP printers — the professional kind, not a home 3D printer — then sealed and inspected. What you approve in the 3D preview is exactly what lands on your keys.\",\"Q\":\"Is it durable — and how's it made?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"About 2 inches (50 mm) — just right for your keys, a bag, or a lanyard.\",\"Q\":\"How big is it?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"We currently ship to 9 countries: the US, Canada, Brazil, China, Japan, Germany, France, Italy, and Spain. If your address is somewhere else, checkout will let you know before you pay.\",\"Q\":\"Where do you ship?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Yes. We only use your photo to make your keychain — never for ads or AI training, and we never share or sell it. After it ships we keep the photo just long enough for any remake, then delete it.\",\"Q\":\"Is my photo private?\"},\"Title\":\"Good questions, honest answers.\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Brand\":\"Meshy Makes — custom keepsakes, made by Meshy.\",\"Button\":\"Upload your pet's photo\",\"Guarantee1\":\"100% happy guarantee\",\"Guarantee2\":\"See a 3D preview before you buy\",\"Guarantee3\":\"Free shipping over $60\",\"Title\":\"Ready to take them everywhere?\"},\"Gifting\":{\"Body\":\"For the friend who won't stop talking about their dog. For the new pet parent. For someone holding on to a companion they'll always remember.\",\"Chip1\":\"Birthdays\",\"Chip2\":\"Gotcha days\",\"Chip3\":\"Holidays\",\"Chip4\":\"In loving memory\",\"Cta\":\"Make their gift\",\"GiftCard\":\"Don't have a photo of their pet? Send a gift card and let them choose the one.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"A gift-wrapped custom pet keychain with a handwritten card\",\"PerfectForLabel\":\"Perfect for\",\"Reassurance\":\"Surprising someone? Upload their pet's photo and you approve the 3D preview — so the surprise is always a good one.\",\"Title\":\"The gift that says, \\\"I know how much they mean to you.\\\"\"},\"Hero\":{\"CostLabel\":\"Cost\",\"FreeShippingBadge\":\"Limited-time free shipping\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Full-color custom keychain of a dog, shown next to the real pet\",\"NamePlaceholder\":\"Your pet's name\",\"PriceChip\":\"See a 3D preview before you buy\",\"PriceTag\":\"From $39\",\"StartDesign\":\"Start design\",\"Subhead\":\"Turn one photo into a full-color keychain that's unmistakably them — every marking, every expression.\",\"Title\":\"Your best friend, everywhere you go.\",\"UploadCta\":\"Upload your pet's photo\",\"UploadRequiredToast\":\"Please upload a pet photo first\"},\"History\":{\"Helper\":\"Pick up a past design or reorder in one tap.\",\"ThumbAlt\":\"Your past pet keychain design\",\"Title\":\"Your recent creations\",\"ViewAll\":\"View all →\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Callout\":\"We only start once you say yes — you approve a 3D preview before we make anything.\",\"Hook\":\"Every single one is different — because your pet is one of a kind.\",\"Kicker\":\"Here's exactly how it works — and exactly how it'll turn out.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"A clear shot of their face is all we need.\",\"Title\":\"Upload one photo\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"We turn your photo into 4 designs — choose the one that looks most like them.\",\"Title\":\"Pick your favorite\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Spin it, check every angle. We only start making it once you say yes.\",\"Title\":\"Approve your preview\"},\"Step4\":{\"Body\":\"Full color, made to order, on your keys in ~2–3 weeks.\",\"Title\":\"Unbox the real thing\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"Watch your photo become them.\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your pet's photo into a full-color keychain that's unmistakably them. See a 3D preview before you buy. Made to order, ships in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"OgDescription\":\"Turn one photo into a full-color keychain that's unmistakably them. Preview in 3D before you buy.\",\"OgImageAlt\":\"Full-color custom keychain of a tan corgi, shown next to the real dog\",\"OgTitle\":\"Your best friend, on your keys — a full-color keychain from one photo\",\"Title\":\"Custom Pet Photo Keychain — Full-Color, Made From Your Photo | Meshy Makes\"},\"Reviews\":{\"Heading\":\"From our first customers\",\"Kicker\":\"Real photos and stories from the early pet parents who tried Meshy Makes.\",\"Note\":\"Sample reviews shown for layout — replace with real verified reviews before launch.\",\"Review1\":{\"Author\":\"Chloe — a gift for a grieving friend\",\"ImageAlt\":\"A fluffy white rabbit beside its custom photo keychain\",\"Quote\":\"My best friend had just lost her rabbit. The moment I saw these, I ordered one — so she'd always have a way to keep him close.\"},\"Review2\":{\"Author\":\"Shimin \u0026 her cat\",\"ImageAlt\":\"A white cat beside its custom photo keychain\",\"Quote\":\"It's her, right down to the little markings. Now she rides on my keys everywhere I go.\"},\"Review3\":{\"Author\":\"Vera \u0026 her dog\",\"ImageAlt\":\"A dog beside its custom photo keychain\",\"Quote\":\"The detail floored me — it really looks like him. Feels like he's with me all day, even when he's home.\"}},\"Sticky\":{\"Cta\":\"Upload your pet's photo\",\"Price\":\"From $39\",\"Sub\":\"See it in 3D before you buy\"},\"WhatYouGet\":{\"Body\":\"Real photos, no renders. Full color printed right into the material so it won't fade, made on Meshy's own engine — see the finish and the palm-size in your hand, in packaging that's ready to gift.\",\"Detail1Alt\":\"A cat beside its custom photo keychain\",\"Detail2Alt\":\"A dog with its custom photo keychain held in hand\",\"ProductAlt\":\"Custom full-color pet keychain held in hand for scale\",\"Title\":\"What actually lands on your doorstep.\"}},\"SoccerKeychain\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"SoccerKeychain\":\"Soccer Keychain\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"A clear front-facing shot works best — a player portrait, a close-up of a club crest, a jersey with a name and number, or a youth league team photo. Avoid dark backgrounds or motion blur. Meshy's AI handles the 3D conversion automatically; the cleaner the photo, the sharper the result. Shot at a local match, a youth tournament, or a summer league game? Those work great too.\",\"Q\":\"What's the best photo to use for a soccer keychain?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Yes — as long as you own or have rights to the image you upload. Personal photos, fan portraits you took yourself, or original art you created are all fair game. We don't reproduce third-party trademarked logos or official club badges without authorization, so use your own photos rather than pulling images from official sources.\",\"Q\":\"Can I make a keychain of my favorite player or club crest?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"It depends on timing. Production takes 7–10 business days, and shipping to supported countries adds another 7–12 business days — about 2–3 weeks total. If you're ordering as a gift for a specific match or end-of-season occasion, build in that lead time. The 25% off promotion runs through July 20, so there's still a window to order in time.\",\"Q\":\"Is this a good last-minute soccer season gift?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Free shipping during the 6/10–7/20 promotion applies to: the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, South Korea, France, Turkey, Brazil, Canada, Italy, Japan, Spain, Australia, Poland, Mexico, China, Netherlands, Switzerland, Ukraine, Israel, Sweden, Hong Kong, Belgium, Czech Republic, and Austria. If your country isn't on the list, this offer isn't available in your region yet.\",\"Q\":\"Which countries does free shipping apply to?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Keychains are produced on industrial CJP (ColorJet Printing) machines — the same technology used by professional product studios. The substrate is a composite sandstone material, sealed with a polymer infiltrant that locks in color and structural rigidity. This is not desktop FDM printing. Detail quality — facial features, shirt numbers, crest emblems — is significantly higher.\",\"Q\":\"What material is the keychain made from?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Each keychain prints at 2 inches (50 mm). That's large enough to show fine detail clearly, and small enough to carry on a set of keys without bulk.\",\"Q\":\"How big is the keychain?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Upload a photo → Meshy's AI generates a full-color 3D model in about a minute → preview and approve → place your order → production (7–10 business days) → shipping (7–12 business days). The whole design-to-order step takes under five minutes.\",\"Q\":\"What does the process look like, start to finish?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Each is produced individually, so you can order the same design multiple times — useful for team gifts or group orders where everyone chips in for a coach gift.\",\"Q\":\"Can I order multiple keychains from the same photo?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo, refine the 3D preview, and we'll print and ship it. Shipped in about 2–3 weeks. Starts at $29 during the soccer-season offer.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"FooterLink\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Want to see other Creative Lab products?\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Soccer Keychain?\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Turn any photo into a full-color 3D keychain — a soccer player, club badge, or fan portrait. AI-designed, industrially printed, and shipped to your door. The perfect gift for the fan who has everything.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003e3D Printed Soccer Keychain\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From your photo to a finished, full-color keychain — in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in any photo — a player portrait, club logo, jersey number, or fan selfie. Meshy's AI generates a full-color 3D model in about a minute. No design skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for 3D conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Meshy upload screen with a sample soccer photo and a Start Design button\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Rotate, zoom, and inspect the model in your browser. Regenerate until it matches your vision. Every keychain prints at 2 inches (50 mm) for consistent, detailed quality.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and refine your 3D model\",\"Visual\":\"Meshy design step showing 3D soccer keychain previews with color and quantity controls\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Your model goes to trusted industrial-grade CJP print partners — the same technology used by professional studios. Cured, sealed, inspected, then shipped. Allow about 2–3 weeks from order to delivery.\",\"Title\":\"Industrial 3D printing, delivered to your door\",\"Visual\":\"Industrial color 3D printer producing a finished soccer keychain alongside a packaged handoff\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Rig and animate your 3D models — useful for the same characters you turn into keychains.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate the source photo from text first, then drop it into the keychain designer.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add full-color texturing to existing 3D models you didn't create in Meshy.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"The underlying AI that turns your photo into the 3D keychain model.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that designs your soccer keychain is what creators use to build games, animations, and 3D-printable models. Explore the rest of the toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"{label} — Meshy AI feature\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"How Meshy generates print-ready meshes for any 3D printer, not just our partners.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printing workflow\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Start from a text prompt instead of an image — same workflow, different input.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom 3D printed soccer keychain — player, club badge, or fan portrait. AI-designed, industrially CJP-printed in full color, shipped in about 2–3 weeks. From $29.\",\"OGDescription\":\"AI-designed, industrially CJP-printed in full color. From $29. Ships in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"OGImageAlt\":\"Custom 3D printed soccer keychain designed with Meshy AI, printed in full color\",\"OGTitle\":\"Custom 3D Printed Soccer Keychains from Your Photo\",\"Title\":\"Custom 3D Printed Soccer Keychain from Your Photo | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Photo → AI 3D model → industrial CJP soccer keychain. From $29, ships in about 2–3 weeks.\",\"TwitterImageAlt\":\"Custom 3D printed soccer keychain designed with Meshy AI\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"Custom 3D Printed Soccer Keychains from Your Photo\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Industrial CJP printers reproduce millions of colors directly into the material — no painting, no decals. The badge, the kit, the face: what you see in preview is what arrives at the door.\",\"Title\":\"Full color, true to the original\",\"Visual\":\"Side-by-side comparison of a full-color soccer portrait keychain and a flat single-color version\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Every keychain arrives ready to use — finished, sealed, inspected. No supports, no post-processing. This is industrial production quality, not desktop-printer craft.\",\"Title\":\"A collector's piece, not a cheap souvenir\",\"Visual\":\"A finished full-color soccer keychain presented in a black gift box\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"CJP sandstone is sealed with polymer to lock in color and rigidity. Fine details — shirt numbers, facial features, crest emblems — print sharply and stay sharp through daily carry.\",\"Title\":\"Built for the pocket, not just the shelf\",\"Visual\":\"A full-color soccer keychain on a dark marble surface alongside everyday-carry items — sunglasses, a card wallet, a watch, a pen, and a car key\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"This 25% off offer runs through July 20 only. Once the window closes, the standard price returns. If you're giving it as a gift, order with enough lead time — production and shipping take about 2–3 weeks.\",\"Title\":\"Soccer season edition. Limited window.\",\"Visual\":\"A gloved hand holding a finished full-color soccer keychain in a production facility, with rows of identical keychains and industrial 3D printers behind\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most fan merch is generic. This one is theirs alone.\",\"Title\":\"Why It Makes the Perfect Fan Gift\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"From\":\"From\",\"FromValue\":\"$$29\",\"Production\":\"Delivery\",\"ProductionValue\":\"2–3 weeks\",\"Shipping\":\"Ships to\",\"ShippingValue\":\"24 countries\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"July 20, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"A club crest, a player portrait, a favorite jersey number — turned into a full-color 3D keychain. Personalized soccer keychains are one of those gifts that actually land, because they're specific to that fan, not just any fan.\",\"Title\":\"Soccer fan gift\",\"Visual\":\"A full-color soccer fan-gift keychain in an open gift box, surrounded by a team scarf, a sports bag, and a soccer ball\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Youth league, first season, that one action photo from the sideline. Parents and coaches are ordering these as end-of-season keepsakes — more personal than a participation medal, more permanent than a trophy that collects dust.\",\"Title\":\"Soccer gifts for kids\",\"Visual\":\"A youth soccer keychain hanging from a sports bag on a turf field, beside cleats, a medal, and a soccer ball\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a team photo, a coach portrait, or a squad crest. It's the kind of soccer coach gift the whole team can chip in on — personal enough to actually mean something, and easy enough that one person handles the order for everyone.\",\"Title\":\"Soccer coach gift\",\"Visual\":\"A soccer keychain surrounded by coaching gear — a tactical clipboard, a stopwatch, a notebook, and training cones — styled as a coach gift\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Some seasons are worth keeping. A custom soccer keychain from a historic match, a championship run, or a player's farewell tour turns a memory into something physical — a collectible that lives on the keys, not in a drawer.\",\"Title\":\"Soccer memorabilia\",\"Visual\":\"A commemorative soccer keychain from a championship match\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: team gifts and end-of-season giveaways, fan-club merchandise, and tournament keepsakes.\",\"Kicker\":\"A keychain is just a keychain — until it's their player, their club, their kid's first goal. Here's what soccer fans are actually ordering.\",\"Title\":\"What Fans Are Making This Season\"}},\"TwistEgg\":{\"BeforeAfter\":{\"AfterAlt\":\"3D printable twist egg generated by Meshy, split into two halves\",\"AfterLabel\":\"Your twist egg (two halves)\",\"BeforeAlt\":\"Source image uploaded to Meshy\",\"BeforeLabel\":\"Your image\",\"DragHint\":\"Drag\",\"SliderLabel\":\"Before and after comparison slider\",\"Subhead\":\"Drag to see how one image becomes a twist egg in two printable halves.\",\"Title\":\"From an Image to a Twist-Open Egg\"},\"ExploreCreativeLab\":{\"BrickFigure\":\"Brick Figure\",\"BrickFigureDesc\":\"Turn your selfie into a custom brick figure.\",\"Browse\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"CardAria\":\"{label}, a Meshy Creative Lab product\",\"FidgetPixel\":\"Fidget: Pixel\",\"FidgetPixelDesc\":\"Turn your images into pixel art fidget toys for 3D printing.\",\"Figurine\":\"Chibi Figure\",\"FigurineDesc\":\"Turn your photos into chibi-style collectible figures.\",\"FridgeMagnet\":\"3D Fridge Magnet\",\"FridgeMagnetDesc\":\"Snap, stick, and feel your photos in 3D.\",\"Keychain\":\"3D Keychain\",\"KeychainDesc\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"Kicker\":\"The Twist Egg is one of many ways to turn your ideas into 3D you can make. Explore the rest of Creative Lab.\",\"SoccerKeychain\":\"Golden Boot Keychain\",\"SoccerKeychainDesc\":\"The game comes home. So should a keepsake.\",\"Title\":\"Part of Meshy Creative Lab\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Meshy adds a screw connector so the top and bottom twist together and apart, like a real capsule.\",\"Q\":\"Do the two halves really fit together?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"Two print-ready STL files, a top and a bottom, that you 3D print and assemble.\",\"Q\":\"What files do I get?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"You print the STL files on your own 3D printer, or use any online print service.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need a 3D printer?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"No. Upload an image and Meshy handles the hollowing, splitting, and connector for you.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Yes. You can tune the hollow size and choose where to split, right in your browser, before you export.\",\"Q\":\"Can I adjust the hollow and the split?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Generating an egg takes about two minutes and uses 30 credits. Resetting is free.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take, and what does it cost?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Yes. The egg is hollow, so you can tuck a small surprise inside before twisting it shut.\",\"Q\":\"Can I hide something inside?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Meshy does not use your uploaded content for model training. Your image is used only to process your generation, never kept as training data. You keep full ownership of both your inputs and outputs; see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e.\",\"Q\":\"Is my image private, and do I own what I create?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload an image, generate your egg, and download print-ready STL halves. Starts at 30 credits.\",\"Button\":\"Start Designing\",\"SecondaryButton\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Ready to Make Your Twist Egg?\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From an image to a print-ready twist egg in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo, pick a style (Pet, Character, or Other), and Meshy generates your egg in about two minutes. Or start from a sample to skip ahead.\",\"Title\":\"Upload an image and generate\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading an image and generating a twist egg in Meshy\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy hollows the egg, splits it into two halves, and adds a screw connector so they twist together. Fine-tune the hollow and the split right in your browser.\",\"Title\":\"Hollow and split, automatically\",\"Visual\":\"Hollowing and splitting the twist egg into two halves in the Meshy workbench\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Export print-ready STL files for the top and bottom, then 3D print your twist egg at home.\",\"Title\":\"Download and 3D print\",\"Visual\":\"Downloading print-ready STL files for the twist egg\"},\"StepLabel\":\"Step {n}\",\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate images ready for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic textures to any 3D model.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI behind your twist egg powers Meshy's full 3D suite.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"{label}, a Meshy AI feature\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it, generate it, and get 3D models from text prompts.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Intro\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Designing\",\"Slogan\":\"Design and print your own Twist Egg.\",\"Subhead\":\"Upload an image and Meshy turns it into a twist-open egg you can print at home. It comes hollowed and split into two halves that screw together, with room to hide a surprise inside.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Any Image into a \u003caccent\u003e3D Printable Twist Egg\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"You get a finished twist egg made to be printed and assembled, not a static 3D file.\",\"Title\":\"A real toy, not just a model\",\"Visual\":\"A finished 3D printed twist egg you can hold\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy does the hollowing, splitting, and connector for you, so there is no cleanup in Blender or MeshLab.\",\"Title\":\"Print-ready out of the box\",\"Visual\":\"Print-ready twist egg halves with no manual cleanup\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"A built-in screw connector lets the two halves twist together and apart, with space to hide a small surprise inside.\",\"Title\":\"Twists open like the real thing\",\"Visual\":\"Twist egg opening into two halves through a screw connector\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"Everything happens live in your browser, so there is no render queue and no waiting.\",\"Title\":\"Instant, right in your browser\",\"Visual\":\"Designing a twist egg live in the browser\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most AI tools give you a model to look at. Meshy gives you a real toy you can print, twist open, and play with.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Eggs Are Different\"},\"SpecBar\":{\"Generate\":\"Generate\",\"GenerateValue\":\"~2 min · 30 credits\",\"Input\":\"Input\",\"InputValue\":\"Upload an image\",\"Output\":\"Output\",\"OutputValue\":\"2 twist-together STL halves\",\"Styles\":\"Styles\",\"StylesValue\":\"Pet / Character / Other\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Hide a ring, a note, or a small gift inside, then twist it shut.\",\"Title\":\"Surprise gift capsules\",\"Visual\":\"A twist egg used as a surprise gift capsule\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Make your own gachapon-style eggs to collect, trade, or gift.\",\"Title\":\"Capsule and blind-box toys\",\"Visual\":\"Gachapon-style capsule toys made as twist eggs\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Custom decorative eggs for Easter baskets and holidays.\",\"Title\":\"Easter and seasonal eggs\",\"Visual\":\"Decorative twist eggs for Easter and seasonal holidays\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"A twist-open egg for keepsakes, dice, earrings, or odds and ends.\",\"Title\":\"Desk collectibles and trinket holders\",\"Visual\":\"A twist egg used as a desk trinket holder\"},\"Kicker\":\"A printable capsule with a surprise inside.\",\"Title\":\"What People Make with Them\"}},\"VinylFigurine\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"VinylFigurine\":\"Vinyl Figure\"},\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"A vinyl figure is a collectible designer toy — a stylized character with bold colors, a big-head proportion, and a glossy finish made to sit on a shelf. Think Funko Pop or KAWS. Meshy's AI generator lets you make a custom vinyl-style figure from your own photo instead of buying a mass-produced one.\",\"Q\":\"What is a vinyl figure?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"You can upload a photo and generate vinyl figure designs for free. Creating the final 3D model uses Meshy credits. New accounts receive free credits so you can try the full workflow — no credit card required to start. A paid plan unlocks unlimited generations and higher daily limits.\",\"Q\":\"Is the AI vinyl figure generator free?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"A clear, front-facing photo where the face and body are visible works best — good lighting, no heavy blur or cropping. Portraits, pet photos, and cosplay shots all work well. Busy backgrounds are fine; Meshy focuses on the subject. One photo is all you need.\",\"Q\":\"What photos work best for a vinyl figure?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"No printer is required to generate and preview your figure — that all happens free in the browser. To get a physical copy today, download the STL or OBJ and print it yourself or use a local print service. A made-and-shipped option is coming soon, similar to the printed keychains Meshy already ships across 9 countries.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need a 3D printer to get a vinyl figure?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"Meshy exports your vinyl figure as GLB, FBX, OBJ, and STL. Use STL or OBJ in Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, or Cura for 3D printing; GLB or FBX for Blender, Unity, or Unreal Engine. All downloads include the multi-color textures generated with the model.\",\"Q\":\"Can I use my vinyl figure in Blender, Unity, or on a 3D printer?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"Yes — people, pets, and original characters all work. A clear photo where the face and body are visible gives the best likeness. Meshy reads the face, outfit, and pose from the image and carries them into the figure, so it actually looks like your subject rather than a generic shape.\",\"Q\":\"Can I make a vinyl figure of myself, my pet, or a character?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Factory vinyl figures cost $20–$200+ because they need custom molds, hand-painting, and minimum runs of hundreds of units. Meshy removes that entirely — generate a 3D model from a photo for free, download it, and print one copy at home for the cost of filament. No molds, no minimums, no lead time.\",\"Q\":\"Why are vinyl toys so expensive?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Generating your figure in Meshy takes about 1–2 minutes. Downloading and slicing the file takes another few minutes. Print time depends on your printer and scale — a desk-sized figure typically prints in 2–4 hours on a home FDM printer.\",\"Q\":\"How long does it take — photo to finished vinyl figure?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"Models generated on paid Meshy plans include commercial-use rights and can be used in games, films, merch, and 3D prints you sell. Free-tier outputs are for personal and evaluation use. Check the license terms on your current plan before using a figure commercially.\",\"Q\":\"Can I sell or use my vinyl figure commercially?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Most AI vinyl figure tools restyle a photo into a 2D image of a toy. Meshy generates a real 3D model — one you can rotate, view in AR, and 3D-print. You also own exportable GLB, FBX, OBJ, and STL files, not just a flat image.\",\"Q\":\"How is Meshy different from other AI vinyl figure makers?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo and watch Meshy turn it into a custom, printable 3D vinyl figure.\",\"Button\":\"Create My Vinyl Figure\",\"FooterLink\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"FooterPrefix\":\"Looking for more 3D products?\",\"Title\":\"Make Your First 3D Vinyl Figure\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subhead\":\"Meshy's AI turns any photo into a custom, big-head vinyl collectible figure — preview it in AR and download a 3D model you can print at home.\",\"Title\":\"Custom \u003caccent\u003e3D Vinyl Figures\u003c/accent\u003e from Your Photo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Kicker\":\"From a single photo to a printable vinyl-style 3D figure in three steps.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Drop in any photo of a person, pet, or character — Meshy's AI builds a full-color vinyl figure from that single image. No skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload a photo for 3D conversion\",\"Visual\":\"Uploading a photo to the Meshy vinyl figure generator\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Rotate and zoom your figure in the browser. Regenerate as many times as you like until it looks right.\",\"Title\":\"Preview and refine your vinyl figure\",\"Visual\":\"Previewing and refining a vinyl figure in the browser\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Preview in AR, then export as GLB, FBX, OBJ, or STL — ready to 3D-print at home.\",\"Title\":\"View it in AR and export in 4 formats\",\"Visual\":\"Viewing a vinyl figure in AR and exporting it in multiple formats\"},\"Title\":\"How to Make a 3D Vinyl Figure from a Photo\"},\"InternalLinks\":{\"AIAnimationDesc\":\"Auto-rig and animate any 3D character in seconds.\",\"AIAnimationTitle\":\"AI Animation Generator\",\"AIImageDesc\":\"Generate multi-view images optimized for 3D creation.\",\"AIImageTitle\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturingDesc\":\"Add realistic PBR textures to any 3D model with AI.\",\"AITexturingTitle\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"ImageTo3DDesc\":\"Turn any image into a textured 3D model in seconds.\",\"ImageTo3DTitle\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Kicker\":\"The same AI that builds your vinyl figure powers games, animations, and 3D-printable models. Explore the rest of the toolkit.\",\"LinkAriaLabel\":\"Explore {label}\",\"PrintWorkflowDesc\":\"Generate print-ready 3D models for your home printer.\",\"PrintWorkflowTitle\":\"3D Printer Files\",\"TextTo3DDesc\":\"Describe it and generate a 3D model from a text prompt.\",\"TextTo3DTitle\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Powered by Meshy's AI 3D Toolkit\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a custom 3D vinyl figure with Meshy. Generate a printable, multi-color collectible figure, preview it in AR, then download. Free to start.\",\"OGDescription\":\"Generate a custom, multi-color 3D vinyl figure from any photo. Preview it in AR and download to 3D-print at home.\",\"OGTitle\":\"AI Vinyl Figure Generator: Turn a Photo Into a 3D Figure\",\"Title\":\"AI Vinyl Figure Generator: Photo to 3D Figure | Meshy\",\"TwitterDescription\":\"Generate a custom, multi-color 3D vinyl figure from any photo. Preview it in AR and download to 3D-print at home.\",\"TwitterTitle\":\"AI Vinyl Figure Generator: Turn a Photo Into a 3D Figure\"},\"Moat\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy reads your photo and captures the real face, hair, outfit, and pose in a bold designer-toy style — not a generic, assemble-from-parts character.\",\"Title\":\"It actually looks like them\",\"Visual\":\"A photo being turned into a matching vinyl-style 3D figure\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Regenerate and refine as many times as you need, then print only once the figure is exactly right.\",\"Title\":\"Iterate until you love it\",\"Visual\":\"Regenerating a vinyl figure to refine the result\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Every figure comes fully textured in bold, collectible-style color — face, hair, and outfit already applied. No gray model, no hand-painting.\",\"Title\":\"Glossy color out of the box\",\"Visual\":\"A fully textured, full-color vinyl figure\"},\"Kicker\":\"Most custom vinyl figures mean factory minimums of hundreds of units, expensive tooling, and weeks of lead time — or a 2D mockup that only looks like a toy. Meshy turns your photo into a finished, full-color 3D vinyl figure — and hands you the file.\",\"Title\":\"Why These Vinyl Figures Are Different\"},\"Schema\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy AI Vinyl Figure Generator\"},\"Showcase\":{\"AltCharacter\":\"A custom 3D-printed vinyl figure of an original character on a desk, made with Meshy\",\"AltCouple\":\"A pair of custom vinyl figures of a couple, made with Meshy\",\"AltDesk\":\"A custom vinyl figure of a person displayed on a desk, made with Meshy\",\"AltHero\":\"A hand holding a 3D-printed vinyl figure of a dog beside the real dog, made with Meshy\",\"AltPet\":\"A colorful 3D-printed vinyl figure of a pet, made with Meshy\",\"AltPrinter\":\"A custom vinyl figure beside a 3D printer, made with Meshy\",\"AltShelf\":\"A custom vinyl collectible figure displayed on a shelf, made with Meshy\",\"Kicker\":\"Vinyl figures created by Meshy creators from a single photo.\",\"Title\":\"Designs People Are Making\"},\"TrustLine\":{\"Delivery\":\"Shipping\",\"DeliveryValue\":\"Coming soon\",\"Formats\":\"Formats\",\"FormatsValue\":\"GLB · FBX · OBJ · STL\",\"Price\":\"Price\",\"PriceValue\":\"Free to start\",\"Print\":\"Print\",\"PrintValue\":\"At home\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"UpdatedValue\":\"Jun 24, 2026\"},\"UseCases\":{\"Case1\":{\"Body\":\"Turn your partner, wedding photo, or family portrait into a matching set of vinyl figures — a keepsake that looks like a limited-edition designer toy, not a photo print.\",\"Title\":\"Wedding \u0026 couple figures\",\"Visual\":\"A matching set of custom wedding and couple vinyl figures, made with Meshy\"},\"Case2\":{\"Body\":\"Turn your avatar, OC, or on-screen persona into a physical vinyl collectible — the kind fans keep on their desk, not just save to their camera roll.\",\"Title\":\"Creator \u0026 streamer merch\",\"Visual\":\"A custom creator vinyl collectible figure on a desk, made with Meshy\"},\"Case3\":{\"Body\":\"Your dog or cat, rendered as a bold, full-color vinyl figure with their exact markings and face — not a generic animal shape, but actually them.\",\"Title\":\"Pet portraits as art toys\",\"Visual\":\"A bold, full-color custom pet vinyl figure, made with Meshy\"},\"Case4\":{\"Body\":\"Photograph your costume or original character and get a vinyl-style figure of it — a physical collectible from a single shoot, no factory order needed.\",\"Title\":\"Cosplay \u0026 character collectibles\",\"Visual\":\"A cosplay character vinyl-style collectible figure, made with Meshy\"},\"Footer\":\"Also great for: tabletop RPG minis, anniversary gifts, band \u0026 musician merch, sports mascots, office team figures, and convention giveaways.\",\"Kicker\":\"One photo, many ways to use your 3D vinyl figure.\",\"Title\":\"What You Can Make with Custom Vinyl Figures\"}}},\"Creators\":{\"Benefits\":{\"Benefit1\":{\"Description\":\"Instantly receive a free month of Meshy Pro when accepted into the program, or 1,000 free credits if already on a plan. Contribute each month to keep your rewards going and build your streak.\",\"Title\":\"Free Meshy Pro membership\"},\"Benefit2\":{\"Description\":\"The best contribution each month wins an exclusive Meshy Merch Pack shipped to your door*\",\"Title\":\"Top contributor bonus prize\"},\"Benefit3\":{\"Description\":\"Chat and share with the most passionate Meshy Creators, and the Meshy team directly in our private Discord channel.\",\"Title\":\"Private Discord channel access\"},\"Benefit4\":{\"Description\":\"Priority for cross-promotion on the official Meshy socials for stand-out projects.\",\"Title\":\"Project promotion opportunities\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy’s promise, as your favorite 3D AI generator.\",\"Label\":\"Contributor Program\",\"Title\":\"Contributor Program Rewards\"},\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Apply now\",\"Description\":\"Let’s shift the boundaries of 3D content creation together—craft incredible projects, and build a more creative future!\",\"Title\":\"Become a Meshy Maker\"},\"Contributions\":{\"Other\":{\"Description\":\"We're open to other ideas — propose your contribution format in your application.\",\"Title\":\"Other ideas\"},\"Reddit\":{\"Description\":\"Share your project workflow, guide, or detailed showcase in \u003chighlight\u003er/meshyai\u003c/highlight\u003e and at least one other relevant subreddit.\",\"Title\":\"Reddit posts\"},\"Title\":\"What you can contribute\",\"YouTube\":{\"Description\":\"Upload Meshy tutorials, project showcases, or workflow videos to your YouTube account.\",\"Title\":\"YouTube videos\"}},\"Description\":\"Share your Meshy projects publicly, contribute to the community, and earn free Meshy Pro, bonus credits, and exclusive merch.\",\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"This program is open to independent developers and creators working on original projects. Whether you’re an indie game developer, a game artist, or a creative with a vision connected to the gaming space in 3D creation, we encourage you to apply.\",\"Answer2\":\"At the moment, the program is available only for individual creators.\",\"Answer3\":\"When applying, briefly present your project, development timeline, and expected release date. We need to understand how you plan to integrate Meshy into your project and how we\",\"Answer4\":\"Within the Meshy community, we’ll showcase selected projects and also on our social media platforms. Our goal is to spotlight your creativity and, in doing so, help increase your project’s visibility (fame).\",\"Answer5\":\"Absolutely! If your project isn’t selected in the first round, we recommend that you stay alert (lookout) and show initiative (passionate) in moving forward to overcome the limits of 3D creation—refine your proposal and reapply (Reapply).\",\"Eligibility\":{\"A1\":\"At this time, the program is fully managed through Discord, and it's not possible to participate without it. Creating a Discord account is free — you can sign up \u003clink\u003ehere\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"A2\":\"Myko's full Discord username is \u003cusername\u003eMeshy Community Assistant #8067\u003c/username\u003e. If you haven't received a DM, you likely have DMs disabled for the Meshy server. To enable them: right-click the Meshy server icon, select \u003cbold\u003ePrivacy Settings\u003c/bold\u003e, then toggle on \u003cbold\u003eDirect Messages\u003c/bold\u003e (Allow direct messages from other members of this server).\",\"A3\":\"Spots are limited, and we can't approve every application. But if something changes or you have a new project, feel free to reapply anytime.\",\"A4\":\"Absolutely! If your project is not selected in the first round, you're encouraged to refine your proposal and reapply. We're always on the lookout for passionate creators ready to push the boundaries of 3D creation.\",\"A5\":\"That program was retired and replaced with the new Contributor Program. Previous members will need to reapply.\",\"Q1\":\"I don't have Discord or want to use Discord — can I still apply?\",\"Q2\":\"What if Myko doesn't DM me?\",\"Q3\":\"Why was my application declined?\",\"Q4\":\"Can I reapply if my project is not selected for the program?\",\"Q5\":\"What happened to the old Creator Program?\",\"Title\":\"Eligibility \u0026 application\"},\"Membership\":{\"A1\":\"Our Contributor Program Discord channel is full of people in a similar situation, all sharing advice, tips, and best practices. Just ask a question there, and either a community member or a member of the Meshy team will be very happy to help you. Myko will also walk you through the process and best practices for things like Reddit posts and videos.\",\"A2\":\"This is possible by negotiation — tag a Meshy Community team member and let them know.\",\"A3\":\"You'll receive reminders when your new contributions are due or overdue. If it's been too long without an approved contribution, you'll be removed from the program. But don't worry — you can reapply again in the future when you're ready.\",\"A4\":\"We're in beta and value your feedback. Send any issues, ideas, or feedback in our \u003clink\u003eContributor Program Discord channel\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"Q1\":\"I've never shared my creative projects before, so I don't even know where to start.\",\"Q2\":\"What if I want to pause my contributor program membership but not leave it completely?\",\"Q3\":\"What if I join the program but stop submitting approved contributions for too long?\",\"Q4\":\"What if I find a bug?\",\"Title\":\"Membership \u0026 support\"},\"Question1\":\"Who can apply for the creator program?\",\"Question2\":\"Can teams apply for the creator program, or is it only for individuals?\",\"Question3\":\"How do I apply for the creator program?\",\"Question4\":\"How will creators’ work be promoted?\",\"Question5\":\"Can I reapply if my project isn’t selected for the program?\",\"Rewards\":{\"A1\":\"Absolutely! Just let us know when applying, and if accepted we'll award 1,000 free credits a month instead.\",\"A2\":\"No problem — just let us know and we'll queue this up for you.\",\"A3\":\"These are features still in development — stay tuned for more information, and new rewards later!\",\"A4Intro\":\"The best contribution each month wins an exclusive Meshy Merch Pack shipped to you, or 3,000 credits if you've already received one.\",\"A4Item1\":\"Selection is based on quality, how well the contribution showcases Meshy, and the amount of interaction your post or video receives on social media.\",\"A4Item2\":\"The winner is announced in the Contributor Program Discord channel and must provide shipping details within 30 days of winning.\",\"A4Item3\":\"Prizes are shipped at the winner's risk. Meshy is not responsible for lost, stolen, delayed, damaged, or undeliverable packages once dispatched.\",\"A4Item4\":\"Winners are responsible for providing accurate shipping information and for any customs duties, taxes, or import fees.\",\"A4Item5\":\"No cash alternative or replacement is guaranteed.\",\"A4TermsTitle\":\"Terms\",\"Q1\":\"I'm already on a paid plan — can I get rewards still?\",\"Q2\":\"I got accepted and now I want to move from self-funded Pro months to reward months — is that possible?\",\"Q3\":\"How do plan streaks and tiers work?\",\"Q4\":\"How does the Meshy Merch Pack prize work?\",\"Title\":\"Rewards \u0026 plans\"},\"Submitting\":{\"A1\":\"Privately message Myko via Discord DM and click the \\\"Submit Contribution\\\" button. Myko will walk you through the submission guidelines and process — we'll manually review your submission and queue your rewards.\",\"A2\":\"You can send it right away. If approved, we'll queue your reward to manually add later.\",\"A3\":\"We welcome this! You can submit up to 10 contributions a month by messaging Myko once you're in the program.\",\"A4\":\"You'll receive a rejection DM from Myko telling you why it wasn't accepted. You can adjust it to meet the requirements and submit it again once ready.\",\"A5\":\"You can find this in the \u003clink\u003eMeshy Media Kit\u003c/link\u003e!\",\"A6\":\"Usually within 2–3 days, unless it's a weekend or a holiday.\",\"Q1\":\"How do I submit contributions once accepted?\",\"Q2\":\"I just got accepted — can I send my contribution right away or do I have to wait until the end of the month?\",\"Q3\":\"What if I want to submit more than one contribution a month?\",\"Q4\":\"What if my contribution isn't accepted?\",\"Q5\":\"I need the Meshy logo to include in my project showcase\",\"Q6\":\"How long will it take for my application and contributions to be reviewed and approved?\",\"Title\":\"Submitting contributions\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Apply now\",\"CTADisabled\":\"Thank you for your interest — the creator program is temporarily closed and will reopen later.\",\"Description\":\"Share your Meshy Projects — Get rewarded!\",\"Title\":{\"Content\":\"Meshy Contributor Program\"}},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Card1\":{\"Description\":\"You want to share your Meshy Projects with the world!\",\"Title\":\"Bold AI pioneer\"},\"Card2\":{\"Description\":\"You're an independent creator — not a team, or affiliated with a company or studio.\",\"Title\":\"Independent\"},\"Card3\":{\"Description\":\"Your project is entirely original — no elements copied from or based on existing intellectual property.\",\"Title\":\"Original\"},\"Card4\":{\"Description\":\"Spots are limited. We prioritize high quality projects. Don't just show us your models — show us what you're building with them!\",\"Title\":\"High-quality\"},\"Title\":\"Who can join?\"},\"HowToApply\":{\"Badge\":\"Get started\",\"CTA\":\"Apply now\",\"Requirements\":{\"Bullet1\":{\"Description\":\"Provide a brief description of your project, including its core concept, unique features, and the vision behind it.\",\"Title\":\"Project description\"},\"Bullet2\":{\"Description\":\"Attach a link to a demo video (e.g., YouTube) showing your project’s current progress, or attach screenshots.\",\"Title\":\"Link to current demo or screenshots\"},\"Bullet3\":{\"Description\":\"Outline a clear development timeline, directing key milestones and phases.\",\"Title\":\"Development timeline\"},\"Bullet4\":{\"Description\":\"Provide an expected release date for your project. Make sure to account for potential delays and keep your timeline achievable.\",\"Title\":\"Expected release date\"},\"Description\":\"To ensure a comprehensive assessment of your project, please include the following information in your proposal:\",\"Title\":\"Application requirements\"},\"Responsibilities\":{\"Bullet1\":{\"Description\":\"Share how you’re using Meshy in your project—prepare at least one use case in the form of a blog, video, or conversation. Highlight the benefits features you gain with Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Show usage\"},\"Bullet2\":{\"Description\":\"In your project descriptions and promotional activities, such as project release, social media campaigns, or public presentations, include Meshy’s features.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy feature\"},\"Description\":\"To ensure smooth collaboration and mutual recognition, creators are expected to fulfill the following responsibilities:\",\"Title\":\"Responsibilities\"},\"Step1\":{\"CTA\":\"Click to join our Discord\",\"Description\":\"If you're not already a member, hop in. This is where the whole program lives.\",\"Help\":\"If you need a Discord account, it's free to \u003clink\u003ecreate one here\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"Join the Meshy Discord community\"},\"Step2\":{\"CTA\":\"Open the channel\",\"Description\":\"Navigate to the channel by pressing the button below, then press the Apply button. Or, just private message \u003cusername\u003eMeshy Community Assistant #8067\u003c/username\u003e anything.\",\"Title\":\"Visit the Contributor Program Discord channel\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Myko (our Community AI) will privately message you to walk you through the application process. You'll be asked to provide links and information about your Meshy project, and what you would like to contribute in exchange for membership and rewards.\",\"Help\":\"If Myko doesn't DM you, right-click the Meshy server icon, select \u003cbold\u003ePrivacy Settings\u003c/bold\u003e, then toggle on \u003cbold\u003eDirect Messages\u003c/bold\u003e (allow DMs from other members of this server).\",\"Title\":\"Complete your application\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"If accepted, instantly receive free Meshy Pro (or 1,000 bonus credits if already on a plan). Submit a new contribution to Myko each month to receive ongoing rewards.\",\"Footnote\":\"You can privately message Myko anytime to check the status of your application or contributions.\",\"Title\":\"Create, share, get rewarded\"},\"Title\":\"Ready to join?\"},\"Resources\":{\"Discord\":{\"Description\":\"Join the community so you can get help from time to time.\",\"Title\":\"Discord channel\"},\"Documentation\":{\"Description\":\"Start with the basics of using Meshy and implementing the API.\",\"Title\":\"Documentation\"},\"MediaKit\":{\"Description\":\"Everything you need to present the Meshy logo and brand in the right way.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy media kit\"},\"Title\":\"Resources\",\"Tutorials\":{\"Description\":\"Learn how to get the most out of Meshy and create the best projects possible.\",\"Title\":\"Tutorials\"},\"UserStories\":{\"Description\":\"See how other passionate creators are building and sharing with Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"User stories\"}},\"Title\":\"Contributor Program - Meshy\",\"WhatIs\":{\"BulletPoints\":{\"Bullet1\":{\"Description\":\"The applicant must be an independent developer—no support from investors and no affiliation with any company.\",\"Title\":\"Independent\"},\"Bullet2\":{\"Description\":\"The project must be completely original—no elements may be copied from any existing intellectual property.\",\"Title\":\"Default\"},\"Title\":\"If you have a project, apply:\"},\"Description\":\"A creator program for those building projects with Meshy, who want to share their work publicly, create content, and earn rewards — like free Meshy Pro months, bonus credits, and exclusive merch.\",\"Description2\":\"We're looking for all kinds of projects — whether you're an indie game dev, 3D print enthusiast, filmmaker, animator — or something else. Everyone is welcome to apply!\",\"Title\":\"What is the Meshy Contributor Program?\"}},\"CustomerStories\":{\"Post\":{\"CaseOverview\":{\"About\":\"About\",\"Challenge\":\"Challenge\",\"Industry\":\"Industry\",\"Results\":\"Results\",\"Solution\":\"Solution\"},\"InsightsFrom\":\"Insights from\"}},\"Customers\":{\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"Join leading teams using Meshy to power next-generation 3D workflows.\",\"ReadyToScaleYour3DProduction\":\"Ready to Scale Your 3D Production?\"},\"Carousel\":{\"Title\":\"What our customers are saying\"},\"ContactSalesCard\":{\"CTA\":\"Explore Meshy for Business!\",\"Description\":\"Join innovative studios and enterprises using Meshy to deliver more 3D content, faster. From asset generation to full-scale production pipelines, see how Meshy can power your team’s next leap in efficiency.\",\"Title\":\"Scale 3D Creation Now\"},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Discover how world-class companies are transforming their 3D workflows with Meshy, cutting production time, reducing costs, and unlocking new creative potential.\",\"Title\":\"How Leading Teams Scale 3D Content Creation with Meshy.\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Discover how world-class companies are transforming their 3D workflows with Meshy, cutting production time, reducing costs, and unlocking new creative potential.\",\"Title\":\"Customer Stories - Meshy AI\"},\"Partners\":{\"Description\":\"Trusted by visionary teams across industries, redefining the future of 3D creation with Meshy\"},\"Post\":{\"Title\":\"{title} - Customers Stories - Meshy\"},\"RelatedArticles\":{\"Title\":\"How other teams use Meshy\"},\"UseCase\":{\"Title\":\"How teams like yours use Meshy\"},\"UseCaseCard\":{\"ReadMore\":\"Read More\"}},\"Discover\":{\"Description\":\"Connect with fellow Meshy enthusiasts, share models, join contests, and stay updated on the latest updates. Join our vibrant community to collaborate, learn, and grow together!\",\"Title\":\"Community - Meshy\"},\"Educators\":{\"Description\":\"Trusted by leading educational institutions worldwide. Meshy is committed to supporting educators and students in shaping the future of 3D creativity.\",\"Description1\":\"Recognized in A16Z's Games Survey as the #1 AI Tool for Game Developers\",\"Description2\":\"Empowering students and educators to build high-quality 3D content with ease\",\"Description3\":\"Loved by professionals, students, and creators alike\",\"DescriptionThree\":\"Approved applicants gain access to our Pro plan at a significantly discounted rate: Students receive \u003cb\u003e$5.99/month × 13 months of Pro\u003c/b\u003e. Educators can access the \u003cb\u003eStudio plan at a discount\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"Form\":{\"AmbassadorResponsPlaceholder\":\"Share your ideas for promoting Meshy in your academic community...\",\"AmbassadorResponse\":\"Would you be interested in becoming a Meshy student ambassador? If so, how would you promote Meshy adoption amongst fellow student and faculty?\",\"Budget\":\"What is your budget?\",\"BudgetPlaceholder\":\"Budget\",\"Educators\":{\"Description\":\"Submit your info to connect with our team\",\"Title\":\"Educators\"},\"EducatorsEmail\":\"Contact Email\",\"Failed\":\"Form submission failed.\",\"FirstName\":\"First Name\",\"Institution\":\"Institution\",\"InvalidEmail\":\"Invalid email address\",\"InvalidEmailAccount\":\"You must first register a Meshy account with this email before proceeding.\",\"LastName\":\"Last Name\",\"LicensesNeeded\":\"How many licenses will you need?\",\"LicensesNeededPlaceholder\":\"Number of licenses needed\",\"Optional\":\"(Optional)\",\"Required\":\"Please complete this required field.\",\"Students\":{\"Description\":\"You must have a Meshy account registered with your school email (e.g. .edu) before submitting this form.\",\"Title\":\"Students\"},\"StudentsEmail\":\"Student Email\",\"StudentsEmailDescription\":\"Please sign up for a Meshy account with this email first\",\"Success\":\"Thank you for submitting the form! We have received your inquiry and will respond as soon as possible.\",\"UsageDescription\":\"How are you planning to use Meshy?\",\"UsageDescriptionPlaceholder\":\"Tell us about your intended use cases...\"},\"FormDescription\":\"Fill out the below form to apply for Meshy's Education Plan.\",\"FormTitle\":\"Apply for the Education Plan\",\"HelpText\":\"Need help with your application? Please check our \u003cfaq\u003eFAQ\u003c/faq\u003e first. If it doesn't answer your question, contact us at \u003ca\u003eeducation@meshy.ai\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"HeroTitle\":\"Powering the Next Generation of \u003cb\u003eCreatives\u003c/b\u003e\",\"LogosTitle\":\"Trusted by leading educational institutions worldwide:\",\"Maintenance\":{\"Contact\":\"Questions? Contact \u003ca\u003eeducation@meshy.ai\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Description\":\"This project is currently undergoing a scheduled upgrade. We are preparing to launch a brand-new education Plan very soon.\",\"Notice\":\"We appreciate your patience. Our team is working hard to bring you an enhanced experience with new features and improvements.\",\"Title\":\"We will be back soon\"},\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Subtitle1\":\"The 3D AI Tool Trusted by Industry\",\"Subtitle2\":\"100 Million+ 3D Assets Created\",\"Subtitle3\":\"10 Million+ Creators and Counting\",\"Title\":\"Education - Meshy\",\"Title1\":\"Powering\",\"Title2\":\"the next generation\",\"Title3\":\"of Creatives\"},\"Events\":{\"Christmas2025\":{\"ClaimGift\":{\"Error\":\"Fail to claim gift.\",\"Success\":\"🥳 Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year! {amount} credits have been credited to your account. 🎁\",\"Title\":\"Claim Gift\",\"Tooltip\":\"🎁 Claim 200 credits 🎅\"},\"Description\":\"Join the Meshy Christmas 2025 Creative Challenge (Dec 8–25)! Create festive #Christmas2025# models and collections, unlock a Christmas Day gift, and compete for Studio Plans and credits!\",\"Title\":\"🎄 Meshy Christmas 2025 | 3D Holiday Challenge \u0026 Contest\"},\"GDC2025\":{\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"Revolutionize your game development process with Meshy. Try it now and explore AI-powered 3D game asset creation.\",\"Title\":\"Make 3D game assets 10x faster.\"},\"Community\":{\"Description\":\"Discover and download a variety of unique 3D models for your next game project from our vibrant community.\",\"Title\":\"Explore a World of 3D Creations\"},\"DemoSchedule\":{\"Description\":\"Can you create art with GenAI? Join us at our booth, \u003cstrong\u003e#S1527\u003c/strong\u003e, during the Expo from March 19 to 21, where we will be offering guided demonstrations every day. Don't miss the opportunity to experience these insightful sessions!\",\"Label\":\"Meshy in the Workflow\",\"Timeline\":\"Timeline (Every day from March 19 to 21)\",\"Title\":\"Guided Demos at the Meshy Booth\"},\"Description\":\"Join Meshy at GDC 2025 (March 17-21) to explore AI-powered game asset creation (Booth: S1527). Experience our Text to 3D, Image to 3D, and AI texturing tools revolutionizing game development. \",\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":{\"BookDemo\":\"Book a Meeting\",\"Register\":\"Register for GDC\"},\"Description\":\"Join us at the Game Developers Conference (GDC) to explore AI-powered 3D game asset creation.\",\"ShinyIndicator\":{\"Text\":\"GDC Welcome Guide\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy at GDC 2025\"},\"Social\":{\"Description\":\"Stay updated with our latest announcements, demos, and behind-the-scenes content from GDC 2025. Connect with us on social media to join the conversation.\",\"FollowOnLinkedIn\":\"Follow on LinkedIn\",\"FollowOnTwitterX\":\"Follow on Twitter/X\",\"Heading\":\"Follow Our GDC Journey on Social Media\"},\"SponsoredSession\":{\"Credits\":\"1000 credits\",\"CreditsValue\":\"For all attendees (valued at $32)\",\"Date\":\"March 19th, Wednesday\",\"Description\":\"This talk features Our CEO Ethan and leading industry experts as they explore the innovative world of AI-generated 3D models in game development. Ethan will share key insights and effective AI workflows, alongside game developers who will discuss their real-world experiences with 3D generative AI.\",\"Location\":\"Room #2024, West Hall\",\"Max\":\"1-year Meshy Max\",\"MaxValue\":\"For three lucky winners (valued at $576)\",\"Presenters\":\"Meet the Speakers\",\"SessionDetails\":\"Session Details\",\"SpecialOffer\":\"Special Offers for Attendees\",\"Time\":\"10:30 AM PST\",\"Title\":\"Sponsored Session\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy at Game Developers Conference (GDC) 2025 - #MESHYGDC2025 - Meshy\"},\"Gamescom2025\":{\"Brief\":{\"API\":{\"Card1\":{\"Description\":\"Trigger model generation, texture creation, mesh optimization, or animations directly through your systems — no manual clicks.\",\"Title\":\"Automate Workflows\"},\"Card2\":{\"Description\":\"Batch-generate assets at scale for games, XR, films, or product design, saving hours of manual work.\",\"Title\":\"Scale Effortlessly\"},\"Card3\":{\"Description\":\"Plug into your favorite tools (Blender, Unity, and more) for a smooth, connected creative process.\",\"Title\":\"Custom Integrations\"},\"Card4\":{\"Description\":\"Send requests via API and get responses in minutes — ideal for pipelines that need speed and flexibility.\",\"Title\":\"Flexible \u0026 Fast\"},\"Description\":\"Transform your creative process with Meshy's cutting-edge 3D generation API. Built for game developers, our API delivers lightning-fast 3D asset creation that scales with your studio's needs.\",\"Title\":\"Power Up Your Pipeline with Meshy API\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy, the #1 GenAI 3D platform, will demo game-changing tools for developers and artists. Don’t miss live demos, partnership opportunities, and limited-time giveaways at our booth, \u003cstrong\u003eC-040\u003c/strong\u003e! Interact with Meshy-generated assets in a real game environment (supported by \u003ca\u003eStratton Studios\u003c/a\u003e)\",\"GamescomIntro\":\"Gamescom is the world's largest gaming trade fair, bringing together developers, publishers, and fans for an immersive celebration of interactive entertainment. From AAA reveals to indie showcases, esports tournaments, and hands-on demos, Gamescom 2025 promises five days of innovation, networking, and unforgettable experiences.\",\"Title\":\"Meet Meshy at Gamescom 2025\"},\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"Revolutionize your game development process with Meshy. Try it now and explore AI-powered 3D game asset creation.\",\"Title\":\"Make 3D game assets 10x faster.\"},\"Contact\":{\"Title\":\"Want to See It in Action?\"},\"Description\":\"Join us at Gamescom (August 20–22) in Hall 2.1, Stand C-040 to discover how AI can power the creation of 3D game assets.\",\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":{\"BookDemo\":\"Book a Meeting\",\"CheckAPI\":\"Check Our API\"},\"Description\":\"Join us at Gamescom (August 20–22) in Hall 2.1, Stand C-040 to discover how AI can power the creation of 3D game assets.\",\"ShinyIndicator\":{\"Text\":\"What’s new at Gamescom 2025\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy at Gamescom 2025\"},\"Social\":{\"Description\":\"Stay updated with our latest announcements, demos, and behind-the-scenes content from Gamescom 2025. Connect with us on social media to join the conversation.\",\"FollowOnLinkedIn\":\"Follow on LinkedIn\",\"FollowOnTwitterX\":\"Follow on Twitter/X\",\"Heading\":\"Follow Our Gamescom Journey on Social Media\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy at Gamescom 2025 - #MESHYGAMESCOM2025 - Meshy\"},\"Halloween2025\":{\"Description\":\"Join the Meshy Halloween 2025 Creative Challenge (Oct 20 – Nov 3)! Explore the best #Halloween2025 collections and 3D creations, and publish your own spooky models to win prizes — including a PlayStation 5 Pro, Meta Quest 3, Nintendo Switch 2, and 100,000+ credits.\"},\"Halloween2025ach\":{\"Title\":\"🎃 Meshy Halloween 2025 | 3D Model Challenge \u0026 Contest \"},\"Wrapped\":{\"2024\":{\"Official\":{\"Description\":\"Step into Meshy's official 2024 Wrapped to explore a showcase of the year's standout 3D modeling achievements and trends.\",\"Title\":\"Unveil the Top 3D Modeling Moments of 2024 with Meshy - Meshy Wrapped 2024\"},\"Personal\":{\"Description\":\"Join me in celebrating my 3D journey with Meshy! Let's explore the amazing creations and milestones together!\",\"Title\":\"My 2024 3D Journey With Meshy - Meshy Wrapped 2024\"}},\"2025\":{\"Official\":{\"Description\":\"Explore the moments, milestones, and community creations that powered Meshy’s most ambitious and creative year yet — from imagination to 3D reality at unprecedented scale.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy 2025: Accelerating Imagination\"}}}},\"FAQ\":{\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FeatureCard\":{\"Animation\":{\"Description\":\"A one-stop solution for creating animated characters, designed for artists and developers in game, film, XR, and beyond.\"},\"ExploreCommunity\":\"Explore community\",\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Convert your photos or concept art images into 3D models with stunning details in just a matter of seconds.\"},\"LearnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"TextTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy Text to 3D helps you conceptualize, iterate, and experiment with text prompts to create 3D models in seconds.\"},\"TextToTexture\":{\"Description\":\"Generate stunning textures for existing 3D models using text prompts in less than a minute.\"}},\"Features\":{\"3dAgent\":{\"Cta\":{\"Cta\":\"Chat with 3D Agent\",\"Description\":\"Chat your idea into a finished, print-ready 3D model — no modeling experience required.\",\"Title\":\"Chat with Meshy 3D Agent\"},\"Faq\":{\"A1\":\"A text-to-3D tool turns one prompt into one output. Meshy 3D Agent is a conversation. It brainstorms directions, generates concepts in batches, refines through chat, and answers your questions along the way, taking you from a single line to a finished model.\",\"A2\":\"No. There's no learning curve. You describe what you want in plain language, and the agent handles the rest.\",\"A3\":\"Text descriptions, reference photos, sketches, or just a rough idea. It's conversational 3D modeling, chat to 3D, in one place.\",\"A4\":\"Yes. Finished models are yours to download, 3D print, or bring into your own workflow.\",\"A5\":\"Models export in FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF, and DXF (GLB by default), so they drop straight into your slicer (STL/3MF for 3D printing), Blender (BLEND), AR (USDZ), or game engines like Unity and Unreal (FBX/OBJ).\",\"A6\":\"You can create a free Meshy account and start exploring at no cost. Meshy 3D Agent is currently in public Beta for Meshy Pro members and above, and a free trial is on the way, so more creators can try the agent in chat.\",\"A7\":\"3D printing makers, indie game developers, 3D artists, and designers. Anyone who wants to create in 3D without the traditional software barrier.\",\"A8\":\"Yes. Describe the look you're after and the agent generates style-consistent, game-ready assets in batches — characters, props, and whole environments that hold together. Export FBX / OBJ / GLB straight into Unity, Unreal, Blender, or Godot, then bring them into your pipeline.\",\"Q1\":\"How is this different from a regular text-to-3D tool?\",\"Q2\":\"Do I need to know Blender or Maya to use Meshy 3D Agent?\",\"Q3\":\"What inputs does Meshy 3D Agent accept?\",\"Q4\":\"Can I download or 3D print the results?\",\"Q5\":\"What file formats can I export?\",\"Q6\":\"Is Meshy 3D Agent free to use?\",\"Q7\":\"Who is it best suited for?\",\"Q8\":\"Can I use the models in Unity or Unreal Engine?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Hero\":{\"Beta\":\"Beta\",\"Cta\":\"Chat with 3D Agent\",\"Description\":\"From an idea, photo, or sketch to a print-ready 3D model — chat with the world's first AI agent for 3D creation.\",\"ImageAlt\":\"Meshy 3D Agent turning a chat prompt into a textured 3D model\",\"Tagline\":\"AI Agents.\\nNow for 3D.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy 3D Agent\",\"WatchCta\":\"Watch the demo\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Cta\":\"Create My First 3D Model\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Describe the idea in a sentence, drop in a photo, or share a sketch — the agent reads text and images alike.\",\"Title\":\"Describe Your Idea\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"The agent shows a few 2D concepts first, then turns the chosen one into a full 3D model.\",\"Title\":\"Approve Your Design\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"The agent cleans up the geometry, then exports for your pipeline — STL / 3MF to a slicer for 3D printing, or GLB / FBX into Unity, Unreal, and Blender for games.\",\"Title\":\"Export to Your Pipeline\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From a rough idea to a finished 3D model — guided by chat.\",\"Title\":\"How the Meshy 3D Agent Works\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy 3D Agent is the first conversational AI agent for 3D creation. Chat from an idea, photo, or sketch to a print-ready 3D model. Try Meshy free.\",\"Title\":\"3D AI Agent for Conversational 3D Creation | Meshy\"},\"RelatedBlog\":{\"Card1\":{\"Tag\":\"News\",\"Title\":\"Meet the Meshy 3D Agent — the world's first AI agent for 3D creation.\"},\"Card2\":{\"Tag\":\"3D Printing\",\"Title\":\"The best AI tools for 3D printing — from prompt to print bed.\"},\"Card3\":{\"Tag\":\"Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"3D modeling for games — build a game-ready asset library faster.\"},\"Title\":\"Related Blog Articles\"},\"Schema\":{\"Breadcrumb\":\"3D Agent\",\"BreadcrumbFeatures\":\"Features\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"FeaturesListDescription\":\"Everything that makes the Meshy 3D Agent the fastest way to go from idea to 3D.\",\"HowToSupply\":\"An idea, reference photo, sketch, or text description\",\"SoftwareName\":\"Meshy 3D Agent\",\"WhyTitle\":\"What the Meshy 3D Agent does\"},\"Testimonials\":{\"Item1\":{\"Quote\":\"I love using Meshy because it lets us create detailed 3D models from a simple description — something we didn't know was possible until we found this tool. It's incredibly efficient and simplifies workflows in our color 3D printing business.\",\"Role\":\"3D Printing Business, Australia\"},\"Item2\":{\"Quote\":\"I can type in a simple description and get a solid model in seconds, which saves a ton of time compared to starting from scratch in traditional 3D software. It's especially helpful when I'm just trying to prototype an idea.\",\"Role\":\"Arts \u0026 Crafts, United States\"},\"Item3\":{\"Quote\":\"As an independent game developer, I integrate the generated assets into Unity to prototype mechanics and level concepts quickly. The speed of iteration significantly improves my development cycle.\",\"Role\":\"Full Stack Game Developer, Computer Games\"},\"Title\":\"Loved by \u003chl\u003e{count} Creators\u003c/hl\u003e Worldwide\"},\"WhatIs\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy 3D Agent is the world's first conversational AI agent for 3D creation — it turns a chat, from text, a photo, or a sketch, into a print-ready 3D model in FBX, OBJ, GLB, or STL. No 3D experience required.\",\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Pitches creative directions before generating anything, so you start with momentum instead of a blank page.\",\"Title\":\"Brainstorms with you\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Produces multiple concepts in one go, then refines them through chat until the look is right.\",\"Title\":\"Generates visuals in batches\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Converts your favorite concept into a model that's yours to download, 3D print, or take into your own workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Turns it all into 3D\"},\"Card4\":{\"Body\":\"A built-in knowledge base, right in the chat, so you never have to step away to learn how.\",\"Title\":\"Answers your 3D questions\"},\"Title\":\"What is Meshy 3D Agent?\"},\"Workflow\":{\"Card1\":{\"Body\":\"Chat characters, props, and environments into game-ready 3D. Low Poly output drops straight into Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, and Godot.\",\"Title\":\"Game Assets\"},\"Card2\":{\"Body\":\"Go from chat to a print-ready file with a 97% slicer pass rate. Export STL / 3MF / OBJ for Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print and more.\",\"Title\":\"3D Printing\"},\"Card3\":{\"Body\":\"Describe a product and the agent returns a detailed 3D model for visualization, pitch decks, or stakeholder review. Export GLB / OBJ / USDZ.\",\"Title\":\"Product Design\"},\"ExploreCta\":\"Explore use cases\",\"LearnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"Subtitle\":\"From a single chat, the agent slots into the pipeline you already run — games, 3D printing, and product design — exporting the right format for each.\",\"Title\":\"Built for Every 3D Workflow\"}},\"AIImageGenerator\":{\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Start Generating Images\",\"Description\":\"Generate, edit, and convert images to 3D models in one workspace. Free to start — no credit card required.\",\"Title\":\"Start Creating AI Images — Then Take Them to 3D\"},\"Description\":\"Create AI generated pictures ready for 3D modeling. Generate multi-view assets and custom poses instantly. The seamless AI image-to-3D workflow starts here. Try Meshy free!\",\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Generate Images Now\",\"Description\":\"Generate stunning AI images from text prompts, refine them with built-in editing tools powered by Nano Banana, and convert directly to 3D models — all in one workspace. No software to download.\",\"Label\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"Title\":\"AI Image Generator: Create 3D Ready Images from Text\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Open the Meshy workspace and choose your AI model (Nano Banana, Nano Banana 2, or Nano Banana Pro). Type a detailed prompt — include subject, style, lighting, and mood — or upload up to 5 reference images to guide the output. Set the aspect ratio (1:1, 16:9, 9:16, 4:3, or 3:4), pick a stylization preset, and optionally enable Multi-view or set a Pose (A-Pose / T-Pose) for 3D-ready characters. Example: \\\"A knight in full plate armor, front-facing, neutral background, concept art style\\\"\",\"Title\":\"Describe Your Image or Upload a Reference\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Click Generate and Meshy produces up to four image variations in around 15 seconds. Browse the results, then open any image in the integrated editor to fine-tune details: inpaint regions, adjust colors, extend the canvas with outpainting, upscale resolution, or remove unwanted elements — all without leaving the workspace.\",\"Title\":\"Generate and Refine with the Built-in Editor\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Save your finished image in PNG or JPEG, or send it straight to Meshy's Image to 3D pipeline with one click. The AI automatically generates a textured 3D model you can export as FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, or BLEND — ready for games, AR apps, 3D printing, or e-commerce product pages.\",\"Title\":\"Download or Convert to 3D Instantly\"},\"Title\":\"How to Generate AI Images from a Text Prompt?\"},\"Title\":\"AI Image Generator: Text to Images in Minutes\"},\"AITexturing\":{\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Start Texturing Now\",\"Description\":\"No 3D expertise required. Describe the look you want and apply it instantly.\",\"Title\":\"Give Your 3D Models Stunning Textures — Free\"},\"Description\":\"Easily generate textures from text and images for your 3D models. Try it for free!\",\"FAQ\":{\"q1\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eFor mesh-quality-first workflows, Meshy gives you direct controls:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eRemesh — produces clean quad or triangle topology with editable polycount. The key feature for rigging and animation pipelines.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMulti-view — enable during Image-to-3D for better backside and side fidelity.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePolycount targeting — set a tri/quad budget for your target platform (mobile, web, console) via Remesh controls.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAI Model selection — choose Meshy-6 for highest geometry accuracy.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeshy's Remesh is comparable to standalone tools like Quad Remesher (Maxon) and Instant Meshes — but integrated into the same workflow rather than requiring an export → external retopo → re-import dance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf textures aren't the priority, you can export the mesh and apply your own materials downstream.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which platforms let me prioritize mesh quality and topology controls over fancy textures?\"},\"q2\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eMeshy's AI Texturing is purpose-built for this:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eUpload any existing mesh (GLB, FBX, OBJ) or use one generated in Meshy.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply AI Texturing with a prompt — 'aged copper with verdigris patina, hand-hammered surface, PBR.' The AI auto-generates albedo, normal, metalness, and roughness maps mapped to the existing UVs.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFor style references, attach a reference image — Meshy matches the visual treatment.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIterate cheaply — re-run with different prompts; mesh stays unchanged.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMulti-material support — apply different prompts to different material slots if your mesh is split.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eTip: name your textures as you save them and keep the prompt in the filename so you can reproduce or iterate later.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which AI tools can automatically generate better textures and materials on an existing 3D mesh without repainting?\"},\"q3\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eBlurry + stretched is almost always a UV problem, not a resolution problem. Pipeline to fix:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eDiagnose stretching — open the model in Blender, switch to UV Editor, enable 'Display Stretch.' Red areas = stretched UVs.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRe-unwrap — Edit Mode → Select All → U → Smart UV Project (Angle Limit 66°, Island Margin 0.02). Or use UV → Unwrap with seams marked manually.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePack islands — UV → Pack Islands with rotation enabled.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRe-texture in Meshy — the cleanest path is to apply AI Texturing with a fresh prompt; this re-projects textures using the corrected UVs.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eResolution bump — if the UV layout is fine, regenerate at higher texture resolution (4K instead of 2K).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBest result — run Remesh first (which rebuilds UVs cleanly) then AI Texturing. The combination eliminates stretching and yields crisp, even texture density across the surface.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\",\"Q\":\"My textures came out blurry and stretched — how do I regenerate or improve texture mapping?\"},\"q4\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eThree ways to fix blurry close-up textures:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eRe-generate textures at higher resolution — in Meshy, AI Texturing supports up to 4K maps. Re-apply at 4K and re-export.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eImprove UV density on hero areas — if face/eyes/logo are blurry while flat surfaces look fine, the UV island for that area is too small. Re-unwrap with Smart UV Project in Blender, scaling the hero islands larger before re-baking.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse multiple texture sets per material slot — split the model into materials (head, body, accessories) so each gets a full 4K map; effectively 4x the texel density.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply a sharper material prompt — when re-running AI Texturing, request sharper detail: \\\"crisp surface details, sharp normal map, 4K resolution, high frequency micro-textures.\\\"\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eValidate texel density in Blender — UV editor shows checker overlay; uniform check size = uniform sharpness.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor most use cases, Meshy's 4K AI Texturing eliminates the blurry-close-up problem.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"My generated textures look blurry up close — how do I increase texture resolution or re-bake at higher quality?\"},\"q5\":{\"A\":\"$45\",\"Q\":\"How do I stop texture seams from showing up when generating or auto-unwrapping UVs on a 3D model?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Texture Your Model Now\",\"Description\":\"Effortlessly create 3D textures from text and images. No 3D model expertise required, No Software to Download.\",\"Label\":\"AI Texturing\",\"Title\":\"Generate Stunning Textures for 3D Models\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Upload your existing 3D model in any standard format (FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF). Or skip the upload entirely — start from a model you just generated with Meshy's Image to 3D or Text to 3D and apply textures directly, all within the same workspace. No re-exports or file juggling needed.\",\"Title\":\"Upload Your 3D Model\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Choose your texturing method: type a text prompt (e.g., \\\"weathered metal with rust patches, PBR\\\") to describe the exact look you want, or upload a reference image — a photo, illustration, or material swatch — and Meshy maps it onto your model automatically. You can also pick from preset styles for quick results. Mix methods to get closer to your vision on the first try.\",\"Title\":\"Describe or Reference Your Texture\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Preview the texture on your model in real time using the 3D Viewer — toggle Auto Rotate, Wireframe overlay, Grid, and Statistics to inspect surface quality from every angle. Not quite right? Adjust your prompt or swap the reference image and regenerate in seconds. When satisfied, download the fully textured model in 7 formats (FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF) ready for your engine, renderer, or slicer.\",\"Title\":\"Apply \u0026 Download\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Here is a simple three-step process to create AI-generated textures from images and text.\",\"Title\":\"How to Generate 3D Texture from Text or Image\"},\"Title\":\"AI Texture Generator: Create texture from image and text easily\"},\"Animation\":{\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Animate Now — It's Free\",\"Description\":\"Auto-rig, animate, and export. No rigging expertise needed. Perfect for games, film, and XR.\",\"Title\":\"Animate Your 3D Characters in Minutes — Free\"},\"CharacterStyle\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a wide range of character styles, from cartoon to realistic, and historical to sci-fi, providing an extensive array of options.\",\"Fantasy\":\"Fantasy\",\"Historical\":\"Historical\",\"SciFi\":\"Sci-Fi\",\"Title\":\"Character Creation in a Flash\"},\"Description\":\"Easily generate 3D model characters and animations designed for artists and developers in game, film, XR, and beyond.. Try it for free!\",\"FAQ\":{\"q1\":{\"A\":\"$46\",\"Q\":\"How do I structurally edit a 3D model and convert it into an animation?\"},\"q2\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eFor evaluating rigged characters and animations, you need a viewer that plays animation clips and shows the skeleton. Recommended options:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eInside Meshy — the Animate workspace plays the character's selected animation clip live in the browser, with rotation/zoom and a togglable bone overlay. This is the fastest path.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cbabylon\u003eBabylon.js Sandbox\u003c/babylon\u003e — drop a GLB and use the Inspector tab to scrub animation clips, view skeleton joints, and check skin weights visually.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cgltf\u003eglTF Viewer\u003c/gltf\u003e — minimal interface, lists all animations, supports playback.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBlender — full rig inspection including weight paint mode.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorkflow: generate the character in Meshy → Animate → preview the included motion clips → export FBX or GLB → import into your engine.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"What's a good way to preview animations and skeletal rigs in a 3D viewer when evaluating character assets?\"},\"q3\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eMeshy's Animate feature works on humanoid and quadrupedal characters, including mythological and fictional creatures (dragons, griffins, wolves, centaurs, etc.) as long as the body plan is recognizable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eGenerate the creature in Text-to-3D with a clear T-pose / A-pose prompt: \\\"griffin, eagle head, lion body, T-pose, game asset.\\\"\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOpen the model in Animate. Meshy auto-rigs based on body plan — bipedal, quadrupedal, or winged.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply preset motions (idle, walk, run, attack, fly cycle for winged creatures) from 600+ built-in clips.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport as FBX or GLB with the animation tracks baked.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor highly non-standard body plans (a centipede, a six-legged dragon), you'll need manual rigging in Blender or Maya — generate the mesh in Meshy, then rig with Rigify or a custom skeleton.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which AI can animate 3D models of mythological or fictional animals?\"},\"q4\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eAnimation-grade edge flow needs ring loops at deformation joints (eyes, mouth, jaw, neck, shoulders, knees). Meshy's approach:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eRemesh produces quad-dominant topology with edge loops generated automatically along curvature lines. Choose Quad topology for rigging workflows.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFor facial rigs specifically — generate the head with a clear facial reference image (front + 3/4 view via Multi-view) so eye sockets and mouth corners are well-defined.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnimate's auto-rig is itself a topology validator — if Animate succeeds, the body topology is animation-ready.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFor face rigs, you'll typically still want manual cleanup in Blender or Maya — add eye-loop and mouth-loop refinements with tools like RetopoFlow.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFor full-character rigs, Meshy outputs work cleanly with Mixamo, Unreal's Control Rig, and Unity's Mecanim.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eTip: set Pose to T-pose or A-pose during generation — it gives Animate the clean starting position rigging tools expect.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which AI 3D generators produce clean edge flow suitable for animation and facial rigs?\"},\"q5\":{\"A\":\"$47\",\"Q\":\"What's the best workflow to retopologize an AI-generated 3D model with messy topology for animation?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Animate Now\",\"Description\":\"Effortlessly generate 3D model characters Pixar-style. No expertise required, No Software to Download.\",\"Label\":\"Animation\",\"Title\":\"3D Model Animation and Rigging Made Easy for All\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Start with your own 3D character model (FBX, OBJ, GLB supported), or generate one using Meshy's Image to 3D or Text to 3D and animate it directly — no exports or re-imports needed. Meshy's AI auto-rigging works on humanoid characters, bipeds, quadrupeds, and stylized figures, so you can bring almost any character type to life.\",\"Title\":\"Upload Your 3D Model\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Select from a library of 600+ preset motion clips — walk, run, idle, attack, jump, dance, and more — optimized for games, film, and XR. Meshy auto-rigs your character in under 30 seconds, then applies your chosen animation instantly. Preview the motion in the 3D Viewer with Auto Rotate and Grid to evaluate movement quality from every angle before exporting.\",\"Title\":\"Choose Your Animation\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Export your rigged, animated model in FBX or GLB — ready for direct import into Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, Godot, and other major tools. Bone hierarchies follow industry standards, so animations retarget cleanly and blend with existing motion data in your pipeline. From character concept to playable animation, the entire workflow stays inside Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Download \u0026 Export\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Here is a simple three-step process to rig and animate your 3D characters — no rigging expertise required.\",\"Title\":\"How to Generate AI 3D Character Animations\"},\"Library\":{\"AnimationLibraryDemo\":\"Animation library demo\",\"BackLeftRun\":\"Back left run\",\"BackRightRunFight\":\"Back right run fight\",\"BehitFlyup\":\"Behit flyup\",\"Description\":\"Easily add animations to your rigged models using our large library of animation presets, simplifying the animation process.\",\"ForwardLeftRunFight\":\"Forward left run fight\",\"ForwardRightRunFight\":\"Forward right run fight\",\"Run2\":\"Run 2\",\"Run3\":\"Run 3\",\"RunFast\":\"Run fast\",\"Running\":\"Running\",\"Title\":\"Extensive Animation Library\"},\"Rigging\":{\"Description\":\"Achieve automated rigging for both humanoid and quadruped models in a few clicks, with a seamlessly rigged skeleton.\",\"Humanoid\":\"Humanoid\",\"Quadruped\":\"Quadruped\",\"Title\":\"Automatic Character Rigging\"},\"Title\":\"AI 3D Character Animation: Create 3D Model Animation Easily\"},\"Description\":\"Explore the features of Meshy's AI-powered 3D design tools.\",\"ImageTo3D\":{\"AccurateForms\":{\"Description\":\"Enjoy the seamless conversion of image into 3D models that have accurate geometry and are aesthetically pleasing.\",\"Title\":\"Accurate and Graceful Geometry\"},\"AtAGlance\":{\"AIModels\":{\"Label\":\"AI models\",\"Value\":\"Meshy 6 (latest), Meshy 5, Meshy 4\"},\"BatchSize\":{\"Label\":\"Batch size\",\"Value\":\"Up to 10 images per job\"},\"ExportFormats\":{\"Label\":\"Export formats\",\"Value\":\"GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL, USDZ, BLEND, 3MF (7 total)\"},\"GenerationTime\":{\"Label\":\"Generation time\",\"Value\":\"~1 minute per model\"},\"InputFormats\":{\"Label\":\"Input formats\",\"Value\":\"PNG, JPG, JPEG, WebP (max 20 MB)\"},\"MeshFidelity\":{\"Label\":\"Max mesh fidelity\",\"Value\":\"Up to ~600,000 faces\"},\"Plugins\":{\"Label\":\"Plugins\",\"Value\":\"Blender, Unity, Unreal, Godot, Maya, 3ds Max\"},\"Pricing\":{\"Label\":\"Pricing\",\"Value\":\"Free tier available, no credit card required\"},\"Printing\":{\"Label\":\"3D printing\",\"Value\":\"97% Bambu Studio slicer pass rate (figurines)\"},\"Title\":\"Image to 3D at a Glance\",\"TrustedBy\":{\"Label\":\"Trusted by\",\"Value\":\"10M+ creators · G2 4.8/5 · TrustPilot 4.8/5\"}},\"BuiltForWorkflow\":{\"Cards\":{\"ARVR\":{\"Description\":\"Create lightweight, optimized 3D assets ready for immersive AR and VR experiences. Export as USDZ for Apple AR Quick Look or GLB for WebXR and Android — with PBR textures that react realistically to real-world lighting. Use the Smart Remesh tool to dial in polygon counts that balance visual quality with real-time performance on mobile devices and headsets.\",\"Title\":\"AR \u0026 VR\"},\"GameDev\":{\"Description\":\"Generate game-ready 3D assets from concept art or reference photos in seconds — no manual modeling required. Meshy's dedicated Low Poly Mode produces optimized wireframes for real-time performance, and direct integration with Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, Godot, and Maya means your assets are engine-ready on export. Whether you're an indie developer prototyping mechanics or a studio building production assets, image-to-3D cuts your asset pipeline from days to minutes.\",\"Title\":\"Game Development\"},\"Printing\":{\"Description\":\"Convert any image into a print-ready 3D file with a \u003ca\u003e97% Bambu Studio slicer pass rate\u003c/a\u003e on character and figurine models, based on our standardized testing of 75 AI-generated models — see the full methodology and head-to-head comparison vs. Hitem3D, Tripo, Rodin, and CSM. Download as STL, 3MF, or OBJ and print directly on your FDM or resin printer. Meshy integrates with Bambu Studio (one-click \\\"Send to Bambu\\\"), OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, PrusaSlicer, and Cura — so you go from photo to physical object without touching traditional modeling software. Ideal for custom figurines, product prototypes, educational models, and personalized gifts.\",\"Title\":\"3D Printing\"},\"ProductPrototyping\":{\"Description\":\"Turn product photos into detailed 3D models for visualization, pitch decks, or stakeholder design review. Upload a single product image and get a fully textured 3D model you can rotate, inspect, and share with your team — all before committing to manufacturing. Export as GLB, OBJ, or USDZ for use in CAD workflows, presentation tools, or interactive product configurators.\",\"Title\":\"Product Prototyping\"}},\"Heading\":\"Built for Every 3D Workflow\"},\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Start Converting to 3D\",\"Description\":\"No credit card required. No software to download. Generate your first 3D model in under a minute.\",\"Title\":\"Start Converting Images to 3D — Free\"},\"Description\":\"Convert Image to 3D Model with Meshy AI. Turn any photo into a textured 3D model for free. Export GLB, FBX, OBJ, STL for Blender, Unity, Unreal \u0026 3D printing.\",\"FAQ\":{\"Heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. The free plan includes 100 credits per month — enough to generate about 5 models (each Image to 3D generation uses 20 credits). No credit card required to start. Free-tier outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (commercial use allowed with attribution). \u003cpricing\u003ePaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e starting at $14.50/month unlock private licensing (full ownership, no attribution), 4K textures, batch mode, faster generation, and higher monthly limits.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy's Image to 3D free to use?\"},\"Q10\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — Meshy models work with all major 3D tools and game engines. Meshy also offers official plugins for Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Maya, and 3ds Max for one-click import without manual file handling.\",\"Question\":\"Are the models compatible with Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, etc.?\"},\"Q11\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-tier outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution). \u003cpricing\u003ePaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e include a Private license that gives you full ownership with no attribution requirement — use your models commercially in games, apps, 3D printing, product visualization, or any other context. You can optionally share your creations to the \u003ccommunity\u003eMeshy community\u003c/community\u003e for extra exposure.\",\"Question\":\"Who owns the rights to the AI-generated 3D models?\"},\"Q12\":{\"Intro\":\"Meshy models are production-ready for a wide range of workflows:\",\"Question\":\"What can I do after generating a 3D model?\",\"Workflows\":{\"Animation\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eAnimation\u003c/strong\u003e — auto-rig humanoid and quadruped characters with Meshy's \u003ca\u003eAI Animation\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Api\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eAPI integration\u003c/strong\u003e — for production pipelines, integrate via the \u003ca\u003eImage to 3D API\u003c/a\u003e\",\"ArVr\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eAR / VR\u003c/strong\u003e — export USDZ for Apple Vision Pro and AR Quick Look, or GLB for \u003ca\u003eWebXR\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Editing\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eFurther editing\u003c/strong\u003e — open BLEND or OBJ in Blender, Maya, ZBrush, or Substance Painter\",\"GameDev\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eGame development\u003c/strong\u003e — drop FBX or GLB into \u003ca\u003eUnity, Unreal Engine, Godot, or Roblox\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Printing\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e3D printing\u003c/strong\u003e — export STL or 3MF and slice in Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, PrusaSlicer, or Cura\",\"ProductViz\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eProduct visualization\u003c/strong\u003e — embed GLB models in 3D viewers, configurators, or \u003ca\u003ee-commerce listings\u003c/a\u003e\"}},\"Q13\":{\"Answer\":\"Each tool has different strengths. In our \u003cbench\u003e2026 benchmark\u003c/bench\u003e testing 5 leading AI 3D generators (Meshy, Hitem3D, Tripo, Rodin, CSM), Meshy scored highest on full-pipeline print readiness (97% slicer pass rate, native Bambu Studio integration, 3MF export) while also offering the most complete creative pipeline — text-to-3D, image-to-3D, AI texturing, animation, rigging, and plugins for every major DCC tool.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy's Image to 3D better than Tripo, Rodin, or other AI 3D tools?\"},\"Q14\":{\"Intro\":\"Try these steps:\",\"Outro\":\"For more tips, read the \u003ca\u003efull Image to 3D guide\u003c/a\u003e in our Help Center.\",\"Question\":\"My 3D model didn't turn out right — what should I do?\",\"Step1\":\"Enable Image Enhancement before generating — it cleans up your source image automatically.\",\"Step2\":\"Use a clear, well-lit image with the subject centered, minimal background clutter, and a plain or transparent background.\",\"Step3\":\"Use a high-resolution image (≥1040×1040 px). Blurry or low-quality photos produce less detailed models.\",\"Step4\":\"Turn on Multi-view to let the AI generate multiple angles automatically.\",\"Step5\":\"Try a different AI model version — Meshy 6 produces the highest detail, while Meshy 4 and 5 may handle simpler shapes faster.\",\"Step6\":\"For characters intended for rigging, set Pose to A-Pose or T-Pose.\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Most image-to-3D conversions complete in about one minute with Meshy 6, the latest model. The exact time depends on image complexity and selected settings — enabling Multi-view or generating at maximum fidelity may add a few seconds. Meshy 4 and Meshy 5 are also available if you prefer faster processing for simpler objects.\",\"Question\":\"How long does it take to generate a 3D model from an image?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":{\"Meshy4\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eMeshy 4\u003c/strong\u003e — fastest generation time, suitable for simple props and quick concept exploration.\",\"Meshy5\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eMeshy 5\u003c/strong\u003e — strong balance of speed and quality, good for batch generation and rapid iteration.\",\"Meshy6\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eMeshy 6 (latest, recommended)\u003c/strong\u003e — highest mesh fidelity (up to ~600K faces), best edge and detail preservation, supports 4K base color textures and full PBR maps including Emission. Best for production assets, hero characters, and any model where quality matters.\",\"Switch\":\"You can switch between models in the AI Model dropdown before generating.\"},\"Question\":\"What's the difference between Meshy 4, Meshy 5, and Meshy 6?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, and WebP, up to 20 MB per file. For best results, use a clear, high-resolution image (≥1040×1040 px) with a single subject centered in the frame, a clean background, and good even lighting.\",\"Question\":\"What image formats can I upload?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — you can upload product photos, hand-drawn sketches, concept art, AI-generated images, or any 2D artwork you have the rights to use. For best results, focus on a single subject per image, avoid busy backgrounds, and ensure strong subject-background contrast. You can also generate a reference image directly inside Meshy with our \u003cai\u003eAI Image Generator\u003c/ai\u003e and send it to Image to 3D in one click. Or browse the \u003cgallery\u003eMeshy community gallery\u003c/gallery\u003e for inspiration.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use my own images, AI-generated images, or sketches?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"You can upload images up to 20 MB per file. For multi-view generation, upload multiple angles of the same object to improve reconstruction accuracy. Tip: clean backgrounds and good lighting in your source images consistently produce the best 3D results.\",\"Question\":\"What is the file size limit?\"},\"Q7\":{\"Answer\":\"No — Meshy runs entirely in your browser. No installation, no plugins required. If you want deeper integration with your existing 3D pipeline, optional plugins are available for Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Maya, and 3ds Max.\",\"Question\":\"Do I need to download any software?\"},\"Q8\":{\"Formats\":{\"Blend\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eBLEND\u003c/strong\u003e — native Blender projects\",\"Fbx\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eFBX\u003c/strong\u003e — Unity, Unreal Engine, Maya, 3ds Max\",\"Glb\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eGLB / glTF\u003c/strong\u003e — Blender, Three.js, web viewers, real-time renderers\",\"Obj\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eOBJ\u003c/strong\u003e — most 3D editors and CAD software\",\"StlThreeMf\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eSTL / 3MF\u003c/strong\u003e — 3D printing with Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, PrusaSlicer, Cura\",\"Usdz\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eUSDZ\u003c/strong\u003e — Apple AR Quick Look, Vision Pro\"},\"Intro\":\"Meshy exports in 7 formats: FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, and 3MF. Quick guide:\",\"Question\":\"What 3D file formats can I export?\"},\"Q9\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy's character and figurine models achieve a 97% Bambu Studio slicer pass rate in our standardized testing of 75 AI-generated models. Meshy is the only AI 3D generator with one-click \\\"Send to Bambu\\\" integration and native 3MF export (the modern format that preserves color and multi-material data). For full methodology and a comparison vs. Hitem3D, Tripo, Rodin, and CSM, see our \u003cbench\u003e3D printing benchmark\u003c/bench\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy's 3D models for 3D printing?\"},\"q1\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eApple's AR stack (ARKit, RealityKit, AR Quick Look) uses USDZ as its native format. The Meshy flow:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eOpen Image-to-3D and upload the source image. Enable Multi-view if you have more than one angle — backside accuracy makes a big difference for AR objects users walk around.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eGenerate your 3D model.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse Remesh (optional) to optimize topology.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport USDZ directly from Meshy. Single file, embeds geometry and textures, works in Safari, Messages, Mail, and any RealityKit app.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTest on-device: open the .usdz in Files on iPhone, tap AR. Watch for normal direction, transparent material edges, and real-world scale.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eLiDAR-equipped devices don't need any special export from your end — the LiDAR is for environmental scanning, not the model itself.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"How do I convert a 2D image into a 3D asset for Apple LiDAR/AR?\"},\"q2\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eUse Meshy's Image-to-3D with Multi-view enabled:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eCapture 2–4 photos of the object — front, back, left, right are ideal. Even, neutral lighting; clean or transparent background; the object centered and similar in size across shots.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eGo to \u003cworkspace\u003emeshy.ai/workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e → Image to 3D → upload your images and enable Multi-view.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eGenerate. Backside and side geometry will be far more faithful than a single-photo run.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse Remesh (optional) to optimize polygon count and topology.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport as GLB (web/AR), FBX (engines), OBJ (universal), or STL (printing).\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eMulti-view is the closest thing to photogrammetry without the rigor — you don't need 50+ overlapping photos or a turntable. 3–4 angles is usually enough. For fine surface detail, shoot at higher resolution and select Meshy-6 for highest quality output.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"How do I turn multiple photos of an object into a 3D model?\"},\"q3\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eLogo → 3D model in the browser via Meshy:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eOpen Meshy in your browser. No install required.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eImage-to-3D, upload your logo (high-contrast PNG or SVG-rendered PNG works best).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAdd a prompt hint: \\\"clean 3D embossed logo, flat back, smooth bevels, printable\\\" or \\\"3D logo with metallic gold finish.\\\"\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eGenerate. Use Remesh (optional) to optimize topology.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport — GLB for embedding in a webpage, USDZ for iOS AR Quick Look, STL for 3D printing, FBX for animation work.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor very precise vector logos where the geometry must be pixel-perfect, an alternative is Blender's SVG import + extrusion. Meshy's strength is when you want the AI to interpret depth, bevels, and dimensional treatment beyond a flat extrude.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor embedding the result on your site: \u003ccode\u003e{snippet}\u003c/code\u003e is two lines and works in every major browser.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"How do I convert logos into 3D models in the browser?\"},\"q4\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eMeshy works inside Unity via two paths:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAPI integration — call Meshy's Image-to-3D API from Unity (UnityWebRequest or your C# HTTP client), pull back the FBX or GLB URL, and use Unity's runtime GLB loaders (UnityGLTF, glTFast). This is the right pattern for in-game generation where players generate assets at runtime.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAsset import — generate in the Meshy web app, export FBX or GLB, drag into Unity's Project window. Auto-imported as static or skinned mesh; assign your shaders and you're done.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor most game pipelines, the right pattern is: design-time asset generation in the Meshy app, version-controlled FBX in your repo, normal Unity import. Runtime generation is for products where 3D generation IS the feature.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which AI image-to-3D generators can I use inside Unity?\"},\"q5\":{\"A\":\"$48\",\"Q\":\"What should I look for in an image-to-3D generator if I care about accurate proportions over style?\"},\"q6\":{\"A\":\"Upload any photo to Meshy's Image to 3D tool, click Generate, and the AI builds a fully textured 3D model in about a minute — directly in your browser, with no software to install. You can then preview the result, refine its texture, and export the model as GLB, OBJ, FBX, USDZ, or STL.\",\"Q\":\"How can I convert a 2D image to a 3D model online?\"},\"q7\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Meshy's free tier includes {credits} credits every month — enough for about five Image to 3D generations at 20 credits each — and no credit card is required to start. Free-tier models are licensed under CC BY 4.0, so you can use them commercially with attribution. Check the pricing page for higher limits and private licensing.\",\"Q\":\"Can I convert a 2D image to a 3D model online free?\"},\"q8\":{\"A\":\"Drag a JPG (or PNG or WebP) into Meshy's Image to 3D tool and click Generate. The AI reconstructs a 3D mesh from your image in about a minute, applies PBR textures, and lets you export the result as GLB, OBJ, FBX, or STL for Blender, Unity, Unreal, or a 3D printing workflow.\",\"Q\":\"How do I turn a JPG into a 3D model?\"},\"q9\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Generate a 3D model from your JPG with Meshy, then export it directly as STL or 3MF for 3D printing. Most models are ready to slice as-is; for complex geometry, run a quick mesh check in your slicer to confirm the mesh is watertight before printing.\",\"Q\":\"Can I convert a JPG to an STL file with AI?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert to 3D Now\",\"Description\":\"Generate 3D models from images online with high fidelity and ready to use for prototyping, gaming, and 3D printing. No expertise required, No Software to Download.\",\"Label\":\"Image to 3D\",\"ModelPickerAriaLabel\":\"Choose which 2D reference image to show in the hero preview\",\"ModelPickerLabel\":\"Choose 2D image\",\"ModelPickerOptionAriaLabel\":\"2D reference option {n}\",\"Title\":\"Convert Image (2D) to 3D Model in a Minute\"},\"HighFidelity\":{\"Description\":\"The generated model faithfully replicates the original image, capturing intricate shapes and fine details with high precision.\",\"Title\":\"High Fidelity Reproduction\"},\"HowAIConverts\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"AI Pipeline\",\"Intro\":\"Behind every Image to 3D generation is a multi-stage AI pipeline that reconstructs three-dimensional geometry from a single flat image.\",\"Outro\":\"The entire pipeline runs in the cloud and typically completes in about one minute, with no local GPU or 3D software required.\",\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy 6 first synthesizes consistent views of your subject from multiple angles, even when only one image is provided. This step compensates for the depth information missing in a 2D photo.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-view inference\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"The model then builds a volumetric representation of the subject and extracts a clean, watertight mesh — preserving sharp edges, accurate proportions, and surface detail.\",\"Title\":\"Geometry reconstruction\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy automatically unwraps the mesh and generates production-ready PBR maps (Diffuse, Roughness, Metallic, Normal, plus Emission on Meshy 6) so your model is render-ready and game-engine-ready on export.\",\"Title\":\"UV unwrapping and PBR texture synthesis\"},\"Title\":\"How AI Converts a 2D Image into a 3D Model\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Description\":\"A simple three-step process to convert any image into a high-fidelity 3D model in about one minute.\",\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Drag and drop a PNG, JPG, or WebP image (up to 20 MB) into Meshy's Image to 3D tool.\",\"Details\":{\"1\":\"PNG, JPG, JPEG, WebP (max 20 MB)\",\"2\":\"Multi-view and Image Enhancement support\",\"3\":\"Batch mode: up to 10 images at once\"},\"Title\":\"Upload Your Image\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Click Generate and Meshy turns your image into a fully textured 3D model in about a minute.\",\"Details\":{\"1\":\"Fully textured 3D model in about 1 minute\",\"2\":\"Real-time face count and topology stats\",\"3\":\"Automatic Printability check\"},\"Title\":\"Generate Your 3D Model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Download your 3D model in FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, or 3MF for any 3D workflow.\",\"Details\":{\"1\":\"7 export formats (FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF)\",\"2\":\"AI Texture, Remesh, and Print tools\",\"3\":\"Compatible with Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine\"},\"Title\":\"Download \u0026 Use\"},\"Title\":\"How to Convert an Image to a 3D Model\"},\"ImageVsText\":{\"ImageBullet1\":\"You already have a reference image, concept art, product photo, or sketch\",\"ImageBullet2\":\"You need predictable, repeatable results that match a specific visual\",\"ImageBullet3\":\"You're building a themed asset set with a consistent style across many models\",\"ImageBullet4\":\"You're prototyping a real product and need shape accuracy\",\"ImageHeading\":\"Choose Image to 3D when:\",\"Intro\":\"Both workflows generate 3D models with AI — the right choice depends on how much creative control you need.\",\"Outro\":\"For maximum control, generate an image first with Meshy's \u003clink1\u003eAI Image Generator\u003c/link1\u003e, iterate until you're satisfied, then send it to Image to 3D — combining text-level ideation with image-level precision. Or jump straight to \u003clink2\u003eText to 3D\u003c/link2\u003e for one-step prompt-based generation.\",\"TextBullet1\":\"You're brainstorming or exploring ideas rapidly without a fixed visual\",\"TextBullet2\":\"You want to generate variations from a description\",\"TextBullet3\":\"You don't have reference imagery handy\",\"TextHeading\":\"Choose Text to 3D when:\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D vs Text to 3D: Which Should You Use?\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"Jpg2Obj\":\"JPG to OBJ\",\"Jpg2Stl\":\"JPG to STL\",\"Png2Obj\":\"PNG to OBJ\",\"Png2Stl\":\"PNG to STL\"},\"RichDetails\":{\"Description\":\"Experience breathtaking realism with AI-generated characters, props and more, showcasing intricate details like never before.\",\"Title\":\"Incredibly Rich Details\"},\"Schemas\":{\"AppName\":\"Meshy Image to 3D AI Converter\",\"Breadcrumb\":{\"Features\":\"Features\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"FAQ\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. The free plan includes 100 credits per month — enough to generate about 5 models (each Image to 3D generation uses 20 credits). No credit card required to start. Free-tier outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (commercial use allowed with attribution). Paid plans starting at $14.50/month unlock private licensing (full ownership, no attribution), 4K textures, batch mode, faster generation, and higher monthly limits.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy's Image to 3D free to use?\"},\"Q10\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — Meshy models work with all major 3D tools and game engines. Meshy also offers official plugins for Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Maya, and 3ds Max for one-click import without manual file handling.\",\"Question\":\"Are the models compatible with Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, etc.?\"},\"Q11\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-tier outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution). Paid plans include a Private license that gives you full ownership with no attribution requirement — use your models commercially in games, apps, 3D printing, product visualization, or any other context. You can optionally share your creations to the Meshy community for extra exposure.\",\"Question\":\"Who owns the rights to the AI-generated 3D models?\"},\"Q12\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy models are production-ready for a wide range of workflows: 3D printing (export STL or 3MF and slice in Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, PrusaSlicer, or Cura), game development (drop FBX or GLB into Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, or Roblox), AR/VR (export USDZ for Apple Vision Pro and AR Quick Look, or GLB for WebXR), animation (auto-rig humanoid and quadruped characters with Meshy's AI Animation), product visualization (embed GLB models in 3D viewers, configurators, or e-commerce listings), further editing (open BLEND or OBJ in Blender, Maya, ZBrush, or Substance Painter), and API integration via the Image to 3D API.\",\"Question\":\"What can I do after generating a 3D model?\"},\"Q13\":{\"Answer\":\"Each tool has different strengths. In our 2026 benchmark testing 5 leading AI 3D generators (Meshy, Hitem3D, Tripo, Rodin, CSM), Meshy scored highest on full-pipeline print readiness (97% slicer pass rate, native Bambu Studio integration, 3MF export) while also offering the most complete creative pipeline — text-to-3D, image-to-3D, AI texturing, animation, rigging, and plugins for every major DCC tool.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy's Image to 3D better than Tripo, Rodin, or other AI 3D tools?\"},\"Q14\":{\"Answer\":\"Try these steps: (1) Enable Image Enhancement before generating — it cleans up your source image automatically. (2) Use a clear, well-lit image with the subject centered, minimal background clutter, and a plain or transparent background. (3) Use a high-resolution image (≥1040×1040 px). Blurry or low-quality photos produce less detailed models. (4) Turn on Multi-view to let the AI generate multiple angles automatically. (5) Try a different AI model version — Meshy 6 produces the highest detail, while Meshy 4 and 5 may handle simpler shapes faster. (6) For characters intended for rigging, set Pose to A-Pose or T-Pose. For more tips, read the full Image to 3D guide in our Help Center.\",\"Question\":\"My 3D model didn't turn out right — what should I do?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Most image-to-3D conversions complete in about one minute with Meshy 6, the latest model. The exact time depends on image complexity and selected settings — enabling Multi-view or generating at maximum fidelity may add a few seconds. Meshy 4 and Meshy 5 are also available if you prefer faster processing for simpler objects.\",\"Question\":\"How long does it take to generate a 3D model from an image?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy 6 (latest, recommended) — highest mesh fidelity (up to ~600K faces), best edge and detail preservation, supports 4K base color textures and full PBR maps including Emission. Best for production assets, hero characters, and any model where quality matters. Meshy 5 — strong balance of speed and quality, good for batch generation and rapid iteration. Meshy 4 — fastest generation time, suitable for simple props and quick concept exploration. You can switch between models in the AI Model dropdown before generating.\",\"Question\":\"What's the difference between Meshy 4, Meshy 5, and Meshy 6?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, and WebP, up to 20 MB per file. For best results, use a clear, high-resolution image (≥1040×1040 px) with a single subject centered in the frame, a clean background, and good even lighting.\",\"Question\":\"What image formats can I upload?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — you can upload product photos, hand-drawn sketches, concept art, AI-generated images, or any 2D artwork you have the rights to use. For best results, focus on a single subject per image, avoid busy backgrounds, and ensure strong subject-background contrast. You can also generate a reference image directly inside Meshy with our AI Image Generator and send it to Image to 3D in one click. Or browse the Meshy community gallery for inspiration.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use my own images, AI-generated images, or sketches?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"You can upload images up to 20 MB per file. For multi-view generation, upload multiple angles of the same object to improve reconstruction accuracy. Tip: clean backgrounds and good lighting in your source images consistently produce the best 3D results.\",\"Question\":\"What is the file size limit?\"},\"Q7\":{\"Answer\":\"No — Meshy runs entirely in your browser. No installation, no plugins required. If you want deeper integration with your existing 3D pipeline, optional plugins are available for Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Maya, and 3ds Max.\",\"Question\":\"Do I need to download any software?\"},\"Q8\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy exports in 7 formats: FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, and 3MF. GLB / glTF for Blender, Three.js, web viewers, and real-time renderers. FBX for Unity, Unreal Engine, Maya, and 3ds Max. OBJ for most 3D editors and CAD software. STL / 3MF for 3D printing with Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, PrusaSlicer, and Cura. USDZ for Apple AR Quick Look and Vision Pro. BLEND for native Blender projects.\",\"Question\":\"What 3D file formats can I export?\"},\"Q9\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy's character and figurine models achieve a 97% Bambu Studio slicer pass rate in our standardized testing of 75 AI-generated models. Meshy is the only AI 3D generator with one-click \\\"Send to Bambu\\\" integration and native 3MF export (the modern format that preserves color and multi-material data). For full methodology and a comparison vs. Hitem3D, Tripo, Rodin, and CSM, see our 3D printing benchmark.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy's 3D models for 3D printing?\"}},\"Features\":{\"AnyFormat\":\"Any Format, Ready to Use\",\"HighFidelity\":\"High-Fidelity Mesh Output\",\"MultipleImages\":\"Multiple Images to 3D\",\"NoSoftware\":\"No Software, No Setup\",\"PBR\":\"PBR-Ready Textures Included\",\"SharpEdges\":\"Sharp, Well-Defined Edges\",\"SingleImage\":\"Single Image to 3D\"},\"FeaturesList\":{\"Description\":\"Explore the capabilities of Meshy's Image to 3D AI converter.\",\"Items\":{\"AnyFormat\":{\"Description\":\"Export to GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL, USDZ and more. Every file works straight out of the box — no conversion, no re-import friction.\"},\"HighFidelity\":{\"Description\":\"Powered by Meshy 6 (the latest generation), our AI captures every detail from your image — sharp edges, accurate proportions, and rich surface detail. Generated models can reach nearly 600K faces for maximum fidelity. Use the 3D viewer's Wireframe overlay and Statistics panel to inspect mesh quality, then Remesh to optimize polygon counts for your target platform.\"},\"MultipleImages\":{\"Description\":\"Need to convert an entire catalog at once? Upload up to 10 images in Batch mode and bulk-generate separate 3D models for each one — saving hours of repetitive work. Ideal for e-commerce product libraries, game asset batches, or rapid concept-to-3D pipelines. Or integrate via the Image to 3D API to scale up production pipelines.\"},\"NoSoftware\":{\"Description\":\"Everything runs in your browser. No download, no plugin, no learning curve — generate your first 3D model in under a minute.\"},\"PBR\":{\"Description\":\"Every generated model comes with production-ready PBR texture maps — Diffuse, Roughness, Metallic, and Normal. Use the built-in Texture tool to refine materials directly in the 3D viewer, then export assets that look stunning in any game engine or 3D renderer right out of the box.\"},\"SharpEdges\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy 6's edge reconstruction preserves crisp silhouettes and hard surface transitions that older AI models tend to soften — critical for hard-surface props, mechanical parts, and stylized characters where edge clarity defines the look.\"},\"SingleImage\":{\"Description\":\"Upload one photo and Meshy generates a fully textured 3D model in about a minute. Choose from multiple AI model versions (Meshy 4, 5, or the latest Meshy 6) to balance speed and quality. Enable Image Enhancement for cleaner input, or turn on Multi-view to let the AI automatically generate multiple angles for more accurate reconstruction — no 3D expertise needed.\"}},\"Name\":\"What Makes Meshy's Image to 3D Different\"},\"HowTo\":{\"SupplyName\":\"Image (PNG, JPG, JPEG, or WebP, max 20 MB)\",\"ToolName\":\"Meshy Image to 3D AI Converter\"},\"Keywords\":{\"ImageTo3DModel\":\"image to 3d model\",\"ImageTo3DModelFree\":\"image to 3d model free\",\"PhotoTo3DModel\":\"photo to 3d model\",\"PictureTo3DModel\":\"picture to 3d model\",\"TwoDImageTo3DModel\":\"2d image to 3d model\",\"TwoDTo3DConverter\":\"2d to 3d converter\"},\"Offer\":{\"Description\":\"Free tier available with 100 credits per month, no credit card required\"}},\"SharpEdges\":{\"Description\":\"Bring your creations to life with sharp, clear edges that add depth and realism, ensuring every detail is captured with stunning clarity and precision.\",\"Title\":\"Sharp and Well-Defined Edges\"},\"Title\":\"Free Image to 3D Model {year} — Photo to 3D in a Minute | Meshy\",\"WhyMeshy\":{\"Cards\":{\"AnyFormat\":{\"Description\":\"Export to GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL, USDZ and more. Every file works straight out of the box — no conversion, no re-import friction.\",\"Title\":\"Any Format, Ready to Use\"},\"HighFidelity\":{\"Description\":\"Powered by Meshy 6 (the latest generation), our AI captures every detail from your image — sharp edges, accurate proportions, and rich surface detail. Generated models can reach nearly 600K faces for maximum fidelity. Use the 3D viewer's Wireframe overlay and Statistics panel to inspect mesh quality, then Remesh to optimize polygon counts for your target platform.\",\"Title\":\"High-Fidelity Mesh Output\"},\"MultipleImages\":{\"Description\":\"Need to convert an entire catalog at once? Upload up to 10 images in Batch mode and bulk-generate separate 3D models for each one — saving hours of repetitive work. Ideal for e-commerce product libraries, game asset batches, or rapid concept-to-3D pipelines. \u003ca\u003eOr integrate via the Image to 3D API to scale up production pipelines.\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Multiple Images to 3D\"},\"NoSoftware\":{\"Description\":\"Everything runs in your browser. No download, no plugin, no learning curve — generate your first 3D model in under a minute.\",\"Title\":\"No Software, No Setup\"},\"PBRTextures\":{\"Description\":\"Every generated model comes with production-ready PBR texture maps — Diffuse, Roughness, Metallic, and Normal. Use the built-in Texture tool to refine materials directly in the 3D viewer, then export assets that look stunning in any game engine or 3D renderer right out of the box.\",\"Title\":\"PBR-Ready Textures Included\"},\"SharpEdges\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy 6's edge reconstruction preserves crisp silhouettes and hard surface transitions that older AI models tend to soften — critical for hard-surface props, mechanical parts, and stylized characters where edge clarity defines the look.\",\"Title\":\"Sharp, Well-Defined Edges\"},\"SingleImage\":{\"Description\":\"Upload one photo and Meshy generates a fully textured 3D model in about a minute. Choose from multiple AI model versions (Meshy 4, 5, or the latest Meshy 6) to balance speed and quality. Enable Image Enhancement for cleaner input, or turn on Multi-view to let the AI automatically generate multiple angles for more accurate reconstruction — no 3D expertise needed.\",\"Title\":\"Single Image to 3D\"}},\"Heading\":\"What Makes Meshy's Image to 3D Different\"}},\"RelatedUseCases\":{\"Animation\":\"3D Animation\",\"ECommerce\":\"3D for E-Commerce\",\"FilmProduction\":\"Film Production\",\"FreeGameAssets\":\"Free Game Assets\",\"InteriorDesign\":\"Interior Design\",\"Printing\":\"3D Printing Files\",\"ProductDesign\":\"Product Design\",\"Roblox\":\"Roblox Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"Related Use Cases\",\"ToyDesign\":\"Toy Design\",\"Vfx\":\"VFX\",\"VrAr\":\"VR/AR\"},\"Testimonials\":{\"Heading\":\"Loved by {count} Creators Worldwide\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"ArtStyle\":{\"Cartoon\":\"Cartoon\",\"Description\":\"Meshy offers popular art styles, including Realistic, Cartoon, Low Poly, and Voxel, with more coming soon.\",\"PBR\":\"PBR\",\"Realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"Sculpture\":\"Sculpture\",\"Title\":\"Various Art Styles\"},\"CTA\":{\"CTA\":\"Start Generating 3D Models\",\"Description\":\"No credit card required. No 3D expertise needed. Just describe it and generate.\",\"Title\":\"Turn Your Ideas into 3D Models — Free\"},\"Description\":\"Convert text to 3D models in minutes with Meshy's Text to 3D AI generator. Turn prompts into any 3D format for games, prototyping, and 3D printing.\",\"FAQ\":{\"q1\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eSpeed-ranked options:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eInside Meshy — run Remesh on the existing asset. It rebuilds topology AND generates fresh UVs in one step. Fastest path.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply AI Texturing afterward — this re-projects materials onto the new UV layout, so you don't lose your visual style.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn Blender (manual) — Edit Mode → Select All → U → Smart UV Project (Angle Limit 66°, Island Margin 0.02). Takes 10 seconds, yields a clean automatic unwrap.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePack islands — UV Editor → UV → Pack Islands (rotation enabled, margin 0.01).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUV cleanup tip — before re-unwrapping, mark logical seams (under arms, behind ears, along symmetry line) for cleaner islands.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe fastest production path is always Remesh + AI Texturing inside Meshy — no Blender hop required.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"What's the quickest way to regenerate or repair UVs on a text-generated 3D model without redoing everything?\"},\"q2\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eSmeared textures usually trace back to stretched UV islands, low texture resolution, or projection artifacts on inferred geometry. Meshy addresses all three:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eUV unwrap — every Text-to-3D output ships with a non-overlapping UV layout where island scale is balanced.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTexture resolution — 2K–4K PBR maps mean fine details survive close-up viewing.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePBR maps — albedo + normal + metallic + roughness work together so highlights and crevices read correctly under any lighting.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAI Texturing — if a region looks smeared after generation, you can apply a fresh prompt-driven texture to that material slot specifically.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor best results, ask for materials with strong tactile detail in your prompt (e.g., 'brushed copper with hammered surface') — the model focuses detail where you direct it.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"Which text-to-3D generators deliver clean UVs and texture maps that don't look smeared?\"},\"q3\":{\"A\":\"$49\",\"Q\":\"Which file formats should I expect from a text-to-3D generator for Blender and game-engine export?\"},\"q4\":{\"A\":\"\u003cp\u003eUse the Free tier to run this 30-minute integration test before paying:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003eGenerate one representative model — a character if you do characters, a hard-surface object if you do props.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport GLB and FBX — check both formats from a single generation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eImport to Blender — verify materials show up correctly with PBR maps bound to the right channels (Principled BSDF).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eInspect topology — Edit Mode → Statistics. Confirm quad-dominant if you'll animate or sculpt further.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRe-export from Blender to your engine — Unity (FBX), Unreal (FBX), Godot (GLB). Check materials survive the round-trip.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTry Remesh — verify it produces game-ready topology at your target polycount.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTry AI Texturing — check whether you can iterate textures with prompts.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eValidate licensing terms — confirm the outputs would be commercial-usable on a paid plan.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf all steps pass on Meshy's Free tier, the paid plan will fit cleanly into your pipeline.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Q\":\"What should I test before subscribing to confirm a text-to-3D tool fits my Blender, engine-import and texture pipeline?\"},\"q5\":{\"A\":\"$4a\",\"Q\":\"What are the common failure modes of text-to-3D models (missing limbs, melted details, weird symmetry) and how do I prevent them?\"}},\"GenerateDemo\":{\"Description\":\"A user-friendly mesh editor with polycount control and quad mesh conversion. Enhance control and flexibility in your 3D projects.\",\"Title\":\"Controlable Mesh Settings\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert to 3D Now\",\"Description\":\"Create 3D models from text with high fidelity. No expertise required, No Software to Download.\",\"Label\":\"Text to 3D\",\"PromptBoxLabel\":\"Prompts\",\"Title\":\"Generate 3D Model from Text in a Minute\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Describe your 3D object in natural language — up to 800 characters in any language. Include shape, style, material, and context for best results. Then fine-tune your generation settings: choose an AI Model (Meshy 4, 5, or 6), pick a Model Type (Standard for high-detail or Low Poly for game-ready meshes), set Pose (None, A-Pose, T-Pose, or Custom), and select the Number of Generations to produce multiple variations at once. Each generation costs 20 credits.\",\"Title\":\"Write Your Prompt\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI interprets your prompt and generates a detailed 3D mesh with PBR textures — typically in about 1 minute. Meshy 6 (default) delivers the highest fidelity with up to ~600K faces. Preview your model instantly in the built-in 3D Viewer with real-time Statistics (Topology, Face count, Vertex count) and a Printability check that flags issues before you send to a slicer.\",\"Title\":\"Generate Your 3D Model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Inspect your model with the 3D Viewer — toggle Auto Rotate, Wireframe overlay, Grid, and Statistics to evaluate mesh quality from every angle. Refine further with built-in post-generation tools: apply AI Texture for custom surface detail, use Remesh to optimize topology, or run Printability and send directly to Print. When ready, export in 7 formats (FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF) and plug straight into Blender, Unity, Unreal, or your preferred 3D pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"Download \u0026 Use\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Here is a simple three-step process to turn text into a high-fidelity 3D model easily.\",\"Title\":\"How to Convert Text to 3D Model\"},\"QuickTextTo3d\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy Text to 3D helps you conceptualize, iterate, and experiment at lightning speed.\",\"Title\":\"Diverse, Fast, and High-quality\"},\"TextureRichness\":{\"Description\":\"Effortlessly adjust the richness of your model's texture detail.\",\"Title\":\"Texture Richness Level\"},\"Title\":\"Free Text to 3D AI Generator {year}: Prompts to Models | Meshy\",\"TutorialVideo\":{\"Description\":\"With AI texture editing, creators can easily correct or enhance specific areas for a more polished texturing.\",\"Title\":\"Edit Generated Textures with Ease\"}},\"TextToTexture\":{\"MatchWorkflow\":{\"Description\":\"Streamline your workflow with Meshy's rich export format support and plugins.\",\"Label\":{\"BlenderPlugin\":\"Blender plugin\",\"UnityPlugin\":\"Unity plugin\",\"VariousFormats\":\"Various formats\"},\"Title\":\"Native in DCC Software\"},\"PromptsExample\":{\"Color\":{\"Label\":\"Color\"},\"Description\":\"Generate stunning textures for 3D models using text prompts in less than a minute.\",\"Input\":{\"Mesh\":\"3D mesh\",\"Prompt\":\"Text Prompt\",\"Title\":\"Input\"},\"Metallic\":{\"Label\":\"Metallic\"},\"Normal\":{\"Label\":\"Normal\"},\"Output\":{\"Mesh\":\"Textured 3D mesh\",\"PBR\":\"with PBR maps\",\"Title\":\"Output\"},\"Roughness\":{\"Label\":\"Roughness\"},\"Title\":\"Use AI to Texture Any 3D Model\",\"UsableInARVR3DGames\":\"Usable in AR/VR/3D games\"},\"Quality4K\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI texture generator delivers ultra-high-resolution, detail-rich textures that are ready to drop straight into your pipeline. Whether you're working in Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, or any major 3D tool, every generated texture includes PBR maps — albedo, normal, roughness, and metallic — so your assets look stunning from every angle, under any lighting condition.\",\"Example\":{\"Footnote\":\"Meshy-textured armor sets created by rolfy, our beloved 3D artist developing an indie game called Madrigal.\"},\"Footnote\":\"Unparalleled clarity in 4K resolution.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Generated 3D Textures with Production-Ready Quality\"},\"StylesExample\":{\"Description\":\"Whether you're building a game, designing a virtual world, or creating assets for animation, Meshy's AI 3D model generator supports a wide range of popular art styles — including photorealistic, 2.5D cartoon, Japanese anime, untextured base mesh, and beyond. Simply describe your object, choose your style, and let AI generate high-quality textured 3D models in seconds. No 3D modeling experience required.\",\"Label\":{\"25DCartoon\":\"2.5D Cartoon\",\"25DHandDrawn\":\"2.5D Hand-Drawn\",\"CartoonLineArt\":\"Cartoon Line Art\",\"JapaneseAnime\":\"Japanese Anime\",\"OrientalComicInk\":\"Oriental Comic Ink\",\"Realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"RealisticHandDrawn\":\"Realistic Hand-Drawn\"},\"Title\":\"Generate 3D Models in Any Art Style — Realistic, Anime, Cartoon \u0026 More\",\"UntexturedModel\":\"Untextured Model\"}},\"Title\":\"Features - Meshy\"},\"Fellowship\":{\"ApplicationRequirements\":{\"Description\":\"For a thorough assessment of your application, kindly provide the following details in your submission:\",\"Eligibility\":{\"Description\":\"The recipient must remain an active, full-time student during the academic year of the award or forfeit the award.\",\"Title\":\"Eligibility\"},\"FellowshipExclusivity\":{\"Description\":\"A recipient of the Meshy AI Fellowship may not receive another fellowship from another technology company during the same academic year.\",\"Title\":\"Fellowship Exclusivity\"},\"ResearchRelevance\":{\"Description\":\"The proposed research must be closely related to the research areas of multimodal AI and computer graphics.\",\"Title\":\"Research Relevance\"},\"Title\":\"Application Requirements\"},\"ApplicationTimeline\":{\"AnnounceResults\":{\"Description\":\"Winners will be announced by \u003cb\u003eApril 20, 2026, 11:50 PM Pacific Time.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Announce results\"},\"Description\":\"To apply, candidates must submit their applications via our website, providing all required information and documentation. Following the submission period, the Meshy AI team will carefully review all applications and select 20 outstanding candidates for a brief interview.\",\"Interviews\":{\"Description\":\"Our team (including Ethan) talk to 20 finalists and pick the grand / outstanding prize winners.\",\"Title\":\"Interviews\"},\"SelectionOfFinalists\":{\"Description\":\"Our team will review all applications and select \u003cb\u003e20 finalists\u003c/b\u003e for a brief interview.\",\"Title\":\"Selection of Finalists\"},\"SubmitYourApplication\":{\"Description\":\"Submit your application form before \u003cb\u003eMar 15, 2026 11:59 PM Pacific Time.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Submit your application\"},\"Title\":\"Application Timeline\"},\"Awards\":{\"Benefits\":{\"Academic\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy will actively assist in promoting candidates' academic work, helping to amplify visibility within the broader AI and Graphics community.\",\"Title\":\"Academic Promotion Support\"},\"Description\":\"In addition to the monetary awards and Meshy Studio subscription, all Grand Prize and Outstanding Winners will receive the following support to maximize their professional and academic visibility:\",\"Publicity\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy will feature your research breakthroughs and profile on the official Meshy website and social media channels.\",\"Title\":\"Publicity and Showcase\"},\"Title\":\"Exclusive Benefits for All Winners (Grand Prize \u0026 Outstanding Winners)\"},\"Description\":\"Empowering the next generation of 3D GenAI innovators\",\"Finalists\":{\"Description\":\"Every finalist receives \u003cemphasis\u003ea 1-year Meshy Studio subscription\u003c/emphasis\u003e to encourage their innovative efforts.\",\"Title\":\"10 Finalists\"},\"GrandPrize\":{\"Description\":\"We award \u003cemphasis\u003e2 Grand Prizes of $10,000 each and a 1-year Meshy Studio subscription\u003c/emphasis\u003e to the most outstanding students, one in the field of Multimodal AI and one in the field of Graphics.\",\"Title\":\"2 Grand Prize\"},\"OutstandingPrize\":{\"Description\":\"Each selected fellow is awarded \u003cemphasis\u003e$5,000 along with a 1-year Meshy Studio subscription\u003c/emphasis\u003e to support their research and development efforts.\",\"Title\":\"8 Outstanding Prize Winners\"},\"Title\":\"Awards\"},\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"Apply for the Meshy Fellowship to fuel your research in the field of 3D GenAI\",\"Title\":\"Ignite Your Next Big Idea\"},\"Description\":\"MeshyAI Fellowship Program collaborates with top CS students globally, providing resources to explore groundbreaking AI and 3D design concepts for pioneering research and development.\",\"EvaluationCriteria\":{\"Description\":\"Applicants are encouraged to demonstrate their high-impact research in multimodal AI (3D / video / image) and computer graphics, including top-tier conference and journal papers or significantly recognized open-source projects. Preprints and arXived papers are also acceptable.\",\"Title\":\"Evaluation Criteria\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Open to full-time students worldwide (undergraduate, master's, or Ph.D.) conducting research in Multimodal AI (3D / image / video) or Computer Graphics.\",\"Answer2\":\"No. We value high-impact research and projects, including preprints, open-source work, or innovative ideas. Originality and potential matter most.\",\"Answer3\":\"No. The fellowship is independent. Winners are not required to work at Meshy AI during or after the award, though we warmly welcome anyone who wishes to join.\",\"Answer4\":\"Recipients may not receive another fellowship from a technology company in the same academic year. University or government scholarships are allowed.\",\"Answer5\":{\"Part1\":\"Monetary award ($5,000–$10,000)\",\"Part2\":\"1-year Meshy Studio subscription\",\"Part3\":\"Visibility on Meshy AI channels and support promoting your research\"},\"Answer6\":\"Yes. Awards may be subject to taxes in your country or region. Recipients are responsible for reporting and paying any applicable taxes, and Meshy AI will provide necessary payment documentation.\",\"Answer7\":{\"Part1\":\"Application deadline: Mar 15, 2026 · 11:59 PM PT\",\"Part2\":\"Winners announced: Apr 20, 2026 · 11:50 PM PT\"},\"Question1\":\"Who can apply\",\"Question2\":\"Do I need top-tier publications?\",\"Question3\":\"Is the fellowship tied to Meshy AI employment?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I receive other fellowships?\",\"Question5\":\"What do winners receive?\",\"Question6\":\"Are fellowship awards taxable?\",\"Question7\":\"Key dates\"},\"FounderStorySection\":{\"Title\":\"The Courage to Define the Future\"},\"GivingBack\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's success is built on the brilliant ideas emerging from academic research, particularly those driven by top graduate students. The Meshy Fellowship is our way of expressing gratitude and giving back to the academic community.\",\"Title\":\"Giving Back to Academia\"},\"HeroCard\":{\"CTA\":\"Check Recipients\",\"Description\":\"An annual award recognizing rising stars in the fields of multimodal AI and computer graphics research.\",\"Label\":\"MESHY FELLOWSHIP 2026\",\"ShinyIndicator\":{\"Text\":\"Announcing the Meshy Fellowship 2025 Recipients\"},\"Submit\":\"Submit Application\",\"Title\":\"Empowering the Next Generation of Multimodal AI Innovators\"},\"HeroSection\":{\"Description\":\"An annual award recognizing rising stars in the fields of multimodal AI and computer graphics research.\",\"Title\":\"Empowering the Next Generation of Multimodal AI Innovators\"},\"HowToApply\":{\"Description\":\"Submit your application today\",\"Title\":\"How to Apply\"},\"Story\":{\"Paragraph1\":{\"Main\":\"When I pursued my Ph.D. at MIT, I managed a monthly stipend of $3,200, with half going towards rent in Cambridge, MA. Like many peers, I lived paycheck to paycheck, carefully budgeting each day. My research was supported by several fellowships—Edwin Webster, \u003ca1\u003eSnap\u003c/a1\u003e, Adobe, \u003ca2\u003eMeta\u003c/a2\u003e-that provided financial stability to focus on my work. This support enabled me to graduate in three and a half years, culminating in a \u003ca3\u003ethesis\u003c/a3\u003e that earned Honorable Mention in the \u003ca4\u003eSIGGRAPH 2022 Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award\u003c/a4\u003e.\"},\"Paragraph2\":{\"Section1\":\"Upon graduation, I co-founded Meshy AI. The startup CEO journey was far more challenging than publishing at SIGGRAPH, ICLR, or ICRA as a Ph.D. student—filled with unexpected obstacles and steep learning curves. Yet, after sweat and tears, Meshy has found its footing and is now the leading product in 3D generative AI. Although our revenue remains modest, I am eager to give back to the academic community from our early successes. This drive led to the creation of the Meshy AI Fellowship. Through this fellowship, we aim to ease life's challenges and enhance productivity for the next generation of researchers, particularly in the fields of multimodal AI and computer graphics.\"},\"Paragraph3\":{\"Section1\":\"PS: Interestingly, Snap and Meta, who once supported my academic journey, are now among Meshy AI’s first Enterprise clients. It’s amazing how things come full circle!\"},\"Sign\":{\"Title\":\"Founder and CEO, Meshy AI\"},\"Title\":\"Nerdy to Meshy: An MIT Ph.D.'s Startup Story\"},\"Story2026\":{\"Paragraph2\":\"Giving back is important. This core belief drives the \u003cb\u003eMeshy AI Fellowship.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Paragraph3\":\"We are investing in scholars ready to move beyond publishing papers to creating influential work. We seek pioneers with the conviction to ask: \\\"Is this the most important thing I can be doing right now?\\\" This fellowship empowers you to pursue breakthroughs in \u003cb\u003eMultimodal AI and Computer Graphics\u003c/b\u003e without financial constraints.\",\"Paragraph4\":\"For \u003cb\u003e2026\u003c/b\u003e, we are looking for the next generation of pilots ready to make their own \u003cb\u003e\\\"leap of faith\\\"\u003c/b\u003e and define the future of the field.\",\"Paragraph5\":\"Our vision is to use AI and graphics to build radically new interactive entertainment experiences that bring joy to billions of people. We hope the Meshy fellowship can fuel the next generation of pioneers towards this mission.\",\"Quote\":\"We are setting up a flight to somewhere we have yet to explore. Everything is all set, the gate is about to close, and we welcome you on board, to be the pilot.\"},\"Title\":\"Fellowship Program - Meshy\"},\"Footer\":{\"AskAI\":{\"Label\":\"Ask AI about Meshy\",\"Prompt\":\"I'm evaluating AI 3D model generators. Explain what Meshy (Meshy AI) is and how it helps creators produce high-quality 3D models — covering text to 3D, image to 3D, AI texturing, auto-rigging \u0026 animation, and its API. Summarize key highlights from Meshy's official site (https://www.meshy.ai) and creator reviews on G2 and Trustpilot.\"},\"Legal\":{\"AcceptableUsePolicy\":\"Acceptable Use Policy\",\"AllRightsReserved\":\"ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\",\"CookiePolicy\":\"Cookie Policy\",\"PrivacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"TermsOfUse\":\"Terms Of Use\",\"TrustCenter\":\"Trust Center\"},\"PageNav\":{\"Company\":{\"About\":\"About\",\"Careers\":\"Careers\",\"Contact\":\"Contact\",\"Title\":\"Company\"},\"Downloads\":{\"Title\":\"Downloads\"},\"Features\":{\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"Animation\":\"Animation\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D Model\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D Model\",\"Title\":\"Features\"},\"Learn\":{\"Title\":\"Learn\"},\"Product\":{\"API\":\"API\",\"BlenderPlugin\":\"Blender Plugin\",\"Pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"Status\":\"Status\",\"UnityPlugin\":\"Unity Plugin\"},\"Programs\":{\"Title\":\"Programs\"},\"Resources\":{\"AffiliateProgram\":\"Affiliate Program\",\"Blog\":\"Blog\",\"BrickPartsGenerator\":\"AI Brick Parts Generator\",\"Community\":\"Community\",\"CreatorProgram\":\"Contributor Program\",\"CustomerStories\":\"Customer Stories\",\"Docs\":\"Documentation\",\"EducationProgram\":\"Education Program\",\"FAQ\":\"FAQ\",\"FellowshipProgram\":\"Fellowship Program\",\"FileCompressor\":\"3D File Compressor\",\"FileConverter\":\"3D File Converter\",\"HelpCenter\":\"Help Center\",\"LoyaltyProgram\":\"Loyalty program\",\"MediaKit\":\"Media Kit\",\"OnlineViewer\":\"Online 3D Viewer\",\"ReferralProgram\":\"Referral Program\",\"ShoutoutProgram\":\"Earn Program\",\"SketchTo3DConverter\":\"Sketch to 3D Converter\",\"TextGenerator\":\"3D Text Generator\",\"Tutorials\":\"Tutorials\"},\"Tools\":{\"Title\":\"Tools\"}},\"Rating\":{\"G2\":\"G2 Rating: {rating}\",\"Trustpilot\":\"Trustpilot: {rating}\"},\"Subscribe\":{\"ButtonText\":\"Subscribe\",\"Description\":\"Join our newsletter to stay updated on latest news.\",\"ErrorMessage\":{\"DuplicateError\":\"You are already subscribed to our newsletter!\",\"InvalidEmail\":\"Please enter a valid email address\",\"RecaptchaError\":\"Something went wrong! Please try again later.\"},\"Placeholder\":\"Enter your email...\",\"SuccessMessage\":\"Newsletter subscribed!\",\"Title\":\"Subscribe to updates\"}},\"G2Review\":{\"Description\":\"Trusted by users worldwide, Meshy is committed to enhancing product quality through genuine feedback. We encourage users to share their reviews to help improve our services and earn reward credits. Join us in shaping a better user experience!\",\"Form\":{\"Description\":\"Thanks for reviewing us on G2. This is the last step: submit your G2 review link and get credits (within 1-5 business days).\",\"Email\":{\"Label\":\"Meshy Account Email\",\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter your email\"},\"G2Link\":{\"Label\":\"G2 Review Link\",\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter the link\",\"Tooltip\":\"Once your review has been published on G2, Go to \u003clink\u003e\u003c/link\u003e, and click 🔗 icon at the bottom-right to  copy your review link.\"},\"InvalidEmail\":\"Invalid email address\",\"InvalidEmailAccount\":\"You must first register a Meshy account with this email before proceeding.\",\"InvalidURL\":\"Please enter a valid Meshy G2 review URL.\",\"SubmitButton\":\"Submit \u0026 Claim Credits\",\"Submitting\":\"Submitting...\",\"Title\":\"Claim your credits after G2 review!\"},\"SubmitConflict\":\"This G2 review link has already been submitted. Please use a different link and try again.\",\"SubmitFailed\":\"Form submission failed.\",\"SubmitSuccess\":\"Success! Thank you for submitting the form!\",\"Title\":\"G2 Review - Meshy\"},\"Help\":{\"RefundRequest\":{\"Description\":\"Request a refund for your Meshy subscription.\",\"Message\":{\"InvoiceError\":\"Please enter a valid invoice number, in the format of XXXXXXXX-0000\",\"InvoiceError2\":\"Please enter a valid invoice number, in the format of  XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\",\"InvoiceInvalidError\":\"Please enter a valid invoice number before submitting\",\"RefundFailed\":\"Refund failed\",\"RefundSuccess\":\"Refund successfully\",\"UnexpectedError\":\"An unexpected error occurred. Please try again later\"},\"Page\":{\"Description\":{\"Criteria1\":\"Refunds are only available for subscription payments. \u003cemphasis\u003eAdditional credit purchases are non-refundable.\u003c/emphasis\u003e\",\"Criteria2\":\"Your refund request must be submitted \u003cemphasis\u003ewithin 5 days of the initial transaction date\u003c/emphasis\u003e.\",\"Criteria3\":\"The total credits used during your subscription period \u003cemphasis\u003emust not exceed 100\u003c/emphasis\u003e.\",\"Criteria4\":\"Your \u003cemphasis\u003einvoice number\u003c/emphasis\u003e in receipt email after purchase.\",\"Criteria5\":\"If you are using PayPal, please provide your \u003cstrong\u003etransaction ID\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"Criteria6\":\"The free/gifted subscription cannot be refunded.\",\"Criteria7\":\"The $1 referral subscription is not eligible for self-service refund.\",\"Paragraph1\":\"While we generally don't offer refunds due to the high operational costs of our AI services, we understand that exceptional circumstances may arise. We've established a fair refund policy to address such situations.\",\"Paragraph2\":\"To be eligible for a refund, please ensure you meet \u003cemphasis\u003eall of the following criteria\u003c/emphasis\u003e:\",\"Paragraph3\":\"Please note that if any of these conditions are not met, we will be unable to process your refund request.\",\"Paragraph4\":\"To initiate a refund request, please complete the form below. You'll need to provide:\",\"Paragraph5\":\"We appreciate your understanding and will review each request carefully.\",\"Paragraph6\":\"For more information about billing and other frequently asked questions, please visit our \u003cemphasis\u003eBilling FAQ\u003c/emphasis\u003e page in our Help Center.\"},\"Form\":{\"Button\":{\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"Submitting\":\"Submitting...\"},\"Label\":{\"InvoiceNumber\":\"Invoice Number\"},\"Placeholder\":{\"InvoiceNumber\":\"Enter your invoice number, e.g. 9427F82D-0001\",\"InvoiceNumber2\":\"Enter your invoice number, e.g. 7XJ88726PV6280001\"}},\"Response\":{\"Banner\":{\"AlreadyRefunded\":{\"Message\":\"This invoice has already been refunded.\"},\"RequestExpired\":{\"Message\":\"Your refund request has exceeded the 5-day window. We are unable to process your refund request.\"},\"Success\":{\"Message\":\"Your refund request has been approved. The refund will be processed by your payment provider and should appear in your account shortly.\"},\"Surpassed100Credits\":{\"Message\":\"Your subscription has used more than 100 credits. We are unable to process your refund request.\"},\"Warning\":{\"Message\":\"We were unable to locate the invoice associated with your account. Please verify the invoice number and ensure that you are logged in with the correct account. Kindly note that additional credits purchased are non-refundable. If you continue to encounter issues, please reach out to us at support@meshy.ai for further assistance.\"}}},\"Title\":\"Refund Request\"},\"Title\":\"Refund Request - Meshy\"}},\"Home\":{\"BentoGrid\":{\"3DFormats\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D model as OBJ, FBX, USDZ, GLB, STL and BLEND for seamless use in other softwares.\",\"Title\":\"Versatile 3D Formats\"},\"API\":{\"Description\":\"Integrate 3D model generation into your own app or other platforms with our API.\",\"Title\":\"API Integration\"},\"ArtStyle\":{\"Cartoon\":\"Cartoon\",\"Description\":\"Choose from multiple art styles to create the perfect 3D model for your needs.\",\"Realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"Sculpture\":\"Sculpture\",\"Title\":\"Versatile Art Styles\",\"Voxel\":\"Voxel\"},\"BeginnerFriendly\":{\"Description\":\"Easily transform your text or images into 3D models, allowing you to create even with no expertise.\",\"Title\":\"Beginner-Friendly\"},\"Description\":\"Our tool is designed for speed, ease of use, and seamless integration with industry standards and workflows.\",\"LightningSpeed\":{\"Description\":\"Stop losing days for modeling and texturing. 3D can be done in just seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Lightning Speed\"},\"MultilingualSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Enjoy a multilingual user interface that allows you to input prompt text in your preferred language.\",\"Title\":\"Multilingual Support\"},\"PBRMapsSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Automatically generated PBR maps give you even more realistic results.\",\"Title\":\"PBR Maps Support\"},\"Title\":\"Powerful, Fast, and User-Friendly\"},\"CreationSpeed\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy turbocharges every phase of 3D asset creation, slashing turnaround times from days to minutes. From prompt to model, our integrated AI-powered tools let you iterate, generate, and refine with unmatched efficiency.\",\"Feature\":{\"3DToVideo\":{\"Description\":\"Bring 3D models and scenes to life with our AI video generator. Our 3D to Video feature ensures consistent results and gives you full control over every shot.\",\"Title\":\"3D to Video\"},\"AITexturing\":{\"Description\":\"Enhance your 3D models—generated or uploaded—using text prompts or reference images with our AI texture generator, crafting textures in any style you want.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing\"},\"AnimationLibrary\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s animation library offers 500+ game-ready motions—from basic walks and jumps to complex shooting stances, fights, and dance moves.\",\"Title\":\"Animation Library\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your 2D images, sketch or illustrations effortlessly into stunning 3D models with our image to 3D model tool. Perfect for creators looking to bring their images to life.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D Model\"},\"MultilingualSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Besides English, Meshy supports prompts in multiple languages—type in Spanish, French, Chinese, Japanese, and more to create with ease.\",\"Title\":\"Multilingual Support\"},\"MultipleConcurrentTasks\":{\"Description\":\"Accelerate your workflow with bulk generation—Meshy can handle 50+ 3D model and texture tasks at once.\",\"Title\":\"Multiple Concurrent Tasks\"},\"RiggingAndAnimation\":{\"Description\":\"Easily rig your characters with automatic rigging, and prepare them for animation and industry-standard workflows.\",\"Title\":\"Rigging and Animation\"},\"SmartRemesh\":{\"Description\":\"Instantly adjust triangle or quad counts, switch topology types, and balance detail and performance on export with options from 1k to 300k.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Remesh\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Create detailed 3D models from your ideas using our Text to 3D Model tool, which generates accurate 3D models from simple text descriptions.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D Model\"}},\"Name\":\"Creation Speed\",\"Title\":\"Instant 3D Model Creation in Seconds\"},\"CreativeFlexibility\":{\"Description\":\"Unlock limitless creativity with Meshy—craft props, characters, and environments in any style, from photorealistic to cartoon or sci-fi, all on your terms.\",\"Feature\":{\"AIPromptHelper\":{\"Description\":\"The built-in AI prompt helper transforms vague ideas into clear, detailed prompts—so you get the 3D model you envisioned, every time.\",\"Title\":\"AI Prompt Helper\"},\"LimitlessAssetTypes\":{\"Description\":\"You can generate an endless variety of assets including characters, props, environments, and functional models like phone holders—your imagination sets the limit.\",\"Title\":\"Limitless Asset Types\"},\"PBRMapsSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy supports PBR textures—Diffuse, Roughness, Metallic, and Normal maps—export-ready for Unreal, Unity, Blender, Maya, and WebGL.\",\"Title\":\"PBR Maps Support\"},\"VersatileTextureStyles\":{\"Description\":\"Create in any style, from realistic and cartoon to hand painted and fantasy, with Meshy's broad range of texture options at your command.\",\"Title\":\"Versatile Texture Styles\"},\"VibrantCommunity\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s community of over 10 million creators shares, downloads, and remixes models. You can find collaboration, inspiration, and creative growth at Meshy community.\",\"Title\":\"Vibrant Community\"}},\"Name\":\"Creative Flexibility\",\"Title\":\"Unlock Limitless Creative Freedom\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI 3D model generator turns text and images into production-ready 3D models in 20-30 seconds. Export to FBX, OBJ, GLB, and STL formats. Try Meshy free.\",\"EnterpriseGradeControls\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy empowers organizations with robust tools for secure access, data privacy, collaboration, and governance, making it the perfect solution for enterprise-level, multi-team, multi-project environments.\",\"Feature\":{\"CentralizedBilling\":{\"Description\":\"All team members share a single billing account, making it easier for IT and finance teams to manage payments and invoices.\",\"Title\":\"Centralized Billing\"},\"Certification\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy delivers enterprise-grade security across every layer of our platform. Our platform is certified under SOC2 Type II, ISO27001, and GDPR\",\"Title\":\"ISO27001, SOC2 Type II, \u0026 GDPR Certifications\"},\"DataPrivacy\":{\"Description\":\"Enterprise customer data is stored in a separate, secure database to ensure privacy and meet organizational compliance needs.\",\"Title\":\"Increased Data Privacy\"},\"DedicatedAccountSupport\":{\"Description\":\"Dedicated account executives and solutions engineers are here to support your enterprise setup and assist with any general inquiries promptly.\",\"Title\":\"Dedicated Account Support\"},\"ForeverAssetRetention\":{\"Description\":\"Once generated, your models are always available for download—anytime you need them.\",\"Title\":\"Forever Asset Retention\"},\"MultiTeamManagement\":{\"Description\":\"For enterprise organizations managing multiple games and large teams, Meshy enables you to create and manage multiple team workspaces with centralized control and oversight.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-Team Management\"},\"SSO\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy Enterprise supports SSO via SAML, enabling secure, centralized login for large teams using identity providers like Okta, Google Workspace, or Microsoft Entra.\",\"Title\":\"Single Sign-On (SSO)\"},\"SharedTeamWorkspace\":{\"Description\":\"Shared credits and a unified asset library keep your team in sync and enable seamless collaboration throughout the workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Shared Team Workspace\"}},\"Name\":\"Enterprise-Grade Controls\",\"Title\":\"Enterprise-grade Controls and Administration\"},\"Features\":{\"Description\":\"Powerful AI generation tools to help you unlock infinite possibilities.\",\"Label\":\"Features\",\"Title\":\"Your Ultimate AI 3D Model Generator\"},\"FineTunedControl\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy puts you in control—guide generation with input settings, iterate on results, and fine-tune details until the asset aligns with your vision.\",\"Feature\":{\"AITextureEditing\":{\"Description\":\"Create unlimited textures on the same mesh and refine colors, patterns, or materials simply by adjusting your prompts.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texture Editing\"},\"FreeRetry\":{\"Description\":\"With the same prompt, you can re-generate models for free, so you achieve the result you want.\",\"Title\":\"Free Retry\"},\"MultiViewImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Generate front, side, and back view images of your concept, then turn them into a high-fidelity 3D model that matches your vision.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-view Image to 3D\"},\"TextToMultiViewImages\":{\"Description\":\"Generate captivating images from text prompts using our Text to Single or Multiple Image tool, making it easy to visualize your concepts.\",\"Title\":\"Text to Image\"}},\"Name\":\"Fine-tuned Control\",\"Title\":\"Total Creative Authority and Control\"},\"Hero\":{\"AgentBanner\":{\"Label\":\"AI Agents. Now for 3D. Start chatting\",\"Tag\":\"New\"},\"CTA\":\"Start Creating\",\"Categories\":{\"3DAnimation\":{\"Name\":\"3D Animation\"},\"3DPrinting\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy AI turns your ideas into 3D-printable models in seconds\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003e3D Modeling Is No Longer a Barrier to Creation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEasily Resize and Export in Printer-Ready Formats\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eClean, Detailed Models Built to Industry Standards\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"3D Printing\"},\"Button\":\"Explore More\",\"ECommerce\":{\"Name\":\"E-commerce\"},\"Education\":{\"Description\":\"Affordable and Accessible 3D Models for educators and students\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eUnleash Creativity in 3D Printing Classes\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePower Game \u0026 XR Education\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpeed Up Educational App Development\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"Education\"},\"FilmProduction\":{\"Description\":\"Cut costs and accelerate VFX and previsualization workflows with Meshy AI\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eFast Previs \u0026 Look Dev\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStreamlined VFX Workflow\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIndustry-Standard Quality\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"Film Production\"},\"Free3DModels\":{\"Name\":\"Free 3D Models\"},\"GameDevelopment\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy AI slashes 3D asset \u0026 animation cost in game development\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eRemesh \u0026 PBR Texture Support\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnimate Your Game Characters\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExport Seamlessly to Any Game Engine\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"Game Development\"},\"InteriorDesign\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy turns sketches, mood boards, or text into production-ready 3D interior assets\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eFrom Concept to Presentation, Fast\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePhotorealistic Results, No CAD Required\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e3D Design Made Easy for Everyone\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"Interior Design\"},\"ProductDesign\":{\"Description\":\"With Meshy AI, deliver creativity, speed, and precision in your product design workflow\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eRapid Concept to 3D Prototype\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDesign Smarter, Spend Less\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDemocratize Modeling Skills\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"Product Design\"},\"ToyDesign\":{\"Name\":\"Toy Design\"},\"VFX\":{\"Name\":\"VFX\"},\"VRAR\":{\"Description\":\"Low poly, optimized 3D assets for VR/AR made possible with Meshy AI\",\"Features\":\"\u003cli\u003eRapid 3D Asset Creation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOptimized for Real-Time Performance\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuilt for VR/AR Workflows\u003c/li\u003e\",\"Name\":\"VR/AR\"}},\"Description\":{\"Desktop\":\"Meet the world's most popular and intuitive free AI 3D model generator. Transform text and images into stunning 3D models in seconds with our text \u0026 image to 3D model tool—no experience required!\",\"Mobile\":\"Meshy is your AI 3D modeling partner that helps game developers, game studios, 3D printing enthusiasts, and XR creators worldwide create 3D models and animations in seconds.\"},\"Explore\":\"Explore 3D Models\",\"GenerateNowCTA\":\"Generate Now\",\"Get10OffCTA\":\"Get $10 Off\",\"Title\":{\"Desktop\":\"The Easiest Way to Create 3D Models\",\"ForSEO\":\"Create 3D Models from Text and Images with AI\",\"Mobile\":\"Create Stunning 3D Models with Our Free AI 3D Model Generator\"},\"TryForFreeCTA\":\"Try for Free\"},\"Highlights\":{\"3DCreationDemocratized\":{\"Description\":\"Empower anyone to create production-ready 3D assets from a simple text prompt or reference images in seconds, no need for learning specialized modeling skills\",\"Title\":\"3D Content Creation Democratized\"},\"Faster\":{\"Description\":\"Reduce hours or days of manual modeling and texturing to mere minutes, lightning fast generation speed saves you time in the development cycle and ensures your projects stay on schedule\",\"Title\":\"10x Faster Than Traditional Methods\"},\"ScaleCreationWithoutScalingCosts\":{\"Description\":\"Create thousands of assets simultaneously at a fraction of traditional costs, cutting expenses for scaled 3D content creation by up to 100x\",\"Title\":\"Scale Creation without Scaling Costs\"}},\"HowItWorks\":{\"SetItLives\":{\"ButtonName\":\"See It Live\"},\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Upload a clear image or type a short text prompt, no 3D skills required.\",\"Title\":\"Input\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Watch it become a high-quality 3D model aligned to your input in moments.\",\"Title\":\"Generate\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Preview your model in the browser, then download for your workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Download\"},\"Title\":\"How It Works\"},\"InviteeSection\":{\"Achievements\":{\"Description\":\"Here's what some of our millions of users have to say ...\",\"ModelsCreated\":\"Models Created\",\"MostPopular\":\"Most Popular 3D AI Tool\",\"Title\":\"See Why Creators Love Meshy\"},\"Invitee\":{\"AvatarTitle\":\"Invited by\",\"BigTitle\":\"Your Friend Has Gifted You a Free Month to Explore 3D Creation on Meshy!\",\"Description\":\"Dive into 3D modeling with Meshy.Ai, trusted by over 10 million creators. Use your \u003chighlight\u003e$20 reward\u003c/highlight\u003e to start today.\",\"JoinNow\":\"Join Now\",\"Title\":\"You're Invited:\"}},\"InviteeSectionV2\":{\"InviteAction\":{\"AdditionalDiscountNote\":\"Claim now and get additional 50% off for the next 2 months.\",\"CancelAnytime\":\"Cancel Anytime\",\"ClaimFreeTrial\":\"Claim Free Trial\",\"ClaimOffer\":\"Claim Offer\",\"ExclusiveGift\":\"EXCLUSIVE GIFT\",\"InvitedYouToTry\":\"invited you to try...\",\"NewRewardPricingDescription\":\"Claim the offer and get an additional \u003chighlight\u003e50% Off\u003c/highlight\u003e discount for your next 2 months.\",\"ProPlan\":\"Pro Plan\",\"Title\":\"Your Friend Has Gifted You a Free Month to Explore 3D Creation on Meshy!\",\"TitleNewRewardPricing\":\"Unlock 3D creation:  Your Friend Gifted You 30 Days of Pro for Just $1!\",\"ValidFor30Days\":\"Valid for 30 days\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Trust by \u003chighlight\u003e{userCount} users\u003c/highlight\u003e and \u003chighlight\u003e{orgCount} organizations\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Title\":\"No.1 GenAI 3D Platform\"},\"LovedByCreators\":{\"Name\":\"Loved \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eBy \u003cb\u003eCreators\u003c/b\u003e\"},\"Partners\":{\"Description\":\"Trusted by partners and customers across industries to build the future of 3D creation\",\"Rating\":{\"G2\":\"G2 Rating: 4.8\",\"Trustpilot\":\"TrustPilot Rating: 4.8\"}},\"ProductionReadiness\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy offers built-in post-processing to meet poly budgets, fix mesh issues, and export in industry-standard formats—no additional tools required.\",\"Feature\":{\"AssetManagement\":{\"Description\":\"Browse, preview, and manage your generated assets in one place. Label, search, and bulk download past assets anytime, so you spend less time digging and more time creating.\",\"Title\":\"Asset Management\"},\"MultipleFileFormats\":{\"Description\":\"Export model in FBX, GLB, OBJ, STL, 3MF, USDZ, BLEND formats for production use—no extra conversion needed.\",\"Title\":\"Multiple 3D File Formats Support\"},\"PrivateLicensed\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy offers a private license that lets you commercialize your generated models while protecting them from unauthorized use or sharing.\",\"Title\":\"Private Licensed\"},\"ResizeAndPivotTool\":{\"Description\":\"Set accurate real-world dimensions and pivot points for perfect in-scene alignment or 3D-print readiness.\",\"Title\":\"Resize and Pivot Tool\"}},\"Name\":\"Production Readiness\",\"Title\":\"Ready for Professional Production, Instantly\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Collections\":{\"Name\":\"Collections\"},\"ExploreMore\":{\"Name\":\"Explore More\"},\"Models\":{\"Name\":\"Models\"},\"Title\":\"Showcase\"},\"SocialMedia\":{\"Description\":\"Join out community to stay up to date and learn how other people are leveraging the power of Meshy.\",\"Discord\":{\"Description\":\"Become part of our vibrant Discord community to get real-time support, submit feature requests, and have fun connecting with fellow Meshy users.\"},\"Title\":\"Stay in the Loop\",\"Twitter\":{\"Description\":\"Follow us on Twitter/X @MeshyAI to keep up with the latest releases and updates.\"},\"YouTube\":{\"Description\":\"Check out our YouTube channel to learn the techniques and use cases about the latest features.\"}},\"Testimonial\":{\"Description\":\"Here's what some of our millions of users have to say...\",\"ModelsCreated\":{\"Title\":\"Models Created\"},\"MostPopular3D\":{\"Title\":\"Most Popular 3D AI Tool\"},\"Title\":\"See Why Creators Love Meshy\"},\"Title\":\"AI 3D Model Generator: Create 3D from Text \u0026 Images | Meshy\",\"UnlockFaster3DWorkflow\":{\"Name\":\"3D, \u003cb\u003eOn Command\u003c/b\u003e\"},\"UserStories\":{\"Title\":\"User Stories\"},\"WorkflowIntegration\":{\"APIPlatform\":{\"Description\":\"Tap directly into Meshy’s generation power via a robust, well-documented REST API—create tasks, manage balance, and weave 3D creation into any pipeline or language with just a few lines of code.\",\"Title\":\"API Platform\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy’s plugins and API provide a frictionless bridge between asset creation and your preferred tools, ensuring efficiency from ideation to in-engine deployment.\",\"Name\":\"Workflow Integration\",\"PlatformPlugin\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy integrates directly into your game engine and 3D pipeline with native plugins—import generated assets seamlessly into Blender, Unity, 3ds Max, Maya, Godot, Unreal Engine, and 3D printing softwares including Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, Elegoo Slicer, Ultimaker Cura, and Lychee Slicer.\",\"Title\":\"3D Platform Plugins\"},\"Title\":\"Seamless Integration with Your 3D Pipeline\"}},\"HomeNeo\":{\"Agent\":{\"Extract\":{\"Bubble1\":\"Translate the image assets covered in the picture into single model asset images, with a solid-color background, which needs to include: aircraft, plant life, and Mexican-style architecture.\",\"Bubble2\":\"On it! Isolating each asset into its own model on a clean solid background! 🎨\",\"Bubble3\":\"All assets are extracted and ready to use! Each sits on its own solid color. 🎨✨\",\"Desc\":\"Type a text prompt and the AI agent plans, generates, textures, and refines a complete 3D model for you — handling the entire multi-step workflow automatically.\",\"Tab\":\"From 2D Image to 3D Model Assets\",\"TileModel\":\"3D Model\"},\"Headline\":{\"Prefix\":\"Meshy can help you create\",\"Word1\":\"Miniatures\",\"Word2\":\"Characters\",\"Word3\":\"Game Assets\",\"Word4\":\"Props\",\"Word5\":\"Figurines\"},\"PromptPlaceholder\":\"Describe your idea, and start creating with agent\",\"Retexture\":{\"Bubble1\":\"Replace with four images featuring wooden, pure metal, glass texture, and weathered moss textures.\",\"Bubble2\":\"Got it! Generating four material textures simultaneously! 🎨\",\"Bubble3\":\"All four material textures are complete! Each has its own unique effect. 🎨✨\",\"Desc\":\"Chat with the agent to restyle any model — describe a material or mood and it re-textures every variant in a single pass, no manual UV work.\",\"LabelGlass\":\"💎 Glass Texture Version\",\"LabelMoss\":\"🌿 Weathered Moss Version\",\"LabelPureMetal\":\"⚙️ Pure Metal Version\",\"LabelWooden\":\"🪵 Wooden Version\",\"Tab\":\"Texturing by Chat\",\"TileGlass\":\"Glass\",\"TileGolden\":\"Golden\",\"TileMoss\":\"Weathered Moss\",\"TileOriginal\":\"Original\",\"TilePureMetal\":\"Pure Metal\",\"TileWooden\":\"Wooden\"}},\"Cta\":{\"Button\":\"Start Creating for Free\",\"Description\":\"No credit card required. Generate your first 3D model in under a minute.\",\"Title\":\"Start Creating in 3D\"},\"ExploreFeatures\":{\"Title\":\"Explore More Features\"},\"FAQ\":{\"A1\":\"Yes. Meshy has a free tier you can use without a credit card — it lets you generate 3D models from text and images with daily credits. Paid plans add higher resolution, faster generation, private licensing, and commercial rights, with options for individuals, teams, and enterprises.\",\"A2\":\"Commercial use requires a paid plan with Private Licensed output. The free tier is for personal and evaluation use. Paid subscriptions grant commercial rights to the 3D models you generate, so you can sell or ship them in games, products, and client work.\",\"A3\":\"Meshy exports to FBX, OBJ, GLB, and STL, covering real-time engines, 3D printing, and web viewers. Generated models work directly in Unity, Unreal, and Blender through Meshy's native plugins, so assets drop into your existing pipeline without manual conversion.\",\"A4\":\"Meshy produces PBR-textured, production-ready meshes using the Meshy 6 engine, with smart remesh and auto-rigging for clean topology and animation. Detail and realism scale with the input and prompt, and paid plans unlock higher-resolution output for closer-to-final assets.\",\"A5\":\"No. Meshy turns a text prompt or a single image into a 3D model in about 20 to 30 seconds, with automatic remeshing and rigging handled for you. It's built for creators, game developers, and hobbyists who want 3D results without learning traditional modeling software.\",\"Q1\":\"Is Meshy free to use?\",\"Q2\":\"Can I use the 3D models I create commercially?\",\"Q3\":\"What 3D file formats can I export from Meshy?\",\"Q4\":\"How realistic and detailed are Meshy's 3D models?\",\"Q5\":\"Do I need 3D modeling experience to use Meshy?\"},\"Features\":{\"Agent\":{\"Description\":\"Not sure where to start? Just chat. The 3D Agent brainstorms ideas with you, turns 2D concepts into 3D models, and answers your 3D and printing questions as you go.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI Agent\"},\"ImageTo3d\":{\"CardDescription\":\"Upload a photo, sketch, or concept art, and Meshy turns it into a matching 3D model you can print, use in a game, or refine further.\",\"CardTitle\":\"High-Fidelity Image-to-3D\",\"Cta\":\"Convert Images to 3D\",\"CtaConvert\":\"Convert to 3D Now\",\"Description\":\"Upload a photo, sketch, or concept art. Meshy reconstructs it in 3D with faithful geometry and texture.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Image to 3D Model\",\"Feature1Desc\":\"Export to GLB, OBJ, FBX, STL, USDZ and more — ready out of the box.\",\"Feature1Title\":\"Any Format, Ready to Use\",\"Feature2Desc\":\"Everything runs in your browser — no download, no plugin, no learning curve.\",\"Feature2Title\":\"No Software, No Setup\",\"Feature3Desc\":\"Sharp edges, accurate proportions, and rich detail — up to nearly 600K faces.\",\"Feature3Title\":\"High-Fidelity Mesh Output\",\"Feature4Desc\":\"Diffuse, Roughness, Metallic, and Normal maps for any game engine or renderer.\",\"Feature4Title\":\"PBR-Ready Textures Included\",\"Heading\":\"Why Meshy's Image to 3D Leads the Industry\",\"UploadImage\":\"Upload Image\"},\"Menu\":{\"Agent\":\"AI Modeling Agent\",\"ImageTo3d\":\"Image to 3D Model\",\"TextTo3d\":\"Text to 3D Model\"},\"Skip\":\"Skip\",\"Subtitle\":\"Upload a photo for quick generate. Or let the AI agent handle it end to end.\",\"Tabs\":{\"ImageTo3d\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TextTo3d\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"TextTo3d\":{\"CardDescription\":\"Just describe what you want, and Meshy builds a 3D model in about a minute that you can refine or export.\",\"CardTitle\":\"Lightning-Fast Text-to-3D\",\"Placeholder\":\"Coming soon\"},\"Title\":\"Create 3D, your way\"},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy is a free AI 3D model generator that turns text or images into ready-to-use 3D models for games and 3D printing,\u003caccent\u003e in under a minute.\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"ModelPickerAriaLabel\":\"Choose a 3D model to preview\",\"ModelPreviewAriaLabel\":\"Preview 3D model {number}\",\"RotateModel\":\"Rotate model\",\"StartGenerate\":\"Start Creating\",\"Title\":\"Create 3D Models Instantly with Our \u003chighlight\u003eAI 3D Model Generator\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"TryImages\":\"Try images:\",\"UploadHint\":\"Upload Your Image to Generate\"},\"ShowcaseWall\":{\"Cta\":\"Explore the Community\",\"Tags\":{\"Gaming\":\"Gaming\",\"Industrial\":\"Industrial\",\"Printing\":\"3D Printing\"},\"Title\":\"See what the community is creating\"},\"Trust\":{\"Stats\":{\"Models\":{\"Label\":\"Generated Models\",\"Value\":\"100M+\"},\"Rank\":{\"Label\":\"3D AI Tool\",\"Value\":\"#1\"},\"Users\":{\"Label\":\"Users\",\"Value\":\"10M+\"},\"Visits\":{\"Label\":\"Monthly Visits\",\"Value\":\"8M+\"}},\"Title\":\"Trusted by Millions of Creators\"},\"UseCases\":{\"CompatibleWith\":\"Compatible with\",\"CreativeLab\":{\"Cta\":\"Meshy Creative Labs\",\"Subtitle\":\"We'll 3D print the real thing and ship it to your door\",\"Title\":\"No printer?\"},\"ExportFormats\":\"Export formats\",\"Items\":{\"Film\":{\"Label\":\"Media Production\",\"Subtitle\":\"Populate your world in hours, not weeks\"},\"Game\":{\"Features\":{\"LowPoly\":{\"Desc\":\"Low Poly Mode gives you clean topology with a poly count you control, light enough to drop straight into your project without a performance hit.\",\"Title\":\"Low Poly for Real-Time Performance\"},\"Pbr\":{\"Desc\":\"Generate a full PBR set (albedo, normal, metallic, and roughness) with no shader setup. Switch on HD Texture for crisp 4K detail in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"One-Click PBR Texturing\"},\"Rig\":{\"Desc\":\"Auto-rigging works on both humanoid and quadruped characters, paired with a library of 600+ motion presets covering walk cycles, idles, jumps, attacks, and gestures.\",\"Title\":\"Rig and Animate Your Characters\"}},\"Label\":\"Game Dev\",\"Subtitle\":\"More than a one-asset generator, Meshy helps you build enough of your game world to start playtesting.\",\"Title\":\"AI Assets to Get Your Game Playable\"},\"Industrial\":{\"Label\":\"Industrial Design\",\"Subtitle\":\"Prototype faster than you can sketch\"},\"Interior\":{\"Label\":\"Interior Design\",\"Subtitle\":\"Design any space with custom 3D assets\"},\"Printing\":{\"AutoRepairBadge\":\"AI Auto-Repair\",\"Features\":{\"MultiColor\":{\"Desc\":\"Multi-color printing maps each texture to the right filament, with clean color boundaries. When a model is too complex, Auto Split breaks it into watertight parts, pre-arranged on the build plate.\",\"Title\":\"Print in Multi-Color, or Split to Fit\"},\"PrintReady\":{\"Desc\":\"Most AI models need manual cleanup before they'll slice. Meshy models come out watertight and manifold. A built-in printability check still scans every export and auto-repairs any edge cases before you slice.\",\"Title\":\"Born Printable, Not Patched\"},\"Slicer\":{\"Desc\":\"Export as STL, OBJ, or 3MF, then send models directly to OrcaSlicer, Bambu Studio, and more, ready for single- or multi-color printing.\",\"Title\":\"Straight to Your Slicer\"}},\"Label\":\"3D Printing\",\"Subtitle\":\"Meshy 3D models are the most likely to print — watertight, manifold, and ready to slice on the first try. Tested against every major AI 3D tool.\",\"Title\":\"The Only 3D AI Trained to Print\"}},\"MediaLabel\":\"Media\",\"MoreTitle\":\"Other Use Cases\",\"QuickLinks\":{\"IndustrialDesign\":\"Industrial Design\"},\"Skip\":\"Skip\",\"StartCreating\":\"Start Creating\"},\"UserStories\":{\"Items\":{\"ChadHunter\":{\"Description\":\"Tabletop RPG enthusiast Chad Hunter used Meshy to bypass the steep learning curve of traditional 3D modeling — going from technical struggles to intricate, 10-inch dioramas in under a day.\",\"Name\":\"Chad Hunter\",\"Role\":\"Tabletop RPG Creator\",\"Title\":\"“With Meshy, my own character designs go from idea to a 28mm or 32mm miniature in my hand in less than a day. It's amazing.”\"},\"CyberFox\":{\"Description\":\"cyber_fox's journey of overcoming 3D creation challenges for her English-learning app with the help of Meshy — cutting per-model time from 300 hours in Blender to about five minutes.\",\"Name\":\"cyber_fox\",\"Role\":\"3D Artist \u0026 Indie Developer\",\"Title\":\"“Meshy's texturing feels like magic. I've been using it for about eight months, and the texture quality has improved markedly.”\"},\"Florida\":{\"Description\":\"Animation students used Meshy's image-to-3D to turn concept art into 3D previs assets in minutes — cutting placeholder modeling time by 90%.\",\"Name\":\"Pau Comes\",\"Role\":\"Animation Educator · Florida Universitària\",\"Title\":\"“Meshy helped students clarify ideas and show them in an image.”\"},\"Jlemarchand\":{\"Description\":\"Indie developer Jlemarchand uses Meshy to streamline 3D character creation for Navy Island Confidential, saving time while keeping full creative freedom.\",\"Name\":\"Jlemarchand\",\"Role\":\"Indie Game Developer\",\"Title\":\"“Thanks to Meshy, I've also refined my process: paying more attention to character details, poses, and color palettes before generation, which results in better meshes.”\"},\"Liga\":{\"Description\":\"Liga Superbohaterów shares how Meshy helps transform children's superhero drawings into 3D-printed figures, bringing moments of joy and strength to young patients fighting cancer — showing how imagination and technology can support healing.\",\"Name\":\"Liga Superbohaterów\",\"Role\":\"Non-Profit Foundation · Poland\",\"Title\":\"“A child scribbles their hero in a hospital bed, and Meshy brings it to life as a real 3D figure they can hold. Watching their eyes light up — that's magic.”\"}},\"ReadFullStory\":\"Read Full Story\"}},\"Layout\":{\"Schema\":{\"OrganizationDescription\":\"Meshy is the world's most popular AI 3D model generator that helps users effortlessly transform text and images into 3D models in seconds.\"}},\"LoyaltyCredits\":{\"BonusCreditsTable\":{\"Credits\":\"\u003cspan\u003e{value}\u003c/span\u003e credits\",\"Details\":{\"Abuse\":{\"Description\":\"If Meshy detects any abuse, fraud, or other attempts to game the Loyalty Credits Payback program, we reserve the right to revoke related loyalty credits and take appropriate action on the account.\",\"Title\":\"Abuse \u0026 Misuse\"},\"Consecutive\":{\"Description1\":\"A subscription is considered \u003cb\u003econsecutive\u003c/b\u003e if:\",\"Description2\":\"A subscription is considered \u003cb\u003einterrupted\u003c/b\u003e if:\",\"Description3\":\"Once interrupted, the current streak ends. When you subscribe again to an eligible monthly plan, a \u003cb\u003enew\u003c/b\u003e streak starts from month 1, and you will be able to receive the \\\"first renewal\\\" bonus again on the 2nd month.\",\"Item1\":\"Renewal payment is successful on time (or within the grace period), and\",\"Item2\":\"The plan does not enter an \\\"expired\\\" or \\\"cancelled\\\" state in between.\",\"Item3\":\"You cancel the plan and did not renew.\",\"Item4\":\"Payment fails and is not recovered within the grace period;\",\"Item5\":\"You switch to a plan that is not part of this program.\",\"Title\":\"What Counts as \\\"Consecutive\\\"?\"},\"Downgrade\":{\"Description\":\"If you \u003cb\u003edowngrade between monthly plans or switch from yearly to monthly subscription,\u003c/b\u003e your current \u003cb\u003estreak will be reset and not retained.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Plan Downgrade\"},\"Eligibility\":{\"Item1\":\"Applicable plans: \u003cb\u003eStarter Monthly\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003ePro Monthly\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003ePremium Monthly\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eUltra Monthly\u003c/b\u003e, and \u003cb\u003eStudio Monthly\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Item2\":\"Not included: all yearly plans, quarterly plans, enterprise/education/free plan subscriptions\",\"Title\":\"Eligibility\"},\"Issuance\":{\"Item1\":\"Loyalty credits are issued automatically after each successful renewal payment is completed.\",\"Item2\":\"\u003cb\u003eLoyalty credits are type of payment credits that do not expire.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Item3\":\"You can view the credit records in your account/billing/credits section.\",\"Item4\":\"Usage and validity follow Meshy's standard credits policy.\",\"Title\":\"Loyalty Credit Issuance\"},\"RewardStructure\":{\"Description1\":\"The loyalty rewards will be granted based on your subscription streak month.\",\"Description2\":\"The loyalty rewards count as \u003cb\u003epermanent credits\u003c/b\u003e and will not clear out monthly.\",\"Month1\":{\"Item1\":\"You get the credits that come with your plan.\",\"Item2\":\"No extra loyalty credits.\",\"Title\":\"Month 1 (new subscription):\"},\"Month2\":{\"PremiumMonthly\":\"Premium Monthly: \u003cb\u003e1500 credits\u003c/b\u003e\",\"ProMonthly\":\"Pro Monthly: \u003cb\u003e500 credits\u003c/b\u003e\",\"StarterMonthly\":\"Starter Monthly: \u003cb\u003e125 credits\u003c/b\u003e\",\"StudioMonthly\":\"Studio Monthly: \u003cb\u003e1000 credits\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Month 2 (first renewal — highest reward):\",\"UltraMonthly\":\"Ultra Monthly: \u003cb\u003e5000 credits\u003c/b\u003e\"},\"Month3To7\":{\"Description\":\"As long as you renew every month without a break, you will receive an increasing amount of loyalty credits.\",\"Note\":\"After the 7th consecutive month, you may continue your subscription and use your plan as usual, but no additional loyalty credits will be issued for that streak.\",\"PremiumMonthly\":{\"Month3\":\"3rd month: 540 credits\",\"Month4\":\"4th month: 720 credits\",\"Month5\":\"5th month: 900 credits\",\"Month6\":\"6th month: 1080 credits\",\"Month7\":\"7th month: 1260 credits\",\"Title\":\"Premium Monthly:\"},\"ProMonthly\":{\"Month3\":\"3rd month: 180 credits\",\"Month4\":\"4th month: 240 credits\",\"Month5\":\"5th month: 300 credits\",\"Month6\":\"6th month: 360 credits\",\"Month7\":\"7th month: 420 credits\",\"Title\":\"Pro Monthly:\"},\"StarterMonthly\":{\"Month3\":\"3rd month: 45 credits\",\"Month4\":\"4th month: 60 credits\",\"Month5\":\"5th month: 75 credits\",\"Month6\":\"6th month: 90 credits\",\"Month7\":\"7th month: 105 credits\",\"Title\":\"Starter Monthly:\"},\"StudioMonthly\":{\"Month3\":\"3rd month: 360 credits\",\"Month4\":\"4th month: 480 credits\",\"Month5\":\"5th month: 600 credits\",\"Month6\":\"6th month: 720 credits\",\"Month7\":\"7th month: 840 credits\",\"Title\":\"Studio Monthly:\"},\"Title\":\"Month 3–7 (continuous renewals):\",\"UltraMonthly\":{\"Month3\":\"3rd month: 1800 credits\",\"Month4\":\"4th month: 2400 credits\",\"Month5\":\"5th month: 3000 credits\",\"Month6\":\"6th month: 3600 credits\",\"Month7\":\"7th month: 4200 credits\",\"Title\":\"Ultra Monthly:\"}},\"Title\":\"Reward Structure\"},\"Upgrade\":{\"Description\":\"If you \u003cb\u003eupgrade between monthly plans or switch from monthly to yearly subscription,\u003c/b\u003e your current \u003cb\u003estreak will be reset and not retained.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Plan Upgrades\"}},\"Header\":{\"AllOtherPlans\":\"All Other Plans\",\"Month\":\"Month\",\"PremiumMonthly\":\"Premium Monthly\",\"ProMonthly\":\"Pro Monthly\",\"StarterMonthly\":\"Starter Monthly\",\"StudioMonthly\":\"Studio Monthly\",\"UltraMonthly\":\"Ultra Monthly\"},\"MapPinTooltip\":\"You are here!\",\"Month2\":{\"Tooltip\":\"{firstRenewalCredits} credits for the first renewal; {nonFirstRenewalCredits} credits for non-first renewals.\"},\"SeeDetails\":\"See Details\",\"Title\":\"Bonus Credits by Month\"},\"CreditOverviewLanding\":{\"Renew\":\"Renew\"},\"Description\":\"To thank users for their ongoing support, Meshy is launching the \\\"Loyalty Credits Payback\\\" program. Stay on any eligible monthly plan and earn extra permanent credits every month. As long as your subscription renews on time, we'll automatically grant bonus loyalty credits for your future creations — the longer your streak, the more you earn. If your plan is cancelled or renewal fails, your streak resets and starts again from month one.\",\"Dialog\":{\"Button\":\"I Got It\",\"Description\":\"Thanks for renewing subscription, {amount} loyalty credits have been granted to you.\",\"Title\":\"🎉 Your Loyalty Credits Are Ready!\"},\"FAQ\":{\"Answer1\":\"If you complete the payment within the allowed grace period, your streak can remain. If the payment fails, the subscription actually expires or is cancelled, the streak ends and will restart from month 1 next time.\",\"Answer2\":\"Yes. Each new consecutive subscription on any eligible monthly plan (Starter, Pro, Premium, Ultra, or Studio) can receive the Month 2 first-renewal bonus if you have never earned the first renewal credits for that tier. If you have earned the first renewal credits for that tier before, you will get the non-first-renewal amount (2× multiplier) for Month 2 renew.\",\"Answer3\":\"No. Loyalty credits granted under this Loyalty Credits Payback program are lifetime credits and do not expire.\",\"Answer4\":\"This program is designed to reward the first several continuous months the most and to encourage stable usage. After the 7th month you can still stay subscribed, but extra loyalty credits for that streak will stop.\",\"Answer5\":\"No. Credits are issued to the account that renewed and follow Meshy's general credits rules.\",\"Answer6\":\"No. This program applies to Starter Monthly, Pro Monthly, Premium Monthly, Ultra Monthly, and Studio Monthly only. Yearly and quarterly subscription plans have been designed for greater offers and discounts.\",\"Answer7\":\"Starter Monthly is now part of the loyalty credits program and accumulates its own streak. When you switch from Starter Monthly to Pro Monthly, your loyalty streak resets and starts from Month 1 on the Pro plan. You will need to renew Pro Monthly again next month to receive the Pro Month 2 first-renewal bonus (500 credits).\",\"Answer8\":\"When upgrading or downgrading between any eligible monthly plans (Starter, Pro, Premium, Ultra, Studio), your current streak will be reset and not retained.\",\"Question1\":\"What happens if my renewal payment fails?\",\"Question2\":\"As a Pro plan users, can I get the big Month 2 bonus (500 credits) again if I cancel and come back later?\",\"Question3\":\"Do these loyalty credits expire?\",\"Question4\":\"Why is there a cap at the 7th month?\",\"Question5\":\"Can I transfer loyalty credits to another account?\",\"Question6\":\"Does loyalty credit payback apply to yearly or quarterly plans?\",\"Question7\":\"I previously subscribed to the Starter plan for one month, then upgraded to Pro Monthly. How will my loyalty credits be calculated?\",\"Question8\":\"What happens to my streak if I switch between Pro Monthly and Studio Monthly?\",\"Title\":\"FAQ\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Check Your Tier\",\"Description\":\"To thank users for their ongoing support, Meshy is launching the \\\"Loyalty Credits Payback\\\" program. Stay on any \u003chighlight\u003eeligible monthly plan\u003c/highlight\u003e and earn \u003chighlight\u003eextra permanent credits\u003c/highlight\u003e every month. As long as your subscription renews on time, we'll automatically grant bonus loyalty credits for your future creations — the longer your streak, the more you earn. If your plan is cancelled or renewal fails, your streak resets and starts again from month one.\",\"Tag\":\"Bonus Credits\",\"Title\":\"Loyalty Program\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Choose any \u003chighlight\u003eeligible monthly plan\u003c/highlight\u003e (Starter, Pro, Premium, Ultra, or Studio) to start earning loyalty credits with your first subscription.\",\"Title\":\"Subscribe\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Keep your subscription active through \u003chighlight\u003eautomatic renewals\u003c/highlight\u003e to build your streak.\",\"Title\":\"Stay Active\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Receive \u003chighlight\u003ebonus permanent credits\u003c/highlight\u003e with each renewal (up to 6 months). Credits increase based on your streak length.\",\"Title\":\"Earn Credits\"},\"Title\":\"How the Loyalty Program Works\"},\"Title\":\"Loyalty Credits - Meshy\",\"YourTier\":{\"CreditBalance\":\"Credit Balance\",\"Description\":{\"Cancelled\":\"You have \u003cb\u003ecancelled\u003c/b\u003e the subscription next month and is \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible to get loyalty credits. Click to \u003cb\u003erenew\u003c/b\u003e your subscription and earn {credits} credits next month!\",\"Default\":\"You are now on \u003cb\u003e{tier} Plan\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible for loyalty credit payback. Thanks for your interest.\",\"FreeOrStarter\":\"You are now on {tier} Plan and \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible for loyalty credit payback. Please upgrade to any \u003cb\u003epaid monthly plan\u003c/b\u003e to start earning loyalty credits.\",\"NotLoggedIn\":\"Please login to view your tier and loyalty credits.\",\"OverMaxMonths\":\"Thanks for subscribing {tier} Plan for \u003cb\u003e{months} months\u003c/b\u003e.You are \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible to earn more loyalty credit payback. \",\"Quarterly\":\"You are now on {tier} \u003cb\u003eQuarterly Plan\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible for loyalty credit payback. Thanks for your interest.\",\"Renewing\":\"You are \u003cb\u003eeligible\u003c/b\u003e for loyalty credit payback. Thanks for subscribing {tier} Plan for \u003cb\u003e{months} {months, plural, =1 {month} other {months}}\u003c/b\u003e. Keep your subscription and earn {nextLoyaltyCredits} credits next month! If you cancelled the subscription, you will lost your next {tier} loyalty reward and back to the start.\",\"Yearly\":\"You are now on {tier} \u003cb\u003eYearly Plan\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eNOT\u003c/b\u003e eligible for loyalty credit payback. Thanks for your interest. We will keep offering your the best deals in the future.\"},\"LearnMore\":\"Learn more about \u003clink\u003eLoyalty Program\u003c/link\u003e\",\"LearnMoreShort\":\"Learn More\",\"LegacyUser\":\"You have an existing subscription streak. Rewards start from the launch of the loyalty program and will be granted on your next renewal.\",\"MonthTooltip\":{\"5thMonthBonus\":\"{month, selectordinal, one {#st} two {#nd} other {#th}} month's bonus: \u003cb\u003e{credits}\u003c/b\u003e Credits!\",\"CompletedBefore\":\"Completed before program launch.\",\"Earned\":\"🎉You earned \u003cb\u003e{credits}\u003c/b\u003e Loyalty Credits!\",\"FirstMonth\":\"Thanks for subscribing! Your bonus credits start next month.\",\"NextBonus\":\"Next bonus: \u003cb\u003e{credits}\u003c/b\u003e Credits!\",\"NextBonusCancelled\":\"renew your plan and get \u003cb\u003e{credits}\u003c/b\u003e bonus credits!\"},\"MonthlyCredits\":\"Monthly credits\",\"MonthlyCreditsTooltip\":\"Monthly credits that reset each billing cycle\",\"Months\":\"{months} {months, plural, =1 {month} other {months}}\",\"NextBonusIn\":\"Next bonus in {days} days\",\"PermanentCredits\":\"permanent credits\",\"PermanentCreditsTooltip\":\"Permanent credits that never expire\",\"RenewalStreak\":\"Renewal Streak\",\"Tier\":\"Tier\",\"Title\":\"Your Tier\",\"TotalLoyaltyCredits\":\"Total Loyalty Credits Earned\",\"YourPlanRenewsOn\":\"Your plan renews on \"}},\"MediaKit\":{\"Colors\":{\"Button\":{\"CopyHex\":\"Copy hex\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy's main brand color is a tech-inspired lime green, and the secondary color is a cyberpunk-style flamingo pink. For a quick Meshy look on social media or other places, we suggest using those two colors. Pair them with the deep black shades provided for outlining.\",\"MeshyBlack\":\"Meshy Black\",\"MeshyLime\":\"Meshy Lime\",\"MeshyPink\":\"Meshy Pink\",\"Title\":\"Meshy colors\"},\"CopyToClipboard\":{\"Success\":\"Copied to clipboard!\"},\"Description\":\"Get the latest Meshy media kit, including logos, brand guidelines, and press releases.\",\"Logo\":{\"Button\":{\"Download\":\"Download\"},\"Description\":\"For layouts with limited space or logo grids, you can use the Meshy logomark to represent the brand.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy logo\"},\"Page\":{\"Button\":{\"DownloadAll\":\"Download All\"},\"Description\":\"Resources for presenting the Meshy brand in a consistent and professional way.\",\"Title\":\"Media Kit\"},\"Title\":\"Media Kit - Meshy\",\"Usage\":{\"Description\":\"Leave ample space around Meshy brand elements. Whether making them larger or smaller, allow breathing room so they don't appear crowded or cluttered.\",\"Disclaimer\":\"These graphics are proprietary assets of Meshy, protected by intellectual property laws. Please avoid modifying or misusing them, including using them as logos for your products. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at:\",\"DisclaimerDot\":\".\",\"Title\":\"Usage\"},\"Wordmark\":{\"Button\":{\"Download\":\"Download\"},\"Description\":\"Use the Meshy wordmark whenever referring to Meshy, if space permits. We prefer the horizontal multicolor usage with the brand colors listed below.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy wordmark\"}},\"Pricing\":{\"Common\":{\"Unlimited\":\"Unlimited\"},\"Compare\":{\"API\":{\"3DPlatformPlugin\":{\"Title\":\"3D platform plugins\"},\"APIAccess\":{\"Title\":\"API access\"},\"APIConsole\":{\"Title\":\"API Console\"},\"APIPlayground\":{\"Full\":\"Full\",\"Limited\":\"Limited\",\"Title\":\"API Playground\"},\"AssetRetention\":{\"Forever\":\"Forever\",\"Title\":\"Asset retention\",\"XDays\":\"{days} days\"},\"DCCBridge\":{\"Title\":\"DCC bridge\"},\"RateLimits\":{\"Title\":\"Requests per second\"}},\"Collaboration\":{\"CentralizedBilling\":{\"Title\":\"Centralized billing\"},\"MultipleWorkspaces\":{\"Title\":\"User access to multiple workspaces\"},\"SSO\":{\"Title\":\"Single Sign-On (SSO)\"},\"SharedTeamCredits\":{\"Title\":\"Shared team credits\"},\"TeamWorkspaces\":{\"Multiple\":\"Multiple\",\"Single\":\"Single\",\"Title\":\"Team workspaces\"},\"Title\":\"Workspace \u0026 Collaboration\"},\"Description\":\"Get an overview of what’s included in each plan and choose the one that suits you best.\",\"Features\":{\"AITextureEditing\":{\"Title\":\"AI texture editing\"},\"AITexturing\":{\"Title\":\"AI Texturing\"},\"Animation\":{\"Title\":\"Rigging \u0026 animation\"},\"AnimationLibrary\":{\"Over500\":\"Over \u003cstrong\u003e500\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Animation library\"},\"DownloadCommunityModels\":{\"Starter\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e Downloads of community models\",\"Title\":\"Download community models\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"TextToImage\":{\"Title\":\"Text to Image\"},\"Title\":\"Features\"},\"Fundamental\":{\"AssetLicense\":{\"PrivateCustomerOwned\":\"Private \u0026 Customer owned\",\"Title\":\"Asset license\"},\"AssetsGeneration\":{\"MobileUnit\":\"Up to \u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Assets generation\",\"Unit\":\"Up to \u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e / month\"},\"CreditPlans\":{\"Customizable\":\"Customizable\",\"MobileUnit\":\" credits\",\"Title\":\"Credit plans\",\"Tooltip\":\"Credits reset at the beginning of each billing cycle.\",\"Unit\":\" credits / month\"},\"DownloadLimit\":{\"Free\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e \u003cb\u003eMeshy 5\u003c/b\u003e models / month\",\"MobileFree\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e \u003cb\u003eMeshy 5\u003c/b\u003e\",\"MobileStarter\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e downloads of all models\",\"Starter\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e downloads per month of all models\",\"Title\":\"Download limit\"},\"FreeRetries\":{\"Title\":\"Free retries\",\"Unlimited\":\"Unlimited\",\"X\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e for each task\"},\"GenerationSpeed\":{\"Title\":\"Generation speed\"},\"MonthSuffix\":\" / month\",\"PurchaseExtraCredits\":{\"Title\":\"Purchase extra credits\"},\"QueueLimit\":{\"Title\":\"Concurrent task limit\"},\"Remesh\":{\"Title\":\"Remesh\"},\"TaskProcessingPriority\":{\"High\":\"High\",\"HigherThanX\":\"\u003cspan\u003eHigher\u003c/span\u003e than {plan}\",\"Highest\":\"Highest\",\"Low\":\"Low\",\"Medium\":\"Medium\",\"Priority\":\" priority\",\"Title\":\"Task processing priority\"},\"Title\":\"Fundamental\"},\"Price\":{\"BilledMonthly\":\"{price} billed monthly\",\"BilledYearly\":\"billed yearly\",\"CustomPrice\":\"Custom price\",\"PerMonth\":\"{price} per month\"},\"Privacy\":{\"PrivacyControls\":{\"Advanced\":\"Advanced\",\"Basic\":\"Basic\",\"Title\":\"Privacy controls\"},\"SAMLSSO\":{\"Title\":\"SAML SSO\"},\"Title\":\"Privacy \u0026 Security\"},\"Support\":{\"Dedicated\":{\"Title\":\"Dedicated account support\"},\"Discord\":{\"Title\":\"Discord\"},\"Email\":{\"Title\":\"Email\"},\"LiveChat\":{\"Title\":\"Live chat\"},\"Title\":\"Support\"},\"Title\":\"Compare Plans\"},\"Description\":\"Compare Meshy plans: Free, Pro, Studio \u0026 Enterprise for AI 3D model generation. Upgrade for more credits \u0026 faster speed. Start free.\",\"FAQ\":{\"Billing\":{\"Answer1\":{\"Section1\":\"In the Meshy platform, Credits function as a form of internal currency or token.\",\"Section2\":\"They can be utilized to access and pay for various services offered by Meshy. Users can employ Credits to submit generation tasks or to tip and appreciate the work of others.\",\"Section3\":\"For more information about billing and other frequently asked questions, please visit our Billing FAQ page in our Help Center.\"},\"Answer10\":\"Meshy offers four plans: Free: $0; Pro: $20/mo (or $240 billed annually); Studio: $60/mo (or $576 billed annually); and Enterprise: custom pricing.\",\"Answer11\":\"Yes! The Free plan is available with no credit card required. You get 100 credits/month. Free-plan outputs are licensed under CC BY 4.0, which allows commercial use with attribution; queue priority is lower than paid plans.\",\"Answer12\":\"Absolutely. Meshy is a well-established AI 3D generation platform with a real team, regular product updates, and millions of creators and studios as customers, including paid enterprise clients.\",\"Answer13\":\"For most users, yes. Pro at $20/mo gets you 1,000 credits, 60% faster generation, API access, private asset ownership, and 10 concurrent tasks - making it one of the most affordable AI 3D tools available.\",\"Answer14\":\"1,000 credits/month. Plan credits reset monthly and do not accumulate.\",\"Answer15\":\"Yes. Additional credits can be purchased on Pro and Studio plans. The Free plan does not support credit top-ups.\",\"Answer2\":\"Certainly! We provide free users with {count} credits every month, which automatically reset at 00:00 (UTC) on the first day of each month. Additionally, you can earn extra credits via the methods provided in \u003clink\u003ethis help article\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"Answer3\":{\"Section1\":\"There are two types of credits, monthly credits and permanent credits. Monthly credits reset every month, whereas permanent credits do not expire.\",\"Section2\":\"Monthly credits are part of your subscription plan. Permanent credits include extra credits you purchase or free credits you earn as rewards.\"},\"Answer4\":{\"Section1\":\"After logging in, navigate to the Settings - Subscription page. Under the “Current Plan” section, you will find a “Cancel Plan” button, as highlighted in the image. Click this button to cancel your subscription.\"},\"Answer5\":{\"Section1\":\"You can upgrade your subscription whenever you like, with changes taking effect instantly.\",\"Section2\":\"To do so, navigate to the Settings - Subscription page. In the “Current Plan” section, click on the “Manage Plan” button. This will redirect you to the Stripe payment management page, where you can select a new plan seamlessly.\"},\"Answer6\":{\"Section1\":\"We generally don’t provide refunds, given the high operational costs associated with AI services powered by expensive GPUs.\",\"Section2\":\"However, exceptions may be made in \u003cemphasis\u003ecertain circumstances\u003c/emphasis\u003e. If you believe your situation warrants a refund, please contact us via email at support@meshy.ai to explain your case. Be sure to include:\",\"Section5\":\"- Your account email\",\"Section6\":\"- A detailed reason for your refund request.\",\"Section7\":\"- The invoice number of the payment (which was emailed to you at the time of payment).\",\"Section8\":\"We will review your request and determine if a refund can be issued. Normally this will take 3 business days to process.\"},\"Answer7\":{\"Section1\":\"We gladly accept all major credit cards and offer a range of popular payment options, including Cash App Pay, Apple Pay, Link, and iDEAL.\",\"Section2\":\"For our Enterprise plans, we can also accommodate wire transfers upon request.\"},\"Answer8\":\"We use Stripe as our payment processor. This means that when you make a payment, all payment details are handled directly by Stripe and Meshy does not have access to your credit card data.\",\"Answer9\":{\"Section1\":\"After your subscription is successful, an invoice will be automatically sent to your registered email address. \",\"Section2\":\"If you do not receive this email, please reach out to our customer service team at \u003cemail\u003e\u003c/email\u003e.\"},\"Question1\":\"How do credits work?\",\"Question10\":\"What is the price of Meshy AI?\",\"Question11\":\"Is Meshy AI free?\",\"Question12\":\"Is Meshy AI legit?\",\"Question13\":\"Is Meshy worth the money?\",\"Question14\":\"How many credits does the Pro plan include each month?\",\"Question15\":\"Can extra credits be purchased on paid plans?\",\"Question2\":\"Can I get free credits?\",\"Question3\":\"Do credits have an expiration date?\",\"Question4\":\"How can I cancel my subscription plan?\",\"Question5\":\"How can I upgrade my subscription plan?\",\"Question6\":\"Can I get a refund?\",\"Question7\":\"What payment methods do you offer?\",\"Question8\":\"How does Meshy ensure the security of payment information?\",\"Question9\":\"How can I get receipts?\",\"Title\":\"Billing FAQs\"},\"Description\":\"Get answers to frequently asked questions on Meshy.\",\"Product\":{\"Answer1\":{\"Section1\":\"Meshy is a 3D generative AI toolbox for effortlessly creating 3D assets from text or images, accelerating your 3D workflow.\",\"Section2\":\"Powered by the latest advances in AI, Meshy is built for 3D artists, game developers and 3D printing hobbyists. With Meshy, you can create high-quality 3D models and textures in minutes. The best part? You don't need any 3D modeling experience to get started, and it'll take you less than a minute to create your first 3D asset.\"},\"Answer2\":\"Yes, we take data security seriously. If you are using the web app, your data is stored securely with Amazon Web Services in the United States. We will NOT share your data or use it for any training purpose without your consent.\",\"Answer3\":\"For AI texturing, we support uploading models in \u003cemphasis\u003e.fbx\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.obj\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.stl\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.gltf\u003c/emphasis\u003e, and \u003cemphasis\u003e.glb\u003c/emphasis\u003e formats. Be sure to upload one model at a time. The size limit for the web app is 50MB. For Text to 3D and Image to 3D, we support downloading models in \u003cemphasis\u003e.fbx\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.obj\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.usdz\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.glb\u003c/emphasis\u003e, \u003cemphasis\u003e.stl\u003c/emphasis\u003e, and \u003cemphasis\u003e.blend\u003c/emphasis\u003e formats.\",\"Answer4\":\"Yes, we provide API services. You can visit \u003cemphasis\u003ehttps://docs.meshy.ai/en/\u003c/emphasis\u003e to check the API documentation.\",\"Answer5\":\"Yes, we currently have \u003clink1\u003eBlender plugin\u003c/link1\u003e and \u003clink2\u003eUnity plugin\u003c/link2\u003e.\",\"Answer6\":\"Yes. Under our Terms of Use, you own the assets created through our platform, provided that you have used materials that do not violate the copyrights of others in the process of generating your model. If you are on a premium plan, you own all assets you create with Meshy. If you are on a free plan, we grant you a \u003clink\u003eCC BY 4.0\u003c/link\u003e license instead.\",\"Answer7\":{\"Section1\":\"Yes. As a premium subscriber, the models you create using Meshy are exclusively yours, and you have full rights to distribute and sell them.\",\"Section2\":\"However, if you're a free user, you are also welcome to sell the models, but we kindly ask that you credit Meshy for the tool's use in the description of your commercial page.\"},\"Question1\":\"What makes Meshy different?\",\"Question2\":\"Is my asset safe?\",\"Question3\":\"What 3D file formats do you support?\",\"Question4\":\"Does Meshy provide API services?\",\"Question5\":\"Does Meshy provide plugins?\",\"Question6\":\"Can I use my generated assets for commercial projects?\",\"Question7\":\"Can I sell the assets I create with Meshy on other platforms?\",\"Title\":\"Product FAQs\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Page\":{\"Description\":\"Start for \u003chighlight\u003efree\u003c/highlight\u003e and scale with flexible Meshy plans designed for \u003chighlight\u003eindividual creators\u003c/highlight\u003e, \u003chighlight\u003egrowing teams\u003c/highlight\u003e, and \u003chighlight\u003eenterprise workflows\u003c/highlight\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Pricing \u0026 Plans\"},\"Testimonials\":{\"Title\":\"Turn your ideas into 3D assets \u003cb\u003ein minutes, not days\u003c/b\u003e\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy Official Pricing: Free, Pro, Studio \u0026 Enterprise Plans\"},\"RefGift\":{\"ClaimIneligible\":{\"Close\":\"Close\",\"Description\":\"Failed to claim the reward, please try again later.\",\"DescriptionNotFound\":\"The reward is not found, please check the link and try again.\",\"DescriptionOnlyOneClaimedAllowed\":\"This reward can only be claimed once.\",\"DescriptionPaidUser\":\"The \u003chighlight\u003e{rewardName}\u003c/highlight\u003e from your friend is only eligible for new/free users... but we truly appreciate having you with us.\",\"Title\":\"Uh-oh!\"},\"ClaimSuccess\":{\"ApplyNow\":\"Apply Now\",\"Description\":\"Thank you for joining Meshy! The \u003chighlight\u003e{rewardName}\u003c/highlight\u003e from your friend has been added to your account.\",\"MaybeLater\":\"Maybe Later\",\"Title\":\"Congrats!\"},\"GiftUnavailable\":{\"BigTitle\":\"This Gift is No Longer Available\",\"Description\":\"The reward has either been withdrawn by the sender or already claimed by someone else, so this invitation can't be redeemed anymore. You can still explore Meshy’s Holiday \u0026 New Year offers!\",\"Title\":\"Oops!\"},\"ReceiveGift\":{\"AvatarTitle\":\"Gifted By\",\"BigTitle\":\"Your Friend Is Sharing Their Meshy Holiday Pass With You!\",\"ClaimNow\":\"Claim Now\",\"Description\":\"Enjoy a \u003chighlight\u003e{rewardName}\u003c/highlight\u003e on Meshy.AI as a Holiday \u0026 New Year gift. Create, edit, and render 3D models in minutes—no experience needed. Claim your pass now and keep your reward even after the event ends.\",\"ExploreOffers\":\"Explore Offers\",\"HelperText\":\"This gift comes from our limited-time Holiday \u0026 2026 New Year promotion and is only available for new users and free-plan users. Don't miss it!\",\"NoOfferError\":\"Invalid gift link. Please check the link and try again.\",\"Title\":\"You're Invited to Meshy's Holiday \u0026 New Year 2026 Event:\"}},\"Referral\":{\"Description\":\"Refer your friends to our platform and earn up to 3 free months of Pro subscription. \",\"IncludedAssets\":\"Included Assets\",\"Invitation\":{\"CodeStatus\":{\"Applied\":\"Applied\",\"AppliedTips\":\"Will be automatically applied on \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e\",\"ApplyButton\":\"Apply to Next Renewal\",\"AwaitingRecipientNextSteps\":\"Awaiting the Recipient's Next Steps\",\"ConsumedTips\":\"Was applied on \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e\",\"CouponCode\":\"Coupon Code\",\"EligibleFree\":\"copy and paste this at checkout\",\"EligiblePremium\":\"apply only one code per billing cycle\",\"Expired\":\"Expired\",\"NotEligible\":\"Not Eligible\",\"RedeemButton\":\"Redeem Now\",\"ToastApplied\":\"Coupon code applied successfully!\",\"ToastCopied\":\"Coupon code copied\",\"ToastFailed\":\"Coupon code failed to apply. Please try again later.\"},\"NoInvitations\":\"No record of invitations\",\"RecipientStatus\":{\"EmailedDoesNotQualifyForOffer\":\"Emailed - Does Not Qualify for Offer\",\"EmailedNotRegistered\":\"Emailed - Not Registered\",\"ModelCreatedRewardCapReached\":\"Model Created - Reward Cap Reached\",\"ModelCreatedRewardEligible\":\"Model Created - Reward Eligible\",\"RegisteredAwaitingFirstModelCreation\":\"Registered - Awaiting First Model Creation\",\"RegisteredAwaitingFirstSubscription\":\"Registered - Awaiting First Subscription\",\"RegisteredFraudRisk\":\"Registered - Unusual Activity Detected\",\"RegisteredNoModelCreated\":\"Registered - No Model Created\"},\"TableHeader\":{\"CodeStatus\":\"Code Status\",\"Email\":\"Recipient Email\",\"FreeMonthsEarned\":\"Free Months Earned:\",\"RecipientStatus\":\"Recipient Status\",\"TotalInvited\":\"Total successful invitation:\",\"UpdatedTime\":\"Updated Time\"}},\"InviteFAQs\":{\"Answer1\":{\"Part1\":\"It’s simple! Share your unique referral link with friends who have never registered for Meshy. When they sign up, they’ll receive a $20 reward (equivalent to one free month of Pro) that can be applied to their next payment. Once they create their first model within 14 days, you’ll earn a $20 reward too - you can use it during your next purchase, or apply it directly to your current subscription from your referral page.\",\"Part1NewRewardPricing\":\"It's simple! Share your unique referral link with friends who have never registered for Meshy. When they sign up and subscribe, they'll get their first month of Pro for just $1, plus 50% off for the next 2 months. Once they subscribe, you'll earn a free month of Pro - you can use it during your next purchase, or apply it directly to your current subscription from your referral page.\",\"Part2\":\"Both rewards are valid for any subscription tier and auto-renewal plans. For annual subscription users, rewards can also be used toward credit purchases. They remain valid for one year from the date they are issued.\",\"Part3\":\"If you encounter any issues with the referral program, please email support@meshy.ai for assistance.\"},\"Answer2\":\"Rewards are capped at three, meaning you can earn up to three $20 rewards (equivalent to three free months of Pro). But feel free to refer as many friends as you want to help them explore Meshy!\",\"Answer2NewRewardPricing\":\"Rewards are capped at three, meaning you can earn up to three free months of Pro. But feel free to refer as many friends as you want to help them explore Meshy!\",\"Answer3\":\"Anyone who hasn’t signed up for MeshyAI before. Just make sure they register using your referral link and create their first model within 14 days.\",\"Answer4\":\"No, only one $20 reward can be applied per payment. Rewards cannot be stacked but will automatically reduce the total amount of your next payment. If you have multiple coupons, others may be applied first, and the referral coupon will be automatically applied once those are used. Rewards are valid for one year from the date they are issued.\",\"Answer4NewRewardPricing\":\"No, only one free month reward can be applied per payment. Rewards cannot be stacked but will automatically reduce the total amount of your next payment. If you have multiple coupons, others may be applied first, and the referral coupon will be automatically applied once those are used. Rewards are valid for one year from the date they are issued.\",\"Answer5\":\"We take fraud seriously. If we notice anything suspicious, all rewards will be canceled. Accounts involved may also be suspended or face legal action.\",\"Answer6\":\"Unfortunately, we're unable to support reward redemption through PayPal at this time. To redeem your rewards, please use Stripe to complete your transaction.\",\"Question1\":\"How does the referral program work? \",\"Question2\":\"How much reward can I earn?\",\"Question3\":\"Who can I invite?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I use more than one reward at once?\",\"Question5\":\"What if fraud is detected?\",\"Question6\":\"Is it possible to redeem rewards through PayPal?\",\"Title\":\"FAQs\"},\"InviteSection\":{\"Share\":{\"Social\":{\"Title\":\"Invite by Social Media\"},\"Title\":\"Invite friends and get Free Months!\"},\"Step\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Share your link with friends new to Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Invite New Friends\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Your friend enjoys one free month of Pro when they sign up.\",\"DescriptionNewRewardPricing\":\"Your friend gets 30 days of Pro for $1, plus 50% off for the next 2 months.\",\"Title\":\"They Get a Free Month\",\"TitleNewRewardPricing\":\"They Get Pro for Just $1\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Earn $20 when they create their first model within 14 days. Use it on any plan or credits.\",\"DescriptionNewRewardPricing\":\"Earn $20 instantly when they subscribe. Use it on any plan or credits.\",\"Title\":\"You Get a $20 Reward\"},\"Title\":\"Easy as 1, 2, 3\"},\"SubDesc1\":\"Earn up to \u003chighlight\u003e3 free months of Pro\u003c/highlight\u003e :\",\"SubDesc2\":\"Invite new users, and both you and your friend receive a free month! *\",\"SubDesc2NewRewardPricing\":\"Invite new users to try Pro for just $1 - you earn a free month! *\",\"Tips\":{\"Part1\":\"The reward, equivalent to one month of Pro, can also be applied towards any tier, allowing you to upgrade or buy credits if desired.\",\"Part2\":\"Warning: Fraudulent activities such as account manipulation will result in immediate termination and potential legal consequences. All rewards will be forfeited.\",\"Term\":\"* Terms apply.\"},\"Title\":\"Give a Month, Get a Month\"},\"Moment\":{\"Description\":\"Invite new users, and both you and your friend receive a \u003chighlight\u003efree month of Pro Plan\u003c/highlight\u003e!\",\"DescriptionNewRewardPricing\":\"Invite new users and earn up to 3 free months of Pro!\",\"MaybeLater\":\"Maybe Later\",\"ShareAndInvite\":\"Share and Invite\",\"Title\":\"A Special Thank-You for being with Meshy!\"},\"More\":\"More\",\"Sidebar\":{\"Description\":\"You've been invited to unlock Meshy's full creative toolkit — ultra-fast 3D generation, high-poly downloads, and AI texturing tools.\",\"Title1\":\"Claim Your\",\"Title2\":\"30-Day Pro Plan\"},\"SignUpToViewAll\":\"Sign up to view all models\",\"TeamMember\":{\"Description\":\"The referral program is not available for team accounts.\",\"Title\":\"Notice\"},\"Title\":\"Referral Program - Meshy\"},\"ShareReview\":{\"CopyButton\":\"Copy\",\"CopySuccess\":\"Review copied!\",\"Description\":\"Thanks for reviewing us on G2! Share your G2 review on LinkedIn, X, or Facebook — earn 50 credits for every platform you post on.\",\"Loading\":\"Generating review content...\",\"RegenerateButton\":\"Regenerate\",\"ShareOn\":\"Share on\",\"ShareSuccess\":\"Credits claimed successfully!\",\"Title\":\"Share review and win 150 credits!\"},\"Shared\":{\"ExploreMore\":{\"3DAgent\":{\"Description\":\"Chat from an idea, photo, or sketch to a print-ready 3D model\",\"Title\":\"3D Agent\"},\"AIImageGenerator\":{\"Description\":\"Generate multi-view images optimized for 3D creation\",\"Title\":\"AI Image Generator\"},\"AITexturing\":{\"Description\":\"Add realistic PBR textures to any 3D model with AI\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing\"},\"Animation\":{\"Description\":\"Auto-rig and animate any 3D character in seconds\",\"Title\":\"Animation\"},\"Api\":{\"Description\":\"Integrate Meshy's 3D into your app or pipeline\",\"Title\":\"API\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any photo into a detailed 3D model in seconds\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"TextTo3D\":{\"Description\":\"Describe it, generate it - 3D models from text prompts\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"Explore More Features\"}},\"Shoutout\":{\"Campaigns\":{\"BrowseAll\":\"Browse all campaigns\",\"Credits\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count, number}\u003c/b\u003e credits\",\"Items\":{\"AprilCharacters\":{\"EndsIn\":\"Ends in 5d\",\"Title\":\"April Characters Challenge\"},\"EnvironmentSprint\":{\"EndsIn\":\"Ends in 7d\",\"Title\":\"Environment Sprint\"},\"ProductReveal\":{\"EndsIn\":\"Ends in 15d\",\"Title\":\"Product Reveal Remix\"}},\"Kicker\":\"Live Campaigns\",\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Pick your next\",\"Line2\":\"campaign.\"},\"UpTo\":\"Up to\"},\"FAQ\":{\"Items\":{\"HowEarn\":{\"Answer\":\"Rewards are Meshy credits and PayPal cash gift cards, issued in tiers based on your post's views — you receive the highest tier you reach. Some campaigns also cap the reward per video or per person; you'll see the tiers on each campaign page before you post.\",\"Question\":\"How do I earn money?\"},\"HowToJoin\":{\"Answer\":\"Sign up on the program page and connect your social accounts and PayPal email — one registration per person. Then publish a video that meets the campaign requirements on a connected account and submit the link via Submit Your Post on the campaign page. Once it passes review, you're in.\",\"Question\":\"How do I join a campaign?\"},\"WhatContent\":{\"Answer\":\"Your video should fit the campaign theme and clearly show you using Meshy — the interface, your workflow, or the final result. Include the required hashtags and @Meshy in the caption, keep the post public, meet the minimum length, and publish within the campaign window from your own account. Each campaign page lists the exact requirements.\",\"Question\":\"What kind of content should I post?\"},\"WhatIs\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy Earn is Meshy's creator program that rewards talented creators for making great content. Create and publish a video that meets a campaign's requirements on your own social account, and you earn based on the views your post gets — the more views, the bigger the reward.\",\"Question\":\"What is Meshy Earn?\"},\"WhenPaid\":{\"Answer\":\"Credits are added to your Meshy account automatically once your video passes review. For cash rewards: after a campaign ends there's a 7-day view-counting window, then we send your payout via PayPal within 20 business days after settlement. Just make sure your PayPal email is on file — we can't reroute a payment once it's sent.\",\"Question\":\"When and how do I get paid?\"},\"WhoCanJoin\":{\"Answer\":\"You're eligible if you're at least 18 years old and have at least one active account on TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, or X.\",\"Question\":\"Who can join the program?\"}},\"Kicker\":\"FAQ\",\"Title\":\"Questions, answered.\"},\"FinalCTA\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"MESHY · EARN · PROGRAM\",\"PrimaryCTA\":\"Start Earning\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"Browse campaigns\",\"Subtitle\":\"Create. Post. Earn.\",\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Go earn something\",\"Line2\":\"this weekend.\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"The Meshy Earn Program pays you for sharing your 3D creations journey on social. No follower count, no gatekeepers — just posts, views, and real money.\",\"Line1\":\"Create.\",\"Line2\":\"Post.\",\"Line3\":\"Earn.\",\"LivePill\":\"Meshy Earn Program\",\"PlatformReach\":\"{platform} reach\",\"PrimaryCTA\":\"Start Earning\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"How it works\",\"Stat1Label\":\"required\",\"Stat1Value\":\"No followers\",\"Stat2Label\":\"supported\",\"Stat2Value\":\"All platforms\",\"Stat3Label\":\"guaranteed\",\"Stat3Value\":\"Fast payouts\"},\"How\":{\"Kicker\":\"How it works\",\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Browse live campaigns with clear briefs and per-view bonuses. Pick the one that fits your style.\",\"Title\":\"Pick a campaign\",\"TitleBreakLine1\":\"Pick a\",\"TitleBreakLine2\":\"campaign\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Generate 3D models through words or images with Meshy in minutes. No modeling skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Create with Meshy\",\"TitleBreakLine1\":\"Create with\",\"TitleBreakLine2\":\"Meshy\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Make a post about your 3D creation and share on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube or X.\",\"Title\":\"Share on your socials\",\"TitleBreakLine1\":\"Share on\",\"TitleBreakLine2\":\"your socials\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Transparent payout rules. Hit bonus tiers, receive cash right after the campaign. No gatekeeping.\",\"Title\":\"Earn based on views\",\"TitleBreakLine1\":\"Earn based\",\"TitleBreakLine2\":\"on views\"},\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Four steps,\",\"Line2\":\"zero gatekeeping.\"}},\"MetaDescription\":\"Get paid for sharing your 3D creations. No follower count required, no gatekeepers — just posts, views, and real money. Join the Meshy Earn Program.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Earn Program | Meshy\",\"OgImageAlt\":\"Meshy Earn Program - Get paid for sharing your 3D creations\",\"Voices\":{\"Kicker\":\"Creator Voices\",\"Subtitle\":\"From creators with 10 followers to 1M+ — they showed up, posted, and got paid. Hover to pause.\",\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Real posts.\",\"Line2\":\"Real payouts.\"}},\"Why\":{\"Items\":{\"Dashboard\":{\"Description\":\"Track views, engagement, and earnings across every campaign — all in one clean view.\",\"Title\":\"All-in-one dashboard.\"},\"Instant\":{\"Description\":\"Apply, get approved, and join your first campaign in minutes. No waiting list, no gatekeepers.\",\"Title\":\"Instant onboarding.\"},\"Payout\":{\"Description\":\"No invoices, no requests, no chasing. We send your earnings the moment the campaign wraps.\",\"Title\":\"Auto payouts.\"},\"Pick\":{\"Description\":\"A menu of campaigns across every theme. Choose the ones that click with your style.\",\"Title\":\"Pick what fits you.\"},\"Platforms\":{\"Description\":\"TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, X — all supported. No new platform to learn.\",\"Title\":\"Post anywhere.\"},\"Threshold\":{\"Description\":\"No threshold, no tiers — every creator gets a fair shot at the bonus.\",\"Title\":\"No follower threshold.\"},\"Transparent\":{\"Description\":\"See exactly how every dollar is calculated before you create. No black box, no surprises.\",\"Title\":\"Transparent earnings.\"},\"Views\":{\"Description\":\"Your payout scales with engagement, not fame. Viral post \u003e big account.\",\"Title\":\"Paid by views.\"}},\"Kicker\":\"Why Meshy Earn\",\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Views in, cash out.\",\"Line2\":\"No catch.\"}}},\"SiteName\":\"Meshy\",\"Snippet\":{\"HiringNow\":\"We're growing fast - join us!\"},\"Tags\":{\"Description\":\"Download {model_count}+ free {tag} 3D models in STL, GLB, FBX, OBJ formats for 3D Printing, Games, Animation and more. Ready to use – instant download on Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Free {tag} 3D Models - Download Instantly | Meshy\"},\"Terms\":{\"AcceptableUsePolicy\":{\"Description\":\"View our Acceptable Use Policy to learn more about our policies.\",\"Title\":\"Acceptable Use Policy - Meshy\"},\"CookiePolicy\":{\"Description\":\"View our Cookie Policy to learn more about how we use cookies.\",\"Title\":\"Cookie Policy - Meshy\"},\"EarnProgramTerms\":{\"Description\":\"View the Meshy Earn Program User Terms to learn how participation and rewards work.\",\"Title\":\"Earn Program Terms - Meshy\"},\"PrivacyPolicy\":{\"Description\":\"View our Privacy Policy to learn more about how we handle your data.\",\"Title\":\"Privacy Policy - Meshy\"},\"TermsOfUse\":{\"Description\":\"View our Terms of Use to learn more about our policies.\",\"Title\":\"Terms of Use - Meshy\"}},\"ThreeDAgent\":{\"Awards\":{\"AriaLabel\":\"Awards and recognition\",\"BadgeHighPerformerAlt\":\"G2 High Performer — Mid-Market, 3D Modeling\",\"BadgeLeaderAlt\":\"G2 Leader — 3D Modeling\",\"BadgeUsabilityAlt\":\"G2 Best Usability — 3D Modeling\",\"Heading\":\"The #1 AI 3D model generator for creators\",\"Stat1Label\":\"Global users\",\"Stat2Label\":\"Rated for 3D modeling on G2\",\"Stat3Label\":\"5-star\",\"Stat3LinkText\":\"G2 reviews\"},\"BeforeAfter\":{\"Description\":\"What used to take skills, tools, and days now starts with a sentence.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Before \u0026 After\",\"NewTag\":\"The new way\",\"NewTitle\":\"After Meshy 3D Agent\",\"OldTag\":\"The old way\",\"OldTitle\":\"Before Meshy 3D Agent\",\"Title\":\"The hard part, handled.\"},\"ClosingCta\":{\"Heading\":\"Be among the first to create 3D with \u003cagent\u003ean agent\u003c/agent\u003e.\"},\"Common\":{\"StartChatting\":\"Start chatting\"},\"Faq\":{\"A1\":\"A text-to-3D tool turns one prompt into one output. Meshy 3D Agent is a conversation. It brainstorms directions, generates concepts in batches, refines through chat, and answers your questions along the way, taking you from a single line to a finished model.\",\"A2\":\"Starting from text, an image, or a sketch — anything from a single object to a style-consistent set of game asset concepts, or a custom concept you can prepare for 3D printing.\",\"A3\":\"No. You describe what you want in plain language and refine by chatting — no sculpting, retopology, or prior 3D experience required.\",\"A4\":\"Yes. The agent shapes your idea into a 3D concept and helps you check, repair, and scale it to prepare for printing.\",\"A5\":\"Models export in FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF, and DXF (GLB by default), so they drop straight into your slicer (STL/3MF for 3D printing), Blender (BLEND), AR (USDZ), or game engines like Unity and Unreal (FBX/OBJ).\",\"A6\":\"You can create a free Meshy account and start exploring at no cost. Meshy 3D Agent is currently in public Beta for Meshy Pro members and above, and a free trial is on the way, so more creators can try the agent in chat.\",\"Q1\":\"How is this different from a regular text-to-3D tool?\",\"Q2\":\"What can I make with it?\",\"Q3\":\"Do I need 3D modeling skills?\",\"Q4\":\"Can I use it for 3D printing?\",\"Q5\":\"What formats can I export?\",\"Q6\":\"Is Meshy 3D Agent free to use?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Features\":{\"Body\":\"Printability check, auto-repair, multicolor — it's all in the chat. One agent, no extra tools.\",\"Title\":\"Every feature, right inside the agent.\"},\"Game\":{\"BeforeAfter\":{\"New1\":\"No skills, just describe it\",\"New2\":\"One chat, end to end\",\"New3\":\"A whole set, one style\",\"New4\":\"Minutes, not days\",\"Old1\":\"Needs modeling skills or budget\",\"Old2\":\"Juggle multiple tools\",\"Old3\":\"Styles drift apart\",\"Old4\":\"Hours or days per asset\"},\"ClosingCta\":{\"Subhead\":\"Your game world, one chat away from 3D.\"},\"Features\":{\"Body\":\"Export-ready formats, AI texturing, and automatic PBR maps — all in one chat. One agent, no extra tools.\",\"Card1Body\":\"Download game-ready GLB, FBX, OBJ and more — right from the chat.\",\"Card1Title\":\"Export right from the chat\",\"Card2Body\":\"Tell the agent the look you want; it re-textures from a prompt.\",\"Card2Title\":\"Re-texture by just asking\",\"Card3Body\":\"Full PBR maps — metallic, roughness, normal, AO — no UV unwrapping.\",\"Card3Title\":\"PBR maps, done for you\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subcopy\":\"The first AI agent built for 3D. Describe props, characters, or environments — Meshy generates a full asset set in one consistent style and refines it with you.\",\"TypeTail\":\"Game Dev.\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Chat your way to a full set of game-ready 3D assets in one consistent style with Meshy's AI 3D Agent.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Agent for Game Development | Meshy\"},\"ModelShowcase\":{\"Body\":\"The agent breaks your scene into parts and generates each asset, so you get a style-consistent scene prototype in minutes.\",\"Title\":\"One conversation. A whole scene, one style.\"},\"UseCase\":{\"Body\":\"Start with a line, a sketch, or an image. The agent proposes concepts, refines them as you chat, and shapes them into game-ready assets.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"For game developers\",\"Flow1Alt\":\"A concept sketch for a cozy fantasy market\",\"Flow2Alt\":\"Meshy 3D Agent turning the sketch into a matching asset pack\",\"Flow3Alt\":\"A generated, style-consistent game asset pack\",\"Step1Body\":\"Start with a sketch, image, or prompt.\",\"Step1Title\":\"Describe\",\"Step2Body\":\"The agent proposes concepts and adjusts as you chat.\",\"Step2Title\":\"Generate \u0026 refine\",\"Step3Body\":\"Get a full asset set in one consistent style.\",\"Step3Title\":\"Build your set\",\"Title\":\"Chat your way to a cohesive world.\"}},\"General\":{\"AgentCanvas\":{\"Case1Agent1\":\"On it! Isolating each asset into its own model on a clean solid background! 🎨\",\"Case1Agent2\":\"All assets are extracted and ready to use! Each sits on its own solid color. 🎨✨\",\"Case1Tab\":\"From 2D Image to 3D Model Assets\",\"Case1User\":\"Translate the image assets covered in the picture into single model asset images, with a solid-color background, which needs to include: aircraft, plant life, and Mexican-style architecture.\",\"Case2Agent1\":\"Got it! Generating four material textures simultaneously! 🎨\",\"Case2Agent2\":\"All four material textures are complete! Each has its own unique effect. 🎨✨\",\"Case2Mat1\":\"🪵 Wooden Version\",\"Case2Mat2\":\"⚙️ Pure Metal Version\",\"Case2Mat3\":\"💎 Glass Texture Version\",\"Case2Mat4\":\"🌿 Weathered Moss Version\",\"Case2Tab\":\"Texturing by Chat\",\"Case2TileGlass\":\"Glass\",\"Case2TileGolden\":\"Golden\",\"Case2TileMetal\":\"Pure Metal\",\"Case2TileMoss\":\"Weathered Moss\",\"Case2TileOriginal\":\"Original\",\"Case2TileWooden\":\"Wooden\",\"Case2User\":\"Replace with four images featuring wooden, pure metal, glass texture, and weathered moss textures.\",\"Headline\":\"Meshy can help you create\",\"PromptPlaceholder\":\"Describe your idea, and start creating with agent\",\"StartGenerating\":\"Start Generating\",\"TileModel\":\"3D Model\",\"Word1\":\"Miniatures\",\"Word2\":\"Characters\",\"Word3\":\"Game Assets\",\"Word4\":\"Props\",\"Word5\":\"Figurines\"},\"AllInOne\":{\"Demo\":{\"AgentIntro\":\"Sure, let me ask a few questions:\",\"AgentReply1\":\"You got it!\",\"AgentReply2\":\"I'll extract each one individually.\",\"ModelAlt\":\"Generated 3D robot model\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"OptionOther\":\"Other\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\",\"RobotFamilyAlt\":\"A family of five robots generated by the Meshy 3D agent\",\"Skip\":\"Skip\",\"StyleCartoonDesc\":\"Expressive, character-driven robots with lots of personality\",\"StyleCartoonTitle\":\"Cartoon / Pixar-ish\",\"StyleChibiDesc\":\"Round, chubby, big-eyed robots with a kawaii toy feel\",\"StyleChibiTitle\":\"Cute / Chibi\",\"StyleQuestion\":\"What visual style would you like for the robot family?\",\"StyleRetroDesc\":\"Classic tin-toy robots with boxy shapes, rivets, and old-school charm\",\"StyleRetroTitle\":\"Retro / Vintage\",\"StyleSciFiDesc\":\"Sleek, modern robots with clean lines and glowing accents\",\"StyleSciFiTitle\":\"Sci-Fi / Futuristic\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\",\"UseImagesDesc\":\"I only need 2D concept art / illustrations\",\"UseImagesTitle\":\"Just Images\",\"UseModelsDesc\":\"I want GLB/digital models for use in games or renders\",\"UseModelsTitle\":\"3D Models\",\"UsePrintDesc\":\"I want to print individual figurines\",\"UsePrintTitle\":\"3D Print\",\"UseQuestion\":\"What's the intended use of the robot family?\",\"UseUnsureDesc\":\"Just exploring — I'll decide later\",\"UseUnsureTitle\":\"Not sure yet\",\"UserMsg1\":\"Hi Meshy, create a robot family of 5.\",\"UserMsg2\":\"Change color to lime + pink.\",\"UserMsg3\":\"convert them into 3d models\"},\"Title\":\"The first AI agent built for 3D.\"},\"ClosingCta\":{\"Subhead\":\"The only way to make 3D by just chatting. Your idea, one chat away from 3D.\"},\"Features\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Capabilities\",\"PluginsLabel\":\"One-click export to\",\"Row1Body\":\"Brainstorm ideas, ask questions, check model quality, and prep for 3D printing — get expert answers at every stage of your creative workflow.\",\"Row1Title\":\"A 3D Expert by Your Side at Every Step\",\"Row3Body\":\"Turn one style direction into a consistent set of 3D models. Generate characters, props, objects, and variations that feel like they belong in the same world.\",\"Row3Title\":\"Batch Generate Assets with a Consistent Style\",\"Row4Body\":\"Your agent plugs into the apps and pipeline you already work in, so you can move 3D assets across your workflow without breaking your creative flow.\",\"Row4Title\":\"Connected to All the Tools You Already Use\",\"Title\":\"Not a generator. An agent that does the work.\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subcopy\":\"Other AI tools hand you a model and leave the rest to you. Meshy's agent runs the whole 3D pipeline — brainstorm, generate, refine, and export, all in one chat.\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Create 3D by chatting with Meshy's AI 3D Agent — generate, refine, and export, all in one conversation.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Agent | Meshy\"}},\"Hero\":{\"AriaLabel\":\"AI Agents. Now for {tail}\",\"TitleLine1\":\"AI Agents.\",\"TitlePrefix\":\"Now for\",\"TypeBase\":\"3D.\"},\"ModelShowcase\":{\"Body\":\"No redoing models one by one — tell the agent the direction and it redesigns the entire set for you, in one consistent style.\",\"Caption\":\"Click and explore them in 3D\",\"DotLabel\":\"Show model {index}\",\"ModelAlt\":\"A 3D model made with Meshy 3D Agent\",\"NextLabel\":\"Next model\",\"PrevLabel\":\"Previous model\",\"Title\":\"Tell the agent. Get a whole new set.\"},\"Printing\":{\"BeforeAfter\":{\"New1\":\"No skills, just describe it\",\"New2\":\"One chat, end to end\",\"New3\":\"Clean, printable mesh\",\"New4\":\"Minutes, not days\",\"Old1\":\"Needs modeling skills or budget\",\"Old2\":\"Juggle multiple tools\",\"Old3\":\"Messy mesh to clean up\",\"Old4\":\"Hours or days per model\"},\"ClosingCta\":{\"Subhead\":\"Your idea, one chat away from a printable model.\"},\"Hero\":{\"Subcopy\":\"The first AI agent built for 3D. Start with a photo, a sketch, or a few words — Meshy shapes a clean, printable model and refines it with you.\",\"TypeTail\":\"3D Printing.\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn a photo, sketch, or idea into a clean, printable 3D model by chatting with Meshy's AI 3D Agent.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Agent for 3D Printing | Meshy\"},\"UseCase\":{\"Body\":\"No modeling skills needed — the agent shapes your photo, sketch, or idea into a clean 3D model for you.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"For 3D printing creators\",\"Flow1Alt\":\"A reference photo of a corgi\",\"Flow2Alt\":\"Meshy 3D Agent turning the photo into a 3D model\",\"Flow3Alt\":\"A 3D model prepared for printing\",\"Step1Body\":\"Start with a photo, sketch, or prompt.\",\"Step1Title\":\"Describe\",\"Step2Body\":\"The agent shapes a 3D concept as you chat.\",\"Step2Title\":\"Generate \u0026 refine\",\"Step3Body\":\"Check, repair, and scale it, ready to slice.\",\"Step3Title\":\"Prepare to print\",\"Title\":\"Chat your idea into a printable model.\"}}},\"ThreeDPrinting\":{\"CommunityGallery\":{\"AltDinobot\":\"Dinobot Snarl in Dino Mode\",\"AltFloralVase\":\"Ornate Floral Vase\",\"AltGauntlets\":\"Crimson Crystal Gauntlets\",\"AltPendant\":\"Six-Petal Rosette Pendant with Tassel\",\"AltSafetyCar\":\"Safety Car\",\"AltStoneNest\":\"Stone Nest in Marble Frieze\",\"AltSword\":\"Death Knight Sword\",\"AltTempleGuardian\":\"Temple Guardian Rabbit\",\"AltTigerQueen\":\"Tiger Queen on a Round Base\",\"AltTinyRex\":\"Tiny Rex\",\"AltUnavailable\":\"{name} (currently unavailable)\",\"AltValencina\":\"Valencina from Limbus Company\",\"AltVerdantAcolyte\":\"Verdant Acolyte\"},\"Compatibility\":{\"Formats\":\"Formats\",\"Processes\":\"FDM + Resin\",\"PublishTo\":\"Publish to\"},\"CreativeLab\":{\"Cta\":\"Explore Creative Lab\",\"HeadlineFull\":\"No printer? \u003cneon\u003eCreative Lab\u003c/neon\u003e will make it for you.\",\"StepsAlt\":\"Creative Lab flow: describe, print, and ship to your door\",\"Sub\":\"Describe what you want, pick your material and finish, and we'll 3D print the real thing and ship it to your door.\"},\"Faq\":{\"AutoRepairA\":\"Broken meshes, non-manifold edges, floaters, and inverted normals — repaired automatically before export so you don't have to round-trip through Blender or Meshmixer.\",\"AutoRepairQ\":\"What does Auto Repair fix?\",\"CommercialA\":\"Yes. Commercial use is included on all paid plans.\",\"CommercialQ\":\"Can I sell what I print?\",\"FailA\":\"Our printability check catches most issues before you print. For edge cases — re-generate is free.\",\"FailQ\":\"What if a print fails?\",\"MachineA\":\"Yes — we test outputs weekly on Bambu, Creality, Elegoo, Prusa, Form 3. STL / OBJ / 3MF all supported.\",\"MachineQ\":\"Will it actually print on my machine?\",\"ModelingA\":\"Not at all. Type a description or upload a reference image. We handle topology, manifoldness, and supports automatically.\",\"ModelingQ\":\"Do I need to know 3D modeling?\",\"SpeedA\":\"Around 60 seconds per model. Multicolor split and base addition add a few seconds.\",\"SpeedQ\":\"How long does generation take?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Features\":{\"AutoRepair\":\"Auto Repair\",\"AutoRepairDesc\":\"AI fixes broken meshes and non-manifold edges automatically\",\"AutoRepairHud\":{\"Available\":\"AI auto-repair available\",\"Done\":\"Repair finishes\"},\"AutoSplit\":\"Auto Split\",\"AutoSplitDesc\":\"Breaks complex models into watertight parts, pre-arranged on the build plate.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Only on Meshy\",\"Headline\":\"Every feature, built for a smoother print.\",\"MulticolorHud\":{\"ColorCount\":\"Color count\"},\"MulticolorPrint\":\"Multi-color Print\",\"MulticolorPrintDesc\":\"Vertex colors for Bambu AMS, Creality CFS, and OrcaSlicer.\",\"MulticolorReady\":\"Multicolor Ready\",\"PrintabilityCheck\":\"Printability Check\",\"PrintabilityCheckDesc\":\"Auto-flag thin walls, floaters, and non-manifold edges before you waste filament\",\"PrintabilityHud\":{\"Checking\":\"checking\",\"Holes\":\"Holes\",\"NonManifoldEdges\":\"Non-manifold edges\",\"Title\":\"Printability\",\"Volume\":\"Volume\",\"Watertight\":\"Watertight\",\"WatertightYes\":\"Yes\"},\"Sub\":\"Print-ready from generation. No extra tools needed.\"},\"FinalCta\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Creating\",\"HeadlineFull\":\"Print something \u003cneon\u003enobody else owns\u003c/neon\u003e.\",\"Microcopy\":\"No credit card · free credits to start\",\"Sub\":\"Generate your first print-ready model in under a minute. Free to try.\"},\"Hero\":{\"Cta\":\"Start Creating\",\"Description\":\"Turn text or images into STL files ready for 3D printing in under a minute. No modeling skills needed.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"The #1 AI 3D Model Generator\",\"HeadlineFull\":\"Generate 3D models that \u003cneon\u003eactually print\u003c/neon\u003e.\"},\"HeroSlider\":{\"AltModel\":\"Meshy model — {subject}\",\"AltPrinted\":\"Painted FDM-printed {subject}\",\"Drag\":\"DRAG\",\"SliderLabel\":\"Before/after compare slider. Use arrow keys to adjust.\",\"SubjectDragon\":\"Dragon\",\"SubjectFullScene\":\"Full Scene\",\"SubjectTown\":\"Town\",\"SubjectVillager\":\"Villager\",\"TagConceptSketch\":\"Concept sketch\",\"TagMeshyModel\":\"Meshy model\",\"TagRealPrinted\":\"Printed\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Generate 3D models that actually print. No modeling skills required. Compatible with Bambu, Creality, Elegoo, and more.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy for 3D Printing — Generate Print-Ready 3D Models\"},\"Testimonials\":{\"ChadHunterAlt\":\"Tabletop warrior diorama by Chad Hunter\",\"ChadHunterQuote\":\"With Meshy, I can have a new design of my own characters in 28mm or 32mm — from idea to in-hand in less than a single day.\",\"ChadHunterRole\":\"3D Printing Artist\",\"ChadHunterTag\":\"USER STORY\",\"Headline\":\"Loved by makers who actually print.\",\"ThornsTavernAlt\":\"Thorns Tavern full-color miniatures\",\"ThornsTavernQuote\":\"Meshy is now core to our production workflow — turning user-uploaded designs into 3D models and dramatically shortening the time from concept to finalization.\",\"ThornsTavernRole\":\"TTRPG Studio \u0026 Custom 3D Printing\",\"ThornsTavernTag\":\"CASE STUDY\",\"WestEdgeAlt\":\"Polyjet-printed locomotive crew figures by West Edge 3D\",\"WestEdgeQuote\":\"The generated models feature lifelike details and shadows that, when printed on the polyjet system, can rival the very best hand-painted figurines.\",\"WestEdgeRole\":\"Polyjet Figurine Studio, Australia\",\"WestEdgeTag\":\"USER STORY\"},\"UseCases\":{\"AccessoriesHeadline\":\"Custom accessories, made to fit.\",\"AccessoriesSub\":\"Phone cases, keychains, charms, and clip-ons — designed in minutes, printed to spec.\",\"AccessoriesTag\":\"Accessories\",\"AltPrompt\":\"{tag} prompt reference\",\"CollectiblesHeadline\":\"Detailed prints worth showing off.\",\"CollectiblesSub\":\"Sculptures, busts, and statement pieces — generated in detail, printed display-ready.\",\"CollectiblesTag\":\"Sculpture\",\"CommunityCta\":\"Find More To Print\",\"CommunityHeadlineFull\":\"Thousands of printable models, \u003cneon\u003eready to remix\u003c/neon\u003e.\",\"CommunitySub\":\"Start with any community model, customize it with AI, and print your own version.\",\"DecorHeadline\":\"Reshape the space around you.\",\"DecorSub\":\"Vases, lamps, and organizers — functional pieces generated to fit your home exactly.\",\"DecorTag\":\"Decor\",\"HeadlineFull\":\"Generate \u003cneon\u003eprintable models\u003c/neon\u003e for any idea.\",\"MiniaturesHeadline\":\"Tabletop-ready in minutes.\",\"MiniaturesSub\":\"Armies, terrain, and heroes — generated at scale, printed sharp enough to paint.\",\"MiniaturesTag\":\"Miniatures\",\"Prompt\":\"Prompt\",\"SpecFullcolorResin\":\"Fullcolor resin\",\"SpecPrintDuration\":\"~{hours}h print\",\"SpecResin\":\"Resin\",\"WearablesHeadline\":\"Wearable art, made yours.\",\"WearablesSub\":\"Pendants, charms, and jewelry — sketched, generated, printed to wear.\",\"WearablesTag\":\"Wearables\"}},\"ThreeDPrintingMakers\":{\"Compatibility\":{\"Leadin\":\"Send to your printer directly\"},\"Hero\":{\"Sub\":\"No modeling skills needed.\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Turn text or images into print-ready STL files in under a minute. Built for the maker community — no modeling skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"3D Printing for Makers — Meshy\"}},\"Tutorials\":{\"Academy\":{\"Article\":{\"3dPrintingTerms\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the big \\\"Three\\\" terms you need to know?\",\"Text\":\"3D printing is a world of weird acronyms and engineering slang. This is your cheat sheet to understanding the community on Reddit and knowing exactly why someone is telling you to \\\"check your Z-offset\\\".\\n\\nBefore you hit print, you need to understand the workflow:\\n\\n- FDM (Fused Deposition Modeling): The most common type of hobbyist printing that melts spools of plastic filament.\\n\\n- Slicer: The software (like Bambu Studio or Cura) that acts as a \\\"translator,\\\" turning your 3D model into machine instructions.\\n\\n- G-Code: The actual language the printer speaks—it is a text file containing a long list of coordinates for the nozzle to follow.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the most common hardware parts?\",\"Text\":\"- Hotend: The metal part that gets very hot to melt the plastic filament so it can flow out. Think of it as the \\\"heating element\\\" in a glue gun.\\n\\n- Extruder: The motor and gears that \\\"push\\\" the plastic into the hotend.\\n\\n- Build Plate / Bed: The surface where the model is built; often made of textured steel (PEI).\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What terms will save your prints from failing?\",\"Text\":\"- Z-Offset: The tiny, critical gap between the nozzle and the bed. If this is wrong, your print won't stick or will get squashed.\\n\\n- Supports: Temporary \\\"scaffolding\\\" for parts of your model that hang in mid-air (overhangs).\\n\\n- Brim: A thin, flat layer of plastic around the base of your model to stop it from peeling off the bed.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"Lingo FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: What is a \\\"Benchy\\\"? \\n\\nA: It is a small toy boat (3DBenchy) used as the universal benchmark for 3D printers. If your Benchy looks clean, your machine is \\\"dialed in\\\".\\n\\nQ: What does \\\"Non-Manifold\\\" mean? \\n\\nA: It means your 3D model has \\\"holes\\\" or errors in the mesh that make it impossible for the slicer to understand. AI-generated models often need a \\\"Repair\\\" to become manifold.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 1 EP03] What do these 3D printing words mean? A Beginner's Dictionary\"},\"AddingTextures\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Image Input: How to use reference photos for 3D textures?\",\"Text\":\"$4b\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Text Input: How to write prompts for 3D textures?\",\"Text\":\"Enter a text prompt in the Text Input field to describe the texture you want, such as materials, style, or surface details. If you’re unsure what to write, use our Texture Helper to instantly transform simple ideas into professional prompts.\\n\\nOnce everything is ready, click Texture. In just a few seconds, you’ll receive a textured 3D model.\\n\\nSatisfied with the overall look but want to tweak a specific detail? You don't have to restart! You can fine-tune colors, patterns, and materials using Texture Edit. \\n\\n## FAQ\\n\\nQ: Does the AI texture follow my model's shape?\\n\\nA: Yes! Meshy is \\\"geometry-aware,\\\" meaning it recognizes surface features. It intelligently places textures based on your model's contours.\\n\\nQ: Can I re-texture a model multiple times to try different styles?\\n\\nA: Absolutely! Select any textured model from your history to apply new prompts or images. This is perfect for creating seasonal variations of the same character without re-modeling.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP06] AI Texturing: How to Add Textures to 3D Models in Meshy?\"},\"ChoosingYourFirstPrinter\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"FDM vs. Resin: Which one should I start with?\",\"Text\":\"Don't just hunt for the absolute cheapest clone on the market. In 2026, the real choice isn't about \\\"quality\\\"—most mainstream brands produce great results. The real choice is between a machine that is an \\\"Appliance\\\" (focused on printing) and one that is a \\\"Project\\\" (focused on tinkering).\\n\\nThis is the \\\"fork in the road.\\\" Based on our tracking of over 10,000+ community members, most beginners find more long-term success starting with FDM:\\n\\n- FDM (Filament): Uses spools of plastic. Best for functional parts, toys, and large props. It's safer, cleaner, and the \\\"standard\\\" 3D printing experience.\\n\\n- Resin (SLA/LCD): Uses liquid chemicals. Best for high-detail miniatures (D\u0026D) and jewelry. Warning: It is messy, smells, and requires gloves/masks.\\n\\nMeshy's Take: Start with FDM unless you specifically only want to print tiny 28mm soldiers.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"The \\\"Appliance\\\" vs. The \\\"DIY Path\\\": What's the difference?\",\"Text\":\"Instead of looking at price tags, look at the workflow:\\n\\n- The Appliance Experience: These are \\\"ready-to-print\\\" machines from reputable mainstream brands. They focus on UX, offering AI-assisted monitoring and seamless app integration so you can spend your time creating, not fixing.\\n\\n- The DIY Path: Often found at the budget end, these require manual tuning and constant \\\"tinkering\\\". Great for learning how machines work, but frustrating if you just want a finished model.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I know if a printer is \\\"Newbie-Friendly\\\"?\",\"Text\":\"In 2026, features like Auto Bed Leveling (ABL) and PEI Build Plates are standard on most mid-range machines. Look for these \\\"Newbie-Friendly\\\" extras:\\n\\n1. Remote Monitoring \u0026 App Control: Receive mobile alerts, view live progress, and pause prints from your phone.\\n\\n1. Filament Runout Sensor: Automatically pauses if you run out of plastic mid-print.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Is 3D printing an expensive hobby? \\n\\nA: The initial cost is the printer ($200-$1,000). After that, a standard 1kg spool of PLA filament costs about $15-$25 and can print roughly 40-50 small \\\"Benchy\\\" boats. It is much cheaper than collecting high-end statues or LEGO sets.\\n\\nQ: Can I put a 3D printer in my bedroom? \\n\\nA: We don't recommend it. While FDM printing is generally safe, it still produces \\\"Ultra-fine Particles\\\" (UFPs). It's best to keep it in a well-ventilated room, an office, or a garage with some airflow.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 1 EP01] How do I choose my first 3D printer?\"},\"Day1Checklist\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Is the hardware actually ready to rock?\",\"Text\":\"Don’t just plug it in and pray. Most \\\"Day 1\\\" failures are caused by loose hardware or a dirty build plate. Follow this ritual to ensure your first \\\"Benchy\\\" doesn't turn into a ball of plastic yarn.\\n\\nBefore you flip the power switch, do a quick \\\"sanity check\\\" on the machine:\\n\\n- Tension the Belts: They should feel firm and \\\"ping\\\" like a low guitar string when plucked.\\n\\n- Clean the Bed: Even if it’s brand new, wipe the build plate with 90%+ Isopropyl Alcohol (IPA) to remove factory oils or fingerprints.\\n\\n- The \\\"Paper Test\\\": If your printer doesn't have auto-leveling, use a piece of A4 paper to set your Z-Offset until there is a slight \\\"tug\\\".\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the \\\"Golden\\\" software settings for a first try?\",\"Text\":\"Don't get fancy with your slicer on Day 1:\\n\\n- Material: Use the spool of PLA —it is the \\\"King\\\" of beginner materials. While some brands include a sample, many printers don't ship with filament anymore—always have a backup roll ready.\\n\\n- Profiles: Use the \\\"Standard\\\" or \\\"0.2mm Optimal\\\" default profile in Bambu Studio or Cura.\\n\\n- Speed: Don't floor it; keep your initial layer speed slow (around 20mm/s) to ensure it sticks.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Day 1 FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: What should my first print be? \\n\\nA: Print the \\\"3DBenchy\\\" boat. It is designed to test every part of your printer, from overhangs to cooling, and it’s the universal language of the community.\\n\\nQ: My print is finished! How do I get it off the bed? \\n\\nA: Wait for the bed to cool to room temperature. Most modern PEI plates will \\\"pop\\\" the print off as the metal shrinks. If it's still stuck, gently flex the steel plate or use a plastic scraper (spatula) to pry it loose.\\n\\nQ: Should I use glue on the bed? \\n\\nA: On a clean, modern PEI bed with correct Z-offset, you usually don't need it for PLA. If you are struggling with adhesion and re-clean the bed.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 1 EP04] What is the Day 1 checklist for a successful first print?\"},\"DesigningPrintableModels\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"🎯 The Golden Rule: Stability is King\",\"Text\":\"Meshy can dream up anything, but your printer lives in the real world with gravity. If you want to avoid a bed full of plastic spaghetti, you need to \\\"design for the nozzle.\\\"\\n\\nSuccessful printing starts in the generation phase, not the slicer. For a high-success \\\"set it and forget it\\\" experience, follow the Flat \u0026 Low principle.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"✅ The \\\"High Success\\\" Profile (Green Light)\",\"Text\":\"Target these traits when prompting in Meshy to ensure a \\\"Banger\\\" print:\\n\\n- Large Footprint: Opt for models with a flat base or a wide contact area (think coasters, busts, or thick-legged characters). This ensures maximum bed adhesion.\\n\\n- Dense Geometry: Lean toward \\\"solid\\\" or stylized low-poly designs. They are structurally sound and handle infill better.\\n\\n- Gentle Slopes: Features that slope up gradually (less than 45°) are a dream to print and often don't even need supports.\\n\\nView More 3D Print Ready Models\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"❌ The \\\"Spaghetti\\\" Profile (Red Light)\",\"Text\":\"These traits are \\\"Printer Kryptonite\\\"—avoid them unless you're a support-material wizard:\\n\\n- Spider-Legs: Tiny, free-floating limbs or thin antennas. They tend to snap during printing or support removal.\\n\\n- Acute Overhangs: Massive parts hanging in mid-air with nothing beneath them. These require heavy \\\"scaffolding\\\" (supports) and leave a messy surface finish.\\n\\n- Hollow/Shell Gaps: AI models with weird internal voids can confuse your slicer, leading to \\\"ghost\\\" layers that collapse.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"💡 Pro-Tip: The \\\"Base-First\\\" Strategy\",\"Text\":\"If you have a complex AI model you really want to print, don't fight gravity—bypass it.\\n\\nTry our \\\"Add Base\\\" feature in Meshy. It’s the ultimate \\\"cheat code\\\" for intricate designs like miniatures and figurines. We provide dozens of pre-set bases to:\\n\\n- Prevent Failures: Eliminate issues caused by uneven or rounded bottoms.\\n\\n- Improve Quality: Give your printer a solid foundation for the entire build.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"Printability FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Why doesn't my physical print look as detailed as the 3D view? \\n\\nA: FDM printers have physical limits based on nozzle size (usually 0.4mm). While Meshy 6 generates sculpting-level detail, extremely tiny features may be \\\"lost\\\" or simplified by the slicer to maintain structural integrity during the print process.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP02] What are the Dos and Don'ts for Meshy printability?\"},\"DetailsTooThin\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"🛠️ Hardware Solution: Change the Nozzle\",\"Text\":\"$4c\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"💻 Software Solutions: Slicer Adjustments\",\"Text\":\"If you prefer to stick with your current hardware, use these digital workarounds:\\n\\n- Option 1: Scale Up (120% - 200%) Increasing the overall size of the model is the simplest fix. It widens thin features until they exceed the 0.4mm threshold, giving the printer enough space to create a solid structure.\\n\\n- Option 2: The \\\"Cut \u0026 Lay Flat\\\" Technique Use the Cut tool in your slicer to separate delicate parts (like a staff or an outstretched arm). Rotate these pieces and print them flat on the build plate for better results.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 5 EP02] Model Detail Too Thin\"},\"DryingWetFilament\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I know if my filament is wet?\",\"Text\":\"Here's a plot twist most beginners don't see coming: All 3D printing filaments absorb moisture from the air. Your filament can get \\\"wet\\\" just by sitting on your desk.\\n\\nWet filament is your #1 enemy. It's like trying to cook with soggy pasta—technically possible, but the results will be sad.\\n\\n- Stringing: Thin strings and wisps between parts that weren't there before — the most visible sign of moisture damage.\\n\\n- Popping/Crackling Sounds: That's literally water boiling into steam inside the nozzle. Especially noticeable with transparent filaments, where you can see tiny bubbles forming.\\n\\n- The \\\"Acne\\\" Look: Random bumps, tiny holes, or fuzzy textures on the surface.\\n\\n- Poor layer adhesion: Layers don't bond properly and parts break easily.\\n\\nMeshy Pro-Tip — The \\\"Snap\\\" Test: Bend the end of your PLA filament 90 degrees. Dry PLA bends with resistance and springs back. Wet PLA snaps instantly like a dry twig. If it snaps — dry it immediately.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What's the best way to dry filament?\",\"Text\":\"- Filament Dryer (Recommended): Dedicated dryers maintain precise temps. Set the temperature, wait a few hours, and done.\\n\\n- Heated bed method: Place the spool on the print bed and heat it to the target temperature. Works well on enclosed printers — open-frame printers can't retain enough heat for this method.\\n\\n- Food Dehydrator: Works great if it reaches the specific temperatures needed. Never leave it unattended, ensure low-temperature operation, and avoid placing filament near surfaces that contact food.\\n\\n- Oven (Danger Zone): Home ovens have poor temp control. A spike above the glass transition temp will melt your spool into a plastic donut.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What temperature and time should I use for drying?\",\"Text\":\"[Table: 3 rows x 3 cols]\\n\\nMaterial\\n\\nTemp\\n\\nTime\\n\\nPLA\\n\\n45–55°C\\n\\n4–8 hours\\n\\nPETG\\n\\n55–65°C\\n\\n4–8 hours\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I prevent moisture damage in the first place?\",\"Text\":\"Prevention is the best cure — and always better than trying to fix wet filament after the fact:\\n\\n- Seal it: Store filaments in airtight bags or containers with silica gel (desiccant) packets. This is the single most effective thing you can do.\\n\\n- Don't leave it out: Unload and bag up your filament after each print session.\\n\\n- Climate check: In humid climates (\u003e60% RH), consider drying filaments before every print.\\n\\nMonitor humidity: Place a hygrometer in your storage container. Aim for below 20% RH — at typical indoor humidity (~55% RH). Freshly dried filament re-absorbs moisture within hours.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Can I \\\"over-dry\\\" filament?\\n\\nA: Not really, as long as you stay below the glass transition temperature. Excessive heat will warp the spool or fuse coils together — always stick to the recommended temps in the chart above.\\n\\nQ: Are vacuum-sealed new filaments already dry?\\n\\nA: Usually yes, but quality varies by brand. If the silica gel packet inside the bag has turned pink, the filament may have absorbed moisture during shipping. Dry it before first use to be safe.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 3 EP04] How Do I Dry Wet 3D Printing Filament and Prevent Moisture Damage?\"},\"EditingTextures\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How to Edit Textures Using AI?\",\"Text\":\"$4d\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"How to Edit Textures Manually?\",\"Text\":\"$4e\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP07] Texture Edit: How to Refine and Customize Your 3D Model Textures?\"},\"EssentialToolsAndKit\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What tools are essential for bed adhesion and cleaning?\",\"Text\":\"Most printers ship with a \\\"starter bag\\\" of cheap tools, but they are usually the bare minimum. If you want to spend more time printing and less time struggling, you need a dedicated kit for cleaning, maintenance, and the inevitable \\\"clog surgery\\\".\\n\\nThe secret to a perfect first layer isn't a \\\"magic setting\\\"—it's a clean surface.\\n\\n- Isopropyl Alcohol (IPA) 90%+: This is the \\\"Gold Standard\\\" for wiping down your PEI bed to remove oils and fingerprints.\\n\\n- Microfiber Cloth: Use this to wipe the bed without leaving lint or scratches behind.\\n\\n- Dish Soap: If IPA isn't working, a simple wash with warm water and basic dish soap is the best way to deep-clean a build plate.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What do I need for removing supports and post-processing?\",\"Text\":\"Once the print is done, the work isn't quite over:\\n\\n- Flush Cutters (Nippers): These are mandatory for snipping filament and removing stubborn support structures.\\n\\n- Deburring Tool: Perfect for cleaning up sharp edges or the \\\"Elephant’s Foot\\\" on the bottom of your prints.\\n\\n- Needle-nose Pliers: Essential for reaching into tight gaps to pull out tree supports.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What tools are required for hardware maintenance?\",\"Text\":\"- Digital Calipers: If you want to ensure your 20mm cube is actually 20mm, you need these for dimensional accuracy.\\n\\n- Nozzle Cleaning Needles: For those minor clogs that don't require full \\\"clog surgery\\\".\\n\\n- Allen Key Set: Most printers use metric hex bolts; a high-quality set will prevent you from stripping screws.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"Tools FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Do I really need a glue stick? \\n\\nA: For PLA on a clean PEI bed, usually no. Glue is often used as a \\\"release agent\\\" for materials like PETG so they don't stick too well and damage the bed.\\n\\nQ: Should I buy a 3D printing \\\"Tool Kit\\\" bundle? \\n\\nA: Many \\\"all-in-one\\\" bundles on Amazon are filled with low-quality junk. You are better off buying a few high-quality basics like IPA, flush cutters, and a deburring tool separately.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 1 EP05] What are the Must-Have tools for every 3D printing kit?\"},\"FixingStlFiles\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Step 1: Download your Masterpiece\",\"Text\":\"Before sending the amazing model you created in Meshy straight to the printer, there's one small but important technical detail to check: non-manifold edges. \\n\\nThe good news? Fixing this is easier than it sounds. Here is a quick, beginner-friendly guide to making your model \\\"watertight\\\" and ready for print.\\n\\nGo to your model page in Meshy. Click the green download icon in the bottom-right corner, select STL format, and click Download. This is the standard file type for 3D printing and the most compatible format for repair tools.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Step 2: Check for Slicer Red Flags\",\"Text\":\"Open your favorite slicer (like Bambu Studio, Cura, or OrcaSlicer) and drop your file in. Keep a close eye on the bottom right corner for a pop-up warning. \\n\\n📌If you see an error saying \\\"Non-manifold edges detected\\\", stop right there! For a clean, professional print, it's better to fix the model's geometry of the model before hitting \\\"Slice\\\".\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Step 3: One-Click Fix\",\"Text\":\"Head over to Formware's Online STL Repair. You can use this free online tool without hassle to fix your stl files quickly.\\n\\n- Upload your original STL file.\\n\\n- The tool will automatically scan for holes, flipped faces, and those pesky non-manifold edges.\\n\\n- Within minutes, the tool patches every flaw, turning your mesh into a perfectly solid, print-ready file.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"Step 4: Download \u0026 Slice\",\"Text\":\"Once the repair is finished, download the fixed version of your model. Toss this new file back into your slicer. You'll notice the warnings are gone! \\n\\nNow you can safely hit \\\"Slice,\\\" send it to your printer, and watch your Meshy creation come to life without any weird gaps or structural glitches.\\n\\n## FAQ\\n\\nQ: What exactly is a \\\"non-manifold\\\" edge, and why does it ruin my print?\\n\\nA: It is a physical impossibility—like a shape with zero thickness or holes. Slicers can't distinguish \\\"inside\\\" from \\\"outside,\\\" causing skipped layers or messy \\\"spiderwebs.\\\"\\n\\nQ: Will repairing my STL file reduce the level of detail I created in Meshy?\\n\\nA: Generally, no. Standard repair tools focus on fixing the \\\"logic\\\" of the mesh (closing holes and merging edges) rather than simplifying it.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP05] AI Model Repair: How to Fix Your STL Files for a Flawless Print?\"},\"HowSlicingWorks\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"$4f\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP01] Slicing 101: How does a 3D printer know what to print?\"},\"ImageTo3dWorkflow\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How to turn photos into 3D models?\",\"Text\":\"Turning a photo into a fully realized 3D model might sound like magic — but with Meshy’s Image-to-3D feature, it's just a few clicks away.\\n\\nStep 1: Go to Workspace\\nChoose the Image-to-3D feature in Meshy.\\n\\nStep 2: Upload Your Image\\nSelect a high-resolution image with a standard front view. \\n\\nStep 3: Generate\\nClick \\\"Generate\\\" and watch Meshy turn your 2D input into a high-quality 3D model in seconds.\\n\\nStep 4: Retry if Needed\\n\\nIf you are not happy with the first result, don’t worry—Meshy allows you to regenerate your model.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What kind of photos work best for 3D printing?\",\"Text\":\"$50\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Which image types should you avoid?\",\"Text\":\"- Text on the Image\\n\\n Avoid images containing text, as letters can confuse the 3D generator and reduce model accuracy.\\n\\n- Unclear Object vs. Background\\n\\nDo not use images where the object blends into the background. Clear separation or strong contrast ensures the generator captures the shape correctly.\\n\\n- Excessive Environmental Effects\\n\\nAvoid smoke, fog, magical particles, or any effects that obscure the object’s form, as they make 3D generation unreliable.\\n\\n- Long Hair, Fur, or Fine Structures\\n\\nImages with long hair, fur, or delicate hair-like parts are difficult for the generator to interpret accurately, often resulting in messy geometry.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"Pro Tip: How can you fix photos that aren’t perfect?\",\"Text\":\"Meshy's Image Workspace allows you to modify your images before generating a 3D model, making it easier to get exactly the look you want. You can remove backgrounds, adjust colors, or make other edits directly in the workspace.\\n\\n1. Add Your Image to Image References\\n\\nUpload the image you want to modify into the Image References section. This will be the base for all edits.\\n\\n1. Use the Prompt Field to Describe Changes\\n\\nIn the Prompt field, type the modifications you want to apply. For example, you can write \\\"remove background\\\" or \\\"brighten colors.\\\"\\n\\n1. Preview Generated Options\\n\\nClick Generate, and Meshy will create 4 edited previews based on your instructions. Review all four to see which one best matches your intended result.\\n\\n1. Select and Generate 3D Model\\n\\nOnce you find the preferred preview, send it to Image-to-3D to generate the final model. This ensures your 3D asset closely matches your envisioned design.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: What should I do if my object has asymmetrical details that aren't showing up correctly?\\n\\nA: If a model looks too symmetrical or is missing unique features on one side, try using the Image Workspace to generate a slightly angled view or a \\\"Three-Quarter\\\" view before hitting the final 3D generate button. Providing a clearer sense of the object's volume through edited previews can help the AI better understand non-symmetrical geometry.\\n\\nQ: Can I turn a hand-drawn sketch into a 3D model for printing?\\n\\nA: Yes, Meshy is excellent at interpreting 2D sketches. For the best results, ensure your sketch has bold, clean outlines and is drawn from a straight-on perspective.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP04] Image-to-3D Workflow: How to Pick Right Images for 3D Generation?\"},\"MeshyToMultiColor\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How to enable multi-color printing in Meshy？\",\"Text\":\"$51\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Which file format is best for multi-color 3D printing?\\n\\nA: 3MF is the highly recommended format. \\n\\nQ: Where can I find examples of successful multi-color prints created with Meshy?\\n\\nA:  You can explore the Meshy Community Gallery or join our Discord server. Many users share their physical results there, along with the specific slicer settings they used.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP05] Multi-Color Printing: How to Turn a Meshy Textured Model into a Multi-Color 3D Print?\"},\"MultiColorPrinting\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How Do I Print 3D Models in Multi-Color Using Meshy?\",\"Text\":\"$52\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP09] How Do I Print 3D Models in Multi-Color Using Meshy?\"},\"PaintingColorsInSlicer\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What should you set before painting a model in slicer?\",\"Text\":\"In the world of 3D printing, you are no longer limited to a single color. This guide will walk you through the process of painting your model in the slicer.\\n\\n- Before you start painting, you need to tell the software how many colors you plan to use. \\n\\n- Open the Filament list, which shows all available filaments in the current project as colored boxes.\\n\\n- Click a color box to select a filament for painting. You can assign a different filament to each section of your model.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"How to start color painting in the slicer?\",\"Text\":\"Once the colors are ready, select your model and click the Color Painting icon in the top toolbar (or press shortcut N) to enter Painting Mode.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Which painting tool should you pick?\",\"Text\":\"$53\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Why does the estimated print time increase so much after painting?\\n\\nA: Multi-color printing requires frequent filament changes. Each time a color switches on a layer, the printer must retract, cut, load new material, and purge the nozzle.\\n\\nQ: Can I apply a color photo directly to my model?\\n\\nA: No, the slicer's painting tools are for manual coloring. However, you can use Meshy's AI Texturing tool to generate the texture first and then export the multi-color model directly into your slicer, which will automatically map the colors to your filaments.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP04] Multi-Color in Slicer: How to Paint Your 3D Models?\"},\"ReducingWaste\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Is PLA really eco-friendly?\",\"Text\":\"Let's be real: 3D printing creates waste. Failed prints, support structures, test pieces — they add up. According to industry data, roughly 33% of all filament used ends up as waste. But you can still print responsibly without sacrificing quality or fun.\\n\\nPLA is plant-based (corn starch / sugarcane), which sounds great. But here's the truth:\\n\\n- PLA only biodegrades under industrial composting conditions (60°C+ with specific microbes).\\n\\n- In a landfill or your backyard, it acts just like regular plastic for decades.\\n\\nSo PLA is better than petroleum-based plastics, but it's not a magic guilt-free material. Responsible habits still matter.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the simplest ways to reduce printing waste?\",\"Text\":\"- Optimize infill: Meshy models are usually for display, not structural stress. Standard parts use 15–20% infill, but for Meshy figurines, 5–10% is usually plenty — based on our testing, this saves up to 40% material with no visible difference.\\n\\n- Choose recycled filament: Brands like Polymaker, eSun, and Filamentive sell \\\"rPLA\\\" — made from recycled factory waste. It prints identically to virgin PLA with a smaller carbon footprint.\\n\\n- Nail your settings first: Print a small test piece before committing to a 12-hour print. One calibration run can prevent a whole spool of wasted plastic.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What should I do with scraps and failed prints?\",\"Text\":\"Most curbside recycling bins DO NOT accept 3D prints because they lack the recycling code symbols. Here are your options:\\n\\n- Specialist services: Collect scraps and mail them to recyclers like Printerior (US) or Recycling Fabrik (EU).\\n\\n- Creative upcycling: Melt scraps into silicone molds for coasters, or use them for mosaic art.\\n\\n- Filament extruder: You can buy a filament extruder that grinds your scraps and melts them back into new filament spool. These machines are expensive and tricky to master. But for hardcore makers, it's the ultimate recycling dream.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Can I recycle PLA with regular household recycling?\\n\\nA: No. PLA lacks the standard recycling code symbols that sorting facilities recognize. Collect 3D printing scraps separately and use a specialist recycling service.\\n\\nQ: Is recycled filament (rPLA) lower quality than regular PLA?\\n\\nA: No. Modern rPLA prints at the same temperatures (190–215°C) and delivers identical surface quality. You won't notice a difference.\\n\\nQ: Does reducing infill weaken my display prints?\\n\\nA: For figurines and display models, no. Even 10% infill with 3–4 wall lines provides plenty of strength for shelf display. Only increase infill for functional, load-bearing parts.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 3 EP05] How Can I Reduce 3D Printing Waste and Print More Sustainably?\"},\"SafetyFumesAndFire\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Fumes: What are you actually breathing?\",\"Text\":\"3D printing is safe if you aren't reckless. Modern machines are much safer than they used to be, but you are still melting plastic in your house. Use common sense: don't huff the fumes, and don't leave a \\\"tinker\\\" printer unattended.\\n\\nThe \\\"smell\\\" of printing depends entirely on the material. Based on air quality studies, FDM and Resin have very different safety profiles:\\n\\n- FDM (Filament): Standard PLA is generally considered safe, but it still emits Ultra-fine Particles (UFPs) and Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs). Materials like ABS or ASA are \\\"spicy\\\" and require a dedicated enclosure and external venting.\\n\\n- Resin (SLA): These chemicals are sensitizers. You must wear nitrile gloves and a respirator. Never handle uncured resin with bare skin.\\n\\nMeshy suggest keeping any 3D printer out of your bedroom to avoid long-term exposure to particulates.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Fire Safety: Is my printer a fire hazard?\",\"Text\":\"Early 3D printers were notorious for \\\"Thermal Runaway\\\"—where the heater gets stuck \\\"on\\\" until it catches fire.\\n\\n- Modern Gear: In 2026, reputable mainstream \\\"Appliance-style\\\" printers include robust firmware protections as a default. These systems automatically shut the machine down if a temperature anomaly is detected。\\n\\n- Budget \\\"Clones\\\": If you bought a $99 \\\"no-name\\\" printer, double-check that \\\"Thermal Runaway Protection\\\" is enabled in the settings.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Safety FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Can I leave my 3D printer running while I'm at work?\\n\\n A: For high-end, reliable machines with built-in sensors, many users do this daily. However, for your first few weeks, we recommend only printing while you are home until you trust your setup.\\n\\nQ: Are 3D printed items food-safe? \\n\\nA: Generally, no. Even if the plastic is \\\"food-safe,\\\" the tiny gaps between layers are breeding grounds for bacteria. Use 3D prints for display or utility, not for your dinner plate.\\n\\nQ: Is it safe to have a 3D printer around pets or kids? \\n\\nA: Only if it's enclosed. Hotends reach 220°C+ and the moving parts can easily pinch small fingers or inquisitive paws. An enclosure is a \\\"must-have\\\" for family-friendly setups.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 1 EP02] Is 3D printing safe? What you need to know about fumes and fire?\"},\"SpecialtyPla\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I print Silk PLA for a metallic finish?\",\"Text\":\"You've mastered PLA Basic and Matte. Now you want your Meshy models to look like metal, stone, or magic. Welcome to specialty PLA — standard PLA mixed with additives that change how prints look and feel. Each type has quirks, though. You shouldn't just use your standard profile and expect a banger.\\n\\nSilk PLA has a gorgeous metallic sheen that makes prints look like polished treasure. Though it's also the weakest PLA variant. The shiny additives ruin layer-to-layer bonding.\\n\\n- Temperature: Print at 215–230°C for maximum gloss (hotter than standard PLA).\\n\\n- Flow Trick: Lower your flow rate to 0.90 or 0.95 to prevent bloating.\\n\\n- Speed Limit: Slow down your outer walls to 30–40mm/s for maximum bling. High speeds disturb the polymer alignment and turn the finish matte.\\n\\n- Cooling Fan: 30–50%. Too much cooling also dulls the finish.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I get that natural stone look with Marble PLA?\",\"Text\":\"Marble PLA is usually a white or grey PLA with tiny black specks suspended in it. The variegated texture hides layer lines and makes prints look like solid plaster. \\n\\n- The Risk: Most \\\"Marble\\\" PLA uses colored plastic specks, but some also use real rock powder. Check before you buy. If it contains real stone, use a 0.6mm nozzle to prevent clogs. Pigment-only versions work fine at 0.4mm.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"How do I get the best results with Wood PLA?\",\"Text\":\"Wood filament is PLA mixed with 30–40% wood dust. It smells like a woodshop when printing and can be sanded, stained, and varnished like real timber.\\n\\n- Temp Trick: Higher temperature = darker \\\"burn\\\" marks for wood grain effect. Print at 190°C for a light pine look, or 230°C for a dark mahogany look.\\n\\n- Nozzle Requirement: A 0.6mm nozzle is strongly recommended. 0.4mm nozzle will easily get clogged. 0.2mm nozzle is not compatible.\\n\\n- Don't Let it Cook: Unload Wood PLA immediately after printing. Otherwise, it will carbonize and permanently block your hotend.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"What should I know before printing Glow-in-the-Dark PLA?\",\"Text\":\"Glow filament is best for ghosts, magic items, and sci-fi accessories. It looks cool in the dark, but it's also abrasive. Those phosphorescent particles are basically tiny sandpaper bits running through your printer.\\n\\n-  A hardened steel nozzle is required when printing. Stainless steel nozzles are not compatible. 0.2mm nozzles are not compatible.\\n\\n- AMS 2 Pro, AMS HT \u0026 AMS are compatible, but can lead to faster wear. AMS Lite is not compatible.\\n\\n- Expose to light for 5-10 minutes for maximum glow.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Can I mix specialty PLA with regular PLA in a multi-color print?\\n\\nA: Yes, but use the specialty filament's settings for the whole print to avoid quality issues between material transitions.\\n\\nQ: Do specialty filaments need special storage?\\n\\nA: Yes — especially Wood and Silk PLA, which absorb moisture faster than standard PLA. Seal with desiccant and dry before use.\\n\\nQ: Are specialty PLA filaments safe for food contact?\\n\\nA: No. Additives like wood dust and glow particles make them unsuitable for food use. Display items only.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 3 EP02] Speciality PLA Filament: How Do I Print PLA Silk, Marble, Wood, and Glow-in-the-Dark?\"},\"SupportStructures\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"✅ Why do 3D printers need supports?\",\"Text\":\"3D printers—specifically FDM (Fused Deposition Modeling) machines—are like wizards, but they have one weakness: they cannot print on thin air. Since printers build layer by layer from the bottom up, any part of your model that hangs in empty space will collapse into a mess of \\\"spaghetti\\\" without help.\\n\\nThis is where Supports come in. Think of them as temporary \\\"scaffolding\\\" that holds up the overhanging parts of your model (like an outstretched arm or a dragon’s chin) while it prints.\\n\\nThe \\\"YHT\\\" Rule:\\n\\n- The \\\"Y\\\" Shape: Requires no support because its gradual slopes (45° or steeper) allow each successive layer to overlap securely with the layer beneath it.\\n\\n- The \\\"H\\\" Shape: Utilizes \\\"bridging\\\" to span short gaps successfully without support, but requires support for longer distances where gravity will cause the filament to sag.\\n\\n- The \\\"T\\\" Shape: Must have support because FDM printers cannot deposit material in mid-air, causing severe 90-degree overhangs to fail instantly due to gravity.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"💡 Should I choose Normal or Tree supports?\",\"Text\":\"Most slicers offer two main types. Choosing the right one saves you time and scarring.\\n\\n- Tree Supports\\n\\nWhat do they look like? These grow like tree branches, wrapping around the model to touch only the necessary points. \\n\\nPros: Use less material, print faster, easy to remove, minimal contact with the print, often results in better surface finish.\\n\\nCons: Can be less stable for very heavy or complex overhangs, may not be suitable for all slicers. \\n\\nBest Suited For:  Organic shapes like characters and miniatures, or complex figures where you need to preserve surface details.\\n\\n- Normal Supports\\n\\nWhat do they look like? They are sturdy and great, build straight vertical pillars.\\n\\nPros: Stronger and more supportive of large or heavy overhangs. \\n\\nCons: More difficult to remove, can leave significant scarring on the print.\\n\\nBest Suited For: Geometric structures, tilted models, spheres, and parts with large, flat overhangs.\\n\\nImage Source: Cytron.io\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"💡Pro Tips：When to use \\\"On build plate only\\\"\u0026When to use \\\"Supports Everywhere\\\"?\",\"Text\":\"$54\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"🛠️ The Workflow: What are the steps to generate supports?\",\"Text\":\"Step 1: Analyze and Orient\\n\\nBefore adding support, examine your model for overhangs. While not every model needs rotation, consider re-orienting the object to minimize support usage\\n\\nStep 2: Auto Support Generate \\n\\nSelect Support Type In your slicer, enable \\\"Support.\\\" Based on the guide above, choose the support type that best fits your model's specific geometry and complexity.\\n\\nStep 3: The Preview Check \\n\\nSlice the model and carefully verify the preview. Look for the support interface layers under the overhangs. Ensure no part of the model starts \\\"in mid-air\\\" (floating islands) and that critical details are properly supported.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"⚠️ Pro Tips: How do I remove supports without damaging the print?\",\"Text\":\"- Tools: Use flush cutters to snip the connection points carefully.\\n\\n- Technique: Don't rip them off violently. For small details, warm water (for PLA) can soften the supports slightly, making them peel away like an orange skin.\\n\\n- Aftercare: Small marks are normal. A quick sanding will make them disappear.\"},\"S6\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Will removing supports ruin the surface of my model? \\n\\nA: Supports often leave small marks or \\\"scars\\\" where they touch the print. To minimize this, use Tree Supports for organic models or tune your \\\"Z-distance\\\" settings. Any remaining marks can usually be removed with fine-grit sandpaper or a hobby knife.\\n\\nQ: Why did my print fail even with support enabled? \\n\\nA: Slicers sometimes miss small overhangs or isolated parts. Always verify the Preview mode before printing. If you see unsupported areas starting in mid-air, you must manually add support using the \\\"Paint-on\\\" feature to prevent collapse.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP03] Support Structures: How to build support for complex, floating models?\"},\"TextTo3dPrompting\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"✅ The Winning Formula: Subject + Physics + Style\",\"Text\":\"$55\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"❌ The \\\"Printer-Killer\\\" Traps (What to Avoid)\",\"Text\":\"$56\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP03] Text-to-3D Workflow: How to craft banger prompts to generate printable models?\"},\"TextureHelperPrompts\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"$57\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP08] Texture Helper: How to Improve Your Texture Prompts with Meshy's AI Helper?\"},\"TuningSlicerProfile\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Classic Mode\",\"Text\":\"$58\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Arachne Mode\",\"Text\":\"$59\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP02] Profile Tuning: How to Set Up 3D Printing Slicer for the Best Results?\"},\"UnevenFirstLayer\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Issue A: Uneven Bottom. The AI generates a base with tiny bumps or uneven textures, preventing it from lying perfectly flat.\",\"Text\":\"## The Great Escape: Why models lose their grip？\\n\\nIf your 3D model were a ballerina, its tiny claw-tips or slender legs might be performing a daring pirouette on the virtual stage of your slicer. But once music starts on the physical print bed, gravity can be a harsh critic. Without a solid footing, your character might just decide to take an unscheduled bow and fall right off the stage. This guide helps you give your models the strong foundation they need.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Issue B: Tiny Contact Points. The character has claws or thin feet, meaning there is almost zero surface area sticking to the bed.\",\"Text\":\"## How can you fix it?\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Method A (Best for characters without a base): Use the Meshy \\\"Add Base\\\" feature.\",\"Text\":\"- How to do it: Go to the Print tab in Meshy and click the Add Base button.\\n\\n- Key Tip: After adding the base, check the preview carefully. Make sure all bottom parts of your model (like claw tips) are fully touching and merged into the new base. This turns tiny contact points into one solid, stable foundation to prevent print failure.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"Method B (Universal fix): Use the \\\"Planar Cut\\\" tool in your slicer.\",\"Text\":\"- How to do it: This works whether your model has a base or not. In slicing software like PrusaSlicer or Bambu Studio, press the C key to open the Cut tool. Move the cutting plane up by 0.5mm - 1.0mm to cut off the uneven bits. \\n\\n- The Result: This forces the bottom of the model to be a perfectly flat surface for 100% bed adhesion.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"Method C (Z-Axis Sinking):\",\"Text\":\"- Alternatively, you can move the model down along the Z-axis (e.g., Z = -1.0mm) so the uneven bottom part is \\\"sunk\\\" below the virtual build plate. The slicer will ignore anything below zero and print a flat first layer starting from the new contact point.\"},\"S6\":{\"Heading\":\"Method D: Add a Brim or Raft.\",\"Text\":\"- In your slicer settings, go to Other- Bed Adhesion- turn on Brim. This prints a wide \\\"ring\\\" around the bottom of the model to help it grip the bed.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 5 EP01] Uneven First Layer\"},\"VariableHeightIroningFuzzySkin\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What it does?\",\"Text\":\"## Variable layer height: How to control detail and speed through layer height settings?\\n\\nVariable Layer Height lets the slicer use different layer thicknesses in different parts of a model instead of one fixed layer height. This lets you improve surface quality without significantly increasing total print time.\\n\\n- Uses thinner layers on curves and slopes → smoother surface\\n\\n- Uses thicker layers on flat areas → faster printing\\n\\n- Improves quality without greatly increasing total print time\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"How to use?\",\"Text\":\"$5a\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What it does？\",\"Text\":\"- Creates a smooth, injection-molded finish on flat areas (like badges, box lids, or mechanical parts).\\n\\n- Trade-off: Adds extra print time.\\n\\n- Note: Only effective on horizontal flat surfaces, not curved tops or slopes.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"How to use?\",\"Text\":\"- Enable Ironing: Check the box in the Quality settings.\\n\\n- Type: Select \\\"All top surfaces\\\" to iron every flat step, or \\\"Topmost surface only\\\" to smooth just the absolute highest layer.\\n\\n- Pattern: Keep the default \\\"Rectilinear\\\" for the cleanest finish.\\n\\n## Fuzzy Skin: How to hide layer lines and add texture?\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"What it does?\",\"Text\":\"Instead of drawing smooth straight lines, the printer randomly jitters the nozzle to create a rough, textured finish on the outer walls.\\n\\n- Visual Magic: Completely hides layer lines, ringing, and Z-seams, effectively simulating materials like stone, cast iron, or fur.\\n\\n- Tactile Benefit: Adds excellent grip to tool handles and knobs.\\n\\n- Trade-off: Massively increases print time due to the complex, jittery toolpaths required for every outer wall.\"},\"S6\":{\"Heading\":\"How to use?\",\"Text\":\"- Contour: Always select \\\"Contour\\\" (or Outer Wall) to apply texture only to the visible outside, keeping inner holes precise for assembly.\\n\\n- Point Distance: Controls density. Lower values (e.g., 0.1-0.2mm) create a finer, \\\"furry\\\" texture; higher values create a rougher \\\"rock\\\" look.\\n\\n- Fuzzy Skin Thickness: Controls depth. 0.3mm is a standard starting point.\\n\\n⚠️ Warning: Do not use on mating surfaces (like lids or screw threads), or parts won't fit together. Use a Modifier to block these areas if needed.\\n\\n## Hide Seams: Why is there an ugly line on my model?\"},\"S7\":{\"Heading\":\"What it does?\",\"Text\":\"Every FDM print has a \\\"Z-Seam\\\"—a vertical scar formed where the printer starts and stops each layer. Because the nozzle must physically start and end its path somewhere on the outer perimeter, this is an unavoidable reality of 3D printing. If ignored, this \\\"zipper\\\" can appear right on a character's face or a smooth surface, ruining the look.\\n\\n💡 Tip: To spot these seams before printing, slice your model and go to the Preview tab. Set the Color Scheme to Line Type, and you will see the Seams represented as white lines.\"},\"S8\":{\"Heading\":\"How to use?\",\"Text\":\"$5b\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 4 EP06] Slicing Tips: How to use Variable layer height, Ironing, Fuzzy skin, and Hide seams for pro-quality prints?\"},\"WhatMeshyDoes\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Image to 3D: How Can I Turn a Sketch into a Printable Statue?\",\"Text\":\"$5c\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Multi-Color Printing: How Do I Get Colorful Prints Without Manual Painting?\",\"Text\":\"$5d\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 2 EP01] How does Meshy change the game for non-designers?\"},\"WhenToSwitchToPetg\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What is PETG and why is it called \\\"the best of both worlds\\\"?\",\"Text\":\"Your Meshy model looks amazing, but you want it on your car dashboard or use it as a garden planter. PLA's glass transition is only 60°C — one hot afternoon turns it into a sad puddle. \\n\\nTime to level up to PETG — the material that laughs at heat.\\n\\nThink of PETG as PLA's tougher, more athletic sibling. It combines PLA's ease of printing with engineering-grade durability:\\n\\n- Heat resistant: PETG's glass transition is 81°C — a 21°C advantage over PLA. Car accessories and outdoor decor will stay solid.\\n\\n- Flexible strength: Unlike brittle PLA, PETG bends before it breaks.\\n\\n- No toxic fumes: Low odor and safe for home printing.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What problems should I expect when printing PETG?\",\"Text\":\"- It's stringy (the \\\"Spiderweb Effect\\\"): PETG flows like honey and leaves thin strings between parts. Increase retraction speed and distance slightly compared to your PLA settings.\\n\\n- It's a moisture magnet: PETG absorbs humidity like a sponge — roughly 0.3% by weight — causing popping sounds while printing and rough surfaces. Always dry PETG before first use (see our Keeping it Dry guide).\\n\\n- It sticks too well: PETG can fuse permanently to glass and smooth PEI sheets. Use a glue stick or hairspray as a release agent — it creates a barrier so prints pop off safely.\\n\\nMeshy Pro-Tip: PETG and PLA don't stick to each other, so you can't combine them in a multi-color print expecting a strong bond. Flip side: this makes them useful as breakaway support material for each other in dual-extruder setups.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the recommended print settings for PETG?\",\"Text\":\"FAQ\\n\\nQ: Is PETG food-safe?\\n\\nA: PETG itself is FDA-approved, but 3D printed PETG isn't truly food-safe — micro-gaps between layers harbor bacteria. Apply a food-safe epoxy coating for food use.\\n\\nQ: Can I print PETG without an enclosure?\\n\\nA: Yes. Unlike ABS, PETG doesn't warp badly and produces minimal fumes. An enclosure is optional but helps with temperature consistency on large prints.\\n\\nQ: Is PETG recyclable?\\n\\nA: PETG carries the #1 recycling code and is technically recyclable, but most curbside programs don't accept 3D prints. Collect scraps for specialist recycling services.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 3 EP03] When Should I Switch from PLA to PETG for 3D Printing?\"},\"WhyStartWithPla\":{\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Which PLA finish should I choose: Basic or Matte?\",\"Text\":\"Last updated: Feb 2026\\n\\nIf 3D printing filaments were a royal family, PLA would be the beloved king that everyone loves. It's forgiving, affordable, and won't fill your house with chemical fumes.\\n\\nFor beginners—especially those printing their first Meshy-generated model — PLA Basic or PLA Matte would be your best friend.\\n\\n- Basic PLA: Glossy, shiny finish that makes colors pop. Trade-off: visible layer lines can give prints a \\\"cheap plastic\\\" look.\\n\\n- Matte PLA: Hides layer lines beautifully with a clay-like, non-reflective surface. Community favorite for figurines and display pieces.\\n\\nQuick rule of thumb: if your model has lots of fine detail (like a Meshy figurine), go Matte. If you want vivid, eye-catching color, go Basic.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Why should beginners start with PLA Basic \u0026 Matte?\",\"Text\":\"- Easiest to print: Nozzle temp of 190–220°C, minimal warping, and better overhang performance than almost any other material.\\n\\n- Pleasant to work with: Unlike ABS, PLA gives off a faint, sweet aroma — almost like waffles. Always ventilate your space, though.\\n\\n- Widest availability: Basic and Matte PLA are stocked by every major brand in dozens of colors, making them easy to source anywhere.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"What are PLA Basic \u0026 Matte's biggest weaknesses?\",\"Text\":\"- Brittle under impact — Can snap under stress. Avoid using it for functional gears or load-bearing parts.\\n\\n- Softens at ~60°C — PLA's glass transition temperature is around 60°C. A print left in a hot car will deform. For heat-exposed parts, consider PETG (see our PETG guide).\\n\\n- Not ideal for outdoor use — PLA degrades under prolonged UV exposure. For outdoor projects, also switch to PETG.\"},\"S4\":{\"Heading\":\"What are the recommended print settings?\",\"Text\":\"Here are the recommended settings for PLA Basic and Matte:\\n\\n- **Nozzle temperature:** 205–215°C (start at 210°C and adjust)\\n- **Bed temperature:** 50–60°C (PLA sticks well even without a heated bed, but warmth helps)\\n- **Print speed:** 50–200 mm/s (Matte PLA may benefit from slightly slower speeds for best surface finish)\\n- **Cooling fan:** 100% after the first layer — PLA loves cooling\\n- **Retraction (direct drive):** 0.5–1 mm\\n- **Retraction (Bowden):** 4–6 mm\\n- **Layer height:** 0.1–0.3 mm (use 0.16–0.2 mm for a good balance of speed and quality)\\n\\nMatte PLA tip: Matte finishes can sometimes clog smaller nozzles (0.2 mm) over long prints. A 0.4 mm nozzle is recommended.\\n\\nAlways run a temperature tower test with a new brand — every manufacturer's PLA is slightly different.\"},\"S5\":{\"Heading\":\"FAQ\",\"Text\":\"Q: Can I paint or post-process PLA Basic and Matte prints?\\n\\nA: Yes. PLA Matte takes paint particularly well due to its non-glossy surface. PLA Basic benefits from light sanding before painting to improve adhesion.\\n\\nQ: How should I store PLA filament?\\n\\nA: Keep it sealed with silica gel packets. Moisture-absorbed PLA causes popping, stringing, and rough surfaces. A dry box is a worthwhile investment.\\n\\nQ: Is PLA environmentally friendly?\\n\\nA: PLA is made from renewable resources like corn starch and is industrially compostable. However, it won't break down in a home compost bin or typical landfill within a normal timeframe.\"},\"Title\":\"[Phase 3 EP01] Why 90% of Your Prints Should Start With PLA Basic or PLA Matte?\"}},\"ArticleView\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\",\"TryInMeshyCta\":\"✦ Try it in Meshy — Create your 3D model now\"},\"Complete\":\"Complete\",\"Data\":{\"Course\":{\"CreateWithMeshy\":{\"Desc\":\"Turn text and images into printable 3D models — no CAD needed.\",\"Title\":\"Create with Meshy\"},\"GettingStarted\":{\"Desc\":\"Choose your printer, stay safe, and nail your first print.\",\"Title\":\"Getting Started\"},\"MaterialsAndFilaments\":{\"Desc\":\"Pick the right material, store it properly, and print sustainably.\",\"Title\":\"Materials \u0026 Filaments\"},\"SlicingAndSoftware\":{\"Desc\":\"Set up your slicer, tune profiles, and unlock multi-color printing.\",\"Title\":\"Slicing \u0026 Software\"},\"Troubleshooting\":{\"Desc\":\"Diagnose and fix the most common print failures.\",\"Title\":\"Troubleshooting\"}},\"Lesson\":{\"3dPrintingTerms\":{\"Title\":\"3D printing terms you need to know\"},\"AddingTextures\":{\"Title\":\"Adding textures to your model\"},\"ChoosingYourFirstPrinter\":{\"Title\":\"Choosing your first 3D printer\"},\"Day1Checklist\":{\"Title\":\"Day 1 checklist\"},\"DesigningPrintableModels\":{\"Title\":\"Designing models that actually print\"},\"DetailsTooThin\":{\"Title\":\"Details printing too thin\"},\"DryingWetFilament\":{\"Title\":\"Drying wet filament\"},\"EditingTextures\":{\"Title\":\"Editing textures\"},\"EssentialToolsAndKit\":{\"Title\":\"Essential tools \u0026 kit\"},\"FixingStlFiles\":{\"Title\":\"Fixing STL files before printing\"},\"HowSlicingWorks\":{\"Title\":\"How slicing works\"},\"ImageTo3dWorkflow\":{\"Title\":\"Image-to-3D workflow\"},\"MeshyToMultiColor\":{\"Title\":\"Meshy model to multi-color print\"},\"MultiColorPrinting\":{\"Title\":\"Multi-color printing with Meshy\"},\"PaintingColorsInSlicer\":{\"Title\":\"Painting colors in the slicer\"},\"ReducingWaste\":{\"Title\":\"Reducing waste\"},\"SafetyFumesAndFire\":{\"Title\":\"Safety basics: fumes \u0026 fire\"},\"SpecialtyPla\":{\"Title\":\"Specialty PLA: Silk, Marble, Wood, Glow\"},\"SupportStructures\":{\"Title\":\"Support structures\"},\"TextTo3dPrompting\":{\"Title\":\"Text-to-3D prompting\"},\"TextureHelperPrompts\":{\"Title\":\"Texture Helper: AI-assisted prompts\"},\"TuningSlicerProfile\":{\"Title\":\"Tuning your slicer profile\"},\"UnevenFirstLayer\":{\"Title\":\"Uneven first layer\"},\"VariableHeightIroningFuzzySkin\":{\"Title\":\"Variable height, Ironing, Fuzzy skin\"},\"WhatMeshyDoes\":{\"Title\":\"What Meshy does for you\"},\"WhenToSwitchToPetg\":{\"Title\":\"When to switch to PETG\"},\"WhyStartWithPla\":{\"Title\":\"Why start with PLA\"}},\"Unit\":{\"BeforeYouPrint\":{\"Title\":\"Before You Print\"},\"CommonFailures\":{\"Title\":\"Common Failures\"},\"LevelingUp\":{\"Title\":\"Leveling Up\"},\"MeshyBasics\":{\"Title\":\"Meshy Basics\"},\"MultiColorPro\":{\"Title\":\"Multi-Color \u0026 Pro Settings\"},\"PlaBasics\":{\"Title\":\"PLA — Your Go-To\"},\"RefineAndExport\":{\"Title\":\"Refine \u0026 Export\"},\"SlicingBasics\":{\"Title\":\"Slicing Basics\"},\"YourFirstPrint\":{\"Title\":\"Your First Print\"}}},\"Done\":\"Done\",\"Lesson\":{\"3dPrintingTerms\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Cuts filament\",\"Option2\":\"Converts models to G-code\",\"Option3\":\"Levels the bed\",\"Option4\":\"Repairs STL files\",\"Question\":\"What does a Slicer do?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"The Big Three\",\"Text\":\"FDM (Fused Deposition Modeling) — melts plastic filament spools. The most common hobbyist method.\\n\\nSlicer — software (Bambu Studio, Cura) that translates 3D models into printer instructions.\\n\\nG-Code — the language your printer speaks. A text file of coordinates, speeds, and temperatures.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Hardware \u0026 Print-Saving Terms\",\"Text\":\"Nozzle — hot tip that melts filament. Build Plate — print surface. Extruder — motor pushing filament.\\n\\nZ-Offset — nozzle-to-bed gap. Retraction — pulling filament back to prevent stringing. Bridging — printing across a gap without support.\\n\\nBenchy — the universal 3D printer benchmark boat. If it looks clean, your machine is dialed in.\"},\"Title\":\"3D printing terms you need to know\"},\"AddingTextures\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Only uploaded\",\"Option2\":\"Only generated\",\"Option3\":\"Both generated and uploaded\",\"Option4\":\"Animated only\",\"Question\":\"Which models can be textured?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What Can Be Textured?\",\"Text\":\"Meshy AI Texturing works on: Meshy-generated models and uploaded models. Stylized/animated models are not supported.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Text vs. Image Input\",\"Text\":\"Text — describe: \\\"weathered bronze armor with green patina.\\\"\\nImage — upload a reference photo.\\n\\nBoth let you iterate until it matches your vision.\"},\"Title\":\"Adding textures to your model\"},\"ChoosingYourFirstPrinter\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Resin (SLA)\",\"Option2\":\"FDM (Filament)\",\"Option3\":\"SLS (Powder)\",\"Option4\":\"DLP\",\"Question\":\"Which technology is recommended for beginners?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Option1\":\"Detects clogs\",\"Option2\":\"Auto-pauses when filament runs out\",\"Option3\":\"Measures layers\",\"Option4\":\"Monitors temp\",\"Question\":\"What does a Filament Runout Sensor do?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"FDM vs. Resin\",\"Text\":\"In 2026, the real choice isn't about quality — most mainstream brands produce great results.\\n\\nFDM (Filament) uses spools of plastic. Best for functional parts, toys, and large props. Safer, cleaner, and the standard experience.\\n\\nResin (SLA/LCD) uses liquid chemicals. Best for high-detail miniatures and jewelry — but messy, smells, and requires gloves \u0026 masks.\\n\\nMeshy's Take: Start with FDM unless you specifically only want tiny 28mm soldiers.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"\\\"Appliance\\\" vs. \\\"DIY Project\\\"\",\"Text\":\"Instead of price tags, look at the workflow:\\n\\nThe Appliance — ready-to-print machines from reputable brands. AI-assisted monitoring, app integration. Spend time creating, not fixing.\\n\\nThe DIY Path — budget machines requiring manual tuning. Great for learning, frustrating if you just want a finished model.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Newbie-Friendly Features\",\"Text\":\"Auto Bed Leveling (ABL) and PEI Build Plates are standard in 2026. Also look for:\\n\\n1. Remote Monitoring \u0026 App Control — mobile alerts, live progress, pause from phone.\\n2. Filament Runout Sensor — auto-pauses if you run out mid-print.\\n\\nCost: Printer $200–$1,000. A 1kg PLA spool costs $15–$25 and prints ~50 Benchy boats.\"},\"Title\":\"Choosing your first 3D printer\"},\"Comic\":{\"ChoosingYourFirstPrinter\":{\"P1\":{\"Scene\":\"Beginner at crossroads: FDM (sunny) vs Resin (dark lab)\",\"Talk\":\"FDM = plastic spools, safe, great for big prints. Resin = liquid chemicals, ultra-detail minis. Most beginners thrive with FDM!\"},\"P2\":{\"Scene\":\"Two printers personified: sleek robot vs scrappy mechanic\",\"Talk\":\"2026 choice: an \\\"Appliance\\\" that just works, or a \\\"DIY Project\\\" that teaches you everything... the hard way.\"},\"P3\":{\"Scene\":\"Phone showing print at 87%, alert: 'Filament low!'\",\"Talk\":\"Newbie features: app monitoring, filament sensors, auto leveling. These save you from Day 1 disasters.\"},\"P4\":{\"Scene\":\"Maker holding perfect Benchy, price tag: '$20/kg'\",\"Talk\":\"After the printer ($200–$1K), PLA costs $15–25/kg and prints ~50 Benchys. Cheaper than LEGO!\"}},\"DesigningPrintableModels\":{\"P1\":{\"Scene\":\"Meshy dragon with thick base sitting on print bed\",\"Talk\":\"Golden Rule: Stability is King! Flat base + chunky proportions = success.\"},\"P2\":{\"Scene\":\"Spaghetti mess next to ballerina on tiptoes\",\"Talk\":\"Spaghetti Profile: Tiny feet + thin limbs + top-heavy = guaranteed failure.\"},\"P3\":{\"Scene\":\"Prompt box: 'chunky dragon, flat base, thick legs'\",\"Talk\":\"Formula: Subject + Physics + Style. Tell Meshy what the printer needs!\"},\"P4\":{\"Scene\":\"Split: Meshy model left, perfect print right\",\"Talk\":\"Design for the nozzle, not the screen. Base-First = banger prints!\"}},\"HowSlicingWorks\":{\"P1\":{\"Scene\":\"STL confused, slicer 'translator' in the middle\",\"Talk\":\"Printer doesn't speak STL — it speaks G-code! The Slicer translates.\"},\"P2\":{\"Scene\":\"Model cross-section: thin layers like a cake\",\"Talk\":\"Slicer cuts into hundreds of layers, plots the nozzle's exact path.\"},\"P3\":{\"Scene\":\"G-code floating: G28, G1 X100, M104 S200\",\"Talk\":\"G-code: G28 = home, M104 S200 = heat 200°C. Readable, rarely needs editing.\"},\"P4\":{\"Scene\":\"Chef with ingredients: Speed, Temp, Layer Height\",\"Talk\":\"Slicing = cooking. Same model, different recipe = different result!\"}},\"UnevenFirstLayer\":{\"P1\":{\"Scene\":\"Ballerina wobbling on one toe on print bed\",\"Talk\":\"Tiny feet can't grip the bed. Gravity is harsh.\"},\"P2\":{\"Scene\":\"Meshy 'Add Base' button, platform appearing\",\"Talk\":\"Fix #1: Meshy's Add Base — solid platform, automatic.\"},\"P3\":{\"Scene\":\"Slicer Brim toggled on, border appearing\",\"Talk\":\"Fix #2: Brim = thin border for extra grip. Like boots for your model!\"},\"P4\":{\"Scene\":\"Perfect model on base, 'First Layer: Perfect' badge\",\"Talk\":\"Slow layer + bed temp +5°C + clean bed = rock-solid!\"}},\"WhyStartWithPla\":{\"P1\":{\"Scene\":\"PLA on throne of filament spools\",\"Talk\":\"If filaments were royalty, PLA is king. Forgiving, affordable, no fumes.\"},\"P2\":{\"Scene\":\"Two figurines: glossy Basic vs smooth Matte\",\"Talk\":\"Basic: Shiny but shows layers. Matte: Hides layers — community fav for figurines!\"},\"P3\":{\"Scene\":\"Thermometer 60°C, PLA drooping in sun\",\"Talk\":\"PLA's kryptonite: softens at 60°C. Car dashboard = puddle.\"},\"P4\":{\"Scene\":\"Beginner printing Meshy figurine, thumbs up\",\"Talk\":\"For learning and display — nothing beats PLA. Master it, then graduate!\"}}},\"Day1Checklist\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Nozzle\",\"Option2\":\"Build plate with IPA\",\"Option3\":\"Filament spool\",\"Option4\":\"Screen\",\"Question\":\"First thing to clean on a new printer?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Hardware Check\",\"Text\":\"Most Day 1 failures come from loose hardware or a dirty build plate.\\n\\n• Tension Belts — firm, \\\"ping\\\" like a guitar string.\\n• Clean Bed — wipe with 90%+ IPA to remove factory oils.\\n• Paper Test — slide paper between nozzle and bed. It should drag slightly.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Day 1 Settings\",\"Text\":\"Keep it simple:\\n\\n• Material: PLA\\n• Layer Height: 0.2mm\\n• Nozzle: 200–210°C / Bed: 55–60°C\\n• Speed: default (~50mm/s)\\n• Infill: 15–20%\\n\\nPrint a Benchy first. If it's clean, you're ready.\"},\"Title\":\"Day 1 checklist\"},\"DesigningPrintableModels\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Ballerina on toes\",\"Option2\":\"Bust with flat base\",\"Option3\":\"Long sword character\",\"Option4\":\"Top-heavy mushroom\",\"Question\":\"Most reliable model type?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Stability is King\",\"Text\":\"Meshy can dream up anything, but your printer lives with gravity. Success starts in the generation phase.\\n\\nFollow the \\\"Flat \u0026 Low\\\" principle.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"What Works vs. What Fails\",\"Text\":\"High success:\\n• Large footprint — flat base, wide contact\\n• Chunky proportions — thick limbs, solid bodies\\n• Low center of gravity\\n\\nSpaghetti:\\n• Tiny contact points (ballerina toes)\\n• Thin extensions (outstretched arms)\\n• Top-heavy designs\\n\\nAlways prompt Meshy to include a solid base.\"},\"Title\":\"Designing models that actually print\"},\"DetailsTooThin\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"0.1mm\",\"Option2\":\"0.2mm\",\"Option3\":\"0.4mm\",\"Option4\":\"1.0mm\",\"Question\":\"Standard FDM nozzle?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"The Problem\",\"Text\":\"Standard 0.4mm nozzle can't print thinner features. Fingers become spaghetti, hair becomes bird nests.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Solutions\",\"Text\":\"Hardware: 0.2mm nozzle (4x slower).\\n\\nSoftware: Scale up model, layer height 0.08–0.12mm, speed 25–30mm/s.\\n\\nMeshy: re-prompt with \\\"thick, chunky\\\" to avoid thin geometry.\"},\"Title\":\"Details printing too thin\"},\"DryingWetFilament\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Color fading\",\"Option2\":\"Stringing\",\"Option3\":\"Layer shifting\",\"Option4\":\"Warping\",\"Question\":\"Most visible sign of wet filament?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"All Filament Absorbs Moisture\",\"Text\":\"Signs of wet filament: stringing, popping/crackling (water boiling in nozzle), bubbly surface.\\n\\nSnap Test: Bend PLA 90°. Dry PLA bends back. Wet PLA snaps.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Drying \u0026 Prevention\",\"Text\":\"Options: filament dryer (best), food dehydrator, oven at lowest (risky).\\n\\nTemps: PLA 45–50°C / 4–6h. PETG 65°C / 4–6h. Nylon 70°C / 8+h.\\n\\nPrevention: airtight containers + silica gel. Print from a dry box.\"},\"Title\":\"Drying wet filament\"},\"EditingTextures\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Before generation\",\"Option2\":\"After texturing\",\"Option3\":\"Only on uploads\",\"Option4\":\"During slicing\",\"Question\":\"When is Texture Edit available?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Texture Edit\",\"Text\":\"Change colors, add patterns, or apply new textures to specific regions after texturing.\\n\\nThe Texture Edit icon appears at bottom center. Select regions and apply changes via AI prompts or manual adjustments.\"},\"Title\":\"Editing textures\"},\"EssentialToolsAndKit\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Soap\",\"Option2\":\"Window cleaner\",\"Option3\":\"IPA 90%+\",\"Option4\":\"Acetone\",\"Question\":\"Best cleaner for a PEI plate?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Bed Adhesion \u0026 Cleaning\",\"Text\":\"• IPA 90%+ — gold standard for PEI beds.\\n• Microfiber cloth — lint-free wiping.\\n• Glue stick — emergency adhesion for tricky materials.\\n• Scraper — pop prints off without damage.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Support Removal \u0026 Maintenance\",\"Text\":\"• Flush cutters — precision support removal.\\n• Craft knife — clean up edges.\\n• Needle-nose pliers — tight spaces.\\n\\nMaintenance: spare nozzles ($2), acupuncture needles for clogs, hex wrenches for belts.\"},\"Title\":\"Essential tools \u0026 kit\"},\"FixingStlFiles\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Thick walls\",\"Option2\":\"Mesh gaps confusing slicers\",\"Option3\":\"Surface details\",\"Option4\":\"Supports\",\"Question\":\"Non-manifold edges are?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Non-Manifold Edges\",\"Text\":\"Check for non-manifold edges — tiny mesh gaps that confuse slicers. Easy to fix with one-click tools.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"4-Step Fix\",\"Text\":\"1. Download from Meshy as STL\\n2. Import into slicer, check warnings\\n3. One-click repair\\n4. Re-slice the fixed file\"},\"Title\":\"Fixing STL files before printing\"},\"HowSlicingWorks\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"STL\",\"Option2\":\"G-code\",\"Option3\":\"JPEG\",\"Option4\":\"OBJ\",\"Question\":\"Slicer output?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Why You Can't Print Directly\",\"Text\":\"A slicer divides your model (.STL/.3MF) into thousands of layers, then generates G-code — coordinates, speeds, temperatures.\\n\\nSlicing = preparing a recipe for the machine.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"G-Code Basics\",\"Text\":\"G28 — Home axes. G1 X100 Y50 F1500 — Move. M104 S200 — Heat to 200°C.\\n\\nRarely edited manually, but understanding it helps debug.\"},\"Title\":\"How slicing works\"},\"ImageTo3dWorkflow\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Group photo\",\"Option2\":\"Clear front-facing single subject\",\"Option3\":\"Blurry image\",\"Option4\":\"Flat lay\",\"Question\":\"Best image for 3D conversion?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Steps\",\"Text\":\"1. Choose Image-to-3D in Meshy\\n2. Upload high-res, front-facing image\\n3. Generate\\n4. Regenerate if needed\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Good vs. Bad Images\",\"Text\":\"Best: Clear subject, front-facing, high contrast, minimal background.\\n\\nAvoid: Multiple subjects, extreme angles, transparent objects, thin/flat subjects.\\n\\nTip: Crop tight, increase contrast, use plain background.\"},\"Title\":\"Image-to-3D workflow\"},\"MeshyToMultiColor\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"2\",\"Option2\":\"4\",\"Option3\":\"8\",\"Option4\":\"16\",\"Question\":\"Recommended color count?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"From Texture to Color\",\"Text\":\"Click printing icon → Multi-Color Printing. Select 1–16 colors. 4 colors = best balance.\\n\\nKeep 100k+ faces for smooth color mapping.\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy model to multi-color print\"},\"MultiColorPrinting\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Smaller file size\",\"Option2\":\"3MF bundles color data, STL doesn't\",\"Option3\":\"STL is deprecated\",\"Option4\":\"3MF prints faster\",\"Question\":\"Why use 3MF instead of STL for color?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Option1\":\"5 minutes\",\"Option2\":\"1 minute\",\"Option3\":\"Under 10 seconds\",\"Option4\":\"30 minutes\",\"Question\":\"How fast does Meshy process color maps?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What Is Meshy Multi-Color Printing?\",\"Text\":\"This feature unlocks your FDM printer's full potential. Traditionally, adding color required hours of manual painting. Meshy automates this — generating print-ready color-mapped files directly.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Generating a Multi-Color 3MF\",\"Text\":\"1. Generate your model and texture based on image input (simple colors work best).\\n2. Click \\\"Multi-color Printing\\\" in Meshy.\\n3. Select color count (4 or 8 recommended). Meshy simplifies textures into these zones.\\n4. Download as .3MF — this format packages mesh + color assignments together.\\n\\nWhy 3MF? STL only stores shape. 3MF is the modern standard that bundles geometry, colors, and material data.\"},\"S3\":{\"Heading\":\"Slicer Setup\",\"Text\":\"1. Drag .3MF into your slicer (Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer).\\n2. The slicer auto-recognizes color zones. Map them to your AMS filament slots.\\n3. Add supports, enable prime tower for clean color transitions, and print.\\n\\nRequires a multi-material system (Bambu Lab AMS, Prusa MMU). Without one, you can still do manual filament swaps at layer changes.\"},\"Title\":\"Multi-color printing with Meshy\"},\"PaintingColorsInSlicer\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Same\",\"Option2\":\"Decreases\",\"Option3\":\"2–3x longer\",\"Option4\":\"Halves\",\"Question\":\"Multi-color print time?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Setup\",\"Text\":\"Open Filament list → assign colors → select model → Color Painting (press N in Bambu Studio).\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Tools\",\"Text\":\"Circle — brush-like, organic shapes.\\nSphere — paint by volume.\\nTriangle — click individual faces.\\n\\nMulti-color prints take 2–3x longer.\"},\"Title\":\"Painting colors in the slicer\"},\"ReducingWaste\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"10%\",\"Option2\":\"20%\",\"Option3\":\"33%\",\"Option4\":\"50%\",\"Question\":\"Typical filament waste %?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Is PLA Eco-Friendly?\",\"Text\":\"PLA is plant-based but only biodegrades under industrial composting (60°C+). In landfills, it acts like regular plastic.\\n\\n~33% of filament becomes waste.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Tips\",\"Text\":\"• Use Meshy's printability tips to avoid failures\\n• Test at small scale first\\n• 15% infill is plenty for display\\n• Save fails for recycling programs\"},\"Title\":\"Reducing waste\"},\"SafetyFumesAndFire\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"ABS\",\"Option2\":\"ASA\",\"Option3\":\"PLA\",\"Option4\":\"Nylon\",\"Question\":\"Safest FDM material?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Fumes\",\"Text\":\"FDM with PLA is generally safe but emits Ultra-fine Particles (UFPs) and VOCs. ABS/ASA are worse — they release styrene vapors.\\n\\nResin produces strong chemical fumes. Uncured resin is toxic on skin. Always use nitrile gloves and ventilation.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Fire Safety\",\"Text\":\"Modern \\\"Appliance\\\" printers have thermal runaway protection. DIY/budget machines may not.\\n\\nKeep printers out of bedrooms. Use a ventilated room or garage. Never leave budget printers unattended overnight.\"},\"Title\":\"Safety basics: fumes \u0026 fire\"},\"SpecialtyPla\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Too hot\",\"Option2\":\"Abrasive particles\",\"Option3\":\"Too flexible\",\"Option4\":\"Bad smell\",\"Question\":\"Why does Glow PLA need a hardened nozzle?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Silk \u0026 Marble\",\"Text\":\"Silk PLA — metallic sheen, weakest variant (additives hurt bonding). Print at 215–230°C.\\n\\nMarble PLA — white/grey with black specks. Hides layer lines naturally.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Wood \u0026 Glow\",\"Text\":\"Wood PLA — real wood fiber, natural grain. Vary temp (190–220°C) for light-to-dark tone.\\n\\nGlow-in-the-Dark — extremely abrasive particles. Use hardened steel nozzle, not brass.\"},\"Title\":\"Specialty PLA: Silk, Marble, Wood, Glow\"},\"SupportStructures\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Y\",\"Option2\":\"All three\",\"Option3\":\"T\",\"Option4\":\"None\",\"Question\":\"In YHT, which needs support?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Why Supports Exist\",\"Text\":\"FDM can't print on air. The \\\"YHT\\\" Rule:\\n\\nY — no support (angles merge up)\\nH — needs support (horizontal bridge)\\nT — definitely needs support (flat overhang)\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Normal vs. Tree\",\"Text\":\"Normal — straight pillars, reliable, more marks.\\nTree — branch-like, less scarring, less material.\\n\\nRemove while slightly warm. Use flush cutters.\"},\"Title\":\"Support structures\"},\"TextTo3dPrompting\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Color\",\"Option2\":\"Solid base\",\"Option3\":\"Flying effects\",\"Option4\":\"Tiny details\",\"Question\":\"Which prompt element prevents failures?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Workflow\",\"Text\":\"1. Open Meshy → Text to 3D\\n2. Enter prompt\\n3. Generate — text becomes 3D in seconds\\n4. Review, iterate, download STL\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Subject + Physics + Style\",\"Text\":\"Good: \\\"Chunky cartoon dragon sitting on round stone base, thick legs, solid body, smooth surface\\\"\\n\\nBad: \\\"Dragon flying with outstretched wings\\\" — floating parts fail.\\n\\nAlways include: base type, chunky proportions, stable pose, surface style.\"},\"Title\":\"Text-to-3D prompting\"},\"TextureHelperPrompts\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Prints image\",\"Option2\":\"Converts image to text prompt\",\"Option3\":\"Uploads to printer\",\"Option4\":\"Creates 3D model\",\"Question\":\"\\\"Image to Prompt\\\" does what?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"What It Does\",\"Text\":\"AI assistant for texture prompts:\\n\\n• Batch Prompt — generate multiple prompts at once.\\n• Change Style — quickly adjust visual style.\\n• Image to Prompt — convert reference images to text prompts.\"},\"Title\":\"Texture Helper: AI-assisted prompts\"},\"TuningSlicerProfile\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"0.08mm\",\"Option2\":\"0.16–0.20mm\",\"Option3\":\"0.32mm\",\"Option4\":\"0.50mm\",\"Question\":\"Best balance layer height?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Layer Height\",\"Text\":\"0.08–0.12mm (Fine) — miniatures, slow.\\n0.16–0.20mm (Standard) — best all-around.\\n0.24–0.28mm (Draft) — fast, visible layers.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Infill, Speed \u0026 Temp\",\"Text\":\"Infill: 15% display, 30% handling, 60%+ functional. Grid reliable, Gyroid strongest.\\n\\nSpeed: start ~50mm/s. Higher = vibration.\\n\\nTemp: follow manufacturer's range. Print a temp tower.\"},\"Title\":\"Tuning your slicer profile\"},\"UnevenFirstLayer\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Print faster\",\"Option2\":\"Meshy's Add Base\",\"Option3\":\"Lower bed temp\",\"Option4\":\"Remove supports\",\"Question\":\"Easiest fix for tiny feet?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Why Models Fail to Stick\",\"Text\":\"Issue A: AI-generated base has bumps preventing flat contact.\\nIssue B: Character has claws/thin feet — almost zero bed contact.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Fixes\",\"Text\":\"Method A: Meshy's \\\"Add Base\\\" — auto-generates a flat platform.\\n\\nMethod B (slicer): Add Brim, first layer width 150%, speed 15mm/s, bed temp +5°C.\"},\"Title\":\"Uneven first layer\"},\"VariableHeightIroningFuzzySkin\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Removes supports\",\"Option2\":\"Smooths top surfaces\",\"Option3\":\"Adds texture\",\"Option4\":\"Hides seam\",\"Question\":\"What does Ironing do?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"Variable Height \u0026 Ironing\",\"Text\":\"Variable Layer Height — thin layers on curves, thick on flats. Better quality, same speed.\\n\\nIroning — nozzle re-passes top surfaces. Glass-smooth finish.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Fuzzy Skin \u0026 Seam Hiding\",\"Text\":\"Fuzzy Skin — random wall noise for organic texture (rocks, pottery).\\n\\nHide Seams — \\\"Sharpest Corner\\\" hides in edges, \\\"Random\\\" scatters it.\"},\"Title\":\"Variable height, Ironing, Fuzzy skin\"},\"WhatMeshyDoes\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Cheaper filament\",\"Option2\":\"No CAD skills needed\",\"Option3\":\"Faster printing\",\"Option4\":\"Auto-leveling\",\"Question\":\"Meshy's key advantage?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"The Content Barrier\",\"Text\":\"The biggest barrier in 3D printing hasn't been hardware — it's content creation. Without CAD skills, you were stuck downloading others' files.\\n\\nMeshy changes this. Powered by Meshy 6, it bypasses traditional modeling's steep learning curve.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Text\":\"Meshy's Image-to-3D interprets depth, form, and structure from 2D input to build a 3D model in minutes.\\n\\nWith multi-color support, you can produce full-color prints from textured Meshy models — no painting required.\"},\"Title\":\"What Meshy does for you\"},\"WhenToSwitchToPetg\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Cheaper\",\"Option2\":\"Higher heat resistance\",\"Option3\":\"Better colors\",\"Option4\":\"Easier to print\",\"Question\":\"PETG's advantage over PLA?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"PLA's Tougher Sibling\",\"Text\":\"PLA softens at 60°C. PETG handles 81°C — ideal for car accessories, outdoor use, functional parts.\\n\\nPETG = PLA's ease + engineering durability: heat resistant, flexible, chemical resistant.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"PETG Tips\",\"Text\":\"More stringing, more moisture-sensitive.\\n\\nSettings: Nozzle 230–250°C, Bed 70–80°C, ~40mm/s, extra retraction. Always dry PETG first.\"},\"Title\":\"When to switch to PETG\"},\"WhyStartWithPla\":{\"Q1\":{\"Option1\":\"Basic\",\"Option2\":\"Matte\",\"Option3\":\"Silk\",\"Option4\":\"PETG\",\"Question\":\"Which PLA hides layer lines best?\"},\"S1\":{\"Heading\":\"The King of Filaments\",\"Text\":\"PLA is forgiving, affordable, and fume-free.\\n\\nBasic PLA — glossy, vivid colors. Visible layer lines.\\nMatte PLA — hides layers with a clay-like surface. Community favorite for figurines.\\n\\nFine detail → Matte. Vivid color → Basic.\"},\"S2\":{\"Heading\":\"Strengths \u0026 Weaknesses\",\"Text\":\"PLA prints at 190–220°C, barely smells, sticks easily. Perfect for your first Meshy model.\\n\\nWeakness: glass transition at ~60°C. A hot car dashboard deforms it. Not for mechanical stress. But for learning and display — nothing beats it.\"},\"Title\":\"Why start with PLA\"}},\"LessonView\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"BackToCourses\":\"Back to courses\",\"ComingSoon\":\"Coming Soon\",\"CompleteLesson\":\"Complete Lesson\",\"Correct\":\"Correct!\",\"GreatWorkOn\":\"Great work on \\\"{title}\\\"\",\"IncorrectTryAgain\":\"Incorrect — try again!\",\"LessonComplete\":\"Lesson Complete!\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"NextLesson\":\"Next Lesson\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\",\"Quiz\":\"Quiz\",\"StepXOfY\":\"Step {current} of {total}\",\"TryAgain\":\"Try Again\",\"TryInMeshyCta\":\"✦ Try it in Meshy — Create your 3D model now\",\"UnderConstruction\":\"This lesson is under construction.\"},\"LessonsCompleted\":\"{done}/{total} lessons completed\",\"Syllabus\":\"Syllabus\",\"SyllabusDescription\":\"Deep-dive articles for every topic\",\"Title\":\"3D Printing Academy\"},\"Description\":\"Learn how to use Meshy AI with our step-by-step complete guides. See how to generate high-quality 3D AI textures, text-to-3D, and image-to-3D models.\",\"Detail\":{\"BackLink\":\"Back to tutorials\",\"MetadataTitle\":\"{title} | Meshy Tutorials\",\"VideoDescription\":\"Video Description\",\"WatchOnYouTube\":\"Watch on YouTube\"},\"Guides\":{\"BackToTutorials\":\"Back to tutorials\",\"Badge\":\"Guides\",\"BreadcrumbHome\":\"Home\",\"BreadcrumbTutorials\":\"Tutorials\",\"Empty\":\"No guides yet. Check back soon.\",\"HeroTag\":\"Tutorial Guide\",\"KeyFeatures\":\"Key Features\",\"PrintingAcademy\":\"3D Printing Academy\",\"RelatedGuides\":\"Related Guides\",\"RelatedTutorials\":\"Related Tutorials\",\"StartCreating\":\"Convert Image to 3D\"},\"Page\":{\"Title\":\"Tutorials\"},\"Pagination\":{\"Label\":\"Tutorials pagination\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"Previous\":\"Previous\"},\"Sorter\":{\"All\":\"All\",\"Community\":\"Community\",\"CompleteGuides\":\"Complete Guides\",\"Hottest\":\"Hottest\",\"Meshy3DPrinting\":\"Meshy + 3D Printing\",\"MeshyBlender\":\"Meshy + Blender\",\"MeshyGameDev\":\"Meshy + Game Dev\",\"MeshyOfficial\":\"Meshy Official\",\"MeshyQuickGuide\":\"Meshy Quick Guide\",\"Newest\":\"Newest\",\"VideoTutorials\":\"Video Tutorials\"},\"Title\":\"Meshy AI Tutorials \u0026 Guides {year} | Master 3D Generation\",\"VideoMetaDescription\":\"Watch our official Meshy AI video tutorials and video walkthroughs. See exactly how to transform text and images into stunning 3D assets in real-time.\",\"VideoMetaTitle\":\"Meshy AI Video Tutorials \u0026 Walkthroughs {year} | Watch \u0026 Learn 3D AI\",\"Videos\":{\"Badge\":\"Videos\"}},\"UseCase\":{\"3DAnimation\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Generate a character from a \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompt\u003c/textTo3d\u003e or concept image — or upload your own model — then rig and \u003canimation\u003eanimate it\u003c/animation\u003e, all in the browser. AI Prompt Helper suggests style and pose keywords (like T-pose) to include in your prompt.\",\"Question\":\"How do I create an animated 3D character with Meshy?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Skip manual bone setup, IK, and weight painting entirely — simply select whether your character is humanoid or quadruped, and Meshy's \u003cautoRigging\u003eAuto-Rig\u003c/autoRigging\u003e assigns a full skeleton in the browser automatically, with no joint marking required.\",\"Question\":\"Can Meshy auto-rig my character without manual weight painting?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Choose from a \u003canimation\u003ebuilt-in motion library\u003c/animation\u003e — walk cycles, idle poses, combat actions, and more — applied to humanoid or quadruped characters in a few clicks, with no external animation software. Free accounts include 20 presets; paid plans unlock 500+ (humanoids have the widest selection).\",\"Question\":\"What 3D animation presets can I apply to my model?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Download animated FBX or GLB files with models and animations intact — ready for \u003cunity\u003eUnity\u003c/unity\u003e, \u003cunreal\u003eUnreal\u003c/unreal\u003e, Blender, and Godot, with no manual export or conversion. On Pro and above, you can also push directly via the Meshy DCC bridge.\",\"Question\":\"Can I export animations to Unity, Unreal, Blender, or Godot?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Upload your model and apply motions from Meshy's animation library — 20 on the free plan, 500+ on paid — to bring existing assets to life.\",\"Question\":\"Can I animate a model I made with another tool?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (use and sell with attribution, and they're public); the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant full private ownership with no attribution — ship your animated characters in any game or project.\",\"Question\":\"Do I own the animated models, and can I use them commercially?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy streamlines your 3D animation workflow—generate high-quality characters, rig and animate humanoid or quadruped models in minutes. Whether for game dev, film, or motion prototyping, Meshy’s AI-powered tools and built-in animation library make the process fast, powerful, and intuitive.\",\"Tag\":\"3D ANIMATION\",\"Title\":\"Effortless 3D Animation for Every Creator\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Skip manual bone setup and complex IK—instantly rig both humanoid and quadruped characters with a simple drag-and-drop workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Rig Humanoids \u0026 Quadrupeds in a Few Clicks\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Bring your characters to life using Meshy’s 500+ built-in motion presets—walk, run, attack—without external 3D animation software.\",\"Title\":\"Extensive Character Animation Library\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Export animated FBX or GLB files ready for Unity, Unreal, Blender, or Godot—with models and animations intact, no manual export or conversion hassles.\",\"Title\":\"Seamless Integration into Your 3D Animation Pipeline\"},\"Title\":\"3D Animation made easy with Meshy's AI 3D Generators \u0026 Animations\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy supports Humanoids \u0026 Quadrupeds character rigging \u0026 animations, no matter if the model is uploaded by you or generated by Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Streamlined Character Animation Workflow\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Rig characters simply by marking key joints like the shoulder, ankle, and waist—no complex weight painting required.\",\"Title\":\"Easy Rigging for Humanoids \u0026 Quadrupeds\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's Extensive Animation Library offers a robust collection of 500+ animation presets—including walk cycles, idle poses, and combat actions—that can be seamlessly applied to common humanoid or quadruped characters, whether generated within Meshy or imported from other sources.\",\"Title\":\"Extensive Motion Library\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Generate characters for animation using simple text prompts or concept art images.\",\"Title\":\"Text or Image‑Driven 3D Model Creation\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Generate studio-quality PBR textures instantly from text or image inputs, delivering ready-to-use, realistic materials for your animation pipeline without manual UV or shader setup.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR Texture Support\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI prompt assistance optimizes your text prompts, and helps you define character styles (realistic, cartoon, sculpture, or voxel) and poses (A-pose, T-pose, and more), perfect for subsequent rigging and animating processes.\",\"Title\":\"AI Prompt Assistance for Optimal Model Generation\"},\"Feature7\":{\"Description\":\"Download animated FBX or GLB files compatible with Unity, Unreal, Blender, Godot—no conversion headaches.\",\"Title\":\"Engine‑Ready Export Formats\"},\"Feature8\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's paid plans empower you to run multiple generation tasks simultaneously—ranging from 10 tasks on the Pro plan to over 50 on the Enterprise tier. This capability enables rapid mass production of 3D assets, textures, and animations.\",\"Title\":\"Accelerate Asset Production with Concurrent Generation\"},\"Feature9\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's enterprise offerings are crafted to support game development studios with robust security, streamlined collaboration, and efficient asset management. Features include SAML Single Sign-On (SSO) for secure and centralized user authentication, multiple team and workspace management for organized project coordination, and access to the Community Model API for leveraging a vast library of community-generated assets.\",\"Title\":\"Enterprise-Grade Collaboration \u0026 Control for Game Studios\"},\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Features for 3D Animation\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Top-notch AI 3D animation tool. Generate, rig, and animate humanoid and quadruped characters in a few clicks. Access 500+ motions in Meshy's extensive animation library. Fast generation, easy rigging, compatible exports to 3D animation software.\",\"Title\":\"3D Animation - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"3DAvatar\":{\"Engines\":{\"Blender\":{\"Title\":\"Blender\"},\"Godot\":{\"Title\":\"Godot\"},\"IntegrationAvailable\":\"Integration available\",\"Maya\":{\"Title\":\"Maya\"},\"Omniverse\":{\"Title\":\"Omniverse\"},\"OneClickBridge\":\"One-click DCC Bridge delivery\",\"Roblox\":{\"Title\":\"Roblox\"},\"ThreeDSMax\":{\"Title\":\"3ds Max\"},\"Title\":\"Works With Every Game Engine \u0026 3D Tool\",\"Unity\":{\"Title\":\"Unity\"},\"Unreal\":{\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine\"},\"ZBrush\":{\"Title\":\"ZBrush\"}},\"Explore\":{\"Card1\":{\"LinkText\":\"Learn More\"}},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"CharacterRigging\":\"Character Rigging\",\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Type a description like \\\"cyberpunk street samurai\\\" or upload a reference image, and Meshy generates a fully textured 3D avatar in minutes — matching your reference in look and proportions. From there, you can auto-rig, animate, and export it. No modeling experience needed.\",\"Question\":\"How do I create a 3D avatar from a photo or text?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Both. Guide the look with your prompt or reference image — from realistic characters to stylized and anime-style avatars — and Meshy matches that direction in the generated model.\",\"Question\":\"Can I create realistic or stylized/anime avatars?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Once your avatar is generated, Meshy's auto-rigging builds a humanoid skeleton with no manual bone work, and you can pick from 600+ animation presets, all exported with full skeleton data for your engine's animation system.\",\"Question\":\"Are the avatars rigged and animated?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, and 3MF. FBX and GLB are the most common for avatars — natively supported by Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, and Roblox Studio, and used in the VRChat SDK pipeline.\",\"Question\":\"What file formats can I export for avatars?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — Meshy generates and auto-rigs a humanoid avatar and exports it as FBX or GLB. To publish it in VRChat, bring the rigged model into Unity and upload it with the VRChat SDK, the standard workflow for custom avatars. See our \u003cvrchatModels\u003eVRChat 3D models guide\u003c/vrchatModels\u003e for more.\",\"Question\":\"Can I make a VRChat avatar with Meshy?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Send your model to Roblox Studio with Meshy's DCC Bridge, or export it as FBX or GLB. For the best import compatibility, prompt for a standard T-pose reference. For a full walkthrough see our \u003crobloxAvatar\u003eRoblox avatar\u003c/robloxAvatar\u003e and \u003croblox3dModel\u003eRoblox 3D model\u003c/roblox3dModel\u003e guides.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy avatars in Roblox?\"},\"Q7\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Free-tier assets are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution to Meshy). Paid plans include full commercial ownership with no attribution required. See \u003cpricing\u003ePricing\u003c/pricing\u003e for details.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use the avatars commercially?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Formats\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert Now\",\"Connector\":\"to\",\"Subtitle\":\"Every export is engine-optimized — no extra conversion steps.\",\"Title\":\"Export Your 3D Avatar in Any Format\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Start Creating Your 3D Avatars\",\"Description\":\"Turn a text prompt or a reference image into a fully textured, rigged 3D avatar in minutes. Auto-rig humanoid characters, animate them with hundreds of motion presets, and export FBX or GLB for VRChat, Roblox, and every major game engine — no modeling or rigging skills required.\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"See How It Works\",\"Tag\":\"3D AVATAR\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Avatars for VRChat, Roblox \u0026 Games 2026\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Enter a text prompt like \\\"stylized female knight in silver armor\\\" or upload reference art. Meshy's AI returns a fully textured 3D avatar in under 2 minutes — matching your reference in look and proportions. No modeling skills or software required.\",\"Title\":\"Generate Your Avatar from Text or an Image\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Automatically generate studio-grade diffuse, normal, metallic, and roughness maps. No UV unwrapping, no manual shader work — a production-ready, textured avatar instantly.\",\"Title\":\"Apply PBR Textures in One Click\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Use Meshy's built-in auto-rigging for humanoid characters — no manual bone setup. Pick from 600+ animation presets — idles, walk cycles, waves, emotes, and combat — and export them with full skeleton data.\",\"Title\":\"Auto-Rig and Animate\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Download in FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, or 3MF — or use Meshy's DCC Bridge to send your avatar in one click to Unity, Unreal, Blender, Godot, Roblox, Maya, 3ds Max, or ZBrush. For VRChat, take a rigged FBX/GLB into the VRChat SDK to publish your avatar.\",\"Title\":\"Export or Send to VRChat, Roblox, and Game Engines\"},\"Title\":\"How to Create a 3D Avatar with Meshy\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Create free 3D avatars from text or images — full-body characters with PBR textures, auto-rigging, and FBX/GLB export for VRChat, Roblox, Unity \u0026 Unreal.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Avatar Creator for VRChat, Roblox \u0026 Games | Meshy AI\"},\"Platforms\":{\"Engines\":{\"Body\":\"Drop rigged avatars straight into \u003cunity\u003eUnity\u003c/unity\u003e, \u003cunreal\u003eUnreal Engine\u003c/unreal\u003e, or \u003cblender\u003eBlender\u003c/blender\u003e with one-click plugins, PBR materials intact, and drive them with each engine's animation system. Browse all \u003cintegrations\u003eintegrations\u003c/integrations\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"For Game Engines\"},\"Roblox\":{\"Body\":\"Send your avatar to \u003crobloxStudio\u003eRoblox Studio\u003c/robloxStudio\u003e with Meshy's DCC Bridge, or export FBX/GLB. For the smoothest import, prompt for a standard T-pose. Explore \u003crobloxAvatar\u003eRoblox avatar\u003c/robloxAvatar\u003e and \u003croblox3dModel\u003eRoblox 3D model\u003c/roblox3dModel\u003e workflows, or our \u003crobloxUseCase\u003eRoblox game-dev use case\u003c/robloxUseCase\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"For Roblox\"},\"Title\":\"3D Avatars for VRChat, Roblox \u0026 Game Engines\",\"VRChat\":{\"Body\":\"Generate a humanoid avatar, let Meshy \u003cautoRig\u003eauto-rig\u003c/autoRig\u003e it, and export a rigged FBX or GLB. Bring it into \u003cunity\u003eUnity\u003c/unity\u003e with the VRChat SDK to set up and upload your custom avatar. See \u003cvrchatModels\u003ehow creators source VRChat 3D models with Meshy\u003c/vrchatModels\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"For VRChat\"}},\"Showcase\":{\"Title\":\"3D Avatars Made With Meshy AI\"},\"Specs\":{\"API\":{\"Body\":\"Automate avatar generation and pull models into your own pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"API Integration\"},\"Animation\":{\"Body\":\"600+ animation presets, exported with full skeleton data.\",\"Title\":\"AI Animation\"},\"ExportFormats\":{\"Body\":\"FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, and 3MF, optimized for direct import.\",\"Title\":\"Engine-Ready Export Formats\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"COMPLETE TOOLKIT\",\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Turn concept art, a sketch, or a reference photo into a 3D avatar that matches its look and proportions.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"License\":{\"Body\":\"Free-tier assets under CC BY 4.0; paid plans include full commercial ownership.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial Licensing\"},\"PBR\":{\"Body\":\"One-click diffuse, normal, metallic, and roughness maps, compatible with every major engine.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing with Full PBR\"},\"Rigging\":{\"Body\":\"Automatic humanoid bone hierarchy and skin weights, no manual setup.\",\"Title\":\"Auto Rigging\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From prompt to rigged, animated, engine-ready avatar — Meshy covers the full pipeline.\",\"TextTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Describe any character in plain language and get a textured 3D avatar in minutes.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"Everything You Need to Build 3D Avatars\"},\"Types\":{\"Card1\":{\"Alt\":\"Realistic 3D avatar with studio-grade PBR material detail\",\"Description\":\"Generate \u003clifelike\u003elifelike characters\u003c/lifelike\u003e with studio-grade PBR detail — ideal for games, cinematics, and immersive metaverse worlds.\",\"Title\":\"Realistic 3D Avatars\"},\"Card2\":{\"Alt\":\"Anime and stylized 3D avatar characters generated by Meshy\",\"Description\":\"Prompt for \u003canime\u003eanime, cartoon, or stylized looks\u003c/anime\u003e and Meshy matches the art direction you describe — a range \u003cblog\u003ecreators already put to work\u003c/blog\u003e across games and social worlds.\",\"Title\":\"Anime \u0026 Stylized Avatars\"},\"Card3\":{\"Alt\":\"Full-body rigged humanoid game character in T-pose\",\"Description\":\"Prompt for a full-body character and Meshy delivers a rigged humanoid — ready to animate and drop straight into Unity, Unreal, or Roblox.\",\"Title\":\"Full-Body Game Characters\"},\"Title\":\"Types of 3D Avatars You Can Make\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Alt\":\"Screenshot of Meshy text-to-3D and image-to-3D interface generating a stylized 3D avatar character\",\"Chip1\":\"Text-to-3D\",\"Chip2\":\"Image-to-3D\",\"Description\":\"Describe your character in plain language or upload concept art, a sketch, or a reference photo. Meshy builds a fully textured 3D avatar that matches your reference in look and proportions — realistic or stylized, no modeling expertise needed.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"TEXT \u0026 IMAGE TO 3D\",\"Title\":\"Text \u0026 Image to 3D Avatars\"},\"Card2\":{\"Alt\":\"Screenshot of Meshy auto-rigging and animation presets applied to a humanoid 3D avatar character\",\"Chip1\":\"Auto-Rigging\",\"Chip2\":\"600+ Animations\",\"Description\":\"Auto-rig humanoid characters without touching a single bone, then pick from 600+ animation presets — idles, walks, emotes, and combat — exported with full skeleton data and ready to drop into your scene or game.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"RIGGING \u0026 ANIMATION\",\"Title\":\"Built-In Rigging \u0026 Animation Library\"},\"Card3\":{\"Alt\":\"Screenshot of Meshy export panel showing FBX and GLB export options and DCC Bridge one-click send to game engines\",\"Chip1\":\"FBX\",\"Chip2\":\"GLB\",\"Description\":\"Every avatar exports in engine-ready FBX, GLB, and more with PBR materials intact — or use Meshy's DCC Bridge to send it in one click to Unity, Unreal, Blender, Godot, Roblox, Maya, or ZBrush.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"EXPORT \u0026 DCC BRIDGE\",\"Title\":\"Export or One-Click Send to Any Platform\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Text-to-3D, auto-rigging, and engine-ready export — everything you need to ship 3D avatars fast.\",\"Title\":\"Why Creators Choose Meshy for 3D Avatars\"}},\"3DModels\":{\"Explores\":{\"Blog\":{\"LinkText\":\"Explore Meshy blog posts\",\"Title\":\"Explore Professional Tips \u0026 Ideas\"},\"CreativePotential\":{\"LinkText\":\"Shimmy's Journey: Unleashing Creative Potential with Meshy's AI-Powered 3D Modeling\",\"Title\":\"Featured Creator Spotlight\"},\"Tutorials\":{\"LinkText\":\"Explore Meshy tutorials\",\"Title\":\"Boost Your 3D Pipeline with Expert Tutorials\"},\"UserStories\":{\"LinkText\":\"More User Stories\",\"Title\":\"Discover What Our Users Are Building\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"You can generate and download free 3D models directly on Meshy — no modeling skills required. Sign up, then describe your idea in a text prompt or upload a reference image, and Meshy's \u003ctextTo3d\u003eText to 3D\u003c/textTo3d\u003e and \u003cimageTo3d\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e turn it into a fully textured model in about a minute. Every account gets 100 free credits each month to start creating right away.\",\"Question\":\"How do I get free 3D models with Meshy?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Free models are generated fully textured with PBR maps (albedo, normal, roughness, metallic) and clean topology, so they drop into game engines, renders, or slicers with minimal cleanup — lightweight enough for real-time engines and detailed enough for renders and prints.\",\"Question\":\"Are Meshy's free 3D models good enough for real projects like games or 3D printing?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. With \u003caiTexturing\u003eAI Texturing\u003c/aiTexturing\u003e you can apply brand-new textures to a plain model — or your own uploaded model — from a simple text prompt, and Meshy generates full PBR maps without manual UV unwrapping. You can also convert between formats with the free \u003cfileConverter\u003e3D File Converter\u003c/fileConverter\u003e before editing in your DCC tool.\",\"Question\":\"Can I edit or re-texture the free models I generate?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"You can export in GLB, FBX, OBJ, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF, and .DXF — compatible with major game engines, animation and DCC tools, AR/VR platforms, and 3D printing software. Working in Blender? The native \u003cblender\u003eBlender plugin\u003c/blender\u003e imports your generated models directly, no manual file handling needed.\",\"Question\":\"What file formats can I download free 3D models in?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Every Meshy account includes 100 free credits each month, enough to generate around 10 assets per month. On the Free plan you can download 10 models made with Meshy 5; downloading Meshy 6 models requires a paid plan, private licensed models you generate while subscribed stay downloadable even if you later return to Free. For higher volume, see the paid plans on the \u003cpricing\u003epricing page\u003c/pricing\u003e — otherwise the free tier renews monthly.\",\"Question\":\"How many 3D models can I create and download for free?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Assets generated on the free plan are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0) — you can use, modify, and even sell them commercially, as long as you credit the creator and Meshy (for sales, add the credit in your product page description); note that free-plan models are public. If you need private, confidential ownership with no attribution, the Pro plan and above grant a Private License, so your models stay fully yours. See the \u003cpricing\u003epricing page\u003c/pricing\u003e for details.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use free 3D models commercially?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy brings the power of AI to your creative workflow, allowing anyone to generate, texture, and export production-ready free 3D models instantly.\",\"Tag\":\"3D MODELS\",\"Title\":\"Pro-Level Free 3D Models Built by AI, Free to Use\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Turn simple text prompts or reference images into polished 3D models in seconds, with no 3D modeling experience required.\",\"Title\":\"Effortless Creativity\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Sign up to start generating and downloading AI 3D models immediately. All is for free!\",\"Title\":\"Lightning-Fast 3D Generation\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy assets supports multiple export formats, which are compatible with major 3D software, game engines, web/AR apps, and 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"Compatible with Any Workflow\"},\"Title\":\"Fast. Easy. Ready for Your Workflow\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Part1\":{\"Feature1\":\"Seamlessly integrate Meshy into your workflow with export-ready assets in GLB, FBX, OBJ, USDZ, .BLEND, and more.\",\"Feature2\":\"Compatible with major game engines, animation tools, AR/VR platforms, 3D printing software, and DCC tools.\",\"Title\":\"Broad Format Support for Diverse Applications\"},\"Part2\":{\"Feature1\":\"Instantly apply new textures to white models using simple text prompts with text-to-texture.\",\"Feature2\":\"Generate full PBR maps (normal, metallic, roughness, AO) without manual UV unwrapping.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR Map Generation\"},\"Part3\":{\"Feature1\":\"Meshy's built-in AI Prompt Helper turns simple ideas into detailed, style-rich prompts that guide the AI to generate the models you envision.\",\"Feature2\":\"Jump start your 3D creations with Meshy’s example prompt suggestion, offering curated prompt suggestions for instant inspiration.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Prompt Assistance for Generating Models You Envision\"},\"Part4\":{\"Feature1\":\"Browse and download a wide range of free 3D models from the Meshy community for inspiration or direct use.\",\"Feature2\":\"Free plan models are CC BY 4.0 licensed: use, remix, and share them commercially with proper attribution to Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Community Models \u0026 Flexible Licensing for Every Creator\"},\"Title\":\"Why Meshy is the #1 AI for 3D Models: Explore More Key Features\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy offers FREE access to AI 3D model generator and downloads. Turn text or image prompts into 3D models online. Fast, easy, production-ready.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Models - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"},\"Models\":{\"Title\":\"See Meshy in the Works\"}},\"3DPrinterFiles\":{\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"Make Models for 3D Printing with Meshy: A Step-by-Step Guide\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — no CAD skills needed. Describe your object in a \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompt\u003c/textTo3d\u003e or \u003cimageTo3d\u003eupload an image\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e, and Meshy generates a 3D model in about a minute. It handles mesh generation and detailing, so hobbyists and 3D-printing businesses alike can go from idea to print fast.\",\"Question\":\"Can I create 3D printable models with AI if I don't know CAD?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy outputs clean, high-quality meshes — with the right prompt you get a smooth, printable base, and in most cases a quick touch-up and slicing in your software is all that's needed. For cleaner geometry, the Remesh tool can adjust topology and polycount. You can also tune styles from realistic to sculpture or voxel for figurines and display pieces.\",\"Question\":\"Are Meshy's models actually ready to 3D print?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Rescale assets — phone holders, figurines, and more — before export, and the mesh stays optimized and production-ready, so you can match exact print dimensions without remodeling.\",\"Question\":\"Can I resize or optimize a model before printing?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export in STL, 3MF, and OBJ — the standard 3D-printing formats, compatible with any slicer (PrusaSlicer included). Meshy can also send models directly to integrated slicers — Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, Ultimaker Cura, Elegoo Slicer, and Lychee Slicer.\",\"Question\":\"What file formats can I export, and which slicers work?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — every account gets 100 free credits each month to generate printable models, and models made with Meshy 5 are downloadable on the Free plan (downloading Meshy 6 models requires a paid plan). For higher print volume, \u003cpricing\u003epaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e add capacity.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy free for 3D printing projects?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Models created on the free plan are licensed under CC BY 4.0 — use, remix, and sell your prints commercially as long as you credit the creator and Meshy; free-plan models are public. The \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant a Private License with full private ownership and no attribution.\",\"Question\":\"Can I sell the 3D prints I make with Meshy?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy turns your ideas into optimized 3D models for 3D Printing, from just text or images. It is made for hobbyists, small businesses, educators, and people alike.\",\"Tag\":\"3D PRINTING\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered 3D Printing Made Simple\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s AI takes care of the heavy lifting: mesh generation, texture application, and fine detailing. You can focus on ideas, not technical hurdles.\",\"Title\":\"Effortless Creativity\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Easily export optimized models in STL, 3MF, or OBJ formats, fully compatible with all major 3D printing softwares.\",\"Title\":\"Compatible Exports\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"No CAD skills? No problem. Meshy’s intuitive interface makes 3D printing accessible to beginners and hobbyists alike.\",\"Title\":\"Beginner-Friendly\"},\"Title\":\"Why Makers Choose Meshy for 3D Printing\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Part1\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Create models for 3D printing prototypes, figurines, toys, and more in seconds - just by entering a prompt or uploading an image. Meshy accelerates 3D printing pipeline and unlocks ideas that were once out of reach.\",\"Title\":\"Fast 3D Prototyping via Text or Image input:\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Perfect for hobbyists or 3D printing businesses alike. Intuitive web interface allows any beginner to jump start and generate a high-quality model with minimal learning curves.\",\"Title\":\"Beginner-to-business ready\"},\"Title\":\"AI-Driven 3D Models Print-Ready In Seconds\"},\"Part2\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Easily export your AI-generated models as STL, OBJ, 3MF, and other major formats, fully compatible with leading 3D printing software like Cura and PrusaSlicer.\",\"Title\":\"Universal format support\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Resize 3D assets like phone holders or figurines before you export the model. The mesh remains optimized and ready for production.\",\"Title\":\"Scale and rescale with confidence\"},\"Title\":\"Compatible Exports for Every Printer \u0026 Pipeline\"},\"Part3\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy generates clean, high-quality 3D models right out of the box. With the right prompt, you can produce a smooth base for easy printing. At most, a quick touch-up and slicing in your preferred software is all that’s needed before you hit print.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized models for 3D printing projects\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"From realistic to cartoon, sculpture to voxel, Meshy helps you fine-tune art styles, poses, and details to match your vision. This is ideal for display pieces, educational tools, and decorative prints.\",\"Title\":\"Versatile styles for any project\"},\"Title\":\"Industry-Standard Quality and Aesthetics\"},\"Part4\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Explore and download a vast array of 3D models shared by the Meshy community, perfect for inspiration or direct use in your projects. If you wish to share your own creations, publish them to the community to showcase your result, receive feedback, or enable others to remix or print them.\",\"Title\":\"Access a World of 3D Creations\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Models created under the free plan are licensed under CC BY 4.0, allowing you to use, share, and remix them for any purpose, including commercial use, provided you attribute the original creator and Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Commercialize with Meshy Assets for Free\"},\"Title\":\"Community Models \u0026 Flexible Licensing for Every Creator\"},\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Features for 3D Printing\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Bring your 3D printing ideas to life in seconds. Meshy transforms text and images into clean, ready-to-print models. No modeling skills are required. Download in STL, OBJ, and more. Powered by the leading AI 3D generator.\",\"Title\":\"Printable 3D Models - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"},\"Models\":{\"Title\":\"See How Meshy Works\"}},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"ECommerce\":\"E-commerce\",\"Education\":\"Education\",\"FilmProduction\":\"Film Production\",\"FreeModels\":\"Free 3D Models\",\"GameDevelopment\":\"Game Development\",\"Godot\":\"Godot\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"InteriorDesign\":\"Interior Design\",\"ProductDesign\":\"Product Design\",\"Roblox\":\"AI 3D Tools for Roblox\",\"ThreeDAnimation\":\"3D Animation\",\"ThreeDAvatar\":\"3D Avatar\",\"ThreeDPrinting\":\"3D Printing\",\"ToyDesign\":\"Toy Design\",\"UseCases\":\"Use Cases\",\"VFX\":\"VFX\",\"VRAR\":\"VR/AR\"},\"CharacterRigging\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"Current\":\"Character Rigging\",\"GameDevelopment\":\"Game Development\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"UseCases\":\"Use Cases\"},\"Explore\":{\"LinkText\":\"Explore\"},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy supports a wide range of character types: humanoid characters (heroes, NPCs, stylized avatars), quadrupeds (wolves, horses, dogs), fantasy creatures (dragons, centaurs, monsters), mechanical rigs (robots, mech suits), and fully custom skeletons. The AI automatically detects the skeleton type from your mesh — no manual selection required, even for a model you just generated with \u003clink\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/link\u003e. For the full creation workflow, follow our \u003cguide\u003eImage to 3D guide\u003c/guide\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"What types of 3D characters can Meshy rig?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"No experience needed. Meshy's AI handles \u003clink\u003ethe entire rigging process\u003c/link\u003e — bone placement, hierarchy building, and skinning weight calculation — automatically. If you want to fine-tune the result, optional manual tools are available inside the editor. New to 3D modeling? Start with our \u003cguide\u003estep-by-step Text to 3D guide\u003c/guide\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"Do I need rigging experience to use Meshy?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy generates skeleton naming that matches Mixamo's bone conventions. Once exported, you can upload your rigged character directly to Mixamo and apply any motion clip from their library. New to the workflow? Learn \u003clink\u003ewhat rigging in animation is\u003c/link\u003e first.\",\"Question\":\"Is the rigged output compatible with Mixamo animations?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Auto-rigging typically completes in under 30 seconds. Processing time varies depending on polygon count, mesh complexity, and server load — a high-poly character (100k+ triangles) may take up to 3–5 minutes. The complete workflow of upload, analysis, rigging, and export takes under 5 minutes.\",\"Question\":\"How long does AI rigging take?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. After the AI generates the rig, you can use Meshy's built-in editor to adjust bone positions, rename and re-parent joints, and repaint skin weights manually. You can also export the rig and continue refining in \u003clink\u003eBlender\u003c/link\u003e, Maya, or any DCC tool of your choice.\",\"Question\":\"Can I edit the bones or skin weights after AI rigging?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy offers a free tier that includes a set number of rigging credits per month — no credit card required to start. Paid plans unlock higher polygon limits, faster processing, batch rigging, and priority queue access. See the \u003clink\u003ePricing page\u003c/link\u003e for current plan details.\",\"Question\":\"Is character rigging free?\"},\"Q7\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Characters you rig with Meshy are yours to use — ship them in \u003clink\u003ecommercial games\u003c/link\u003e on Steam, the App Store, Google Play, console platforms, or any other distribution channel. Free-tier and paid-plan outputs both carry commercial-use rights.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy-rigged characters commercially in shipped games?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Formats\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert now\",\"Connector\":\"to\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Export Anywhere\",\"FBX\":{\"Body\":\"Best for Unity, Unreal Engine, Maya, and 3ds Max. The industry standard — preserves skeleton, skinning weights, and animation clips in a single file.\",\"Title\":\"FBX\"},\"GLB\":{\"Body\":\"Best for the web (Three.js, Babylon.js) and real-time apps. A compact binary format with embedded textures, recommended for WebGL and browser-based 3D.\",\"Title\":\"GLB / GLTF\"},\"OBJ\":{\"Body\":\"Best for static mesh export and cross-platform use. Geometry only — no skeleton data. Use it when you need the base mesh without a rig.\",\"Title\":\"OBJ\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Need a different file type for your engine or DCC pipeline? Convert your rigged Meshy models between popular 3D formats right in your browser — free, fast, and with no upload limits.\",\"Title\":\"Export in Any Format for Character Rigging\",\"USDZ\":{\"Body\":\"Best for Apple AR (Reality Composer, RealityKit). Optimized for iOS/macOS AR workflows and Apple Vision Pro.\",\"Title\":\"USDZ\"}},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Rig Your Character\",\"Description\":\"Upload your model — Meshy's AI character rigging for game development auto-generates a full skeleton, skinning weights, and blend shapes in seconds. No manual rigging. No experience needed. Animation-ready output, optimized for Unity, Unreal, and any modern game engine.\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"See How It Works\",\"Tag\":\"AI CHARACTER RIGGING\",\"Title\":\"AI Character Rigging for Game-Ready 3D Models\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a model in Meshy, or import your own — we support FBX, OBJ, GLB/GLTF, and USDZ. AI animation with auto-rigging is available for models generated in Meshy; no skeleton setup or mesh cleanup required.\",\"Label\":\"Step 1\",\"Title\":\"Bring Your 3D Character to Life\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy automatically identifies whether your character is humanoid, quadruped, or a custom creature. A real-time bone preview lets you confirm the detection before proceeding.\",\"Label\":\"Step 2\",\"Title\":\"AI Detects Your Skeleton Type\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"With one click, Meshy builds a complete bone hierarchy, calculates smooth skinning weights, and generates blend shapes for facial animation — all without a single brush stroke.\",\"Label\":\"Step 3\",\"Title\":\"Auto-Generate Bones \u0026 Weights\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Download your rigged character as FBX, GLB, or USDZ. Import directly into Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, or Maya and apply any animation immediately.\",\"Label\":\"Step 4\",\"Title\":\"Export \u0026 Animate\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From raw mesh to animation-ready character — in under 2 minutes.\",\"Title\":\"How to Rig a Game Character with Meshy\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Upload your model and Meshy's AI auto-generates a full skeleton, skinning weights, and blend shapes in seconds. Animation-ready character rigging for Unity, Unreal, and any game engine.\",\"Title\":\"AI Character Rigging for Game-Ready 3D Models | Meshy\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation Generator\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Complete Your Character Production Workflow\"},\"Schema\":{\"OfferDescription\":\"Free tier — sign up with no credit card required.\",\"SupplyAccount\":\"A Meshy account (free or paid)\",\"SupplyModel\":\"A 3D character model (FBX, OBJ, GLB/GLTF, or USDZ)\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Title\":\"See What Creators Are Building\"},\"Specs\":{\"AnimationPresets\":{\"Body\":\"600+ game-ready animation presets — walking, attacking, idle poses, and more — ready to apply to any rigged character.\",\"Title\":\"600+ Animation Presets\"},\"BlendShapes\":{\"Body\":\"Blend shape and morph-target support for expressive facial animation and lip sync.\",\"Title\":\"Blend Shapes \u0026 Morph Targets\"},\"BoneEditor\":{\"Body\":\"Reposition, rename, and re-parent joints in the built-in bone editor — fine-tune any rig without leaving Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Built-in Bone Editor\"},\"BoneHierarchy\":{\"Body\":\"Complete bone hierarchy generation — spine, limbs, fingers, and tail — built automatically from your mesh.\",\"Title\":\"Full Bone Hierarchy\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"Everything You Need\",\"Guide\":{\"Body\":\"Rig characters entirely in your browser. No software to download, no setup — start with a free account.\",\"CTA\":\"Rig Your Character\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Cloud-Based — No Install\"},\"Retargeting\":{\"Body\":\"Retarget animations across different character proportions and skeletons so one motion library fits your whole cast.\",\"Title\":\"Animation Retargeting\"},\"SkeletonDetect\":{\"Body\":\"Auto-detects humanoid, quadruped, and custom skeletons — for NPCs, enemies, bosses, and mounts.\",\"Title\":\"Multi-Skeleton Auto-Detect\"},\"SkinWeights\":{\"Body\":\"Automatic skinning weights with smooth joint deformation — no manual weight painting required.\",\"Title\":\"Automatic Skinning Weights\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Rigging, animation, and one-click export to every game engine and DCC tool — all in one platform.\",\"Title\":\"Complete Character Rigging \u0026 Animation Toolkit\"},\"Tools\":{\"Blender\":{\"Body\":\"Full Armature edit, NLA animation, render-ready. Bones import as a Blender Armature with vertex groups intact.\",\"Title\":\"Blender\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"Official Plugins\",\"Godot\":{\"Body\":\"Open-source engine with native FBX/GLB support via ufbx. Import rigged characters directly into Godot 4.3+.\",\"Title\":\"Godot\"},\"Max\":{\"Body\":\"Studio animation and rendering workflow. Full bone hierarchy and skinning weights preserved.\",\"Title\":\"3ds Max\"},\"Maya\":{\"Body\":\"HumanIK- and MotionBuilder-compatible studio workflow. Skeleton structure works with Maya's HumanIK solver.\",\"Title\":\"Maya\"},\"Mixamo\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy uses Mixamo-compatible bone naming. Upload your rigged character and apply any free motion clip directly — no plugin required.\",\"Title\":\"Mixamo — Format Compatible\"},\"Omniverse\":{\"Body\":\"NVIDIA's real-time 3D simulation platform with a USD-compatible pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"Omniverse\"},\"Roblox\":{\"Body\":\"Build and publish Roblox games with AI-generated characters via the Meshy Bridge app.\",\"Title\":\"Roblox Studio\"},\"Subtitle\":\"One-click export to every major game engine and DCC tool — via official Meshy plugins.\",\"Title\":\"Works With Every Tool in Your Workflow\",\"Unity\":{\"Body\":\"Drive characters with the Animator Controller and Humanoid motion clips. FBX or GLB; skeleton maps to Unity's Humanoid Avatar.\",\"Title\":\"Unity\"},\"Unreal\":{\"Body\":\"Use as a Skeletal Mesh, driven by Control Rig or Sequencer. Compatible with Unreal's retarget pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine\"}},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"Humanoid \u0026 Quadruped\",\"Chip2\":\"Custom Skeletons\",\"Description\":\"Most rigging tools lock you into humanoid characters. Meshy supports humanoid heroes, four-legged creatures, robotic rigs, and custom skeletons — all in one tool. The AI automatically detects your character type and applies the optimal skeleton template. No manual setup, no tool switching.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Every Character Type\",\"Title\":\"Support for Every Character Type\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"AI Skinning\",\"Chip2\":\"Natural Deformation\",\"Description\":\"Traditional rigging wastes days on skinning. Meshy's AI generates production-quality weights in seconds, eliminating elbow collapse, knee pinching, and finger distortion. Your joints deform naturally on the first try — fine-tune in the built-in editor or export and iterate in any DCC tool.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Zero Weight Painting\",\"Title\":\"Skip 2–8 Hours of Manual Weight Painting\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"Under 30 Seconds\",\"Chip2\":\"Scale Production\",\"Description\":\"Meshy completes auto-rigging in under 30 seconds, and the entire workflow — upload, analysis, bone generation, weight calculation — finishes in under 5 minutes, replacing 1–3 days of technical-artist work. Indie teams rig 50+ characters in an afternoon; AAA studios use it for rapid iteration.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Minutes, Not Days\",\"Title\":\"Production-Ready Output in Minutes, Not Days\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Every character type, production-quality weights, and a full rig in minutes — not days.\",\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy Over Manual Rigging \u0026 Other Tools\"}},\"ECommerce\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Generate refined 3D models in minutes from \u003ctextTo3d\u003eprompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e or images — ideal for prototyping physical products or preparing digital downloads to sell.\",\"Question\":\"How quickly can I create 3D products to sell?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Export AR-ready USDZ/GLB models to power \u003conlineViewer\u003einteractive 3D previews\u003c/onlineViewer\u003e in your online store — boosting engagement and buyer trust.\",\"Question\":\"Can I show products in AR on my store?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. The Remesh tool lets you clean up topology and optimize meshes for reliable print-on-demand results and positive customer feedback.\",\"Question\":\"Will the 3D models print reliably for physical products?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export in \u003cfileConverter\u003eseven formats\u003c/fileConverter\u003e — FBX, OBJ, STL, GLB, USDZ, BLEND, and 3MF — compatible with Etsy, MyMiniFactory, Cults, CGTrader, TurboSquid, Sketchfab, and other 3D marketplaces, whether you're selling physical prints or digital downloads.\",\"Question\":\"What file formats and 3D marketplaces (Etsy, CGTrader) are supported?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes — generate multiple assets efficiently with Batch mode (up to 10 images) or parallel tasks via the \u003capi\u003eMeshy API\u003c/api\u003e on paid plans, to build themed bundles and asset packs for selling collectible sets at scale.\",\"Question\":\"Can I produce product bundles or asset packs?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (sell with attribution, and public); the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant a Private License with full private ownership — sell digital or physical products with confidence.\",\"Question\":\"Can I sell AI-generated 3D models and keep them mine?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy empowers e‑commerce sellers to generate high-quality 3D models—from 3d printing ideas to sell to polished digital downloads—using only text or image prompts. Whether you’re launching a 3d printed toy line or offering digital asset packs, Meshy helps you publish to platforms like Etsy, MyMiniFactory, CGTrader, or your own virtual storefront with ease, supporting next‑level visual commerce and ai e commerce flows.\",\"Tag\":\"E-COMMERCE\",\"Title\":\"Launch 3D Products \u0026 Digital Assets Instantly\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate refined 3D models in minutes—ideal for prototyping 3d printing ideas or preparing digital downloads to sell.\",\"Title\":\"Fast Prototype-to-Sale Workflow\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Deliver immersive 3D previews and AR integrations—boosting engagement and trust as part of your visual commerce strategy.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized for Visual Commerce\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy fits into pipelines with clean topology and optimized formats, minimizing artist cleanup and boosting compositing efficiency.\",\"Title\":\"Efficient, High-Quality VFX Pipeline\"},\"Title\":\"Transform Ideas into Revenue‑Ready 3D Products\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate high-quality 3D models directly from prompts, ideal for toys, accessories, or collectible figurines.\",\"Title\":\"Instant Market-Ready Models\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Remesh, heal, and optimize texture—ensuring reliable outputs and positive customer feedback.\",\"Title\":\"Remesh \u0026 Heal for Print Success\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Export STL/OBJ/GLB formats tailored for Etsy, MyMiniFactory, Cults, CGTrader, TurboSquid, Sketchfab—whether physical or digital download models.\",\"Title\":\"Exportable for Multiple Platforms\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Produce themed toy bundles or asset packs—great for selling collectible design sets and digital product bundles.\",\"Title\":\"Batch Generation for Asset Catalogs\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Create interactive 3D previews and AR-integrated content—bringing your virtual storefront to life with visual commerce and ai in visual merchandising benefits.\",\"Title\":\"Visual Commerce Ready\"},\"Title\":\"Built for 3D Sellers \u0026 Digital Creators\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy transforms text, sketches, or photos into production ready 3D models—ideal for e-commerce markets and custom storefronts. Generate 3D printed products and digital downloadable 3D assets for sale - in one click.\",\"Title\":\"E-commerce - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"Education\":{\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"Enhancing Virtual Reality Education: Jeremy's Innovative Use of AI at Stanford\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Students can turn text prompts, hand-drawn sketches, or photos into interactive 3D models in about a minute — no CAD or modeling background needed. \u003cimageTo3d\u003eImage to 3D\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e makes it easy to bring classroom concepts to life.\",\"Question\":\"How can students create 3D models without modeling experience?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy generates low-poly, real-time-friendly models that run well on classroom devices for VR/AR, game, and app projects, with full PBR textures. AR/VR browser viewing works anytime, anywhere.\",\"Question\":\"Are the 3D models suitable for classroom VR/AR and game projects?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"If a generated model isn't quite right, the simplest fix is to regenerate with a clearer prompt or turn on Multi-view for cleaner geometry — no manual repair or 3D expertise needed. (On paid plans, the Remesh tool can further clean up topology and polycount.)\",\"Question\":\"What if a student's 3D model has errors?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Try to click DCC bridge (Pro and above) or just download it as FBX, OBJ, or GLB and import directly into \u003cunity\u003eUnity\u003c/unity\u003e, \u003croblox\u003eRoblox\u003c/roblox\u003e, Unreal, or any 3D software — a natural fit for game-development and XR courses.\",\"Question\":\"Which tools can I import the 3D models into — Unity, Roblox, Unreal?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Every account includes 100 free credits each month — enough to generate around 10 assets — so students can create at no cost and download Meshy 5 models for free (downloading Meshy 6 models requires a paid plan). Meshy removes the financial barrier to high-quality 3D for class projects, and higher-volume needs are covered by affordable \u003cpricing\u003epaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"Is Meshy free for students and teachers?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 — use, share, and remix them in class projects, student games, or educational apps, with credit to the creator and Meshy; free-plan models are public. For fully private ownership (e.g., a commercial edtech app), the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant a Private License.\",\"Question\":\"Can we use the models in school projects and apps we publish?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy brings AI-powered 3D creation into the classroom—making 3D modeling accessible from K–12 to higher education. With one click, students can turn verbal ideas or hand-drawn sketches into fully formed 3D models, transforming how they learn, create, and innovate.\",\"Tag\":\"EDUCATION\",\"Title\":\"Bring 3D to Your Classroom Effortlessly\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Enable beginners to bring their ideas to life—creating 3D printed objects that would be too complex or time-consuming to model manually.\",\"Title\":\"Unleash creativity in 3D printing classes\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Give students in higher-ed courses the freedom to generate 3D assets for class projects at an affordable price—Meshy removes technical and financial barriers so they can focus on storytelling, design, and interactivity.\",\"Title\":\"Empower game development and XR education\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"For teachers, developers, and edtech innovators, Meshy significantly lowers the cost and effort of producing high-quality 3D assets—whether it's for a potty training app, a wildlife discovery game, or an interactive tutoring experience.\",\"Title\":\"Accelerate educational app development\"},\"Title\":\"Transform Your Game Dev Workflow with AI - All Free to Use\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Convert student-drawn sketches or images into interactive, manipulable 3D models with Meshy's advanced AI 3D modeling features.\",\"Title\":\"Image-to-3D for Conceptual Learning\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy auto-generates low-poly and multi-level-of-detail models ideal for smooth VR/AR, game, and app experiences.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized for VR/AR Environments\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Auto-fix holes, inverted faces, and intersecting surfaces in textures; control LOD with polycount and topology options—convenient to beginners and learners.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Mesh Editing \u0026 Healing\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Download as FBX, OBJ, or GLB and import directly into Unity, Roblox, Unreal, or any 3D software.\",\"Title\":\"Engine-Ready Export Formats\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Multi-language support and AR/VR viewing make learning available to diverse learners, anytime, anywhere.\",\"Title\":\"Accessible \u0026 Inclusive Learning\"},\"Title\":\"Game-Dev–Focused Tools\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Inspire student creativity with Meshy’s free AI 3D model generator—turn text, photos, or hand sketches into VR/AR-ready assets in one click. Ideal for AR, VR, game dev, 3D printing, and 3D modeling courses from K–12 to higher education.\",\"Title\":\"Education - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"Explore\":{\"Title\":\"Explore More\",\"UseCasesTitle\":\"Explore More Use Cases\"},\"FilmProduction\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Generate sets, props, vehicles, and creatures from \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e in minutes — letting you previsualize scenes and lock art direction, before cameras roll or VFX work begins.\",\"Question\":\"How can Meshy speed up previsualization?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Upload concept art or \u003cimageTo3d\u003ereference images\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e to generate high-fidelity 3D creature models, then auto-rig and \u003canimation\u003eanimate them\u003c/animation\u003e entirely within Meshy — no external tools needed.\",\"Question\":\"Can I turn concept art into a rigged creature?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy assets feature clean topology, high-resolution PBR textures, and animation-ready exports — professional-grade quality with minimal cleanup.\",\"Question\":\"Is the output quality good enough for film pipelines?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export to \u003cfileConverter\u003eFBX, USDZ, GLB, .BLEND, and more\u003c/fileConverter\u003e — compatible with Maya, Blender, Unreal Engine, Houdini, and other industry-standard film pipelines.\",\"Question\":\"Which film/VFX software do the exports work with?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Assets are optimized for real-time rendering and integrate directly into \u003cunreal\u003eUnreal Engine\u003c/unreal\u003e — suitable for LED-volume virtual production, on-set lighting tests, camera blocking, and live previews.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use the assets in virtual production or LED volumes?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution; outputs are public). The \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant full private ownership with no attribution required — suitable for any studio production.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy assets in a commercial film?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy revolutionizes film production by generating high-fidelity 3D assets—sets, props, creatures—via text or image prompts. Reduce reliance on expensive physical builds, accelerate VFX pipelines, and pre-visualize scenes with AI-powered 3D assets.\",\"Tag\":\"FILM PRODUCTION\",\"Title\":\"Streamline Your Film Production with a Faster 3D Workflow\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Visualize sets, props, and creatures through ai 3d scene generator tools—iterate fast before shooting or VFX, and refine artistic direction on the fly.\",\"Title\":\"Rapid Previsualization \u0026 Look Development\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Export assets optimized for real-time LED environments (like StageCraft), enabling cinematographers to see AI animation and creature motion live on set.\",\"Title\":\"Virtual Production Ready\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s clean topology, rich AI textures, PBR textures, and animation-ready exports streamline artist workflow, making AI VFX production more efficient with minimal cleanup required.\",\"Title\":\"Efficient, High-Quality VFX Pipeline\"},\"Title\":\"Supercharge Film Production with AI-Crafted 3D Assets\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Create detailed props, vehicles, and creatures with natural-language prompts—instantly power your ai 3d character generator or scene ideas.\",\"Title\":\"Prompt-Based Asset Generation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Transform concept art or 2D images into high-fidelity, fully rigged 3D creature models in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Image Reference to Rigged Creature\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Export FBX, USDZ, GLB, and more, compatible with Maya, Blender, Unreal, Houdini, and other AI VFX and animation tools.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized Formats for Film Pipelines\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy-generated assets feature clean topology and detailed textures, fully optimized with PBR support for professional-grade results.\",\"Title\":\"Top-Quality Model Output\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Use Meshy-generated assets inside Unreal Engine or LED volumes for on-set lighting tests, camera blocking, and smart film production visualization.\",\"Title\":\"Real-Time Set Previews\"},\"Title\":\"Film-Ready Features for Producers \u0026 VFX Teams\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI 3D model generator makes film production faster and smarter. Turn concepts, reference images, and hand sketches into screen-ready 3D assets in a FEW CLICKS. Generate 3D models with ultrarealistic details, PBR texuring, and clean mesh now.\",\"Title\":\"Film Production - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"FreeGameAssets\":{\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\"},\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"Into the Depths of Remnants of R'lyeh: Crafting a Lovecraftian Horror Game with AI\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"A1\":\"Free users receive 100 credits per month, automatically resetting on the 1st of each month (UTC). Each standard Text-to-3D or Image-to-3D generation costs approximately 10 credits, giving you up to 10 fully textured, engine-ready models per month at no cost.\",\"A2\":\"Meshy supports FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, and 3MF. All formats are natively compatible with Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Roblox Studio, and Blender. One-click plugins are available for each engine to streamline import.\",\"A3\":\"Yes. Free-tier assets are licensed under CC BY 4.0 — you can use them in commercial projects as long as you attribute Meshy. Paid plans include full commercial ownership with no attribution required, which is suitable for shipped titles or asset store sales.\",\"A4\":\"Yes. Meshy's built-in auto-rigging supports humanoid and quadruped characters with no manual bone setup required. Free users can access 20+ preset animations; paid plans unlock 600+ motions including walk cycles, attacks, idles, and jumps.\",\"A5\":\"Meshy generates assets across a range of polygon levels. Before exporting, you can set your target polycount and choose between triangle or quad topology. Typical engine budgets: hero characters ~50K triangles, NPCs ~10K, props ~3K. Paid users can further refine geometry with the Remesh tool.\",\"A6\":\"Yes. Export your model in FBX or GLB and import it directly into Roblox Studio. A dedicated Roblox plugin is also available for seamless asset integration into your Roblox game project.\",\"Q1\":\"How many free 3D game assets can I generate per month?\",\"Q2\":\"What file formats does Meshy export for game engines?\",\"Q3\":\"Can I use Meshy-generated assets in a commercial game for free?\",\"Q4\":\"Does Meshy support auto-rigging and animation for game characters?\",\"Q5\":\"What polygon counts do Meshy models generate — are they engine-ready?\",\"Q6\":\"Does Meshy work with Roblox Studio?\"},\"GameDevTools\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Chip2\":\"Image to 3D\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI GENERATION\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"Fast iteration\",\"Chip2\":\"Free to start\",\"Eyebrow\":\"RAPID PROTOTYPING\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"Full PBR maps\",\"Chip2\":\"One-click\",\"Eyebrow\":\"PBR TEXTURING\"},\"Card4\":{\"Chip1\":\"Auto-rigging\",\"Chip2\":\"600+ motions\",\"Eyebrow\":\"RIGGING \u0026 ANIMATION\"},\"Card5\":{\"Chip1\":\"Unity\",\"Chip2\":\"Unreal Engine\",\"Eyebrow\":\"ENGINE INTEGRATIONS\"},\"Card6\":{\"Chip1\":\"CC BY 4.0\",\"Chip2\":\"Commercial use\",\"Eyebrow\":\"COMMERCIAL READY\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From first prototype to in-engine delivery, Meshy covers the full game-asset pipeline.\"},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy empowers game developers with a powerful 3D modeling AI for game asset workflows. \",\"Tag\":\"GAME DEVELOPMENT\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Assets for Game Developers\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"\u003cp\u003eCreate high-quality props, characters, and environments instantly from text prompts or reference images. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeshy eliminates the need for costly asset packs, making 3D creation fast and affordable for you.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Slash 3D Asset Costs with AI\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"\u003cp\u003eRig humanoid and quadruped characters with a few clicks - no manual bone setups or Inverse Kinematics required. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose from 600+ prebuilt animations, including walks, attacks, and jumps, ready for immediate use in your game development.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Built‑in Rigging \u0026 Animation\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"\u003cp\u003eExport assets in FBX, STL, GLB, or OBJ, and other formats, fully compatible with Unity, Unreal Engine, ZBrush, and other leading tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeshy plugin allows you to integrate Meshy models effortlessly into your game dev pipeline.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Export to Major Game Engines\"},\"Title\":\"Transform Your Game Dev Workflow with AI - All Free to Use\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Enter a text prompt like \\\"low-poly fantasy sword\\\" or upload a reference image. Meshy's AI returns a fully textured 3D model in under 2 minutes — no modeling skills, software, or prior 3D experience required.\",\"Label\":\"Step 1\",\"Title\":\"Generate 3D Models from Text or Image\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Automatically generate studio-grade diffuse, normal, metallic, roughness, and ambient occlusion maps. No UV unwrapping, no manual shader setup — just a production-ready textured asset, instantly.\",\"Label\":\"Step 2\",\"Title\":\"Apply PBR Textures in One Click\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Use Meshy's built-in auto-rigging for humanoid and quadruped characters. Free users access 20+ preset animations including walk cycles, idles, and jumps. Upgrade to unlock 600+ motion presets for attacks, gestures, and more.\",\"Label\":\"Step 3\",\"Title\":\"Rig \u0026 Animate Your Characters\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Download in FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, or 3MF. Import directly into Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Roblox Studio, or Blender using native one-click plugins — no manual conversion needed.\",\"Label\":\"Step 4\",\"Title\":\"Export to Your Game Engine\"},\"Title\":\"How to Create Free 3D Game Assets with Meshy\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Part1\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate low-poly to high-detail 3D models — environments, props, vehicles, and characters — from a simple text prompt or reference image. No modeling expertise needed to produce assets that are production-ready from day one.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered, High-Quality 3D Asset Creation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"100 free credits every month make experimentation genuinely zero-cost. Test new art directions, iterate on designs, and prototype entire scenes without committing to a budget or timeline.\",\"Title\":\"Risk-Free Exploration and Rapid Prototyping\"}},\"Part2\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate physically-based textures in one click: diffuse, normal, metallic, roughness, and ambient occlusion maps — all included. Compatible with every major game engine's material system out of the box.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing with Full PBR Support\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Auto-rig humanoid and quadruped characters without touching a single bone manually. Free users access 20+ preset animations; paid plans unlock 600+ motions including walk cycles, attacks, idles, and jumps — ready to drop into your scene.\",\"Title\":\"Built-In Rigging \u0026 Animation Library\"}},\"Part3\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Export in FBX, OBJ, GLB, BLEND, USDZ, STL, and 3MF. Every format is optimized for direct import into your target engine — no extra conversion steps.\",\"Title\":\"Engine-Ready Export Formats\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"One-click plugins available for Blender, Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, Roblox Studio, 3ds Max, and Maya. Import assets directly from Meshy into your project without leaving your engine.\",\"Title\":\"Native Plugins for Major Engines \u0026 Tools\"}},\"Part4\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"The AI Prompt Helper refines your ideas by generating detailed prompts, offering style variations, and expanding simple descriptions into rich, production-ready instructions.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Prompt Assistance\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Free-tier assets are licensed under CC BY 4.0 — usable in commercial games with attribution to Meshy. Paid plans include full commercial ownership with no attribution required, suitable for shipped titles, asset store sales, and client work.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial Licensing Built for Development\"}},\"Title\":\"Game-Dev–Focused Tools\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Create free AI-generated 3D game assets from text or images. Get PBR textures, auto-rigging, and engine-ready exports for Unity, Unreal Engine, and Roblox Studio.\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D Game Assets for Game Development | Meshy AI Workflow\"},\"Models\":{\"Title\":\"Showcase\"},\"RelatedFeatures\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"LinkText\":\"Read More\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Related 3D Features\"},\"SubPages\":{\"Category\":\"By Engine \u0026 Workflow\",\"CharacterRigging\":{\"Title\":\"Character Rigging\"},\"Godot\":{\"Title\":\"Godot\"},\"Roblox\":{\"Title\":\"Roblox\"},\"Title\":\"Free Game Assets for Every Engine \u0026 Workflow\",\"Unity\":{\"Title\":\"Unity\"},\"UnrealEngine\":{\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine\"}}},\"Godot\":{\"Explore\":{\"Card1\":{\"LinkText\":\"Learn More\"}},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"CharacterRigging\":\"Character Rigging\",\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\",\"Unity\":\"Unity\",\"Unreal\":\"Unreal Engine\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Godot 4 has native glTF 2.0 support, so a GLB or .gltf file imports by simply dragging it into the FileSystem dock — no plugin or add-on required. Meshy exports GLB directly, so the model lands in Godot with materials mapped automatically. For a step-by-step walkthrough, see Meshy's \u003ctutorials\u003eGodot tutorials\u003c/tutorials\u003e.\",\"Question\":\"Can I import 3D models into Godot without a plugin?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"GLB is the best default: it bundles the mesh, PBR textures, and skeleton into one file that Godot reads natively. Use .gltf if you prefer textures as separate, editable files. FBX also works (native since Godot 4.3), and OBJ is fine for simple static geometry.\",\"Question\":\"What file format should I use for Godot — GLB or glTF?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Select the MeshInstance3D node, then use Mesh \u003e Create Trimesh Static Body for complex static props, or Create Single Convex Collision Sibling for simpler, faster physics. For custom control, add a StaticBody3D with a CollisionShape3D as children. Use CharacterBody3D or RigidBody3D for characters and moving objects.\",\"Question\":\"How do I add collision to an imported model in Godot?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy offers an \u003cplugin\u003eofficial Godot plugin\u003c/plugin\u003e — a DCC Bridge between Meshy and Godot, available on the Godot Asset Library and GitHub for Godot 4.4. Copy it into your project's addons folder, enable it under Project Settings \u003e Plugins, then generate in Meshy and import models into Godot with one click. The plugin is free; one-click DCC Bridge transfer is available on Meshy Pro plans. Prefer not to install anything? You can still export GLB and use Godot's native glTF import.\",\"Question\":\"Does Meshy have a Godot plugin?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy auto-rigs humanoid and quadruped characters and offers 600+ animation presets. Export with skeleton and animation data, import into Godot, and drive the clips with the built-in AnimationPlayer. See more workflows on the \u003cblog\u003eMeshy blog\u003c/blog\u003e and our \u003crigging\u003eAuto Rigging\u003c/rigging\u003e use case.\",\"Question\":\"Can I generate rigged and animated characters for Godot?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Pro plan assets come with full commercial rights and private ownership, so you can ship them in any game on any platform. Free plan assets are available under CC BY 4.0, which allows commercial use with attribution. See \u003cpricing\u003ePricing\u003c/pricing\u003e for details.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy assets commercially in my Godot game?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"Formats\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert Now\",\"Connector\":\"to\",\"Subtitle\":\"GLB is the recommended format for Godot 4 — a single self-contained file with embedded PBR textures and native glTF 2.0 support. Need to convert between formats? Meshy's \u003ctools\u003e3D tools\u003c/tools\u003e handle GLB, FBX, OBJ, and more.\",\"Title\":\"What Is the Best Export Format for Godot Game Development?\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Generate Godot Assets Free\",\"Description\":\"From a text prompt or concept image to a Godot-ready 3D model in minutes. Use the official Meshy Godot plugin to import models with one click — or export GLB for Godot 4's native glTF pipeline.\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"Get the Godot Plugin\",\"Tag\":\"GODOT GAME DEVELOPERS\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Assets for Godot Game Development\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Download the official Meshy plugin from the Godot integration page or the Godot Asset Library, copy the folder into your project's addons directory, then enable Meshy official plugin under Project Settings \u003e Plugins. A new Meshy tab appears in the editor.\",\"Title\":\"Install the Meshy Godot Plugin\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Click Run Meshy Bridge, then Open Meshy Editor. Describe your asset with a text prompt or upload a concept image — something like A mossy stone dungeon door with iron hinges. No 3D or modeling skills needed.\",\"Title\":\"Generate or Pick a Model in Meshy\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Send the finished model straight from Meshy into your Godot project via the DCC Bridge — it imports automatically, with PBR materials mapped. No manual downloads, no format juggling. (One-click Bridge transfer is available on Meshy Pro plans.)\",\"Title\":\"One-Click Import Into Godot\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Drag the imported asset into your 3D scene. To make it solid, select the MeshInstance3D, then use Mesh \u003e Create Trimesh Static Body for props, or add a StaticBody3D and CollisionShape3D for full control. For characters, use CharacterBody3D or RigidBody3D.\",\"Title\":\"Add to Scene and Set Collision\"},\"Title\":\"How to Use AI 3D Models in Godot 4 for Game Development\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Generate game-ready 3D assets for Godot in minutes. Use the official Meshy Godot plugin to import models with one click, or export GLB for native glTF.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Assets for Godot Game Development\"},\"Showcase\":{\"Title\":\"Godot Game Assets Made With Meshy AI\"},\"Specs\":{\"API\":{\"Body\":\"Automate asset generation and pull models directly into your custom Godot pipeline\",\"Title\":\"API Integration\"},\"Animation\":{\"Body\":\"A library of 600+ ready-to-use motion clips exported with full skeleton data\",\"Title\":\"AI Animation\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"COMPLETE TOOLKIT\",\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Turn concept art, reference photos, or screenshots into fully textured 3D assets\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"License\":{\"Body\":\"Pro plan assets are 100% yours, with full commercial rights for any game you ship\",\"Title\":\"Commercial License\"},\"PBR\":{\"Body\":\"Automatic Metallic-Roughness PBR maps that Godot 4 reads natively from GLB\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR\"},\"Plugin\":{\"Body\":\"Import models straight from Meshy into the Godot editor with one click. Free plugin, Bridge transfer on Pro plans\",\"Title\":\"Godot Plugin (DCC Bridge)\"},\"Rigging\":{\"Body\":\"One-click bone hierarchy and skin weights for humanoid and quadruped characters\",\"Title\":\"Auto Rigging\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From first concept to final game build, Meshy covers the entire Godot asset pipeline\",\"TextTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Describe any prop, character, or environment in plain language and get a textured, game-ready model in minutes\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"Everything You Need for Godot Game Development\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"DCC Bridge\",\"Chip2\":\"One-Click Import\",\"Description\":\"The official Meshy plugin adds a Meshy tab to the Godot editor. Run the DCC Bridge, generate in Meshy, and import models straight into your project — no manual downloads or file handling. The plugin is free on the Godot Asset Library and GitHub (Godot 4.4); one-click DCC Bridge transfer is available on Meshy Pro plans. Prefer no add-on? Godot 4 also imports Meshy GLB files natively.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"ZERO-FRICTION IMPORT\",\"Title\":\"Official Meshy Godot Plugin\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"PBR\",\"Chip2\":\"Metallic-Roughness\",\"Description\":\"Every model ships with a Metallic-Roughness PBR set — Base Color, Normal, Roughness, and Metallic. Godot 4 reads these straight from the GLB, so materials render correctly on import without manual remapping.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"PBR WORKFLOW\",\"Title\":\"PBR Materials Godot Reads Automatically\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"Auto-Rig\",\"Chip2\":\"600+ Animations\",\"Description\":\"Auto-rig humanoid and quadruped characters, pick from 600+ animation presets, and export with full skeleton data. Import into Godot and drive playback with the built-in AnimationPlayer.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"CHARACTER PIPELINE\",\"Title\":\"Rigged and Animated Characters\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Everything you need to build Godot games faster with AI-generated 3D assets\",\"Title\":\"Why Choose Meshy for Godot Game Development\"}},\"InteriorDesign\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Convert mood boards, \u003cimageTo3d\u003ehand-drawn layouts\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e, or \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e into fully textured 3D furniture, décor, and room layouts in minutes — no CAD software or 3D experience needed.\",\"Question\":\"Can I create 3D room designs from a sketch or text without CAD?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy generates production-ready, PBR-textured models with prompt-controlled styling — from minimalist Scandinavian to maximalist eclectic — ready to render in Blender, Unreal Engine, Enscape, or any visualization tool for client pitches and portfolios.\",\"Question\":\"Can I produce photorealistic visuals for client pitches?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Reposition, rescale, and reorganize assets — sofas, lighting, cabinetry — without losing model quality, perfect for modular configurations and space planning.\",\"Question\":\"Can I rearrange and resize furniture in a layout?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Download in \u003cfileConverter\u003eGLB, OBJ, and FBX\u003c/fileConverter\u003e — compatible with Enscape, Twinmotion, Unreal Engine, Blender, and other CAD tools — fitting straight into your visualization pipeline.\",\"Question\":\"Which interior design tools do the exports work with?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"No installations are needed. Meshy is a \u003conlineViewer\u003ebrowser-based\u003c/onlineViewer\u003e AI interior design assistant — generate, edit, and share design assets for review with no downloads and no steep CAD learning curve.\",\"Question\":\"Do I need to install software, or is Meshy a browser-based interior design tool?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution, and public); the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant a Private License with full private ownership for confidential client projects.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use these models in paid client work?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"\u003cp\u003eMeshy is an AI 3D Model generator that transforms your ideas—whether from a sketch, mood board, or simple text—into production-ready 3D interior assets. Create photorealistic layouts, furniture, and decor pieces with ease. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom ai home decor modeling to virtual staging, Meshy is your shortcut to fast, scalable, and compelling visualizations—without the learning curve of traditional CAD interior design software.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Tag\":\"INTERIOR DESIGN\",\"Title\":\"Bring Concepts to Life with AI-Powered 3D Modeling\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Transform design ideas into detailed 3D room models and decor pieces within minutes. Whether you're visualizing a full layout or pitching mood board concepts, Meshy streamlines your interior design presentation process—no manual modeling required.\",\"Title\":\"Accelerate Concept-to-Presentation Workflow\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Create high-impact visuals for client pitches or portfolio work using Meshy’s AI interior design tools. The platform supports photorealistic rendering and layout generation from simple text or image prompts—removing the need for complex CAD interior design software.\",\"Title\":\"Deliver Photorealistic Results without CAD\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"With Meshy’s browser-based platform, anyone—from freelancers to studio teams—can leverage ai for interior design. No prior 3D experience needed. Use Meshy as your AI interior design assistant to explore styles, iterate quickly, and impress clients with interactive 3D assets.\",\"Title\":\"Make 3D Design Accessible to Every Interior Designer\"},\"Title\":\"Supercharge Interior Design with AI-Crafted 3D Assets\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy enables AI interior design workflows by converting mood boards, hand-drawn layouts, or simple text prompts into fully textured 3D furniture, décor, and room layouts. Whether you're creating an ai room design free or staging a commercial interior, Meshy simplifies visualization for every designer.\",\"Title\":\"Instantly Generate 3D Interior Designs from Text, Sketches, or Photos\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy automatically detects and repairs issues such as holes, flipped normals, and overlapping geometry—delivering photorealistic rendering results without the need for technical cleanup. Ideal for creating polished ai home decor assets ready for client presentations or design reviews.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Mesh Cleanup \u0026 Photorealistic Rendering\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Download your AI 3D furniture generator results in formats like GLB, OBJ, and FBX—fully compatible with Enscape, Twinmotion, Unreal Engine, and even CAD interior design tools. Whether you’re working in Blender or Revit, Meshy fits seamlessly into your pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"Export-Ready for CAD \u0026 Visualization Pipelines\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Reposition, rescale, and reorganize interior assets—like sofas, lighting fixtures, or cabinetry—without compromising model quality. Perfect for modular configurations, space planning, and creating variations across multiple AI interior design tools or rooms.\",\"Title\":\"Scalable Designs with Easy Resizing and Layout Control\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy adapts to your stylistic needs with prompt-controlled detail. From minimalist Scandinavian to maximalist eclectic, define textures, palettes, and form factors to create high-quality 3d interior design assets tailored to your project or client brief.\",\"Title\":\"Flexible Styling for Every Aesthetic Vision\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"Use Meshy as your personal AI interior design assistant—generate, edit, and collaborate directly in your browser. No software installs, no steep CAD learning curves—just instant, shareable design assets for review, presentation, or iteration.\",\"Title\":\"Browser-Based AI Interior Design Assistant\"},\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Tools for Interior Designers\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy empowers interior designers to instantly turn sketches, photos, or text prompts into high-fidelity 3D models. From AI interior design presentations to photorealistic rendering, Meshy accelerates your workflow with free AI tools—no CAD experience needed.\",\"Title\":\"Interior Design - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"ProductDesign\":{\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"Enhancing Virtual Reality Education: Jeremy's Innovative Use of AI at Stanford\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Generate 3D models from \u003cimageTo3d\u003eproduct sketches\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e or \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e in about a minute — no CAD expertise required. Designers, engineers, and marketers can all generate and refine prototypes in the browser.\",\"Question\":\"Can I turn a sketch or idea into a 3D prototype without CAD?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Generate dozens of structural variations from a single prompt or reference image — instantly. Low-cost iteration means you can test concepts early, while the AI handles mesh, texture, and detailing.\",\"Question\":\"Can I explore multiple product design variations quickly?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy outputs clean meshes with adjustable topology, polycount, and \u003caiTexturing\u003ePBR textures\u003c/aiTexturing\u003e — suitable for design reviews, virtual prototyping, and marketing visuals.\",\"Question\":\"Are the 3D prototypes good enough for design reviews and presentation?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export in FBX, GLB, STL, and OBJ — mesh formats that drop into DCC, visualization, and simulation tools, and into CAD/CAE pipelines as reference meshes. (Meshy generates polygon meshes, not parametric CAD solids.) Use the \u003cfileConverter\u003e3D File Converter\u003c/fileConverter\u003e to fit your exact pipeline.\",\"Question\":\"What formats can I export for CAD, CAE, or simulation?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Share editable 3D assets through a \u003conlineViewer\u003ebrowser-based viewer\u003c/onlineViewer\u003e so every stakeholder can view and collaborate — no software installs.\",\"Question\":\"Can my team review the 3D designs together online?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (commercial use with attribution, and they're public). For confidential product work, the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e include a commercial license with full private ownership.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use the prototypes commercially and keep them private?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy streamlines product design by instantly generating high-fidelity 3D models—from concept to prototype—via text or image prompts. Whether you're exploring new concepts or prototypes, it’s the future of generative AI design—creativity, speed, and precision rolled into one.\",\"Tag\":\"PRODUCT DESIGN\",\"Title\":\"Design Faster with AI-Generated 3D Prototypes\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Produce 3D models from product sketches or text prompts in seconds—ideal for virtual prototyping.\",\"Title\":\"Rapid Concept-to-Prototype\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Create 3D prototypes with generative AI design—reducing production expenses and shortening the cycle.\",\"Title\":\"Optimize for Performance \u0026 Cost\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"With Meshy’s browser-based AI 3D modeling, designers, engineers, and marketers can generate and refine assets—no CAD expertise required.\",\"Title\":\"Democratize Modeling Skills\"},\"Title\":\"Transform Product Design with AI-Powered Precision\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Transform text prompts or hand sketches into polished 3D models within seconds—empowering AI 3D modeling for ideation and early-stage design.\",\"Title\":\"Instant Concept Generation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Export in FBX, GLB, STL, and OBJ formats for easy integration into simulation tools or CAD/CAE workflows.\",\"Title\":\"Virtual Prototyping Ready\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Leverage generative AI design to explore thousands of structural variations and create prototype models with clean AI mesh that balance aesthetics and performance. AI handles complex tasks like mesh generation, texture application, and model detailing, allowing you to focus on vision, not technical execution.\",\"Title\":\"Generative AI Design \u0026 Optimization\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Refine and remix product variants instantly, enabling fast, cost-effective design iterations.\",\"Title\":\"AI Prototyping at Scale\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Share editable 3D assets across teams via a browser-based viewer—bringing AI product design collaboration to every stakeholders.\",\"Title\":\"Collaborative \u0026 Accessible Design\"},\"Title\":\"Powerful Tools for AI-Driven Product Design\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s AI 3D model generator converts text, images, or sketches into optimized 3D prototypes—complete with adjustable topology, polycounts, and PBR textures. Fast, easy, and beginner-friendly, Meshy makes AI design and virtual prototyping a seamless part of your product design workflow.\",\"Title\":\"Product Design - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"Roblox\":{\"CTA\":{\"Description\":\"Describe it, generate it, send it to Roblox Studio.\",\"Title\":\"Generate Your First Roblox Asset\"},\"Explore\":{\"Card1\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read the guide\",\"Title\":\"How to Create Roblox 3D Models [3 Ways]\"},\"Card2\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read the article\",\"Title\":\"3D Asset Creation: Generative AI for Game Development\"},\"Card3\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read the article\",\"Title\":\"From Prompt to Play: Stunning 3D Game Assets\"},\"LinkText\":\"Explore\"},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"CharacterRigging\":\"Character Rigging\",\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\",\"Unity\":\"Unity Game Assets\",\"Unreal\":\"Unreal Engine Assets\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"Yes. Roblox's Terms of Service permit AI-generated content. Roblox has also launched Cube 3D, an AI-powered mesh generation tool built directly into Studio, signaling official support for AI in game creation. Many developers already use AI-generated assets for prototyping, props, and environment pieces in published games.\",\"Part2\":\"If your game's identity is built around handcrafted art, consider noting which elements use AI assistance in your game description, the Roblox creator community values transparency, and proactive disclosure builds trust with players.\"},\"Question\":\"Can I use AI-generated 3D models in my Roblox game?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"AI-generated models work well for game props, environment objects, and rapid prototyping, you can produce dozens of assets in the time it takes to manually model one. For hero characters or models requiring precise topology and custom rigging, the recommended workflow is to generate an initial shape with AI, then refine it in Blender or Roblox Studio.\",\"Part2\":\"Meshy's Remesh tool automatically optimizes polygon count to stay within Roblox's limits while preserving visual quality. Roblox caps individual meshes at around 10,000 triangles for batch imports and 21,000 for single imports. For game props, aim for 1K–3K triangles; for characters, 5K–10K.\"},\"Question\":\"Are AI-generated meshes good enough for published Roblox games?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"Use Meshy's Roblox Bridge. It sends models directly to your Creator Hub inventory, no manual export or file conversion needed. The workflow is: generate a model in Meshy, click \\\"Send to Roblox\\\" from the DCC Bridge menu, and the asset appears in your Studio Toolbox under Inventory → My Packages, ready to place.\",\"Part2\":\"The Bridge uses GLB format and handles conversion automatically. For best results, complete your model in this order: Generate → Remesh → Texture, which keeps files compact and under the 20 MB upload limit. You can also export as FBX for rigged characters or OBJ for static geometry if you prefer manual import. No Blender or other DCC software is required, though Meshy also offers a Blender plugin for advanced workflows.\"},\"Question\":\"What's the fastest way to get AI models into Roblox Studio?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"Yes. Meshy can generate basic animations like walk, idle, and jump directly from a static 3D model using AI. Export the animated model as FBX and import it into Roblox Studio's Animation Editor for further adjustments.\",\"Part2\":\"For complex custom animations like combat moves or emotes, use Roblox's Animation Editor after importing the base model. The recommended workflow is: Meshy generates the rigged character with basic animations, then you fine-tune specific movements in Studio. Make sure each vertex is influenced by no more than 4 bones, and follow Roblox's R15 naming conventions for humanoid rigs.\"},\"Question\":\"Can I animate AI-generated models for Roblox?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"Yes. On the free plan, you can generate 3D models, download them as FBX, OBJ, or GLB, and manually import them into Roblox Studio, that's a complete workflow at no cost.\",\"Part2\":\"Paid plans add the one-click Roblox Bridge, higher generation limits, the Remesh optimization tool, AI animation, and full commercial rights to every model you create. If you're building a game you plan to monetize, the commercial license in paid plans covers selling game passes and UGC items that include your AI-generated assets.\"},\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy for free with Roblox?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":{\"Part1\":\"On a paid plan, you own full commercial rights to every model you generate, you can use them in monetized Roblox games, sell UGC items, and no attribution is required.\",\"Part2\":\"Unlike free models from the Creator Store that may contain hidden malicious scripts, models you generate in Meshy are clean geometry with no embedded code. There's zero risk of backdoors, data-harvesting scripts, or self-replicating viruses. If you also use third-party assets alongside Meshy models, always inspect scripts with \u003ccode\u003eCtrl+Shift+F\u003c/code\u003e and search for suspicious keywords like \u003ccode\u003erequire\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003eloadstring\u003c/code\u003e.\"},\"Question\":\"Do I own the rights to models I create, and are they safe to use?\"}},\"Formats\":{\"CTA\":\"Convert now\",\"Connector\":\"to\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Export Anywhere\",\"Subtitle\":\"Convert your Roblox-ready models between FBX, OBJ, and GLB in a click — no Blender round-trip, no broken textures.\",\"Title\":\"Export in Any Format\"},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Generate fully textured, Roblox-ready 3D models from text or image in under 60 seconds. The only AI tool with a native Roblox Bridge — one click sends your model to Creator Hub, textures and all.\",\"PrimaryCTA\":\"Start Creating\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"See How It Works\",\"Tag\":\"Roblox Game Dev\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Model Generator for Roblox Studio\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Create Roblox game assets with AI in seconds. Generate, remesh, and send game-ready 3D models to Studio with Meshy's one-click Roblox workflow. Free to start.\",\"Title\":\"Roblox Game Dev AI Tools - Create 3D Game Assets\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation Generator\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texture Generator\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Explore More AI 3D Tools\"},\"Showcase\":{\"CreateCTA\":\"Create Your Game Assets\",\"Description\":\"From characters and avatars to accessories, weapons, furniture, and full environments, generate any type of Roblox game asset with Meshy and import it directly into Roblox Studio.\",\"Title\":\"Roblox Game Assets \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eMade with \u003caccent\u003eMeshy\u003c/accent\u003e\"},\"Specs\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"Technical Reference\",\"Formats\":{\"Body\":\"\u003cem\u003e.FBX\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003e.OBJ\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003e.GLB\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eFBX recommended for rigged models\",\"Title\":\"File Formats\"},\"FullGuide\":{\"Body\":\"Generation → optimization → Studio import, end to end on the Meshy blog.\",\"CTA\":\"Read the Article\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Full Guide\"},\"Rigging\":{\"Body\":\"Max \u003cem\u003e4 bones\u003c/em\u003e per vertex\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eScale must be frozen at \u003cem\u003e1, 1, 1\u003c/em\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Rigging\"},\"Scale\":{\"Body\":\"1 stud ≈ \u003cem\u003e0.28 m\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eFace \u003cem\u003e+Z\u003c/em\u003e, stand on \u003cem\u003e+Y\u003c/em\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Scale \u0026 Orientation\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Specs your models need to meet before importing into Roblox Studio.\",\"Textures\":{\"Body\":\"PNG / JPG / TGA / BMP\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eMax \u003cem\u003e1024 × 1024\u003c/em\u003e, single material per mesh\",\"Title\":\"Textures\"},\"Title\":\"Roblox Modeling Rules You Need to Know\",\"Triangles\":{\"Body\":\"\u003cem\u003e10K\u003c/em\u003e triangles per mesh (batch import)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cem\u003e21K\u003c/em\u003e triangles (single import)\",\"Title\":\"Triangle Limit\"}},\"Steps\":{\"Eyebrow\":\"How It Works\",\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Create a Roblox 3D model with Text-to-3D or Image-to-3D, or pick one from the Meshy community library. Use Remesh to optimize triangle count for Roblox's import limits before sending to Roblox Studio.\",\"Label\":\"Step 1\",\"Title\":\"Generate or Choose a Roblox 3D Model\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"Click Send to Roblox from the DCC Bridge menu. A one-time OAuth flow connects your Roblox account, log in, review permissions, and confirm. After that, your Roblox Studio workflow is a single click every time.\",\"Label\":\"Step 2\",\"Title\":\"Connect Your Roblox Account\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Navigate to any model in your workspace and click Send to Roblox. The Bridge transfers it to Roblox Studio in GLB format automatically. Pro tip: Generate → Remesh → Texture keeps files under 20 MB.\",\"Label\":\"Step 3\",\"Title\":\"Send Models to Roblox Studio\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Find your model in Creator Hub or Toolbox → My Packages. Click Open in Studio for instant preview. Textures, materials, and scale are preserved, so your Roblox Studio workflow starts immediately.\",\"Label\":\"Step 4\",\"Title\":\"Use in Roblox Studio\"},\"Subtitle\":\"The only AI 3D tool with a native Roblox Studio workflow. No file juggling, no broken textures, no format confusion.\",\"Title\":\"How to Create Roblox 3D Models\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e in 4 Steps\"},\"Tools\":{\"Blender\":{\"Body\":\"Full Armature edit and render-ready workflow. Bones import as a Blender Armature with vertex groups intact.\",\"Title\":\"Blender\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"Official Integrations\",\"Godot\":{\"Body\":\"Open-source engine with native FBX/GLB support. Import rigged characters directly into Godot 4.3+.\",\"Title\":\"Godot\"},\"Max\":{\"Body\":\"Studio animation and rendering workflow. Full bone hierarchy and skinning weights preserved.\",\"Title\":\"3ds Max\"},\"Maya\":{\"Body\":\"HumanIK- and MotionBuilder-compatible studio workflow with full skeleton structure preserved.\",\"Title\":\"Maya\"},\"Omniverse\":{\"Body\":\"USD-native pipeline support for collaborative scene assembly and high-fidelity rendering.\",\"Title\":\"Omniverse\"},\"Roblox\":{\"Body\":\"One-click Roblox Bridge sends models to Creator Hub in GLB format — textures, materials, and scale preserved.\",\"Title\":\"Roblox Studio\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Send your Roblox-ready 3D models straight into the engine or DCC tool you already use.\",\"Title\":\"Works With Every Tool\",\"Unity\":{\"Body\":\"Import game-ready FBX or GLB models directly into Unity for prefabs, props, and characters.\",\"Title\":\"Unity\"},\"Unreal\":{\"Body\":\"Drop rigged FBX characters and static meshes straight into Unreal Engine 5 scenes.\",\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine\"}},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"~60s per model\",\"Chip2\":\"Very Easy\",\"Description\":\"Describe your game prop in plain English or upload a reference image. Meshy generates a fully textured, Roblox-ready AI 3D model in under 60 seconds, no modeling skills needed.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI Generation\",\"Title\":\"Seconds, Not Hours\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"PBR Textures\",\"Chip2\":\"500+ Animations\",\"Description\":\"PBR textures, clean topology, and auto-rigging with 500+ prebuilt animations. Remesh optimizes to Roblox's 2K–10K triangle budgets, no manual retopology or Blender cleanup.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Production Ready\",\"Title\":\"Game-Ready Quality\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"1-Click Bridge\",\"Chip2\":\".FBX .OBJ .GLB\",\"Description\":\"The only AI 3D tool with a native Roblox Bridge. One click sends your model to Creator Hub in GLB format, no file downloads, no FBX drama, no broken textures on import.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Native Integration\",\"Title\":\"Built for Roblox\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Speed, quality, and a native Studio integration: three reasons Meshy is the AI toolkit for Roblox game dev.\",\"Title\":\"Why Roblox Devs Choose Meshy\"}},\"ToyDesign\":{\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Generate toy models in minutes — from robots to plush figures — from a \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompt\u003c/textTo3d\u003e or \u003cimageTo3d\u003ephoto\u003c/imageTo3d\u003e, with no CAD needed.\",\"Question\":\"Can I design a custom toy without CAD skills?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Use photos or text for one-of-a-kind toys, and generate multiple texture variants of the same model via prompts — great for toy lines, collectibles, and personalized gift sets.\",\"Question\":\"Can I make personalized or multiple toy variants?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Meshy produces clean, print-ready meshes suitable for toy prototyping and real-world production. Finished quality depends on your chosen print material and slicer settings.\",\"Question\":\"Are the 3D toy models ready to produce as real toys?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export \u003cfileConverter\u003eSTL, 3MF, OBJ, GLB, and more\u003c/fileConverter\u003e — ideal for prototyping or producing 3D-printed toys on any printer or slicer.\",\"Question\":\"What formats can I export for 3D-printed toys?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Share your own designs in the Meshy community, and get inspired by what other creators post.\",\"Question\":\"Can I share or remix toy designs?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan designs are CC BY 4.0 (sell with attribution, and they're public); the \u003cpricing\u003ePro plan and above\u003c/pricing\u003e grant a Private License with full ownership — sell your printed toys or digital designs commercially.\",\"Question\":\"Can I sell the toys I design?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy unleashes creativity for toy designers and hobbyists by transforming prompts or sketches into detailed 3D models. Iterate on toy design concepts, customize characters, and produce playful, production-ready designs—all through AI-powered simplicity.\",\"Tag\":\"TOY DESIGN\",\"Title\":\"Empower Your Toy Creativity with AI-Generated 3D Designs\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate various toy design models within minutes—from robots to plush figures—without learning CAD.\",\"Title\":\"Instant Concept to Model\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Use photos or text to design one-of-a-kind toys, perfect for gifts, collectible design, and figures.\",\"Title\":\"Personalized Play Experiences\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy ensures clean, durable outputs suitable for real-world use and toy prototyping workflows.\",\"Title\":\"Production-Ready Quality\"},\"Title\":\"Bring Toy Ideas to Life—Fast, Fun, Personalized\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Instantly turn playful ideas described in word into detailed 3D models.\",\"Title\":\"Prompt-to-Toy Generation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Convert hand sketches into interactive 3D toys—ideal for craft workshops.\",\"Title\":\"Sketch-to-Model Transformation\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy-generated models can be exported in STL, OBJ, GLB, and more—ideal for prototyping or producing 3D-printed toys.\",\"Title\":\"Clean Model Output\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Generate multiple texture variants of the same model quickly via prompts—great for toy lines, collectible design, or personalized sets.\",\"Title\":\"Design Variants at Scale\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Publish designs for community remixing, or collect fan-made designs—embracing co-design trends from industry leaders.\",\"Title\":\"Community \u0026 Co-Creation Support\"},\"Title\":\"Smart Tools for Toy-Making Creativity\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy’s AI 3D model generator converts text, images, or hand sketches into optimized 3D models for prototyping and 3D printing. No modeling skills required - perfect for fast collectible, nft toy, and figures designs.\",\"Title\":\"Toy Design - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"Unity\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"Current\":\"Unity\",\"GameDevelopment\":\"Game Development\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"Unity\":\"Unity\",\"UseCase\":\"Free Game Assets\",\"UseCases\":\"Use Cases\"},\"Explore\":{\"Card1\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read More\",\"Title\":\"From Prompt to Play: Creating Stunning 3D Game Assets with Meshy\"},\"Card2\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read More\",\"Title\":\"Top 8 Unity Asset Stores for Free 3D Models\"},\"Card3\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read More\",\"Title\":\"Top 9 Unity Assets for Game Developers in 2025\"}},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"CharacterRigging\":\"Character Rigging\",\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\",\"Unreal\":\"Unreal Engine Assets\"},\"ExportFormats\":{\"FBX\":{\"BestFor\":\"Animated characters, rigged assets.\",\"Name\":\"FBX\",\"Notes\":\"Standard for animation workflows. Supports skeleton, skin weights, and animation clips for Unity's Animator Controller.\"},\"GLB\":{\"BestFor\":\"Textured props, environment assets, static meshes.\",\"Name\":\"GLB\",\"Notes\":\"Single self-contained file with embedded PBR textures. Import via UnityGLTF or glTFast plugin.\",\"Tag\":\"Recommended\"},\"OBJ\":{\"BestFor\":\"Simple geometry, background props.\",\"Name\":\"OBJ\",\"Notes\":\"Lightweight static mesh with a separate .mtl file. Best for minimal-footprint or legacy Unity projects.\"},\"QuickRule\":\"GLB for everything static. FBX when you need animation. OBJ for ultralight props. USDZ for AR or Apple ecosystem previews.\",\"TableHeader\":{\"BestFor\":\"Best For\",\"Format\":\"Format\",\"Notes\":\"Notes\"},\"Title\":\"Supported Export Formats for Unity\",\"USDZ\":{\"BestFor\":\"AR previews, cross-platform sharing.\",\"Name\":\"USDZ\",\"Notes\":\"Ideal for AR Foundation or visionOS prototyping. Useful for sharing asset previews on Apple tools.\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"\u003cconverter\u003eGLB\u003c/converter\u003e is the recommended format — a single self-contained file with embedded PBR textures, which Unity handles cleanly. FBX is better for animation workflows. OBJ works for simple static geometry with a separate .mtl file. All three formats include Base Color, Normal, Metallic, Roughness, and Emission maps (Meshy-6).\",\"Question\":\"What file format should I use to import Meshy models into Unity?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Install via Unity Package Manager (or .unitypackage). \u003cunity\u003eA Meshy panel\u003c/unity\u003e opens inside the Unity Editor. Log in to your Meshy account, browse or \u003cguide\u003egenerate models\u003c/guide\u003e from the panel, then hit Send to Unity — the model is downloaded and placed in your Assets folder with materials applied automatically. No file management required.\",\"Question\":\"How does the Meshy Unity Plugin work?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Pro plan assets come with full commercial rights and are privately owned by you. Free plan assets are released under CC BY 4.0, which allows commercial use with attribution. See the \u003cpricing\u003eMeshy Pricing page\u003c/pricing\u003e for full details.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy-generated assets in commercial Unity games?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy exports textures using the \u003ctexture\u003eMetallic-Roughness PBR workflow\u003c/texture\u003e, which maps directly to Unity's URP Lit and HDRP Lit shaders — as well as the legacy Standard shader. In most cases, models render correctly without any manual material setup.\",\"Question\":\"Does Meshy support Unity URP and HDRP?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy \u003crigging\u003eauto-rigs humanoid and quadruped characters\u003c/rigging\u003e. Export as FBX with your chosen animation presets (600+ available) — the rig is recognized by Unity's Humanoid Avatar system and wires directly into your Animator Controller.\",\"Question\":\"Can I animate Meshy characters in Unity?\"},\"Title\":\"FAQ\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Generate Unity Assets Free\",\"Description\":\"From text prompt or concept art to a Unity-ready asset — without ever leaving your pipeline. Meshy's official Unity Plugin makes AI-generated 3D asset creation a native part of your workflow.\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"Download Unity Plugin\",\"Tag\":\"FOR UNITY DEVELOPERS\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Models for Unity — Official Meshy Plugin 2026\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"The Meshy Unity Plugin is the only AI 3D asset generator with a native Unity Editor integration. Meshy's Bridge pushes your model directly into your project's Assets folder in one click. Supports Unity 6, URP, and HDRP.\",\"Title\":\"Official Unity Plugin — Zero-Friction Import\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Every Meshy model is built for Unity from the ground up. PBR textures are automatically generated and mapped to Unity's Standard, URP Lit, and HDRP Lit shaders — no manual remapping required.\",\"Title\":\"Unity-Ready Formats, Every Time\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Generate a character, rig it automatically, and pick from 600+ animation presets. Export FBX with full skeleton and animation data, ready for Unity's Animator Controller. No Mixamo, no external tools.\",\"Title\":\"Animate Directly — 600+ Presets Included\"},\"Title\":\"Built for Unity Developers\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Type a text prompt or upload a concept image — something like \\\"A weathered wooden treasure chest with iron straps\\\" or \\\"Sci-fi cargo pod, battle-damaged.\\\" No 3D terminology needed.\",\"Label\":\"Step 1\",\"Title\":\"Describe Your Game Asset\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"In seconds, Meshy produces a fully textured mesh with PBR materials — Base Color, Normal, Metallic, Roughness, and Emission maps included. Clean quad-dominant topology, optimized for real-time rendering and LOD workflows out of the box.\",\"Label\":\"Step 2\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Generates a Game-Ready Model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Install the official Meshy Unity Plugin. Hit Send to Unity — your model lands directly in your Assets folder with materials mapped and textures embedded. No manual export. No format juggling.\",\"Label\":\"Step 3\",\"Title\":\"One-Click Bridge to Unity\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Drag the prefab into your Scene view. Colliders intact. Materials rendering correctly in Standard, URP, or HDRP. You're ready to play.\",\"Label\":\"Step 4\",\"Title\":\"Drop Into Scene\"},\"Title\":\"How to Turn Text into a Unity-Ready 3D Model\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Generate PBR-textured, game-ready 3D assets for Unity in seconds. Use the official Meshy Unity Plugin to import models with one click. No 3D skills are needed.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Game Assets for Unity — Official Meshy Plugin 2026 | Meshy\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Related 3D Tools\"},\"Showcase\":{\"BrowseMore\":\"Browse More Assets\",\"Chest\":{\"Category\":\"Props\",\"Prompt\":\"Medieval wooden treasure chest, worn iron straps\"},\"CloseModal\":\"Close\",\"Drone\":{\"Category\":\"Vehicle\",\"Prompt\":\"Sci-fi hover drone, brushed metal hull\"},\"Ruin\":{\"Category\":\"Environment\",\"Prompt\":\"Overgrown stone ruin, mossy bricks\"},\"Tavern\":{\"Category\":\"Environment\",\"Prompt\":\"Wooden tavern bar counter, candles and mugs\"},\"Title\":\"Unity Game Assets Made with Meshy\",\"Totem\":{\"Category\":\"Props\",\"Prompt\":\"Tribal totem pole, hand-carved wood\"},\"Warrior\":{\"Category\":\"Character (Humanoid)\",\"Prompt\":\"Fantasy warrior in full plate armor, battle-worn\"},\"Wolf\":{\"Category\":\"Character (Quadruped)\",\"Prompt\":\"Grey wolf with battle saddle\"}},\"Specs\":{\"Animation\":{\"Body\":\"A complete library of game-ready motion clips, exported as FBX with full skeleton data for Unity's Animator.\",\"Title\":\"600+ Animation Presets\"},\"Eyebrow\":\"Everything You Need\",\"Guide\":{\"Body\":\"Step-by-step guide to installing the Meshy Unity Plugin and sending your first model.\",\"CTA\":\"Read the Guide\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Unity Plugin Docs\"},\"ImageTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Upload concept art, reference photos, or screenshots. Meshy reconstructs them as fully textured 3D assets.\",\"Title\":\"Image to 3D\"},\"License\":{\"Body\":\"Pro plan assets are fully yours — 100% commercial rights, private ownership.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial License\"},\"PBR\":{\"Body\":\"Automatic PBR maps — Base Color, Normal, Metallic, Roughness, Emission. Compatible with Standard, URP, and HDRP.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR\"},\"Rigging\":{\"Body\":\"One-click automatic rigging for humanoid and quadruped characters. Bone placement and skin weights handled entirely by AI.\",\"Title\":\"Auto Rigging\"},\"Subtitle\":\"From prompt to Unity-ready asset — every tool in one platform.\",\"TextTo3D\":{\"Body\":\"Describe any asset in plain language. Get a textured, game-ready model in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D\"},\"Title\":\"Everything You Need for Unity Asset Production\",\"Topology\":{\"Body\":\"Quad-dominant mesh optimized for real-time rendering, LOD generation, and deformation in skinned meshes.\",\"Title\":\"Clean Topology\"}},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"Unity 6\",\"Chip2\":\"URP \u0026 HDRP\",\"Description\":\"The Meshy Unity Plugin is the only AI 3D asset generator with a native Unity Editor integration. Meshy's Bridge pushes your model directly into your project's Assets folder in one click. Supports Unity 6, URP, and HDRP.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Unity Plugin\",\"Title\":\"Official Unity Plugin — Zero-Friction Import\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"Auto PBR Mapping\",\"Chip2\":\"No Manual Setup\",\"Description\":\"Every Meshy model is built for Unity from the ground up. PBR textures are automatically generated and mapped to Unity's Standard, URP Lit, and HDRP Lit shaders — no manual remapping required.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"PBR Textures\",\"Title\":\"Unity-Ready Formats, Every Time\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"600+ Presets\",\"Chip2\":\"Auto-Rigging\",\"Description\":\"Generate a character, rig it automatically, and pick from 600+ animation presets. Export FBX with full skeleton and animation data, ready for Unity's Animator Controller. No Mixamo. No external tools.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Animation\",\"Title\":\"Animate Directly — 600+ Presets Included\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Whether you're prototyping a level, filling out an environment, or shipping a full game, Meshy plugs into your Unity workflow at every stage.\",\"Title\":\"Built for Unity Developers\"}},\"Unreal\":{\"Breadcrumb\":{\"GameDevelopment\":\"Game Development\",\"Home\":\"Home\",\"Unreal\":\"Unreal Engine\",\"UseCases\":\"Use Cases\"},\"Explore\":{\"Card1\":{\"LinkText\":\"Read More\"},\"Title\":\"Explore More Use Cases\"},\"ExploreUseCases\":{\"CharacterRigging\":\"Character Rigging\",\"Unity\":\"Unity Game Assets\"},\"ExportFormats\":{\"FbxObj\":\"FBX to OBJ\",\"GlbObj\":\"GLB to OBJ\",\"GlbStl\":\"GLB to STL\",\"ObjStl\":\"OBJ to STL\",\"Subtitle\":\"Need a different file type for your Unreal Engine pipeline? Convert your Meshy models between popular 3D formats right in your browser — free, fast, and with no upload limits.\",\"Title\":\"3D Tool Format Conversion\"},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"GLB for static meshes — a single self-contained file with embedded PBR textures, drag-and-drop ready in UE5. \u003clink\u003eFBX\u003c/link\u003e for anything you plan to animate. OBJ for simple background props.\",\"Question\":\"What file format should I use for Unreal Engine 5 — GLB or FBX?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Install the \u003cplugin\u003eMeshy plugin\u003c/plugin\u003e and enable DCC Bridge in your Meshy settings, generate an asset, and hit Send to Unreal Engine — it lands in your Content Browser with materials pre-connected. No file management required. Requires \u003cplan\u003ePro plan\u003c/plan\u003e, UE5.1+.\",\"Question\":\"How does the Meshy DCC Bridge work with UE5?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Static meshes import as Nanite-enabled assets by default. Enable Nanite in the Static Mesh editor under Nanite Settings. Note: Nanite is not supported for Skeletal Meshes.\",\"Question\":\"Are Meshy models compatible with Nanite in UE5?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. \u003cguide\u003eExport your character\u003c/guide\u003e as FBX, \u003clink\u003eauto-rig\u003c/link\u003e via Mixamo, then import into UE5 as a Skeletal Mesh. Full compatibility with the Humanoid Skeleton, Animation Blueprints, and Blend Spaces.\",\"Question\":\"Can I animate Meshy characters in Unreal Engine 5?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"UE6 was officially announced in May 2026, with stable release expected in 2027. Meshy assets use standard GLB/FBX formats and \u003clink\u003ePBR textures\u003c/link\u003e — they are expected to remain compatible with UE6 upon release.\",\"Question\":\"Does Meshy work with Unreal Engine 6?\"},\"Title\":\"FAQ\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":\"Generate UE5 Assets Free\",\"Description\":\"From text prompt or concept art to a UE5/UE6-ready asset — without breaking your pipeline. Meshy generates game-ready 3D models with full PBR textures, Nanite-compatible topology, and one-click import via the DCC Bridge.\",\"SecondaryCTA\":\"Get the DCC Bridge\",\"Tag\":\"FOR UNREAL ENGINE DEVELOPERS\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Assets for Unreal Engine – Official Meshy Workflow 2026\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"Step1\":{\"Description\":\"Type a text prompt or upload a concept image — something like \\\"A weathered stone fortress gate, ivy-covered\\\" or \\\"Sci-fi ammo crate, battle-damaged.\\\" No 3D terminology needed.\",\"Label\":\"Step 1\",\"Title\":\"Describe Your Asset\"},\"Step2\":{\"Description\":\"In 2–5 minutes, Meshy produces a fully textured mesh with PBR materials — Base Color, Normal, Roughness, Metallic, and AO included. Clean topology, optimized for Nanite and real-time rendering out of the box.\",\"Label\":\"Step 2\",\"Title\":\"AI Generates a Game-Ready Model\"},\"Step3\":{\"Description\":\"Install the Meshy DCC Bridge (Pro). Hit Send to Unreal Engine — your model lands directly in the Content Browser with materials mapped and textures embedded. No ZIP files. No manual import dialogs.\",\"Label\":\"Step 3\",\"Title\":\"One-Click Bridge to Unreal Engine\"},\"Step4\":{\"Description\":\"Drag the asset from the Content Browser into your level. Lumen lights it. Nanite handles the geometry. You're ready to play.\",\"Label\":\"Step 4\",\"Title\":\"Drop Into Scene\"},\"Title\":\"How to Turn Text into UE Game Assets\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Generate PBR-textured, game-ready 3D assets for Unreal Engine in minutes. Push models directly into UE5/UE6 with the Meshy DCC Bridge. Get started free.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Game Assets for Unreal Engine – Official Meshy Workflow 2026\"},\"RelatedTools\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Related 3D Features\"},\"Schema\":{\"OfferDescription\":\"Free tier available; Pro plan unlocks DCC Bridge\"},\"Showcase\":{\"AltSuffix\":\"3D model made with Meshy\",\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine 5 Game Assets Made with Meshy\"},\"SocialProof\":{\"Title\":\"Used by teams at\"},\"Specs\":{\"API\":{\"Body\":\"Automate asset generation at scale. Integrate the Meshy API directly into your custom pipeline or asset toolchain.\",\"Title\":\"API Integration\"},\"Animation\":{\"Body\":\"Export clean skeletal hierarchies compatible with Mixamo auto-rigging and UE5 Animation Blueprints for a fully automated character production pipeline.\",\"Title\":\"FBX Animation Workflow\"},\"AutoRigging\":{\"Body\":\"Upload any character mesh and Meshy auto-generates a full bone hierarchy with skinning weights. Export FBX and plug straight into UE5 Skeletal Mesh and Animation Blueprint workflows.\",\"Title\":\"Auto Rigging\"},\"Generate\":{\"Body\":\"Describe any asset in plain language or upload concept art — Meshy generates a fully textured, game-ready model in minutes, ready to push into UE5.\",\"Title\":\"Text to 3D \u0026 Image to 3D\"},\"Intro\":\"The \u003cplugin\u003eMeshy Unreal Engine Plugin\u003c/plugin\u003e connects your asset generation directly to your Content Browser — no file exports, no manual imports. Generate from a text prompt or concept image, hit \u003csend\u003eSend to Unreal Engine\u003c/send\u003e, and your model lands with PBR materials pre-connected and Nanite-compatible topology ready to go.\",\"License\":{\"Body\":\"Pro plan assets are 100% yours. Full commercial rights and private ownership — ship them in any game, on any platform, without attribution requirements.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial License\"},\"Plugin\":{\"Body\":\"One-click push from Meshy into your UE5 Content Browser. Materials pre-connected, textures embedded. Supports UE5.1+, available on Pro plans.\",\"Title\":\"Unreal Engine Plugin (DCC Bridge)\"},\"Title\":\"Everything You Need for UE5 Asset Production\"},\"Systems\":{\"Chaos\":{\"Body\":\"Clean geometry with simple collision shapes works with Chaos out of the box. For destructible props, use the Meshy mesh as source geometry in a Geometry Collection.\",\"Title\":\"Chaos Physics\"},\"Lumen\":{\"Body\":\"All Meshy PBR maps work with Lumen global illumination immediately. Roughness and Metallic channels are correctly separated — no remapping needed.\",\"Title\":\"Lumen\"},\"Nanite\":{\"Body\":\"Meshy static meshes import as Nanite-enabled assets with no extra setup. Ideal for environment geometry, rocks, ruins, and architectural pieces at scale.\",\"Title\":\"Nanite\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Meshy assets drop straight into Unreal Engine 5's rendering and physics systems — no extra setup.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized for UE5 Systems (and UE6-Ready)\"},\"Why\":{\"Card1\":{\"Chip1\":\"UE5.1+\",\"Chip2\":\"UE6-Ready\",\"Description\":\"The Meshy DCC Bridge is the most seamless AI 3D asset pipeline for Unreal Engine. Instead of the usual export → drag → fix → reimport loop, Meshy pushes your model directly into your Content Browser in one click, materials pre-connected. Supports UE5.1+ and is forward-compatible with UE6 (stable release expected 2027). Available on Pro plans.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"DCC Bridge\",\"ImgAlt\":\"Meshy DCC Bridge — one-click import into the Unreal Engine Content Browser\",\"Title\":\"DCC Bridge — Zero-Friction Import\"},\"Card2\":{\"Chip1\":\"Auto PBR Mapping\",\"Chip2\":\"Nanite-Enabled\",\"Description\":\"Every Meshy model is built for Unreal Engine from the ground up. PBR textures are automatically generated and mapped to UE5 Material Instances — no manual remapping required. Meshes import as Nanite-enabled Static Meshes by default.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"PBR Textures\",\"ImgAlt\":\"PBR textures auto-mapped to Unreal Engine 5 Material Instances\",\"Title\":\"UE5-Ready Formats, Every Time\"},\"Card3\":{\"Chip1\":\"FBX Output\",\"Chip2\":\"Mixamo-Ready\",\"Description\":\"Generate a character, export FBX with a clean skeletal hierarchy, run it through Mixamo auto-rigging, and bring it back into UE5. Full compatibility with Animation Blueprints, Blend Spaces, and the Humanoid Skeleton system. Minimal cleanup required for humanoid characters.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Animation\",\"ImgAlt\":\"FBX character with a clean skeletal hierarchy, ready for Unreal Engine Animation Blueprints\",\"Title\":\"Animation-Ready FBX Output\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Whether you're building an open world, prototyping a level, or shipping a full game, Meshy plugs into your Unreal Engine workflow at every stage.\",\"Title\":\"Why choose Meshy for Unreal Engine\"}},\"VFX\":{\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"From Hours to Minutes: How Marcos Medel Transforms His VFX Workflow with Meshy AI\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Generate industry-grade environments, props, and characters from \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext or image prompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e in minutes — transforming traditional outsourcing and accelerating your VFX pipeline.\",\"Question\":\"How does Meshy speed up VFX asset creation?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Studio-quality \u003caiTexturing\u003ePBR textures\u003c/aiTexturing\u003e — diffuse, normal, roughness, metallic, and ambient occlusion maps — generated from text or image inputs, ready for high-fidelity rendering.\",\"Question\":\"What PBR texture quality can I expect for VFX?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. With AI texture editing, use the Healing tool to automatically patch flaws and blemishes by blending in the surrounding texture — or use custom prompts to repaint a selected area and adjust its style, detail, or color. (Available on paid plans.)\",\"Question\":\"Can I refine or fix specific parts of a texture?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy auto-rigs humanoid or quadruped characters — no manual weight painting — and animates them from its \u003canimation\u003emotion library\u003c/animation\u003e (500+ presets on paid plans, with the most complete support for humanoid characters) for fast scene population and prototyping.\",\"Question\":\"Can I rig and animate assets to populate scenes?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Export \u003cfileConverter\u003eFBX, GLB, USDZ, and .BLEND\u003c/fileConverter\u003e for integration with Autodesk Maya, Blender, Cinema 4D, Houdini, and Unreal Engine.\",\"Question\":\"Which VFX software do the exports support?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (commercial with attribution, and public); \u003cpricing\u003epaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e grant exclusive private ownership with full rights to use and sell models across projects.\",\"Question\":\"Can I use Meshy assets commercially in VFX projects?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy revolutionizes VFX production by enabling visual effects artists, 3D generalists, and freelancers to generate detailed 3D models, textures, and animations swiftly from text prompts or images. Meshy integrates seamlessly into your workflow, reducing manual effort and accelerating delivery.\",\"Tag\":\"VFX\",\"Title\":\"Accelerate Your VFX Pipeline with AI-Powered 3D Model Generation\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"Create high-quality 3D models from text or images in minutes, streamlining VFX production and transforming traditional outsourcing workflows.\",\"Title\":\"Rapid 3D Asset Generation\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Export assets in formats compatible with major visual effects software like Blender and Unreal Engine, facilitating smooth pipeline integration.\",\"Title\":\"Seamless Integration with VFX Workflows\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Export FBX, GLB, or .blend files ready for Unity, Unreal, Blender, or Godot—models and animations included, no manual setup or conversion needed.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized for High-Fidelity Rendering\"},\"Title\":\"Enhance Your VFX Projects with Meshy's AI-Driven Tools\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate industry-grade 3D models—perfect for environments, props, and characters—simply from text or image prompts. Meshy's AI-driven gaussian splatting 3D modeling accelerates your VFX pipeline, delivering high-quality assets ready for integration.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered 3D Asset Creation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Produce studio-quality PBR textures—including diffuse, normal, metallic, roughness, and ambient occlusion maps—instantly from text or image inputs. These realistic materials are optimized for your development pipeline, enhancing immersive experiences in VFX projects.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR Texture Support\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Select any part of a texture to refine using AI-powered healing or custom prompts—adjust style, detail, or color to bring your model closer to your creative vision.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Texture Editing \u0026 Healing\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Rig humanoid or quadruped characters with intuitive drag-and-drop tools, then animate them in one click, with Meshy’s library of 500+ presets—walk cycles, idle poses, combat actions, and more—perfect for rapid prototyping and scene population.\",\"Title\":\"Built-In Rigging \u0026 Animation\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Export your 3D models in industry-standard formats like FBX, GLB, USDZ, .blend, and more, ensuring seamless integration with leading VFX softwares like Autodesk Maya, Blender, Cinema 4D, Houdini, and UE.\",\"Title\":\"Engine-Ready Export Formats\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy's AI Prompt Helper refines your ideas by generating detailed prompts, offering style variations, and expanding simple descriptions into rich, production-ready instructions, streamlining the creation of 3D assets for visual effects.\",\"Title\":\"AI Prompt Assistance for Optimal Model Generation\"},\"Feature7\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy offers real-time 3D model preview and interaction in browser-based viewer, allowing you to upload, rotate, zoom, and adjust lighting.\",\"Title\":\"Real-Time 3D Model Preview and Interaction\"},\"Feature8\":{\"Description\":\"Paid users receive exclusive, private asset ownership with full rights to use and sell generated models commercially, ensuring that your VFX creations can be utilized across various projects with confidence.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial Licensing Built for Development\"},\"Title\":\"VFX Content Creation: Focused AI Tools\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Generate AI-powered 3D models and animations for VFX projects in seconds. Customize topology (tri/quad), adjust polycounts, and get built-in PBR textures. Revolutionize CGI, NFT animation, and digital effects workflows with Meshy's cutting-edge AI visual effects tools.\",\"Title\":\"Visual Effects - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}},\"VRAR\":{\"Explores\":{\"Spotlight\":{\"LinkText\":\"Unlocking Creativity: How Skylyfe Inc. Uses Meshy AI to Empower the Next Generation of Tech Innovators\"}},\"FAQs\":{\"Q1\":{\"Answer\":\"Generate detailed AR/VR models from \u003ctextTo3d\u003etext prompts\u003c/textTo3d\u003e or images in under a minute — environments, props, and characters — accelerating your immersive content pipeline.\",\"Question\":\"How fast can I create 3D assets for VR/AR?\"},\"Q2\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy produces models optimized for real-time rendering on VR/AR headsets — from lightweight low-poly to high-fidelity ultra-realistic — with full PBR textures for immersive quality.\",\"Question\":\"Are the 3D models optimized for real-time VR/AR headsets?\"},\"Q3\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. Meshy auto-rigs humanoid and quadruped characters — no manual weight painting — and animates them from its \u003canimation\u003emotion library\u003c/animation\u003e (20 presets on free, 500+ on paid; humanoids have the widest selection), ready for interactive experiences.\",\"Question\":\"Can I rig and animate characters for VR/AR?\"},\"Q4\":{\"Answer\":\"Export GLB, FBX, and USDZ — compatible with \u003cunity\u003eUnity\u003c/unity\u003e, \u003cunreal\u003eUnreal Engine\u003c/unreal\u003e, and AR platforms. USDZ can be used for iOS AR experiences (Quick Look).\",\"Question\":\"What formats export for Unity, Unreal, and AR?\"},\"Q5\":{\"Answer\":\"Yes. A \u003conlineViewer\u003ebrowser-based real-time viewer\u003c/onlineViewer\u003e lets you upload and interact with models — rotate, zoom, and adjust lighting — with no software install.\",\"Question\":\"Can I preview 3D models online before importing?\"},\"Q6\":{\"Answer\":\"Free-plan assets are CC BY 4.0 (commercial with attribution, and public); \u003cpricing\u003epaid plans\u003c/pricing\u003e grant exclusive private ownership with full rights to use and sell models commercially.\",\"Question\":\"Can I sell or ship VR/AR apps using these models?\"}},\"Hero\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy empowers creators to effortlessly generate high-quality 3d model assets optimized for virtual reality and augmented reality. Whether you're building immersive environments for Oculus, Apple Vision Pro, or mobile AR, Meshy's AI VR/AR tools streamline workflows, enabling rapid prototyping and deployment of interactive experiences.\",\"Tag\":\"VR/AR\",\"Title\":\"Bring Your Imagination to Life Effortlessly in VR/AR\"},\"Highlights\":{\"Part1\":{\"Description\":\"generate detailed augmented reality or virtual reality models from text prompts or images in under a minute—accelerating your VR/AR game development and immersive content pipelines.\",\"Title\":\"Rapid 3D Asset Creation\"},\"Part2\":{\"Description\":\"Produce low-poly and ultra realistic 3D models optimized for real-time rendering on VR/AR devices.\",\"Title\":\"Optimized for Immersive Platforms\"},\"Part3\":{\"Description\":\"Export generated assets in GLB, FBX, and USDZ, formats compatible with Unity, Unreal Engine, and other VR/AR development platforms without additional conversion steps.\",\"Title\":\"Seamless Integration with VR/AR Workflows\"},\"Title\":\"Elevate Your VR/AR Projects with Meshy's AI-Powered Tools\"},\"KeyFeatures\":{\"Feature1\":{\"Description\":\"Generate everything low-poly, industry-grade 3D models—perfect for environments, props, and characters—simply from text or image prompts.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered 3D Asset Creation\"},\"Feature2\":{\"Description\":\"Generate studio-quality PBR textures from text or image inputs, delivering ready-to-use, realistic materials for your development pipeline to create immersive experience in VR/AR apps and games.\",\"Title\":\"AI Texturing \u0026 PBR Texture Support\"},\"Feature3\":{\"Description\":\"Auto-fix holes and inverted faces in texturing with Meshy texture editing tool.\",\"Title\":\"Smart Texture Editing \u0026 Healing\"},\"Feature4\":{\"Description\":\"Rig humanoids or quadruped characters with intuitive interface, and animate them with Meshy’s 500+ extensive motion library.\",\"Title\":\"Built-In Rigging \u0026 Animation\"},\"Feature5\":{\"Description\":\"Export models in FBX, GLB, and USDZ formats, ready for integration into VR/AR development environments.\",\"Title\":\"Engine-Ready Export Formats\"},\"Feature6\":{\"Description\":\"The AI Prompt Helper refines your ideas by generating detailed prompts, offering style variations, and expanding simple descriptions into rich, production-ready instructions.\",\"Title\":\"AI-Powered Prompt Assistance for Optimal 3D Asset Generation\"},\"Feature7\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy offers real-time 3D model previews in a browser-based viewer, allowing you to upload and interact with models—rotate, zoom, and adjust lighting—without any software installation.\",\"Title\":\"Real-Time 3D Model Preview and Interaction\"},\"Feature8\":{\"Description\":\"Paid users receive exclusive, private asset ownership with full rights to use and sell generated models commercially.\",\"Title\":\"Commercial Licensing Built for Development\"},\"Title\":\"Game-Dev–Focused Tools\"},\"Meta\":{\"Description\":\"Generate low poly, optimized 3D assets \u0026 animate models for VR/AR - in seconds. Customize topology (triangle or quad), adjust polycounts, and get full PBR texture support out of the box—fast, easy, and beginner‑friendly.\",\"Title\":\"VR \u0026 AR - Use Cases - Meshy AI\"}}},\"UseCases\":{\"Hub\":{\"AccentLabel\":\"Use Cases\",\"AllUseCases\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Pick the workflow you're working on.\",\"Title\":\"All use cases\"},\"Breadcrumb\":{\"Current\":\"Use cases\",\"Home\":\"Home\"},\"CTA\":{\"Button\":\"Start my 3D project free\",\"Description\":\"Jump into Meshy Workspace with the same AI 3D tools every use case page highlights.\",\"Title\":\"Ready to pick your workflow?\"},\"Cards\":{\"3d-animation\":{\"Description\":\"Rig and animate humanoid or quadruped models in minutes\",\"Title\":\"3D animation\"},\"3d-avatar\":{\"Description\":\"Create rigged, game-ready avatars for VRChat, Roblox, and beyond\",\"Title\":\"3D avatars\"},\"3d-printer-files\":{\"Description\":\"Bring your 3D printing ideas to life in seconds\",\"Title\":\"3D printing\"},\"ai-tools-for-roblox-game-dev\":{\"Description\":\"Free AI-generated 3D models, avatars, and assets for Roblox Studio\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D tools for Roblox\"},\"e-commerce\":{\"Description\":\"Generate 3D visuals for your products\",\"Title\":\"E-commerce\"},\"education\":{\"Description\":\"Powering the next generation of creatives\",\"Title\":\"Education\"},\"film-production\":{\"Description\":\"Streamline previz and VFX pipelines with faster 3D modeling\",\"Title\":\"Film production\"},\"free-3d-models\":{\"Description\":\"Generate and download 3D models you like\",\"Title\":\"Free 3D models\"},\"free-game-assets\":{\"Description\":\"Save time and cost on 3D modeling for your game\",\"Title\":\"Game development\"},\"interior-design\":{\"Description\":\"Accelerate your workflow from concept to presentation\",\"Title\":\"Interior design\"},\"product-design\":{\"Description\":\"Iterate your ideas faster with sketch to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Product design\"},\"toy-design\":{\"Description\":\"Turn sketches into 3D models for quick prototyping\",\"Title\":\"Toy design\"},\"vfx\":{\"Description\":\"Accelerate prototyping and previz workflow\",\"Title\":\"VFX\"},\"vr-ar\":{\"Description\":\"Bring your imagination to life in the world of XR\",\"Title\":\"VR/AR\"}},\"Categories\":{\"animation\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"3D Animation\",\"Description\":\"Rig humanoid and quadruped characters in minutes, prototype VFX shots, scaffold film previz. The slow parts of motion pipelines, made fast.\",\"Title\":\"Rig, previz, ship.\"},\"entertainment\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Games \u0026 Media\"},\"immersive\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Immersive XR\"},\"industrial\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Product Design\"},\"modeling\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"3D Modeling\",\"Description\":\"From free libraries to product, interior, and game engine workflows. Meshy turns prompts and references into clean 3D models, ready for the tool you finish in.\",\"Title\":\"Generate models. Use them anywhere.\"},\"printing\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"3D Printing\",\"Description\":\"Send Meshy output straight to Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, and more. Generate printable models without manual cleanup.\",\"Title\":\"From digital to physical.\"}},\"Chapters\":{\"design\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Design\",\"Description\":\"Iterate the slow parts of industrial design. Turn sketches and references into 3D for product, toy, and interior concepts, and stage retail-ready visuals for e-commerce in hours, not days.\",\"Tagline\":\"From idea to product\",\"Title\":\"Design physical products\"},\"education\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Education\",\"Description\":\"Empower the next wave of 3D creators. Meshy lowers the barrier so students explore design, animation, and 3D fundamentals without months of software training.\",\"Tagline\":\"Where 3D meets the classroom\",\"Title\":\"Teach 3D creation\"},\"games\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Games\",\"Description\":\"Ship game assets faster. Generate Roblox-ready avatars and props, browse a free 3D library, and bring AI 3D into Unity, Unreal, and Minecraft as more engine plugins arrive.\",\"Tagline\":\"From prompt to playable\",\"Title\":\"Build games with AI\"},\"immersive\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"XR\",\"Description\":\"Build the next generation of immersive experiences with AI 3D for VR, AR, and avatar worlds like VRChat — bring imagination into XR without a 3D team.\",\"Tagline\":\"From 2D to immersive\",\"Title\":\"Step into immersive\"},\"making\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Make\",\"Description\":\"Generate printable models from text or images, or browse a free library. Send straight to your slicer for Bambu Studio, OrcaSlicer, Creality Print, and more.\",\"Tagline\":\"From screen to print\",\"Title\":\"Make real-world things\"},\"motion\":{\"ChipLabel\":\"Motion\",\"Description\":\"Rig humanoid and quadruped characters, prototype VFX shots, and accelerate film previz — replace the blank-canvas blocking that slows every motion pipeline.\",\"Tagline\":\"From model to motion\",\"Title\":\"Bring 3D to life\"}},\"ComingSoonBadge\":\"Coming soon\",\"CustomerStories\":{\"AccentLabel\":\"Customer Stories\",\"Subtitle\":\"Glasses-free 3D, TTRPG miniatures, AAA character production. Three teams using Meshy now.\",\"Title\":\"From the studios that ship\"},\"Description\":\"Meshy is an AI 3D model generator teams use across 12 industries, from game studios and 3D printing makers to educators, filmmakers, and e-commerce brands, right in the browser.\",\"FAQs\":{\"Answer1\":\"Pick the page that matches your goal: Game Development if you are shipping a game, 3D Printing if you are sending files to a printer, 3D Animation if you need rigged characters, Free 3D Models if you want to browse and download assets first. Each page explains Meshy's AI 3D features from that audience's angle. If you build on Roblox, open the Platform-specific guides section for Roblox-first tips.\",\"Answer2\":\"You can start in the browser with free credits to try core flows. Paid plans add higher limits, team workflows, and commercial terms that schools and indie teams typically need once production ramps.\",\"Answer3\":\"Meshy focuses on game-ready and DCC-friendly exports such as FBX, GLB, OBJ, and USDZ depending on the workflow you pick. Each use case page calls out the formats most common for that audience.\",\"Answer4\":\"Paid plans include commercial licensing for assets you create under those terms. Always review the latest license in-app before you ship monetized work.\",\"Answer5\":\"No prior sculpting experience is required for the first pass. Describe an idea or upload a reference image, then polish meshes in the tools you already use if a project needs extra control.\",\"Answer6\":\"Most teams use Meshy to draft shapes, variants, and textured bases fast, then refine topology, rigging, or lighting in dedicated 3D software. It replaces slow blank-canvas blocking, not every expert finishing step.\",\"Question1\":\"Which Meshy use case page should I read first?\",\"Question2\":\"Is Meshy free for hobbyists and classrooms?\",\"Question3\":\"Which 3D file formats does Meshy export?\",\"Question4\":\"Can I use Meshy-generated models commercially?\",\"Question5\":\"Do I need traditional 3D modeling experience?\",\"Question6\":\"How does Meshy compare to a manual modeling workflow?\",\"Title\":\"Frequently asked questions\"},\"Groups\":{\"commercial\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Product, toy, and interior design plus e-commerce viewers.\",\"Title\":\"For design and commerce teams\"},\"creative\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Game studios, film teams, XR creators, and classrooms.\",\"Title\":\"For games, film, and immersive content\"},\"entertainment\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Animation, VFX, and film production plus game studios and Roblox creators.\",\"Title\":\"Games \u0026 Media\"},\"immersive\":{\"Subtitle\":\"VR/AR experiences, classroom content, and simulation environments for training.\",\"Title\":\"Immersive XR\"},\"industrial\":{\"Subtitle\":\"Product, interior, e-commerce, and toy design plus 3D printing workflows that ship physical goods.\",\"Title\":\"Product Design\"}},\"HeroImageAlt\":\"Meshy AI 3D results across industries\",\"HeroSubtitle\":\"Game engines, slicers, motion pipelines, AR viewers. Meshy fits in.\",\"HeroTitleAccent\":\"Use them anywhere.\",\"HeroTitleLead\":\"Build 3D models.\",\"IndustryGridTitle\":\"Explore use cases\",\"MetaDescription\":\"Explore AI 3D use cases for game dev, 3D printing, interior design, and product prototyping. Create production-ready 3D models in minutes with Meshy.\",\"MetaTitle\":\"Meshy AI Use Cases | Professional AI 3D Modeling Solutions\",\"OrbitViewDetails\":\"View use case\",\"PlatformComingSoonDescription\":\"Unity, Unreal Engine, Minecraft, and VRChat guides are planned. Each will ship on its own URL and show up in this row without a hub rewrite.\",\"PlatformComingSoonTitle\":\"More platform guides on the way\",\"PlatformRailDescription\":\"Deep dives for popular engines and communities. Start with Roblox today; more guides appear here automatically when each page goes live.\",\"PlatformRailTitle\":\"Platform-specific guides\",\"PrimaryCta\":\"Try Meshy free\",\"Schema\":{\"Service\":{\"AreaServed\":\"Worldwide\",\"Name\":\"Meshy AI 3D Generation\",\"ServiceType\":\"AI 3D Modeling\"}},\"Title\":\"12 ways creators use Meshy AI 3D, from games to education\",\"WhyMeshy\":{\"AccentLabel\":\"Why Meshy\",\"Card1\":{\"Description\":\"Type a prompt or drop an image. Get a textured, retopologized mesh in minutes.\",\"Title\":\"Prompt to production-ready\"},\"Card2\":{\"Description\":\"FBX, GLB, OBJ, USDZ with PBR textures and clean topology. Drops into your engine, DCC, or slicer.\",\"Title\":\"Built for real pipelines\"},\"Card3\":{\"Description\":\"Free for hobbyists and classrooms. Team workflows and commercial licensing for studios.\",\"Title\":\"Built for every creator\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Pick a workflow. Meshy fits where it's needed and gets out of the way.\",\"Title\":\"Built to fit your work\"}}},\"UserProfile\":{\"NotFound\":{\"Description\":\"The user profile you are looking for does not exist.\",\"Title\":\"User not found - Meshy\"}},\"View\":{\"CommentImageUpload\":{\"DuplicateError\":\"Please avoid uploading duplicate images.\",\"MaxImagesError\":\"You can only upload maximum 9 images.\",\"UploadButton\":\"Upload images (max 9)\",\"UploadSizeLimit\":\"Please upload image less than 20MB.\"},\"SpotlightSection\":{\"DeleteConfirmDescription\":\"Once deleted, the action cannot be undone. If the image has been spotlighted, it will be removed from spotlight section.\",\"DeleteConfirmTitle\":\"Delete this image?\",\"DeleteImage\":\"Delete image\",\"FromComments\":\"or spotlight from comments\",\"Title\":\"Spotlight\",\"Unspotlight\":\"Unspotlight\",\"UploadImages\":\"Upload Images\"}}},\"Notice\":{\"DeprecateStylizePanel\":\"The Stylize Panel will be deprecated on \u003cstrong\u003eSeptember 30, 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Please finish any work using it before then.\",\"ImageProcessingIssue\":{\"ResistFingerprinting\":{\"Description\":\"This operation uses the HTML \u003ccode\u003ecanvas\u003c/code\u003e element for image processing. If you have the 'Resist Fingerprinting' setting enabled in your browser, it may affect functionality. To ensure the best experience, we recommend disabling this setting or using Chrome. For more details, visit: \u003clink\u003eMozilla Support\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"Title\":\"Image Processing Notice\"}},\"Maintenance\":{\"Description\":\"Important Notice: Meshy is scheduled for maintenance on September 4, 2024, from 7-8 PM PT. During this time, our services will be unavailable. We appreciate your understanding and patience!\",\"GotIt\":\"Got it\"}},\"Onboarding\":{\"AssetType\":{\"Answer\":{\"Animations\":\"Animations\",\"Characters\":\"Characters\",\"Environments\":\"Environments\",\"Props\":\"Props\"},\"Other\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter the 3D assets you need...\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eWhat kind of 3D assets do you need? \u003c/b\u003ePick all that apply, we’ll recommend starting points.\"},\"CompanySize\":{\"Answer\":{\"OnlyMe\":\"Only me\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eHow big is your company?\u003c/b\u003e We'll suggest the best ways to collaborate.\"},\"Gift\":{\"Left\":{\"CouponCode\":\"Your coupon code\",\"Description\":{\"NewRewardPricing\":\"Your friend {friendName} thinks you’d love Meshy and sent you a special offer: get your \u003chighlight\u003efirst month of Pro\u003c/highlight\u003e for just \u003chighlight\u003e$1\u003c/highlight\u003e (plus 50% off for the next 2 months)\",\"OldRewardPricing\":\"Your friend {friendName} thinks you’d love Meshy and has gifted you a \u003chighlight\u003efree month of our Pro subscription\u003c/highlight\u003e to explore 3D creation with Meshy.\"},\"FeatureList\":{\"More\":\"And more...\"},\"GiftDescription\":\"Redeem your gift to unlock 1000 credits, unlimited downloads, and priority generation for 30 days.\",\"GiftTitle\":\"Free Pro Subscription\",\"RedeemButton\":\"Redeem Now\",\"RedeemButtonNewReward\":\"Claim Offer for $1\",\"Step1\":\"Click \\\"Redeem Now\\\" below\",\"Step2\":\"Checkout with coupon code: {couponCode}\",\"Step3\":\"Start your 30 days free trial!\",\"Step3NewRewardPricing\":\"Start your 30 days Pro plan!\",\"Title\":\"🎉 Welcome aboard!\\nYour \u003creward\u003e\u003c/reward\u003e Awaits!\",\"TitleNewReward\":\"$$1 Pro Subscription\",\"TitleOldReward\":\"Free Pro Subscription\"},\"Reminder\":{\"ClaimButton\":\"Claim Gift\",\"CouponCode\":\"Your coupon code\",\"Description\":\"Your friend has gifted you \u003chighlight\u003eone-month Pro Plan for Free\u003c/highlight\u003e. Click to apply and claim the 30-days trial.\",\"DescriptionNewRewardPricing\":\"Your friend {friendName} thinks you’d love Meshy and sent you a special offer: get your \u003chighlight\u003efirst month of Pro\u003c/highlight\u003e for just \u003chighlight\u003e$1\u003c/highlight\u003e (plus 50% off for the next 2 months)\",\"RedeemButton\":\"Redeem My Gift\",\"Title\":\"Thank you for joining Meshy!\"},\"Right\":{\"FromFriend\":\"A gift from {friendName}\",\"MoreAbilities\":\"And more abilities for you to discover...\",\"Title\":\"\u003cb\u003eFree Pro\u003c/b\u003e for 30 Days!\"}},\"Industry\":{\"Other\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter your use case...\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eWhat do you use Meshy for?\u003c/b\u003e We’ll set up defaults and examples for your workflow.\"},\"JobLevel\":{\"Answer\":{\"CLevel\":\"C-Level\",\"Director\":\"Director\",\"Executive\":\"Executive/VP\",\"Manager\":\"Manager\",\"TeamMember\":\"Team Member\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eWhat's your role?\u003c/b\u003e We'll tailor resources for decision-makers and creators alike.\"},\"Paywall\":{\"Left\":{\"Description\":\"To help you get the best experience with Meshy, we're offering a \u003cb\u003elimited-time upgrade deal\u003c/b\u003e:\",\"FeatureList\":{\"Title\":\"{plan} includes the following advanced features:\"},\"Get50OFFNow\":\"Get 50% OFF Now\",\"GetTheBestDeal\":\"Get the Best Deal\",\"MonthlyPrice\":\"\u003cb\u003e{firstPrice} first month\u003c/b\u003e \u003cspan\u003ethen {price} / month\u003c/span\u003e\",\"Title\":\"Congratulations, welcome aboard!\",\"TryPlan\":\"Try {plan} for {price}\"},\"Right\":{\"MoreAbilities\":\"And more abilities for you to discover...\",\"MoreCollaboration\":{\"Description\":\"Manage team members, roles, and shared assets in one workspace\",\"Title\":\"More Collaboration\"},\"MoreConfidence\":{\"Description\":\"Free retries on failed generations\",\"Title\":\"More Confidence\"},\"MoreControl\":{\"Description\":\"Commercial-ready private license\",\"Title\":\"More Control\"},\"MoreCredits\":{\"Description\":\"{credits} credits every month — up to {assets} assets\",\"Title\":\"More Credits\"},\"MoreFreedom\":{\"Description\":\"Unlimited downloads, no extra cost\",\"Title\":\"More Freedom\"},\"MoreSpeed\":{\"Description\":\"Priority generation, skip the queue\",\"Title\":\"More Speed\"},\"Title\":\"\u003cb\u003eMore Power.\u003c/b\u003e Less Limits.\"},\"Starter\":{\"Left\":{\"BestFor\":\"✦ Best for hobbyists \u0026 beginners\",\"BilledAnnually\":\"billed annually\",\"BilledYearly\":\"billed yearly\",\"Feature\":{\"Animation\":\"\u003cspan\u003eAnimation\u003c/span\u003e library (500+)\",\"Credits\":\"\u003cspan\u003e250\u003c/span\u003e monthly credits recharge\",\"Downloads\":\"\u003cspan\u003e20\u003c/span\u003e model downloads per month\",\"License\":\"\u003cspan\u003ePrivate\u003c/span\u003e license\",\"Retries\":\"\u003cspan\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e free retries per generation\",\"Speed\":\"\u003cspan\u003e20%\u003c/span\u003e faster generation speed\",\"Tasks\":\"\u003cspan\u003e5\u003c/span\u003e concurrent tasks in queue\",\"Texture\":\"\u003cspan\u003eAI\u003c/span\u003e texture editing\"},\"FeatureList\":{\"Title\":\"Starter includes the following features:\"},\"PlanLabel\":\"Starter\",\"TryStarter\":\"Try Starter — {price}/mo\",\"TryStarterYearly\":\"Try Starter — {price}/yr\"},\"Right\":{\"MoreCredits\":{\"Description\":\"250 credits every month — 2.5x more to create\"},\"MoreFreedom\":{\"Description\":\"20 model downloads for all models\"},\"MoreSpeed\":{\"Description\":\"20% faster generation + 5 concurrent tasks\"},\"PlanLabel\":\"Starter Plan\",\"Title\":{\"Line1\":\"Start Creating.\",\"Line2\":\"Start Growing.\"}}}},\"Source\":{\"Answer\":{\"Ads\":\"Ads\",\"BlogArticleNewsletter\":\"Blog Post, Article, Newsletter\",\"FriendColleague\":\"Friend, Colleague\"},\"Other\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter a source...\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eWhere did you hear about Meshy? \u003c/b\u003eThis helps us build a more lively community for you.\"},\"StylePreference\":{\"Other\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Please enter the style you love...\"},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003ePick a style you love.\u003c/b\u003e We’ll recommend 3D assets in this style.\"},\"Usage\":{\"Answer\":{\"Individual\":{\"Description\":\"I just want to explore and create.\",\"Title\":\"On my own\"},\"Team\":{\"Description\":\"We collaborate and need shared tools.\",\"Title\":\"With my team\"}},\"Question\":\"\u003cb\u003eHow do you want to use Meshy?\u003c/b\u003e We’ll customize features and plans for you.\",\"Team\":{\"ContactSales\":{\"Description\":\"Working with a company? Get a custom demo and team pricing.\",\"Title\":\"Contact Sales\"}}}},\"Page\":{\"Community\":{\"MoreInspiration\":{\"Title\":\"More Inspiration\"},\"SpotLight\":{\"More3DPrinting\":\"More 3D Printing Works\",\"MoreCollections\":\"More Collections\",\"MoreCreators\":\"More Creators\",\"MoreEventCollections\":\"More Event Collections\",\"MoreEventModels\":\"More Event Models\",\"MoreGameDevelopment\":\"More Game Development Works\",\"MoreUserStories\":\"More User Stories\",\"SeeFullEventDetails\":\"See Full Event Details\",\"Title\":\"Community Spotlight\",\"ViewMore\":\"View More\"},\"ToolkitBar\":{\"Slogan\":\"Hi, \u003cuser\u003e\u003c/user\u003e! How can Meshy help you today?\"}},\"CreativeLab\":{\"Action\":{\"TryNow\":\"Try Now\"},\"AiToolkit\":{\"AIAnimation\":\"AI Animation\",\"AIImageGenerator\":\"AI Image Generator\",\"AITexturing\":\"AI Texturing\",\"ImageTo3D\":\"Image to 3D\",\"PrintWorkflow\":\"3D Printing workflow\",\"Subtitle\":\"Switch to Meshy's AI 3D toolkit to design any 3D model your way.\",\"TextTo3D\":\"Text to 3D\",\"Title\":\"Want to Go Further?\"},\"BrowseHeading\":\"Browse Creations\",\"Faq\":{\"Q1\":{\"A\":\"Creative Lab turns your ideas into custom 3D creations — keychains, figurines, lamps, keycaps, fridge magnets, fidgets, and more. Design with AI, then download to 3D-print at home, or have us print and ship it to you.\",\"Q\":\"What is Meshy Creative Lab?\"},\"Q10\":{\"A\":\"Shipping is free — no coupon codes, no hidden fees. The price you see is delivered to your door.\",\"Q\":\"How much does shipping cost?\"},\"Q11\":{\"A\":\"You can cancel within 24 hours of placing your order. After that, contact support from your order page to arrange a refund.\",\"Q\":\"Can I cancel or get a refund?\"},\"Q12\":{\"A\":\"Yes — for products like figurines, you can upload a photo to personalize your creation. Only upload photos of yourself or people who've given you permission.\",\"Q\":\"Can I use a photo of myself or someone else?\"},\"Q13\":{\"A\":\"You own the rights to use your custom designs for personal purposes. Commercial use is covered in our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e.\",\"Q\":\"Who owns the designs I create?\"},\"Q14\":{\"A\":\"Personal use is always included. For commercial or reseller use, see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e or contact us about licensing.\",\"Q\":\"Can I sell what I create?\"},\"Q15\":{\"A\":\"Meshy's core tools (Image to 3D, Text to 3D) give full control to build any model. Creative Lab is curated, ready-to-make objects you personalize and turn into real things, fast.\",\"Q\":\"How is Creative Lab different from Meshy's other tools?\"},\"Q16\":{\"A\":\"Creative Lab is in beta — we're actively adding products and features, and your feedback shapes what's next. Join our \u003cdiscord\u003eDiscord\u003c/discord\u003e to share ideas.\",\"Q\":\"Is Creative Lab still in beta?\"},\"Q2\":{\"A\":\"No. Upload a photo or describe what you want, and our AI handles the 3D design for you.\",\"Q\":\"Do I need any 3D modeling experience?\"},\"Q3\":{\"A\":\"Designing uses your Meshy credits — no extra fee. If you order a physical item, you'll see its price before you pay.\",\"Q\":\"Is Creative Lab free to use?\"},\"Q4\":{\"A\":\"You can download your design in standard 3D-printing formats (3MF and STL), ready for any 3D printer or slicer.\",\"Q\":\"What file formats do I get?\"},\"Q5\":{\"A\":\"The downloaded 3MF/STL files work with any FDM or resin 3D printer or slicer.\",\"Q\":\"Will it print well on my 3D printer?\"},\"Q6\":{\"A\":\"Yes. Once downloaded, the file is yours to modify, remix, or scale in any 3D software like Blender — see our \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/terms\u003e for usage rights.\",\"Q\":\"Can I edit the file before printing?\"},\"Q7\":{\"A\":\"Most orders are printed and shipped within \u003cb\u003e2 or 3 weeks\u003c/b\u003e. Delivery time depends on your location — you'll see an estimate at checkout.\",\"Q\":\"How long does shipping take?\"},\"Q8\":{\"A\":\"We currently ship to 9 countries: the United States, Canada, Germany, Spain, France, Italy, Brazil, China, and Japan. More regions are coming.\",\"Q\":\"Where do you ship?\"},\"Q9\":{\"A\":\"Materials vary by product. Our keychains, for example, pair a full-color or UV-printed resin badge with a genuine leather case. Each item lists its material and finish on its product page.\",\"Q\":\"What materials do you print in?\"},\"Title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},\"FidgetPixel\":{\"Create\":{\"NeedInspiration\":\"Need inspiration? Try these\",\"ShowcaseAlt\":\"Sample pixel art fidget toy\",\"StartDesign\":\"Start Design\",\"StyleLabel\":\"Style\",\"Uploading\":\"Uploading… {percent}%\",\"WaitCooldown\":\"Wait {seconds}s…\"},\"Design\":{\"AnalyzeFailedToast\":\"Failed to analyze image. Please try again.\",\"Create3D\":\"Create 3D\",\"EmptyState\":\"Your designs will appear here\",\"GeneratingMessage\":\"Generating designs…\",\"OptionAlt\":\"Design option {n}\",\"PreviewAlt\":\"Preview\",\"Redesign\":\"Redesign\",\"UploadFirstTooltip\":\"Upload a photo first\"},\"Flow\":{\"CooldownToast\":\"Please wait {seconds}s before generating again.\",\"GenerationFailedToast\":\"Generation failed. Please try again.\",\"InvalidImageToast\":\"Invalid image. Please try another.\",\"TaskInProgressToast\":\"A task is already in progress. Please wait.\",\"TimeoutToast\":\"Generation timed out. Please try again.\",\"UploadFailedToast\":\"Upload failed. Please try again.\"},\"NavigateAwayDialog\":{\"Body\":\"Your current designs will be discarded and cannot be recovered.\",\"Confirm\":\"Go Back\",\"Title\":\"Go Back?\"},\"Page\":{\"Breadcrumb\":\"Creative Lab\"},\"Preview\":{\"ColorCount\":\"Color Count\",\"ExportButton\":\"Export 3MF\",\"ExportFailedToast\":\"3MF export failed. Please try again.\",\"ExportingButton\":\"Exporting 3MF…\",\"GenerateFailedMessage\":\"3D model generation failed. Please try again.\",\"LoadingProgress\":\"Loading model files…\",\"PieceHeight\":\"Piece Height (mm)\",\"PieceSize\":\"Piece Size\",\"QuantizeFailedToast\":\"Failed to re-quantize colors.\",\"Retry\":\"Retry\",\"Shape\":\"Shape\",\"ShapeHex\":\"Hexagon\",\"ShapeSquare\":\"Square\"},\"StyleSelect\":{\"ObjectLabel\":\"Object\",\"ObjectSubtitle\":\"Toys, food, plants, animals, items\",\"PeopleLabel\":\"People\",\"PeopleSubtitle\":\"Faces, characters, portraits\"}},\"Filters\":{\"All\":\"All\",\"New\":\"New\",\"Popular\":\"Popular\",\"PrintAtHome\":\"Print at Home\",\"PrintAtHomeTooltip\":\"Optimized for multicolor FDM printers\",\"ShipToHome\":\"Ship to Home\"},\"FridgeMagnet\":{\"AddPhoto\":\"Add a photo\",\"Creating3D\":\"Creating your 3D fridge magnet…\",\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"CustomGrayscale\":\"Custom Grayscale\",\"DescribeWithText\":\"Describe with Text\",\"DiscardDesignsMessage\":\"Your current designs will be discarded and cannot be recovered.\",\"EmptyDesigns\":\"Your fridge magnet designs will appear here\",\"Generate3D\":\"Generate 3D\",\"GeneratingDesigns\":\"Generating fridge magnet designs…\",\"GoBack\":\"Go Back\",\"GoBackTitle\":\"Go Back?\",\"MetadataTitle\":\"Fridge Magnet | Meshy\",\"Ready3D\":\"3D Ready\",\"ShowcaseAlt\":\"Sample fridge magnet\",\"StartDesign\":\"Start Design\",\"Subtitle\":\"Turn your photos into custom fridge magnets.\",\"Title\":\"Fridge Magnet\",\"UploadGrayscaleDepthMap\":\"Upload grayscale depth map\",\"UploadingPercent\":\"Uploading… {percent}%\",\"View3D\":\"View 3D\",\"WaitSeconds\":\"Wait {seconds}s…\"},\"FromIdea\":{\"Description\":\"Design once. Choose how you get it.\",\"Step1\":{\"Body\":\"Browse keychains, figurines, lamps, keycaps, fridge magnets, fidgets, and more in Creative Lab.\",\"Title\":\"Choose Your Creation\"},\"Step2\":{\"Body\":\"Upload a photo or describe your idea, and our AI turns it into a 3D model in seconds.\",\"Title\":\"Design with AI\"},\"Step3\":{\"Body\":\"Spin it, zoom in, and fine-tune until it looks right — before you commit.\",\"Title\":\"Preview Your Design\"},\"Step4\":{\"Body\":\"Download the file to 3D-print yourself, or we'll print and ship it to your door.\",\"Title\":\"Print at Home or Ship\"},\"Title\":\"How to Get a Custom 3D-Printed Object\"},\"Hero\":{\"Slogan\":\"AI-designed 3D creations — print at home or shipped to your door.\",\"Title\":\"Meshy Creative Lab\"},\"HeroOrders\":{\"Empty\":\"Bring your first creation home\",\"LogIn\":\"\u003caccent\u003eLog in\u003c/accent\u003e to view your orders\",\"Title\":\"{count, plural, =0 {Orders} other {Orders (#)}}\",\"ViewAll\":\"View all\"},\"HowItWorks\":{\"StepLabel\":\"STEP {number}\"},\"Keychain\":{\"AddPhoto\":\"Add a photo\",\"Banner\":{\"Title\":\"Skip the printing — your furry friend ships right to your door.\"},\"CheckOut\":\"Check Out\",\"CreativeLab\":\"Creative Lab\",\"CustomGrayscale\":\"Custom Grayscale\",\"DescribeWithText\":\"Describe with Text\",\"DiscardDesignsMessage\":\"Your current designs will be discarded and cannot be recovered.\",\"Flow\":{\"FailedStartGeneration\":\"Failed to start generation. Please try again.\",\"GenerationFailed\":\"Generation failed. Please try again.\",\"GenerationSucceededNoDepthMaps\":\"Generation succeeded but no depth maps were returned.\",\"GenerationSucceededNoDesigns\":\"Generation succeeded but no designs were returned.\",\"GenerationSucceededNoImages\":\"Generation succeeded but no badge images were returned.\",\"GenerationTimedOut\":\"Generation timed out. Please try again.\",\"InvalidBadgeSelection\":\"Invalid badge selection.\",\"InvalidDesignSelection\":\"Invalid design selection.\",\"InvalidImage\":\"Invalid image. Please try another.\",\"TaskAlreadyInProgress\":\"A task is already in progress. Please wait.\",\"WaitBeforeGenerating\":\"Please wait {seconds}s before generating again.\"},\"GoBack\":\"Go Back\",\"GoBackTitle\":\"Go Back?\",\"InspirationExampleAlt\":\"Inspiration example {index}\",\"NeedInspiration\":\"Need inspiration? Try these\",\"NotifyMe\":\"Notify Me\",\"ShowcaseAlt\":\"Sample 3D keychain\",\"StartDesign\":\"Start Design\",\"Subtitle\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"Supplier\":\"Supplier\",\"Title\":\"3D Keychain\",\"UploadGrayscaleDepthMap\":\"Upload grayscale depth map\",\"UploadingPercent\":\"Uploading… {percent}%\",\"WaitSeconds\":\"Wait {seconds}s…\"},\"Metadata\":{\"Description\":\"Meshy Creative Lab: AI-designed 3D objects, your way. Download to print at home, or let us 3D-print \u0026 ship. Figurines, fidget toys, lamps, keycaps \u0026 more.\",\"Title\":\"AI 3D Designs — Print at Home or Ship to Door | Meshy Creative Lab\"},\"OrderDialog\":{\"Title\":\"Order\"},\"OrderNotFound\":{\"Button\":\"Back to Creative Lab\",\"Description\":\"If this is your order, please make sure you're signed in with the correct account.\",\"Title\":\"Order not found\"},\"OrderStatus\":{\"Canceled\":\"Canceled\",\"Confirmed\":\"Confirmed\",\"Crafting\":\"Crafting\",\"Delivered\":\"Delivered\",\"Refunded\":\"Refunded\",\"Shipped\":\"Shipped\"},\"OrderViewer\":{\"KeychainLeatherCaseNote\":\"Leather case color is for reference only. Final color follows your order selection.\"},\"Products\":{\"BrickFigure\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your selfie into a custom brick figure.\",\"Title\":\"Brick Figure\"},\"EggBuilder\":{\"Description\":\"Design and print your own Twist Egg.\",\"Title\":\"Twist Egg\"},\"FidgetCollapsible\":{\"Description\":\"Print collapsible fidgets in any silhouette you can imagine.\",\"Title\":\"Fidget: Collapsible\"},\"FidgetPixel\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your images into pixel art fidget toys for 3D printing.\",\"Title\":\"Fidget: Pixel\"},\"Figurine\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your photos into chibi-style collectible figures.\",\"Title\":\"Chibi Figure\"},\"Keycap\":{\"Description\":\"3D art at your fingertips.\",\"Title\":\"Keyboard Cap\"},\"Keychain\":{\"Description\":\"Portable 3D art made from your favorite moments.\",\"Title\":\"3D Keychain\"},\"Lamp\":{\"Description\":\"Turn any idea into a glowing 3D-printed lamp.\",\"Title\":\"Lamp\"},\"Magnet\":{\"Description\":\"Snap, stick, and feel your photos in 3D.\",\"Title\":\"3D Fridge Magnet\"},\"Pixleap\":{\"Description\":\"Immersive spatial reality that brings your 3D art to life.\",\"Title\":\"Pixleap 3D Frame\"},\"SoccerKeychain\":{\"Description\":\"The game comes home. So should a keepsake.\",\"Title\":\"Golden Boot Keychain\"},\"VinylFigure\":{\"Description\":\"Turn your photos into big-head vinyl collectible figures.\",\"Title\":\"Vinyl Figure\"}},\"ReadyCta\":{\"Button\":\"Browse Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Ready to choose your custom object?\"},\"SoccerKeychain\":{\"MetadataDescription\":\"Design and preview your custom 3D soccer keychain\",\"MetadataTitle\":\"Golden Boot Keychain - Meshy\",\"ShowcaseAlt\":\"Sample soccer keychain\",\"StartDesign\":\"Create My Golden Boot\",\"Subtitle\":\"Upload any photo — we'll turn it into a soccer-themed 3D keychain.\",\"Title\":\"Golden Boot Keychain\"},\"Tags\":{\"Beta\":\"BETA\",\"ComingSoon\":\"Coming Soon\",\"Discount\":\"30% Off\",\"FreeShipping\":\"Free Shipping\",\"Hot\":\"Hot\",\"TimeLimited\":\"Time-limited\"},\"Why\":{\"FreeDesign\":{\"Description\":\"Designing uses your Meshy credits, no extra fee; you only pay if you order a physical item.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"No Extra Fee\",\"ImgAlt\":\"Designing a 3D model in Creative Lab\",\"Title\":\"Free to design\"},\"NoSkills\":{\"Description\":\"Upload a photo or describe an idea; our AI builds the 3D model for you.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"AI-Powered\",\"ImgAlt\":\"AI turning a photo into a 3D model\",\"Title\":\"No 3D skills needed\"},\"RealObject\":{\"Description\":\"Curated products designed, printed, and shipped to you — not just digital files.\",\"Eyebrow\":\"Made to Order\",\"ImgAlt\":\"A custom 3D-printed object made to order\",\"Title\":\"Real objects, made to order\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Your idea, designed by AI and made into a real object.\",\"Title\":\"Why Creative Lab\"}},\"MyAssets\":{\"Title\":\"My Assets\"},\"PitchCarnival\":{\"Hero\":{\"StartWithTemplate\":\"Start with Template\",\"SubmitNow\":\"Submit Now\"},\"Stage2\":{\"Prompt1\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D mythical creature mascot from [Brazil / Japan / Egypt / Norway] folklore, fierce soccer ball spirit, plain jersey with [tribal emblem / floral pattern / geometric symbol / ancient rune], [dynamic action / mid-kick / leaping / powerful stance] pose, white background.\",\"Prompt2\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D food character mascot — [sushi / empanada / croissant / dumpling], [chubby and round / tall and slim / tiny and fierce / oversized and bouncy] body, [cheering / arms raised / spinning / sliding tackle] pose, white background.\",\"Prompt3\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D building character mascot — [Eiffel Tower / Pyramid / Colosseum / Torii Gate], face with [a fierce grin / a cheerful smile / a determined stare / expressive eyes], [victory jump / charging forward / heading the ball / celebrating with fists] pose, white background.\"},\"Stage3\":{\"Prompt1\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D fantasy soccer-themed celebration prop — [giant foam finger / cheering bouquet / victory banner / confetti cannon], decorated with [tribal patterns / floral motifs / geometric engravings / star patterns], [glowing / metallic / holographic / crystal] finish, white background.\",\"Prompt2\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D fantasy soccer-themed wearable prop — [glowing horn / celebration crown / warrior headband / victory cape], adorned with [lightning bolts / wave motifs / ancient symbols / floral carvings], [vibrant red and gold / electric blue and silver / neon green and white / deep purple and gold] colors, white background.\",\"Prompt3\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D fantasy soccer-themed celebration instrument — [vuvuzela / taiko drum / tribal horn / steel drum], decorated with [tribal patterns / floral motifs / geometric engravings / star patterns], [gold and red / electric blue / neon green / deep purple] colors, white background.\"},\"Stage4\":{\"Prompt1\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D original fantasy soccer-themed trophy inspired by [aurora borealis / maple leaves / cherry blossom / savanna sunset], [radiant and flowing / delicate and ornate / wild and untamed / towering and majestic] form, fictional nature engravings, white background.\",\"Prompt2\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D original fantasy soccer-themed trophy forged as a mythic relic — [a golden ceremonial mask / an ancient war helmet / a ceremonial battle shield / a legendary warrior crown], [ornate and divine / battle-scarred and sacred / gilded and eternal / fierce and transcendent], fictional mythic engravings, white background.\",\"Prompt3\":\"Here's a prompt to get you started — feel free to tweak it or send as is.\\nA 3D ultimate victory soccer-themed trophy, [divine and celestial / epic and legendary / sacred and eternal / glorious and triumphant], adorned with [rays of light / wings of glory / laurel wreaths / golden flames], fictional symbolic engravings, white background.\"}},\"Research\":{\"Follow\":{\"RecruitmentAlt\":\"Meshy Recruitment Website QR Code\",\"RecruitmentLabel\":\"Meshy Recruitment Website\",\"Subtitle\":\"Follow our WeChat Official Account to receive the latest research updates, internship recruitment information, and industry news.\",\"Title\":\"Follow Meshy\",\"WeChatAlt\":\"WeChat Official Account QR Code\",\"WeChatLabel\":\"Meshy WeChat Official Account\"},\"Hero\":{\"CTA\":{\"Follow\":\"Follow Meshy\",\"Positions\":\"Open Positions\",\"ResearchResults\":\"Internship Research\"},\"Description1\":\"Meshy is dedicated to reshaping 3D content creation with AI.\",\"Description2\":\"We are looking for passionate research interns to join us in pushing the technological boundaries of 3D generation, texture synthesis, geometric understanding, and multimodal research.\",\"TitleLine1\":\"Join Meshy Research\",\"TitleLine2\":\"Explore the Future of 3D AI\"},\"Positions\":{\"Card1\":{\"Description\":\"Drive the development of Meshy's core 3D-native generative foundation model. Design, train, and refine large-scale 3D generative models across pre-training, post-training, diffusion, flow matching, and multi-modal learning. Deploy models in real products used by millions of creators.\",\"Label\":\"Hiring\",\"Location\":\"Sunnyvale HQ (hybrid), Shanghai, Beijing, Shenzhen · Remote\",\"Req1\":\"Strong Python and PyTorch skills\",\"Req2\":\"Familiar with Transformers and modern generative models (Diffusion, Flow Matching, VAE)\",\"Req3\":\"Passion for multi-modal and 3D AI\",\"Req4\":\"Large-scale training infra (SLURM/Ray/k8s) or top-tier CV/ML publications a plus\",\"Title\":\"Generative AI — 3D Foundation Model\"},\"Card2\":{\"Description\":\"Design and build high-performance graphics systems—rendering kernels, geometry processing operators, and production pipelines—that power Meshy's 3D generative AI training and products. Collaborate with researchers, artists, and infra engineers to push AI-empowered 3D pipelines forward.\",\"Label\":\"Hiring\",\"Location\":\"Sunnyvale HQ (hybrid), Shanghai, Beijing, Shenzhen · Remote\",\"Req1\":\"Expert-level C++ and GPU programming\",\"Req2\":\"Strong math foundation and deep understanding of rendering or geometry processing\",\"Req3\":\"Hands-on experience building production-grade graphics systems\",\"Req4\":\"DCC tools (Houdini/Blender/Maya), AAA/VFX experience, or SIGGRAPH publications a plus\",\"Title\":\"Generative AI — Graphics Engineer\"},\"Card3\":{\"Description\":\"Help build the world's largest end-to-end 3D-native ML systems, covering pretraining, finetuning, and inference. Work across the full AI stack: training frameworks, high-throughput 3D data pipelines, custom Triton/CUDA operators, and efficient inference engines for diffusion models.\",\"Label\":\"Hiring\",\"Location\":\"Sunnyvale HQ (hybrid), Shanghai, Beijing, Shenzhen · Remote\",\"Req1\":\"Experience in machine learning or high-performance graphics\",\"Req2\":\"Solid grasp of PyTorch or JAX\",\"Req3\":\"Strong Python and/or C++ skills with a performance-oriented mindset\",\"Req4\":\"Triton kernels, FSDP2 / torch.compile, large-scale distributed training, or diffusion models a plus\",\"Title\":\"Generative AI — ML Systems Engineer\"},\"RequirementsLabel\":\"Requirements:\",\"Subtitle\":\"We are recruiting outstanding research interns to join us in defining the future of 3D AI.\",\"Title\":\"Research Positions\",\"ViewDetails\":\"View Details\",\"ViewMore\":\"View More Positions\"},\"Results\":{\"AuthorLabel\":\"Author:\",\"Card1\":{\"Author\":\"Yihao Luo\",\"AuthorRole\":\"Meshy Intern\",\"Description\":\"A high-precision 3D mesh extraction method that directly extracts fine meshes from implicit fields. By improving integration and multi-scale sampling in the UDF → SDF → Iso-Surface pipeline, it supports resolutions of 2048+ while reliably preserving internal structures and edge nodes.\",\"Tag1\":\"3D Reconstruction\",\"Tag2\":\"Mesh Extraction\",\"Tag3\":\"High Fidelity\",\"Title\":\"Faithful Contouring\"},\"Card2\":{\"Author\":\"Chongjie Ye\",\"AuthorRole\":\"Meshy Intern\",\"Description\":\"Based on the X-to-X unified paradigm, it integrates 2D and 3D modalities to enable multiple geometric and textural constraint loops. It breaks through the efficiency bottlenecks of traditional Text-to-3D pipelines as well as the redundancy and inefficiency between tasks.\",\"Tag1\":\"Text-to-3D\",\"Tag2\":\"Multimodal\",\"Tag3\":\"Unified Paradigm\",\"Title\":\"Omni123\"},\"Subtitle\":\"Our research interns have participated in multiple cutting-edge projects. Below are some representative achievements.\",\"Title\":\"Internship Research\",\"ViewDetails\":\"View Details\"}},\"Search\":{\"MetaDate\":{\"Description\":\"Explore 3D models, creators, and collections related to \\\"{keyword}\\\" on Meshy.\",\"Title\":\"Search Result\"},\"ResultFor\":\"Search result for \\\"\u003cb\u003e{keyword}\u003c/b\u003e\\\"\"}},\"PrePaywall\":{\"Title\":\"Not happy with your model? Let the 3D AI Agent refine it — or create something even better.\"},\"Pricing\":{\"Billing\":{\"BillingDetails\":{\"Address\":\"Address\",\"Email\":\"Email\",\"ManageBillingDetails\":\"Manage Billing Details\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"Placeholder\":{\"Address\":\"No address\",\"Name\":\"Example Name\",\"TaxID\":\"No tax identifier\"},\"TaxID\":\"Tax ID\",\"Title\":\"Billing Details\"},\"BillingHistory\":{\"NoBillingHistory\":\"No record of billing history.\",\"Table\":{\"DownloadInvoice\":\"Download Invoice\",\"Failed\":\"Failed\",\"Paid\":\"Paid\",\"Pending\":\"Pending\"},\"TableHeader\":{\"Amount\":\"Amount \",\"Date\":\"Date\",\"InvoiceLink\":\"Invoice Link\",\"InvoiceNumber\":\"Invoice Number\",\"Status\":\"Status\"},\"Title\":\"Billing History\"},\"Overview\":{\"CreditAutoReCharge\":{\"Default\":{\"Description\":\"Enjoy uninterrupted service with automatic credit refills.\",\"Title\":\"Credit Auto Recharge\"},\"Dialog\":{\"AmountToPay\":\"Amount to pay:\",\"AmountToPayDescription\":\"1 credit\",\"Description\":\"Would you like to set up automatic recharge?\",\"Error\":{\"RechargeAmountError\":\"Recharge amount must be between 10,000 and 100,000\",\"ThresholdError\":\"Threshold must be between 100 and 10,000\"},\"NeedMoreControl\":\"Need more control over your credits? \",\"NeedMoreControlDescription\":\"\u003clink\u003eContact Sales\u003c/link\u003e for custom plans and volume pricing.\",\"PaymentMethodNotFound\":\"Please add a payment method to turn on auto-recharge.\",\"RechargeAmount\":\"Automatically purchase\",\"RechargeAmountPlaceholder\":\"Enter a number between 10,000 and 100,000\",\"SaveFailed\":\"Failed! Please try again later.\",\"SaveSuccess\":\"Settings saved successfully.\",\"SubmitButton\":\"Save Settings\",\"Switch\":\"Yes, automatically recharge my card when my credit balance falls below a threshold\",\"Threshold\":\"When credit balance goes below\",\"ThresholdPlaceholder\":\"Enter a number between 100 and 10,000\",\"Title\":\"Auto Recharge Settings\"},\"ModifyButton\":\"Modify\",\"TurnOn\":{\"Description\":\"When your balance hits the threshold of {threshold} credits, an automatic purchase of {rechargeAmount} credits will be made.\",\"Title\":\"Credit auto recharge is on\"},\"TurnOnButton\":\"Turn On\"},\"CurrentPlan\":{\"FreeTrialSection\":\"Free Trial \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e of a\",\"Normal\":\"You're currently on a \u003cname\u003e\u003c/name\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e{cycle}\u003c/strong\u003e plan\"},\"NextPeriod\":{\"Title\":\"Next Bill\"},\"NextPlan\":{\"Balance\":\"You don’t need to pay the full amount this time, as you have a remaining balance of {money}.\",\"Canceled\":\"You‘ve cancelled your subscription and will be on a Free plan on \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e.\",\"Normal\":\"Your {cycle} plan renews on \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e ({day} days left).\",\"TrialNextPlan\":\"Your Free Trial ends on \u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e ({days} days left).At the conclusion of your trial period, you will be charged {money} for the {name} {cycle} plan.\"},\"PendingDowngrade\":{\"Cancel\":\"Cancel Downgrade\",\"CancelFailed\":\"Failed to cancel pending downgrade.\",\"CancelSuccess\":\"Pending downgrade has been canceled.\",\"Message\":\"You have a pending plan downgrade scheduled for the end of your current billing period.\"},\"PendingPlanChange\":{\"CouponWarning\":\"Your scheduled plan change includes a coupon ({coupon}). Restoring your current plan will remove this coupon and it may not be reapplied.\",\"Message\":\"You have a pending plan change scheduled. Your subscription will change at the end of your current billing period.\",\"Restore\":\"Restore Current Plan\",\"RestoreFailed\":\"Failed to restore subscription.\",\"RestoreSuccess\":\"Your subscription has been restored to the current plan.\"},\"Period\":{\"Bimonthly\":\"per bimonth\",\"Month\":\"per month\",\"Quarter\":\"per quarter\",\"Title\":\"Current Billing Period\",\"TrialEndInDays\":\"{days, plural, =1 {Trial ends in # day} other {Trial ends in # days}}\",\"Year\":\"per year\"},\"Title\":\"Overview\",\"Upgrade\":\"Upgrade\",\"UpgradeTips\":\"Looking to get more? Upgrade to enjoy additional credits, enhanced task priority, the ability to download community models and access to more advanced features.\"},\"PaymentMethod\":{\"AddPaymentMethod\":\"Add Payment Method\",\"AddSubscriptionTip\":\"You can add one with a subscription.\",\"Expires\":\"Expires\",\"ManagePayment\":\"Manage Payment Method\",\"NoPaymentMethod\":\"No payment method.\",\"Title\":\"Payment Method\"},\"PaymentTips\":\"Any questions? Check our \u003clink\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c/link\u003e for more information regarding credit usage.\",\"StoreManaged\":{\"ConflictHint\":\"You already have an App Store or Google Play subscription. Manage it there.\",\"ManageOnMobile\":\"Manage on mobile\",\"ManageOnStore\":\"Manage your subscription in the App Store or Google Play.\"}},\"Cancel\":{\"Alternative\":{\"Description\":\"Could you let us know which product you switched to?\",\"OptionOther\":\"Other\"},\"Intro\":{\"ApplyNextCycle70\":\"You’re enjoying a \u003chighlight\u003e70% discount\u003c/highlight\u003e for your next billing cycle, and this is a one-time offer!\\nIf you cancel now, you’ll miss out on this great deal.\\nAre you sure you want to proceed?\",\"Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Description\":\"Your subscription will be active for the remaining time. After that you'll lose access to all the benefits below. Have you tried the latest \u003cb\u003eMeshy 6\u003c/b\u003e? Our updated AI model now delivers \u003cb\u003esculpting-level\u003c/b\u003e 3D models!\",\"FillOutForm\":\"Fill out the form to get a discount →\",\"JustCancel\":\"Just Cancel\",\"Title\":\"Cancel Subscription\"},\"Main\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Continue\":\"Continue to cancel\",\"Description\":\"We're sorry to see you go. We release new features regularly to keep you satisfied.\\nTo help us improve, please let us know why you're canceling.\",\"Option1\":\"It's too expensive\",\"Option2\":\"I need more features\",\"Option3\":\"Quality was less than expected\",\"Option4\":\"Ease of use was less than expected\",\"Option5\":\"Customer service was less than expected\",\"Option6\":\"I found an alternative\",\"Option7\":\"I no longer need it\",\"Option8\":\"Other reason\",\"Stop\":\"Stop canceling\"},\"Offer\":{\"Accept\":\"Accept offer\",\"Accepted\":{\"Button\":\"Done\",\"Description70\":\"Your next bill will enjoy a 70% discount, after which it will return to the original price.\",\"Title\":\"Offer Applied\"},\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Decline\":{\"Default\":\"Decline offer\",\"Description\":\"You won’t be billed again.\",\"Title\":\"Subscription Canceled\"},\"Error\":\"Operation failed, please try again later.\",\"SecondChange\":\"Exciting updates are coming weekly. Please give us a second chance!\",\"Ticket\":{\"Discount70\":\"70% OFF\",\"Message\":\"To maximize the benefits of this offer, consider switching to a yearly plan after acceptance. \u003clink\u003eLearn more\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"NextRenewal\":\"For your next renewal\",\"Title\":\"Claim your offer\"},\"TightBudget\":\"We understand budgets might be tight, and we want to keep adding value for you.\",\"Title\":\"Special Offer\"},\"Prompt\":{\"FeatureMissing\":{\"Title\":\"What features are you looking for that are currently missing?\"},\"LowQuality\":{\"Title\":\"Have you tried the latest \u003cb\u003eMeshy 6\u003c/b\u003e? Our updated AI model now delivers \u003cb\u003esculpting-level\u003c/b\u003e 3D models! If you still wish to cancel, please let us know how we can improve.\"},\"NeedImprovement\":{\"Title\":\"We're sorry to see you go. How should we improve?\"},\"PriceRange\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Any feedback and suggestions are welcome.\",\"Title\":\"What price range would you consider more acceptable for our service?\"}},\"RefundTip\":{\"CTA\":\"Yes, I'd like a refund for some creidts\",\"Description\":\"We're sorry the quality of the models didn't meet your expectations. As a \u003cstrong\u003evalued subscriber\u003c/strong\u003e, you can request a credit refund for unsatisfactory generations instead of canceling. Our models are improving quickly, and we'd love for you to stick around!\",\"Title\":\"Quality is Improving Fast!\"}},\"GetCredit\":{\"ExtraCredit\":{\"Button\":{\"Tooltip\":{\"Description\":\"You must have an active subscription to purchase.\"}},\"Default\":\"Or Purchase Extra Credits (Subscriber only)\",\"DefaultNoSubscription\":\"Or Purchase Extra Credits\",\"SubscriptionSavingsHint\":\"Save more with a subscription — 20% off any monthly plan, 40% off any annual plan.\",\"Tooltip\":{\"Description\":\"Purchased credits do not expire or reset monthly, but you must have an active subscription to purchase and use them.\",\"DescriptionNoSubscription\":\"Purchased credits do not expire or reset monthly.\",\"PaypalDisabledTitle\":\"The current currency is not supported for PayPal payments.\",\"Title\":\"About purchased credits\"}},\"Subtitle\":\"Upgrade Your Plan\"},\"MaxUnlimitedPlanBanner\":{\"Description\":\"New sign-ups for Max Unlimited ended on May 15. As a valued early user, your access remains unchanged. Thank you for being with us.\"},\"PaywallAfterSignup\":{\"DiscountMessage\":\"To help you get the most out of your experience, we’re excited to offer you an exclusive \u003cb\u003e50% OFF\u003c/b\u003e for your first month of Pro subscription. Don’t miss out this chance - it’s a \u003cb\u003eone-time offer\u003c/b\u003e!\",\"OfferRedeemedCount\":\"\u003cb\u003e{count}\u003c/b\u003e creators have already redeemed this offer. Join them and unleash your creative potential!\",\"ProPlan\":\"Pro Plan\",\"Title\":\"Upgrade to Pro\"},\"PremiumBenefitsCard\":{\"AITextureEditing\":\"AI Texture Editing\",\"APIAccess\":\"API Access\",\"AnimationLibrary\":\"Animation Library\",\"DownloadCommunityModels\":\"Download Community Models\",\"DownloadLatestModel\":\"Download Models Generated by Meshy 5 and Meshy 6\",\"Features\":\"Features\",\"Free\":\"Free\",\"FreeRetry\":\"Free Retry\",\"LoyaltyCredits\":\"Loyalty Credits (first time renewing to get {firstRenewCredits}, up to {uptoCredits} credits, — \u003clink\u003emore details\u003c/link\u003e)\",\"MoreTasksWaitingInQueue\":\"More Tasks Waiting in Queue\",\"MultiViewImageTo3D\":\"Multi-view Image to 3D\",\"PriorityGeneration\":\"Priority Generation\",\"PrivateLicense\":\"Private License\",\"Pro\":\"Pro\"},\"PremiumTooltip\":{\"Feature1\":\"More tasks waiting in queue\",\"Feature2\":\"Animation\",\"Feature3\":\"Download community models\",\"Feature4\":\"AI Texture editing\",\"Feature5\":\"Credit refund\",\"FeatureMore\":\"and more\",\"Title\":\"Get more exclusive features\"},\"Subscription\":{\"20250812BuyOneGetTwo\":{\"Banner\":\"⚡️ Meshy 5 Special: Buy 1 Year Get 1 FREE ⚡️\",\"Tooltip\":\"By subscribing for a year, you’ll receive 100% off your next billing year; however, your current billing period (as shown in the Current Plan section) will still end after one year. To view your discount details, click the “Manage Plan” button in Settings \u003e Subscription.\"},\"20250812FiftyPercentOff\":{\"Banner\":\"⚡️ Meshy 5 Special: 50% Off Yearly Pro Plan ⚡️\",\"Tooltip\":\"Available only for payments made via Stripe at this moment.\"},\"Action\":{\"ChangeCycle\":\"Change to {cycle}\",\"Default\":\"Subscribe Now\",\"Downgrade\":\"Downgrade\",\"PayWith\":\"Pay with \u003cmethod\u003e\u003c/method\u003e\",\"PayWithForDiscount\":\"Pay with \u003cmethod\u003e\u003c/method\u003e for Discount\",\"TryPro\":\"Start 3-Day Free Trial\",\"Upgrade\":\"Upgrade\"},\"AnniversaryRetention\":{\"Dialog\":{\"Accept\":\"Alright, one more month!\",\"Decline\":\"I still want to cancel\",\"Description\":\"We've added \u003cbold\u003ea free month of Pro\u003c/bold\u003e to your account.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eIt's already yours. Give us one more month — we think you'll love what's coming.\",\"Success\":\"Your free month has been applied!\",\"Title\":\"We don't want to say goodbye 🥹\"}},\"BestValue\":\"Best Value\",\"Billed\":{\"Bimonthly\":\"Billed bimonthly\",\"FirstAndThen\":\"first {unit}\",\"FirstAndThenPerSeat\":\"/ seat first {unit}\",\"Monthly\":\"Billed monthly\",\"MonthlyPerSeatWithPrice\":\"Billed monthly, {price} / seat / month\",\"MonthlySave\":\"Billed monthly, {price} / month, \u003chighlight\u003eSave {amount}\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"MonthlySavePerSeat\":\"Billed monthly, {price} / seat / month, \u003chighlight\u003eSave {amount}\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"MonthlyWithPrice\":\"Billed monthly, {price} / month\",\"PayToday\":\"today\",\"Quarterly\":\"Billed every 3 months\",\"QuarterlySave\":\"Billed every 3 months, \u003chighlight\u003eSave {amount}\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Yearly\":\"Billed yearly\",\"YearlySave\":\"Billed yearly - {billed} today, \u003chighlight\u003eSave {amount}\u003c/highlight\u003e\"},\"Cancel\":{\"Short\":\"Cancel Plan\",\"Treatment\":{\"Button\":{\"BackButton\":\"Back\",\"CancelSubscription\":\"Cancel subscription\",\"ContinueButton\":\"Continue to cancel\"},\"Confirm\":{\"AcceptButton\":\"Stay with Meshy for 70% OFF\",\"Benefits\":{\"Bonus\":\"Bonus: To maximize the benefits of this offer, consider switching to a yearly plan after acceptance. \u003clink\u003eLearn more\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"CancelAnytime\":\"You can still cancel anytime — no strings attached\",\"ImmediateDiscount\":\"Discount applies immediately\",\"ReturnToOriginal\":\"Future billing period will return to your original plan price unless you cancel\"},\"CancelButton\":\"Cancel subscription\",\"Description\":\"We understand you might be thinking of leaving. Before you go, here's a special offer that might better fit your needs.\",\"GoBack\":\"Go back\",\"Month\":\"month\",\"PriceNextMonth\":\"Price next month:\",\"PriceNextQuarter\":\"Price next quarter:\",\"PriceNextYear\":\"Price next year:\",\"Quarter\":\"quarter\",\"Title\":\"Before you go\",\"Year\":\"year\"},\"Consequences\":{\"Description\":\"Your subscription will still be active until \u003cdate\u003e{date}\u003c/date\u003e. When your subscription ends, a few things will change:\",\"Items\":{\"Batch\":\"You'll be limited to \u003chighlight\u003eone model generation at a time\u003c/highlight\u003e instead of batch generation\",\"Community\":\"\u003chighlight\u003eFree downloads from the Community\u003c/highlight\u003e will no longer be available\",\"Download\":\"You won't be able to download models generated with \u003chighlight\u003eMeshy 5\u003c/highlight\u003e or \u003chighlight\u003eMeshy 6\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Features\":\"Access to advanced features such as \u003chighlight\u003emulti-view, free retries, and AI texture editing\u003c/highlight\u003e will be removed\",\"License\":\"Model generations will default to CC BY 4.0 license instead of a \u003chighlight\u003eprivate license\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"Loyalty\":\"Your \u003chighlight\u003eloyalty credits\u003c/highlight\u003e streak will end, and bonus credits will stop accumulating\"},\"Title\":\"If you cancel...\"},\"ConsequencesWithCoupon\":{\"Description\":\"Good things shouldn't go to waste. You still have a special discount waiting to be used.\",\"Message\":\"You're currently eligible for a \u003chighlight\u003e70% OFF renewal\u003c/highlight\u003e. This is a one-time offer, if you cancel today, this exclusive discount will no longer apply.\",\"Month\":\"month\",\"PriceNextMonth\":\"Price next month:\",\"Title\":\"You have an unused discount\"},\"OfferApplied\":{\"Description\":\"Thanks for staying with us! Your next bill on \u003cdate\u003e{date}\u003c/date\u003e will enjoy a 70% discount. After that, your subscription will automatically return to its regular price.\",\"GotIt\":\"Got it\",\"Title\":\"Special offer applied\"},\"Reason\":{\"CommentLabel\":{\"Alternatives\":\"Why do you think this is a better alternative?\",\"Default\":\"Could you please tell us more about what led to this decision?\",\"EaseOfUse\":\"Please let us know how we can improve it, and we promise to make it better!\",\"Feature\":\"Please let us know how we can improve this feature, and we promise to make it better!\",\"Price\":\"Do you have any suggestions on how we should price Meshy?\",\"Quality\":\"We're sorry the generation results didn't match your expectations. Could you share what went wrong?\",\"Usage\":\"Is there anything we can add or change that would've kept you using Meshy longer?\"},\"CommentMaxLength\":\"Please provide your feedback with at most {max} characters\",\"CommentMinLengthForOther\":\"Your feedback matters! Please write at least {min} characters before submitting.\",\"CommentPlaceholder\":\"I think...\",\"CommentRequired\":\"Please provide your feedback\",\"Description\":\"We are sorry to see you go. To help us improve, we have just a few short questions before you cancel your subscription.\",\"Primary\":{\"Alternatives\":\"I found a better alternative\",\"EaseOfUse\":\"The product was hard to use\",\"Feature\":\"It lacks the features I need\",\"Other\":\"None of the above reasons\",\"Price\":\"The price doesn't fit my needs\",\"Quality\":\"Quality was less than expected\",\"Usage\":\"I don't need Meshy anymore\"},\"ReasonLabel\":\"What is your main reason for cancelling?\",\"ReasonPlaceholder\":\"Select a reason\",\"ReasonRequired\":\"Please select a reason\",\"Secondary\":{\"AlternativesBlender\":\"Blender\",\"AlternativesCSM\":\"CSM\",\"AlternativesHitem\":\"Hitem\",\"AlternativesHunyuan\":\"Hunyuan\",\"AlternativesOther\":\"Other\",\"AlternativesRodin\":\"Rodin\",\"AlternativesTripo\":\"Tripo\",\"EaseOfUseGoodResults\":\"I don't know to get good generation results\",\"EaseOfUseOther\":\"Other\",\"EaseOfUseTrialError\":\"Too much trial and error\",\"EaseOfUseUI\":\"The UI was confusing and needed improvement\",\"EaseOfUseWorkflow\":\"The product didn't match my workflow\",\"FeatureAnimationRigging\":\"I need better animation / rigging capabilities\",\"FeatureExport\":\"I need better export options\",\"FeatureIntegrationPlugin\":\"I need better integration/ plugin features\",\"FeatureMeshEditing\":\"I need better mesh editing tools\",\"FeatureOther\":\"Other\",\"FeatureTextureEditing\":\"I need better texture editing tools\",\"PriceBudgetConstraints\":\"I recently have budget constraints\",\"PriceExpensiveForFrequency\":\"It's too expensive for my frequency of use\",\"PriceLocalCurrency\":\"My local currency makes it expensive\",\"PriceOther\":\"Other\",\"QualityInputOutputMismatch\":\"The output didn't match my prompt / image\",\"QualityMesh\":\"Mesh quality wasn't good enough\",\"QualityOther\":\"Other\",\"QualityStyleMatch\":\"The style did not match my use case\",\"QualityTexture\":\"Texture quality wasn't good enough\",\"UsageFinishedProject\":\"I just finished my one-time project\",\"UsageOther\":\"Other\",\"UsageRarelyUse\":\"I rarely use it\",\"UsageTestTool\":\"I was only testing the tool\",\"UsageTurnOffRenewal\":\"I prefer to turn off auto-renewal\",\"UsageWillComeBack\":\"I'm taking a temporary break but will come back\"},\"Title\":\"Goodbyes are tough\"},\"Success\":{\"Description\":\"You've successfully canceled your subscription and will not be billed again. You will still have access to paid features until \u003cdate\u003e{date}\u003c/date\u003e.\",\"GotIt\":\"Got it\",\"SorryMessage\":\"We're grateful you gave Meshy a try, and you're always welcome back whenever you feel inspired to create again.\",\"SorryTitle\":\"Sorry to see you go\",\"Title\":\"Subscription cancelled\"}}},\"CancelAt\":\"Your plan ends on \u003cdate\u003e\u003c/date\u003e\",\"Coupon\":{\"Apply\":{\"Action\":\"Apply Coupon\",\"Description\":\"To use the New User 50% Off First Month offer, please click the button to apply it to your account.\",\"Description60Off\":\"To use the New User 60% Off First Month offer, please click the button to apply it to your account.\",\"Success\":\"Coupon applied successfully\"},\"Remove\":{\"Action\":\"Remove Coupon\",\"Description\":\"If you’d like to use a coupon other than the New User 50% Off First Month offer, please click the button to remove the current coupon from your account.\",\"Description60Off\":\"If you’d like to use a coupon other than the New User 60% Off First Month offer, please click the button to remove the current coupon from your account.\",\"Success\":\"Coupon removed successfully\"}},\"Currency\":\"Currency\",\"CurrentPlan\":\"Current plan\",\"CurrentPlanTooltip\":\"Tier changes may take some time to process. If your status hasn’t updated after making a payment or changing tiers, please try refreshing the page.\",\"Cycle\":{\"Bimonthly\":\"Bimonthly\",\"Monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"MostSave\":\"Most Save\",\"Quarterly\":\"Quarterly\",\"Yearly\":\"Yearly\"},\"Description\":{\"Enterprise\":\"For organizations that need large volume usage, customized solutions, and more\",\"Free\":\"No credit card needed\",\"Max\":\"Best for studios and teams\",\"Premium\":\"Best for high-volume creators\",\"Pro\":\"Best for individual creators\",\"Starter\":\"Best for hobbyists \u0026 beginner\",\"StudioIndividual\":\"Best for power creators looking to scale up\",\"Ultra\":\"Best for AI agents and advanced workflows\"},\"DowngradeDialog\":{\"Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Description1\":\"This change will:\",\"Description2\":\"Remove all additional seats from your team\",\"Description3\":\"Revoke access for all invited team members\",\"Description4\":\"Reset your monthly credits to the {plan} plan limit ({credits, number} credits)\",\"Description5\":\"This action cannot be undone.\",\"Title\":\"Are you sure you want to downgrade?\"},\"Education\":{\"ApplyNow\":\"Apply Now\",\"Description\":{\"Approved\":\"Congratulations! You've been approved for our education program for students. Enjoy \u003cstrong\u003e$5.99/month × 13 months\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"Default\":\"If you are a current student or educator, apply for our education program to receive a discount.\",\"Pending\":\"Your application is under review. You’ll receive an email update soon — once approved, you can unlock exclusive education pricing.\",\"Used\":\"You are currently on the Education Plan — enjoying discounted pricing and benefits for students and educators.\"},\"Pending\":\"Pending\",\"Subscribe\":\"Subscribe\"},\"EducationUpgradeDialog\":{\"Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Description\":\"This change will:\",\"Description2\":\"Revoke your educational discount immediately, and it cannot be used again\",\"Description3\":\"Unlock all Studio plan features and benefits\",\"Description5\":\"This action cannot be undone.\",\"Title\":\"Are you sure you want to upgrade?\"},\"Enterprise\":{\"Action\":\"Contact Us\",\"Description\":\"For organizations that need large volume usage, customized solutions, and more\"},\"Feature\":{\"API\":{\"Default\":\"API access\",\"Enterprise\":\"\u003cspan\u003eHighest\u003c/span\u003e API throughput\"},\"APIAndPlugins\":{\"Title\":\"API \u0026 3D platform plugins access\"},\"APIAssetRetention\":\"API asset retention\",\"APIPlayground\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eFull\u003c/strong\u003e API Playground Access\",\"AdvancedGenerationTools\":{\"Tips\":\"Batch generation, multi-view image to 3D, Text to Image, Remesh, AI texture editing\",\"Title\":\"Advanced generation tools\"},\"Animation\":{\"Default\":\"Over \u003cstrong\u003e500\u003c/strong\u003e animation library presets\",\"Free\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e20\u003c/strong\u003e animation library presets\",\"Title\":\"Animation library\"},\"AssetsGeneration\":{\"Tooltip\":\"{count} texture tasks, {count} model tasks from Meshy 5 and earlier AI models, or {halfCount} model tasks from Meshy 6.\"},\"CentralizedBilling\":\"Centralized billing\",\"CoreAIFeatures\":{\"Tips\":\"Image to 3D, Text to 3D, AI Texturing, rigging \u0026 animation,