ucation-training\":\"Education, Training\",\"film\":\"Film\",\"gaming\":\"Gaming\",\"manufacturing-product-design\":\"Manufacturing, Product Design\",\"other\":\"Other, please input here!\",\"xr\":\"XR\"}}},\"Title\":\"Which industry best describes your company?\"},\"Page3\":{\"Question\":{\"Label\":{\"Slug\":{\"1000+\":\"1000+\",\"11-50\":\"11 - 50\",\"2-10\":\"2 - 10\",\"201-1000\":\"201 - 1000\",\"51-200\":\"51 - 200\",\"me\":\"Only me\"}}},\"Title\":\"What is the size of your company?\"},\"Page4\":{\"Question\":{\"Label\":{\"Slug\":{\"ads\":\"Ads (Google Ads, Social Media Ads, etc.)\",\"ai\":\"AI (ChatGPT, Perplexity, etc.)\",\"blog-article-newsletter\":\"Blog Post, Article, Newsletter\",\"facebook\":\"Facebook\",\"friend-colleague\":\"Friend, Colleague\",\"google\":\"Google\",\"instagram\":\"Instagram\",\"linkedin\":\"LinkedIn\",\"other\":\"Other, please input here!\",\"reddit\":\"Reddit\",\"tiktok\":\"TikTok\",\"twitter\":\"Twitter/X\",\"youtube\":\"YouTube\"}}},\"Title\":\"How did you hear about Meshy?\"},\"Page5\":{\"AutoClose1\":\"Automatically close after\",\"AutoClose2\":\"seconds\",\"CancelAnytime\":\"Cancel anytime\",\"DiscountMessage\":\"To help you get the most out of your experience, we’re excited to offer you an exclusive \u003cb\u003e50% OFF\u003c/b\u003e for your first month of Pro subscription. Go to checkout page to claim your offer!\",\"NoPayment\":\"$$0 payment today\",\"SubTitle\":\"Unlock all premium features with a 3-day free trial!\",\"SubTitle2\":\"Enjoy generating with Meshy!\",\"Title\":\"Congratulations, you've struck gold!\",\"Title2\":\"Thank you for your time!\"},\"ProPlanCard\":{\"Description\":\"Don’t miss out this chance - it’s one-time offer!\",\"Feature1\":\"Priority generation\",\"Feature2\":\"More tasks waiting in queue\",\"Feature3\":\"Animation\",\"Feature4\":\"Download community models\",\"Feature5\":\"AI texture editing\"},\"Question\":{\"Tip\":\"Choose only the best fit when you can.\"}},\"PMF202401\":{\"Common\":{\"Button\":{\"Back\":\"Back\",\"Close\":\"Close\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"Skip\":\"Skip\",\"Submit\":\"Submit\"},\"Description\":\"Take our quick 2-minute survey and receive 100 free permanent credits in your account. Your responses are confidential and will solely be used to enhance your experience with Meshy!\",\"Title\":\"Share Your Feedback and Get Free Credits!\"},\"Page1\":{\"Question\":{\"NotLikely\":\"Not likely\",\"Title\":\"How likely are you to recommend Meshy to a friend or colleague?\",\"VeryLikely\":\"Very likely\"}},\"Page2\":{\"Question\":{\"Slug\":{\"notdisappointed\":\"Not disappointed\",\"somewhatdisappointed\":\"Somewhat disappointed\",\"verydisappointed\":\"Very disappointed\"},\"Title\":\"How would you feel if you could no longer use Meshy?\"}},\"Page3\":{\"Question\":{\"Label\":{\"Slug\":{\"None\":\"See no alternatives\",\"Other\":\"I would instead use … (please specify)\"}},\"Title\":\"What would you likely use as an alternative if Meshy were \u003cb\u003eno longer\u003c/b\u003e available?\"}},\"Page4\":{\"Question\":{\"Textarea\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Share with us the primary benefits you've received from Meshy.\"},\"Title\":\"What are the problems that Meshy addresses for you, and in what situations do you find Meshy useful?\"}},\"Page5\":{\"Question\":{\"Textarea\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Any feedback and suggestions are welcome.\"},\"Title\":\"How can we improve Meshy to better meet your needs?\"}},\"Page6\":{\"AutoClose1\":\"Automatically close after\",\"AutoClose2\":\"seconds\",\"Title\":\"Thank you for your time! We've added 100 free credits to your account. Enjoy generating with Meshy!\"}},\"PMF202510\":{\"CloseDialog\":{\"Cancel\":\"Yes, close it\",\"Confirm\":\"Stay on the page\",\"Description\":\"Are you sure you want to \u003cstrong\u003egive up 100 credits\u003c/strong\u003e?\",\"Title\":\"Confirm to close the pop-up?\"},\"Common\":{\"Button\":{\"Close\":\"Close\",\"MaybeLater\":\"Maybe Later\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"ReviewOnTrustpilot\":\"Review us on Trustpilot\",\"Submit\":\"Submit \u0026 Claim Credits\"},\"Description\":\"Take our quick 1-minute confidential survey to share your thoughts. As a thank-you, we’ll add 100 permanent credits to your account.\",\"Title\":\"Help us improve Meshy and \u003cstrong\u003eget 100 credits!\u003c/strong\u003e\"},\"Page2\":{\"Question\":{\"Placeholder\":\"Tell us about your experience...\",\"Title\":\"What made you give that score? Tell us a bit about your experience with Meshy, the good, the bad, or anything in between.\"}},\"Page3\":{\"Rating7Above\":{\"Description1\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e100 free credits\u003c/strong\u003e have been added to your account.\",\"Description2\":\"Would you mind leaving us a \u003cstrong\u003equick review on Trustpilot?\u003c/strong\u003e Your feedback helps us keep improving and reach more creators.\"},\"Rating7AndBelow\":{\"Description\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e100 free credits\u003c/strong\u003e have been added to your account. Thank you for your feedback. We’re continually improving Meshy for you.\"},\"Review\":{\"ProductHunt\":{\"CtaText\":\" Review us on Product Hunt\",\"Description\":\"You’re one of our power users — mind leaving a quick review on Product Hunt  and shoutout for Meshy vs competitors? \"},\"Reddit\":{\"CtaText\":\"Post comment on Reddit\",\"Description1\":\"You’ve been using Meshy for a while — what’s the one thing you love most? Share it on Reddit so 3D/AI creators like you can see it.\",\"Description2\":\"Just tried our latest feature/model? Tell the Reddit community what you think — is it better, faster, more useful?\",\"Description3\":\"Have you tried other 3D/AI tools too? Tell Reddit why you chose Meshy and where we’re stronger.\",\"Description4\":\"Got a favorite feature in Meshy that saves you time? Tell people on Reddit how you use it.\",\"Description5\":\"How do you use Meshy in your workflow — game, 3D printing, Artistic creation..? Share your real use case on Reddit.\"}},\"Title\":\"Thank You!\"}}},\"Scene\":{\"