igh detail with accurate shapes—perfect for 3D printing, rendering, and pro production.\\n\u003cimg1\u003e\u003c/img1\u003e\u003cb\u003eLow Poly\u003c/b\u003e: Fewer polygons and cleaner topology—perfect for games, mobile, and real-time use.\\n\u003cimg2\u003e\u003c/img2\u003e\",\"TooltipTopologyMesh\":\"\u003cb\u003eStandard\u003c/b\u003e: High detail with accurate shapes—perfect for 3D printing, rendering, and pro production.\\n\u003cimg1\u003e\u003c/img1\u003e\u003cb\u003eSmart Topology\u003c/b\u003e: Fewer polygons and cleaner topology—perfect for games, mobile, and real-time use.\\n\u003cimg2\u003e\u003c/img2\u003e\",\"TopologyMesh\":\"Smart Topology\"},\"NumberOfGenerations\":\"Number of Generations\",\"PBRMaps\":\"Generate PBR Maps\",\"SuccessMessage\":{\"GenerationStarted\":\"Task created successfully\"},\"Text\":{\"NegativePrompt\":{\"Title\":\"Negative Prompt\"},\"Prompt\":{\"Help\":\"Help me write\",\"Title\":\"Prompt\"}},\"TransferImageStyleLabel\":\"Enable Nano Banana\",\"TransferImageStyleTip\":\"When enabled, your request is processed through Nano Banana for enhanced style transfer.\",\"Workspace\":{\"Title\":\"Workspace\"}},\"Statistics\":{\"Faces\":\"Faces\",\"Vertices\":\"Vertices\"},\"Task\":{\"Download\":{\"Tooltip\":{\"FreePremiumQuota\":\"Download models generated by Meshy 5 and Meshy 6: \u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e {count, plural, one {time} other {times}} left. Upgrade to unlock unlimited downloads.\",\"LimitNewModel\":\"Subscribe to unlock downloads of models generated by Meshy 6. Without a subscription, you can still download models generated by Meshy 5 up to {count} times per month.\",\"LimitedByStarterCount\":\"Download {scene} models: \u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e {count, plural, one {time} other {times}} left this month\u003cextra\u003e\u003c/extra\u003e Upgrade to unlock unlimited downloads.\",\"NewRemaining\":\"Download models generated by Meshy 5: \u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e {count, plural, one {time} other